#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity.rst:5
msgid "Productivity"
msgstr "生產力"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Odoo AI brings AI agents, AI features, and AI-driven automation into Odoo. "
"Learn how to access Odoo AI, use its features, and connect external agents "
"via MCP."
msgstr ""
"Odoo AI 將 AI 代理程式、AI 功能及 AI 驅動的自動化引入 Odoo。了解如何存取 "
"Odoo AI、使用其功能，以及透過 MCP 連接外部代理程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:10
msgid "AI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:14
msgid ""
"Odoo |AI| brings artificial intelligence into Odoo to help users work with "
"information, complete tasks, and automate workflows."
msgstr "Odoo |AI| 將人工智能引入 Odoo，協助使用者處理資訊、完成任務及自動化工作流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:17
msgid ""
"|AI| agents are at the core of Odoo AI. An agent can understand natural-"
"language requests, access information, and perform tasks using the tools "
"available to it. Agents can be configured for specific purposes and can also"
" be triggered as part of automated workflows."
msgstr ""
"|AI| 代理是 Odoo AI 的核心。代理能夠理解自然語言請求、存取資訊，並使用可用的"
"工具執行任務。你可以根據特定用途設定代理，亦可在自動化工作流程中觸發代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:21
msgid ""
"Odoo AI can be used with Odoo's built-in |AI| services or connected to an "
"external |AI| agent through an Odoo MCP server."
msgstr ""
"Odoo AI 可配合 Odoo 內置的 |AI| 服務使用，亦可透過 Odoo MCP 伺服器連接外部 "
"|AI| 代理程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:25
msgid ""
"Installing the **AI** app in an Odoo database on the *Standard* pricing plan"
" automatically triggers an upsell to the *Custom* pricing plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:128
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to `Odoo's pricing page "
"<https://www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_ or contact your account manager."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:32
msgid "Access Odoo AI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:34
msgid "Odoo AI can be accessed from anywhere in the database:"
msgstr "可在資料庫中任何位置存取 Odoo AI："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:36
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`AI` icon at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:37
msgid ""
"Press :kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`k` to open the command palette, enter a prompt, "
"and select the :guilabel:`AI` option."
msgstr ""
"按下 :kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`k` 開啟指令面板，輸入提示詞，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`AI` 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:40
msgid "An open command palette with a prompt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:44
msgid ""
"To open the conversation with the agent in the **Discuss** app, click on the"
" header of the conversation window, then click :icon:`fa-expand` "
":guilabel:`Open in Discuss`."
msgstr ""
"要在 **討論** 應用程式中開啟與代理的對話，請按一下對話視窗的標題欄，然後按一"
"下 :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`在討論中開啟`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:48
msgid "Use Odoo AI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:50
msgid "Odoo provides |AI| features throughout the database, including:"
msgstr "Odoo 在整個資料庫中提供 |AI| 功能，包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:52
msgid ""
":doc:`AI Fields <ai/fields>`: Generate field values based on information "
"from the current record."
msgstr ":doc:`AI 欄位 <ai/fields>`：根據目前記錄的資料產生欄位值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:53
msgid ""
":doc:`AI in email templates <ai/email-templates>`: Generate personalized "
"email content using information from the current record."
msgstr ""
":doc:`電郵範本中的 AI <ai/email-templates>`：使用目前記錄的資訊產生個人化電郵"
"內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:55
msgid ""
":doc:`AI voice transcription <ai/voice>`: Transcribe recorded conversations "
"and generate summaries."
msgstr ":doc:`AI 語音轉錄 <ai/voice>`：轉錄已錄製的對話並產生摘要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:57
msgid ""
":doc:`AI image generation <ai/generate_images>`: Generate images from "
"natural-language prompts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:58
msgid ""
":doc:`AI in Live Chat <ai/live-chat>`: Use an |AI| agent to respond to "
"visitors, qualify conversations, and create leads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:61
msgid ""
"See the related documentation for information about using these features."
msgstr "有關使用這些功能的資訊，請參閱相關文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:64
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:8
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:28
msgid "AI agents"
msgstr "AI 代理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:66
msgid ""
"|AI| agents are configurable virtual assistants that can understand natural "
"language, perform tasks, and interact with Odoo tools."
msgstr ""
"|AI| 代理程式是可配置的虛擬助理，能夠理解自然語言、執行任務，並與 Odoo 工具互"
"動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:69
msgid ""
"An *agent* is configured with a **System Prompt** that defines its purpose "
"and behavior. **Skills** provide the instructions and tools the agent uses "
"to complete tasks, while **Sources** provide information the agent can use."
msgstr ""
"一個 *代理* 會設定 **系統提示**，以定義其用途及行為。**技能** 提供代理完成任"
"務所需的指示及工具，而 **來源** 則提供代理可使用的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:74
msgid ":doc:`AI agents <ai/agents>`"
msgstr ":doc:`AI 代理 <ai/agents>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:77
msgid "AI and automation"
msgstr "AI 與自動化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:79
msgid ""
"|AI| can also be used as part of automated Odoo workflows. |AI| server "
"actions allow |AI| to evaluate a situation and select the appropriate tool "
"to execute. |AI| agents can also be triggered by automated and scheduled "
"actions."
msgstr ""
"|AI| 亦可用作 Odoo 自動化工作流程的一部分。|AI| 伺服器動作可讓 |AI| 評估情況"
"，並選擇合適的工具執行。|AI| 代理亦可透過自動動作及排程動作觸發。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:84
msgid ":doc:`AI server actions <ai/server-actions>`"
msgstr ":doc:`AI 伺服器動作 <ai/server-actions>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:85
msgid ":doc:`AI document sort <ai/document_sort>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:88
msgid "AI providers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:90
msgid ""
"Odoo AI uses Odoo's :doc:`In-App Purchase  <../essentials/in_app_purchase>` "
"(IAP) service for |AI| requests. |AI| usage consumes IAP `credits "
"<https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-services/867>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:93
msgid ""
"Alternatively, an external |AI| agent can connect directly to an Odoo "
"database through the Odoo MCP server (Model Context Protocol). This allows "
"the external agent to access Odoo data and use tools exposed by the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"此外，外部 |AI| 代理亦可透過 Odoo MCP 伺服器（Model Context Protocol）直接連"
"線至 Odoo 資料庫，讓外部代理存取 Odoo 資料及使用資料庫開放的工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai.rst:98
msgid ":doc:`AI MCP server <ai/mcp_server>`"
msgstr ":doc:`AI MCP 伺服器 <ai/mcp_server>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:-1
msgid ""
"AI agents in Odoo are virtual assistants that understand natural-language "
"requests and perform tasks. Learn how agents use instructions, skills, "
"tools, and knowledge sources, and how to create and configure a new agent."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 中的 AI 代理程式是虛擬助理，能夠理解自然語言要求並執行任務。了解代理程式"
"如何使用指示、技能、工具及知識來源，以及如何建立和設定新代理程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:13
msgid ""
"An |AI| agent is a virtual assistant in Odoo that can understand natural-"
"language requests, access information, and perform tasks using the tools "
"available to it. Agents can be configured for specific roles and can be used"
" interactively or as part of automated workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:17
msgid "Agents are built from four main components:"
msgstr "代理由四個主要組件構成："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:19
msgid ""
"*Instructions* define the agent's purpose, behavior, and responsibilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:20
msgid ""
"*Knowledge* provides information the agent can use when completing tasks."
msgstr "*知識庫* 提供代理程式在完成任務時可使用的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:21
msgid ""
"*Skills and tools* define what the agent can do. Skills provide instructions"
" for specific tasks, while tools allow the agent to perform actions in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:23
msgid ""
"*Triggers* determine when the agent is invoked, such as when a user starts a"
" conversation or when an automated or scheduled action calls the agent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:27
msgid ""
"While many |AI| features can be used in Odoo without the **AI** application,"
" creating and customizing agents requires the **AI** application be "
"installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:30
msgid ""
"Odoo |AI| uses In-app purchases (IAP) for AI requests. For more information "
"on using |IAP| credits, including how to purchase additional credits, visit "
"the `Odoo AI IAP <https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-services/867>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo |AI| 使用應用程式內購買（IAP）處理 AI 要求。如欲了解更多使用 |IAP| 點數"
"的資訊（包括如何購買額外點數），請瀏覽 `Odoo AI IAP <https://iap.odoo.com/"
"iap/in-app-services/867>`_ 頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:35
msgid "Agent structure"
msgstr "代理架構"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:40
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "操作說明"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:42
msgid "Instructions define the agent's overall role, purpose, and behavior."
msgstr "指示會定義代理的整體角色、目的及行為。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:44
msgid ""
"Each AI agent is assigned a *System Prompt* that provides its main "
"instructions. It can define the agent's responsibilities, constraints, and "
"how it should respond to requests."
msgstr ""
"每個 AI 代理都會獲指派一個 *系統提示詞*，以提供其主要指示。它可定義代理的職責"
"、限制，以及應如何回應請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:47
msgid ""
"Each :ref:`Skill <ai/agents/skills>` also includes its own prompt-like "
"component, called *Instructions*. Instructions are skill-specific guidelines"
" that refine how the agent behaves in a given context or workflow and how it"
" interacts with the Odoo framework."
msgstr ""
"每項 :ref:`技能 <ai/agents/skills>` 亦包含各自的類似提示詞組件，稱為 *指示*。"
"指示是針對特定技能的指引，用於微調代理在特定情境或工作流程中的表現，以及與 "
"Odoo 框架互動的方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:51
msgid "Instructions often include:"
msgstr "指示通常包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:53
msgid "A purpose, or what the skill covers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:54
msgid "Rules or constraints for the agent to follow when assigned this skill."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:55
msgid "Step-by-step workflows for completing a specific action."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:56
msgid "Technical details needed to complete any actions."
msgstr "完成任何操作所需的技術詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:61
msgid "Skills"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:63
msgid ""
"*Skills* define specific tasks an agent can perform. Each *Skill* includes "
"instructions that guide the agent through the task and can have one or more "
"tools assigned to it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:67
msgid ""
"If an agent is not assigned any Skills, it can **only** provide information."
" It **cannot** complete tasks or make changes to the database."
msgstr ""
"如果代理未獲指派任何技能，它 **只能** 提供資訊，**無法** 完成任務或更改資料庫"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:70
msgid ""
"Multiple *Skills* can be assigned to the same agent, allowing it to perform "
"different types of tasks."
msgstr "可將多項 *技能* 指派予同一位專員，使其能夠執行不同類型的任務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:76
msgid "Agent tools"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:78
msgid ""
"*Tools* are the functions an agent can perform in Odoo. Each agent has the "
"following tools available:"
msgstr "*工具* 是代理可以在 Odoo 中執行的功能。每個代理皆可使用以下工具："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:81
msgid ""
"*Generate image*: A collection of tools to support image generation. Load "
"this skill when the user asks to generate or enhance an image."
msgstr "*生成圖片*：支援圖片生成的工具集合。當用戶要求生成或增強圖片時，載入此技能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:83
msgid "*Web Search*: Enable the Agent to explore the internet in real time."
msgstr "*網頁搜尋*：讓代理即時探索互聯網。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:84
msgid ""
"*Self Update*: Allows an agent to identify missing or incomplete "
"instructions and *Skills* and propose or make changes to its configuration."
msgstr "*自我更新*：讓代理識別遺漏或不完整的指示及 *技能*，並建議或更改其設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:87
msgid ""
"To enable a tool on an agent, click the *Skills* tab, then slide the "
"appropriate toggle to green."
msgstr "要在代理上啟用工具，請點擊*技能*分頁，然後將相應的切換開關滑動至綠色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:89
msgid "The tools on an AI agent, with some enabled."
msgstr "AI 代理上的工具，其中部分已啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:95
msgid "Subagents"
msgstr "子代理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:97
msgid ""
"An agent can use other |AI| agents as *subagents* to handle specialized "
"tasks. When a user submits a request, the main agent can determine whether "
"to delegate part of the task to a subagent based on its purpose and "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"代理可使用其他 |AI| 代理作為 *子代理*，以處理專門任務。當使用者提交請求時，主"
"代理可根據子代理的用途及功能，決定是否將部分任務委派給子代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:101
msgid ""
"Subagents allow an agent to delegate specific tasks to specialized agents "
"rather than handling every request itself. The main agent can then use the "
"subagent's results as part of its response."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:104
msgid ""
"To assign a subagent, click on the *Skills* tab, scroll to the *Subagents* "
"section, then click :icon:`add` :guilabel:`Add`. Then, select from the list "
"of existing agents, or click :guilabel:`Create New` to create a new one."
msgstr ""
"如要指派子代理，請點擊 *技能* 分頁，捲動至 *子代理* 區段，然後點擊 "
":icon:`add` :guilabel:`新增`。接著，從現有代理清單中選擇，或點擊 "
":guilabel:`新建` 以建立新代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:109
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:3
msgid "Knowledge"
msgstr "知識"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:111
msgid ""
"Sources are the data the agent can refer to when generating responses or "
"completing tasks. Sources are indexed so the agent can retrieve relevant "
"information when a user asks a question."
msgstr ""
"資料來源是代理程式在生成回覆或完成任務時可參考的資料。系統會為資料來源建立索"
"引，以便代理程式在用戶提問時擷取相關資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:115
msgid ""
"An agent designed to answer customer support questions has **Knowledge** "
"articles included as sources, which include frequently asked questions."
msgstr ""
"專為回答客戶支援問題而設的代理程式，會將 **知識** 文章納入作為來源，當中包含"
"常見問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:118
msgid "Sources can be in the following formats:"
msgstr "來源可採用以下格式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:120
msgid "Files uploaded to the agent"
msgstr "上載至代理的檔案"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:121
msgid "Links to webpages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:122
msgid ""
"Documents (uploaded in the :doc:`Documents <../documents>` application)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:123
msgid ":doc:`Knowledge <../knowledge>` app articles"
msgstr ":doc:`知識 <../knowledge>` 應用程式文章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:126
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Restrict answers to Sources` option is enabled on an "
"agent, the agent can **only** utilize information from the uploaded and "
"active sources."
msgstr ""
"如果在代理上啟用 :guilabel:`將回答限制於來源` 選項，該代理 **只能** 使用已上"
"載並啟用的來源中的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:130
msgid "Reprocessing sources"
msgstr "重新處理來源"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:132
msgid ""
"If the content of a source changes after it has been indexed, it may be "
"necessary to reprocess the source so that agents use the most recent "
"information. Reprocessing can be triggered manually and ensures that updated"
" documents, links, or knowledge articles are reflected in future agent "
"responses."
msgstr ""
"如果來源內容在建立索引後有所變更，便可能需要重新處理該來源，以確保代理使用最"
"新資訊。重新處理可手動觸發，確保已更新的文件、連結或知識文章會反映在日後的代"
"理回覆中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:137
msgid "To reprocess a source:"
msgstr "要重新處理來源："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:139
msgid "Navigate to the :menuselection:`AI` app and select an |AI| agent."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`AI` 應用程式，並選擇一個 |AI| 代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:140
msgid "Click the *Knowledge* tab, and select a source."
msgstr "點擊 *知識庫* 分頁，然後選取來源。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:141
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon for the"
" source."
msgstr "點擊該來源的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（垂直省略號）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:142
msgid "On the menu, click :guilabel:`Reprocess`."
msgstr "在選單上，點擊 :guilabel:`重新處理`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:144
msgid "The Knowledge tab of an agent, with the Reprocess option visible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:148
msgid "Triggers"
msgstr "觸發條件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:150
msgid ""
"An agent can be triggered in different ways depending on how it is used."
msgstr "視乎使用方式，可透過不同途徑觸發代理程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:152
msgid ""
"Agents can be launched interactively by users through an AI chat. They can "
"also be triggered automatically by automated actions and scheduled actions, "
"allowing agents to participate in automated workflows."
msgstr ""
"用戶可透過 AI 聊天互動式啟動代理程式。代理程式亦可由自動動作及預定動作自動觸"
"發，從而參與自動化工作流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:156
msgid ""
"To add a trigger to an agent, navigate to the *Trigger* tab and click "
":icon:`add` :guilabel:`Add`. On the *When should your agent be triggered?* "
"popup, choose from one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"要為代理程式新增觸發器，請前往 *觸發器* 分頁，然後點擊 :icon:`add` "
":guilabel:`新增`。在 *應在何時觸發你的代理程式？* 彈出視窗中，選擇以下其中一"
"個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:159
msgid "*On a schedule*: Runs automatically according to a set frequency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:160
msgid ""
"*Based on a Date Field*: Runs once per record, as soon as a specific date is"
" reached."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:161
msgid "*After creation*: Runs whenever a new record is added."
msgstr "*建立後*：每當新增記錄時執行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:162
msgid "*After update*: Runs whenever a specific field is updated."
msgstr "*更新後*：每當特定欄位更新時執行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:165
msgid ""
"If unsure which option is best for a particular use case, click the "
":guilabel:`I need help to choose` option at the bottom of the popup. This "
"opens a conversation with the *Odoo AI* agent. The agent then walks through "
"the specifics of the use case to help select the best option."
msgstr ""
"如不確定哪個選項最適合特定使用情境，請按一下彈出視窗底部的 :guilabel:`我需要"
"協助選擇` 選項。系統會開啟與 *Odoo AI* 代理程式的對話，逐步了解該使用情境的具"
"體細節，協助你選擇最佳選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:170
msgid "See :doc:`AI server actions <server-actions>` for more information."
msgstr "有關更多資訊，請參閱:doc:`AI 伺服器動作 <server-actions>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:175
msgid "Create a new agent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:177
msgid ""
"To create a new |AI| agent, navigate to the :menuselection:`AI` app and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Enter an agent name, then add a short description, if"
" desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:181
msgid ""
"Before creating a new agent, it is recommended to have a clear use case in "
"mind. This helps when writing out the *Instructions* and assigning the "
"*Skills*."
msgstr "建立新代理前，建議先確定清晰的使用情境。這有助於編寫 *指示* 並指派 *技能*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:184
msgid ""
"On the *Instructions* tab, enter a system prompt with detailed instructions "
"for the agent as to their role and responsibilities."
msgstr "在 *指示* 分頁中，輸入系統提示，為代理提供有關其角色及職責的詳細指示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:187
msgid "A new agent form."
msgstr "新的代理表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:190
msgid ""
"On the *Skills* tab, select one or more :guilabel:`Skills` for the agent. As"
" explained above, :ref:`Skills <ai/agents/skills>` include both instructions"
" and tools that guide the agent in helping users complete a task."
msgstr ""
"在 *技能* 分頁上，為代理程式選取一項或多項 :guilabel:`技能`。如上所述"
"，:ref:`技能 <ai/agents/skills>` 包含指示及工具，可引導代理程式協助用戶完成任"
"務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/agents.rst:194
msgid ""
"Slide the :guilabel:`Restrict answers to Sources` toggle to active to limit "
"the agent to **only** respond based on the provided resources."
msgstr ""
"開啟 :guilabel:`將回答限制為來源` 切換開關，即可限制代理程式 **只** 根據已提"
"供的資源作答。"

