#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:3
msgid "AI default prompts"
msgstr "AI 預設提示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:7
msgid ""
"*Default prompts* define how |AI| behaves when a user opens a conversation "
"from a specific model in Odoo. They allow users to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:10
msgid "Automatically call a specific |AI| agent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:11
msgid "Apply contextual instructions"
msgstr "套用情境指示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:12
msgid "Display predefined action buttons"
msgstr "顯示預先定義的操作按鈕"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:13
msgid "Adapt |AI| behavior depending on the model"
msgstr "因應模型調整 |AI| 行為"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:15
msgid ""
"Default prompts are model-specific, though they can be applied to all "
"models. This means the |AI| can behave differently depending on where it is "
"launched in the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:18
msgid ""
"When a user opens an |AI| conversation from a record, Odoo provides the full"
" context of that record to the |AI| agent. This includes field values and "
"relevant metadata."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each conversation is context-bound. When opened from a lead, the |AI| "
"receives information about that Lead. When opened from an invoice, the |AI| "
"receives accounting context. The conversation is isolated and reset once "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"每次對話皆與目前內容綁定。從潛在客戶頁面開啟時，|AI| 會接收該潛在客戶的資訊；"
"從發票頁面開啟時，|AI| 則會接收會計相關內容。對話各自獨立，關閉後即會重設。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:26
