msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:28
msgid ""
"Before configuring a default prompt, create or configure the |AI| "
":ref:`agent <ai/create-agent>` in the **AI** application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:32
msgid ""
"The **AI** application comes with pre-configured agents, and default "
"prompts. These vary based on the other applications installed on the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"**AI** 應用程式隨附預先設定的代理程式及預設提示詞。這些設定會因應資料庫中安裝"
"的其他應用程式而有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:35
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`AI app --> Configuration --> Default Prompts` "
"and click :guilabel:`New`. Create a :guilabel:`Rule Name`, then select an "
"action in the :guilabel:`When users need to` field."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`AI 應用程式 --> 設定 --> 預設提示詞`，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`新增`。建立 :guilabel:`規則名稱`，然後在 :guilabel:`當用戶需要` 欄"
"位中選取一個動作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:38
msgid ""
"Next, select a model in the :guilabel:`On the Model` field. This controls "
"what records this rule applies to. For example, if the rule is specific to "
"*Helpdesk* tickets, select *Helpdesk Tickets* from the drop-down menu. "
"Multiple selections can be made in this field. To allow this rule to be used"
" by any model, leave the field blank."
msgstr ""
"然後，在 :guilabel:`在模型上` 欄位中選擇一個模型。這會控制此規則套用於哪些記"
"錄。例如，如果該規則專用於 *服務台* 工單，請從下拉式選單中選擇 *服務台工單*。"
"此欄位可進行多選。若要允許任何模型使用此規則，請將該欄位留空。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:43
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Call the Agent` field, select which agent this rule should"
" apply to. Next, add the :guilabel:`Instructions` for the rule."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`呼叫代理程式` 欄位中，選擇此規則應套用的代理程式。接著，為規則"
"新增 :guilabel:`指示`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:47
msgid ""
"While the agent may already have an existing prompt that defines their "
"behavior, the instructions in the default prompt define the actions in the "
"context of the current model. See :ref:`Understanding AI prompt structure "
"<ai/prompt-structure>` below for additional information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:51
msgid "A default prompt rule record in the AI app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:55
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:664
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "按鈕"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:57
msgid ""
"Within each default prompt, buttons can be configured with predefined prompt"
" instructions. When a user clicks a button, Odoo combines the default prompt"
" *Context* with the selected button prompt and sends both to the |AI| model."
" This structure allows organizations to create reusable AI actions for "
"common workflows, such as rewriting content, summarizing information, "
"applying tone guidelines, or generating standardized responses."
msgstr ""
"在每個預設提示中，均可為按鈕配置預先定義的提示指令。當用戶點擊按鈕時，Odoo 會"
"將預設提示的*上下文*與所選按鈕的提示合併，並將兩者一併傳送至 |AI| 模型。此結"
"構讓機構能為常見工作流程建立可重複使用的 AI 動作，例如改寫內容、摘要資訊、套"
"用語氣指引或產生標準化回覆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:63
msgid ""
"On the *Buttons* tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line` to open the *Create "
"Available User Prompts* pop-up. In the :guilabel:`Title` field, enter a name"
" for this prompt. Whatever is entered in this field is visible on the button"
" for the prompt."
msgstr ""
"在 *按鈕* 分頁中，點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行` 以開啟 *建立可用的使用者提示* "
"彈出視窗。在 :guilabel:`標題` 欄位中輸入此提示的名稱。此欄位所輸入的內容將會"
"顯示在該提示的按鈕上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:67
msgid "AI prompts configured as buttons in a conversation with an agent."
msgstr "在與代理對話中設定為按鈕的 AI 提示詞。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:70
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Prompt` field, enter a prompt to be sent to the AI when "
"the button is clicked. Click :guilabel:`Save & Close` or :guilabel:`Save & "
"New` when finished."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`提示` 欄位中，輸入點擊該按鈕時要傳送給 AI 的提示詞。完成後，點"
"擊 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉` 或 :guilabel:`儲存並新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:76
msgid "Understanding AI prompt structure"
msgstr "了解 AI 提示詞結構"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:78
msgid ""
"|AI| conversations in Odoo are structured using multiple configuration "
"layers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:80
msgid ""
"Each :ref:`agent <ai/agents/prompts-in-odoo>` has a prompt that defines the "
"global identity and behavior of an AI agent. It is configured directly on "
"the agent's record and applies wherever the agent is used. The Agent Prompt "
"defines who the AI is."
msgstr ""
"每個 :ref:`代理 <ai/agents/prompts-in-odoo>` 都有一個提示詞，用於定義 AI 代理"
"的整體身份及行為。它直接在代理的記錄上設定，並適用於該代理的所有使用場景。「"
"代理提示詞」定義了 AI 的身份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:84
msgid ""
"A default prompt configures how an AI agent behaves when launched from a "
"specific model. Default prompt instructions adapt the agent's behavior to "
"the functional context of the model. The default prompt defines how the AI "
"should behave in this specific context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:88
msgid ""
"Button prompts represent predefined user requests within an AI chat window. "
"When a button is clicked, Odoo combines the AI agent's global instructions, "
"the default prompt Context, and the selected button prompt. The Context "
"provides the overall behavioral framework and functional background for the "
"interaction, while the button prompt specifies the exact task the AI should "
"perform at that moment."
msgstr ""
"按鈕提示代表 AI 聊天視窗中預先定義的使用者請求。按一下按鈕時，Odoo 會結合 AI "
"代理的整體指示、預設提示「情境」及所選的按鈕提示。「情境」為互動提供整體行為"
"框架與功能背景，而按鈕提示則指定 AI 當時應執行的確切任務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/default_prompts.rst:95
msgid ":doc:`agents`"
msgstr ":doc:`agents`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:3
msgid "AI document sort"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo |AI| Document Automation enables automated classification, routing, and"
" processing of documents using artificial intelligence. It reduces manual "
"handling of documents such as invoices, contracts, :abbr:`NDAs (Non-"
"Disclosure Agreements)`, and insurance files by automatically sorting them "
"into folders, extracting key information, and triggering business actions."
msgstr ""
"Odoo |AI| 文件自動化運用人工智能，自動進行文件分類、分流及處理。系統會自動將"
"文件整理至資料夾、擷取關鍵資訊並觸發業務操作，從而減少人手處理發票、合約"
"、:abbr:`NDA (保密協議)`及保險檔案等文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:12
msgid ""
"This feature is designed for high-volume, repetitive document workflows "
"where speed, accuracy, and traceability are critical, while still allowing "
"human intervention when required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:18
msgid ""
"To use the |AI| document automation, ensure the following requirements are "
"met:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:20
msgid ""
"The **Documents** application is installed, and the correct permissions are "
"applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:21
msgid ""
"The relevant applications are installed. This can include **Accounting**, "
"**Purchase**, **Sales**, etc. The applications installed impact the prompts "
"that are applied to the documents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:25
msgid ""
"The **AI** app does not need to be installed to utilize the documentation "
"automation. However, the types of |AI| automation actions available are "
"dependent on the other apps installed in the database. For example, to "
"create an invoice, the **Accounting** app must be installed."
msgstr ""
"無需安裝 **AI** 應用程式即可使用文件自動化功能。不過，可用的 |AI| 自動化動作"
"類型取決於資料庫中安裝的其他應用程式。例如，必須安裝 **會計** 應用程式才可建"
"立發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:30
msgid "Documents app overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:32
msgid ""
"The **Documents** application functions as a centralized document management"
" system similar to a shared drive. It is organized into the following "
"workspaces at a minimum, though additional workspaces can be created:"
msgstr ""
"**文件**應用程式作為集中式文件管理系統，運作方式與共用硬碟類似。系統至少設有"
"下列工作區，用戶亦可另行建立其他工作區："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:36
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:10
msgid ""
":guilabel:`All`: displays all folders and files the user has access to."
msgstr ":guilabel:`全部`：顯示使用者有權存取的所有資料夾及檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:37
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:11
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-building` :guilabel:`Company`: contains folders and files shared "
"across the company. Access is determined by the :ref:`access rights "
"<documents/access-rights>` defined for the folder and file."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-building` :guilabel:`公司`：包含全公司共用的資料夾及檔案。存取權由"
"為該資料夾及檔案定義的 :ref:`存取權限 <documents/access-rights>` 決定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:40
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:14
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-hdd-o` :guilabel:`My Drive`: the user's personal workspace for "
"organizing and accessing files and folders they own or have uploaded."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-hdd-o` :guilabel:`我的雲端硬碟`：用戶的個人工作區，用於整理及存取自"
"己擁有或已上載的檔案及資料夾。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:42
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-users` :guilabel:`Shared with me`: includes files that have been "
"shared with the user, but are not part of any parent folder they have access"
" to."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-users` :guilabel:`與我共用`：包含已與用戶共用，但不屬於其有權存取的"
"任何上層資料夾的檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:45
msgid ""
"Documents typically follow a workflow from the Inbox into structured "
"folders, where |AI| automation and business actions are applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:49
msgid "AI auto sort overview"
msgstr "AI 自動分類概覽"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:51
msgid ""
"|AI| Auto-Sort operates at the folder level. Each folder in the "
"**Documents** app can contain its own automation logic, allowing you to "
"design document flows that reflect your internal processes. Instead of "
"applying a single global rule, automation is structured progressively: "
"documents enter a folder, |AI| evaluates them according to the folder's "
"prompt, and then performs the corresponding action."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:57
msgid "The AI prompt for a folder in the Documents app."
msgstr "《文件》應用程式中資料夾的 AI 提示詞。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:61
msgid "Configuring prompts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:63
msgid ""
"To configure a prompt for a folder, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Documents app` and select a folder from the tree on the "
"left. Then, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` icon at the top of "
"the page. Use the drop-down menu to select :guilabel:`AI Auto-sort`."
msgstr ""
"如要為資料夾設定提示詞，請前往:menuselection:`文件應用程式`，並在左側的樹狀結"
"構中選取資料夾。然後，點擊頁面頂部的 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`操作` 圖示。從"
"下拉式選單中選取:guilabel:`AI 自動分類`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:67
msgid "The actions menu in a folder within the Documents app."
msgstr "文件應用程式內資料夾中的操作選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:70
msgid ""
"On the *What do you want the AI to do?* pop-up, craft a :ref:`prompt "
"<ai/agents/prompts-in-odoo>` that explains how documents should be "
"interpreted and what should happen next."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:74
msgid ""
"Type `/` to utilize either :guilabel:`Field Selector` and :guilabel:`Records"
" Selector` to insert fields or records to enhance the prompt."
msgstr ""
"輸入 `/` 以使用 :guilabel:`欄位選擇器` 及 :guilabel:`記錄選擇器` 插入欄位或記"
"錄，從而優化提示詞。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:77
msgid ""
"Below the prompt, click the :guilabel:`What actions can the AI take?` field,"
" and select one or more actions from the drop-down menu. The available "
"actions will vary based on the applications installed."
msgstr ""
"在提示詞下方，點擊 :guilabel:`AI 可以執行哪些操作？` 欄位，並從下拉式選單中選"
"擇一項或多項操作。可用操作會視乎已安裝的應用程式而有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:81
msgid ""
"Based on these instructions, |AI| can move documents to another folder, add "
"tags, trigger activities, or create business records such as invoices or "
"vendor bills. This makes each folder both a storage location and a decision "
"point in the workflow."
msgstr ""
"根據這些指示，|AI| 可將文件移至其他資料夾、新增標籤、觸發活動，或建立客戶發票"
"或供應商賬單等業務記錄。這使每個資料夾既是儲存位置，也是工作流程中的決策點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:85
msgid ""
"When configuring the primary prompt, folders can include instructions to "
"handle exceptions or validation steps before the primary logic is executed. "
"For example, a folder may first verify whether a required value exists in "
"the document before proceeding with automation."
msgstr ""
"設定主要提示詞時，資料夾可包含指示，以在執行主要邏輯前處理例外情況或驗證步驟"
"。例如，資料夾可先驗證文件中是否存在所需數值，然後才繼續執行自動化作業。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:90
msgid ""
"A user wants to identify any PDFs that contain multiple pages, and would "
"need to be manually split. They add the following instructions to the "
"beginning their *Inbox* auto-sort prompt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:93
msgid ""
"`First, check the file to see if it contains a single document or if several"
" documents are collated together. For this, use this field: Is considered "
"multipage. If it is true, add the tag \"To Split\" and stop there. This way,"
" we'll know we first need to manually split it into different files. If it "
"is false, continue with the normal process`"
msgstr ""
"`首先，請檢查檔案是包含單一文件，還是合併了多份文件。為此，請使用「是否視為多"
"頁」（Is considered multipage）欄位。若為 True，請加上「To Split」標籤並停止"
"操作。這樣我們便知道需要先手動將其拆分為多個檔案。若為 False，請繼續執行正常"
"流程`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is considered multipage` is selected via :guilabel:`Field "
"Selector`. Under the :guilabel:`What actions can the AI take?` field, "
":guilabel:`AI: Add Tags` is selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`視為多頁` 已透過 :guilabel:`欄位選擇器` 選取。在 :guilabel:`AI 可"
"執行甚麼動作？` 欄位下，已選取 :guilabel:`AI：新增標籤`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:101
msgid ""
"This action does **not** perform the document split, but it adds a tag "
"indicating which documents need to be split. Adding this step to the "
"beginning of the prompt ensures it is the |AI|'s first action."
msgstr ""
"此操作 **不會** 執行文件分割，但會加入標籤，以標明需要分割的文件。將此步驟加"
"到提示詞開頭，可確保這是 |AI| 的首項操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/document_sort.rst:106
msgid ":doc:`Documents App <../documents>`"
msgstr ":doc:`文件應用程式 <../documents>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:3
msgid "AI in email templates"
msgstr "電郵範本中的 AI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:7
msgid "Odoo allows |AI| prompts to be embedded directly into email templates."
msgstr "Odoo 允許將 |AI| 提示直接嵌入電郵範本中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:9
msgid ""
"When an email is sent, the prompt is evaluated in context, and the generated"
" content is inserted into the message automatically. This feature makes it "
"possible to create dynamic, personalized emails at scale, while keeping "
"templates concise and reusable."
msgstr ""
"發送電郵時，系統會根據上下文評估提示詞，並自動將產生的內容插入訊息中。此功能"
"可大規模建立動態的個人化電郵，同時保持範本簡潔且可重複使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:13
msgid ""
"An AI-enabled email template contains one or more AI prompts that are "
"evaluated at send time. Unlike static templates, AI prompts:"
msgstr ""
"啟用 AI 的電郵範本包含一個或多個 AI 提示詞，會在發送時進行評估。與靜態範本不"
"同，AI 提示詞："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:16
msgid "Adapt the message content to the current record"
msgstr "根據目前記錄調整訊息內容"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:17
msgid ""
"Use available context such as customer data, document content, or related "
"records"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:18
msgid "Generate natural language text automatically"
msgstr "自動產生自然語言文字"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:21
msgid "How AI prompts are evaluated in email templates"
msgstr "如何在電郵範本中評估 AI 提示詞"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:23
msgid ""
"When the database creates an email based on a template with an AI prompt, "
"the prompt uses the current record as context to complete the prompt's "
"objective. If the email is sent in bulk, the prompt is evaluated separately "
"for each record. This allows a single template to produce personalized "
"content for multiple recipients."
msgstr ""
"當資料庫根據包含 AI 提示詞的範本建立電子郵件時，提示詞會使用目前記錄作為上下"
"文來完成提示詞的目標。如果批次發送電子郵件，系統會為每筆記錄單獨評估該提示詞"
"。這讓單一範本能為多位收件人產生個人化內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:29
msgid "Adding an AI prompt to an email template"
msgstr "將 AI 提示詞新增至電郵範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:31
msgid ""
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Email "
"Templates`."
msgstr "首先，前往 :menuselection:`設定 --> 技術 --> 電郵範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:34
msgid ""
":ref:`Developer mode <developer-mode/activation>` needs to be activated to "
"view the *Technical* menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:37
msgid ""
"Select an existing template, or click :guilabel:`New` to create a new one. "
"In the body of the template, type `/`, to open the :ref:`powerbox "
"<essentials/html_editor/commands>`. Select :guilabel:`Prompt` from the drop-"
"down menu. This adds a banner to the template. In the  banner, enter a "
"prompt describing the expected output."
msgstr ""
"選擇現有範本，或點擊:guilabel:`新增`以建立新範本。在範本內文中輸入 `/` 以開"
"啟 :ref:`Powerbox <essentials/html_editor/commands>`。從下拉式選單中選"
"擇:guilabel:`提示詞`。這會在範本中加入一個橫幅。在橫幅中，輸入描述預期輸出的"
"提示詞。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:42
msgid ""
"To utilize :ref:`dynamic placeholders <email_template/dynamic-placeholders>`"
" within the prompt, type `/`, then select :guilabel:`Dynamic Placeholder` "
"from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:45
msgid "An email template with an AI prompt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:49
msgid ""
"Dynamic placeholders reference specific fields within the database to "
"produce unique data in the template. Adding these placeholders is what "
"allows the database to customize the email based on the record referenced."
msgstr ""
"動態佔位符會參照資料庫內的特定欄位，以在範本中產生專屬資料。加入這些佔位符後"
"，資料庫便可根據所參照的記錄自訂電郵內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:405
msgid "Example use cases"
msgstr "使用範例"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:56
msgid ""
"Sales follow-ups: Automatically generate tailored follow-up emails based on "
"opportunity stage, customer activity, or recent communication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:58
msgid ""
"HR communication: Generate personalized onboarding or interview emails based"
" on application or employee data."
msgstr "人力資源溝通：根據申請或員工資料，生成個人化的入職或面試電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:60
msgid ""
"Project updates: Create progress summaries using task descriptions and "
"recent activity."
msgstr "項目更新：使用任務描述及近期活動建立進度摘要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/email-templates.rst:63
msgid ":doc:`../../general/companies/email_template`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../general/companies/email_template`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:56
msgid "AI fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:7
msgid ""
"|AI| fields allow users to utilize Odoo's built-in AI capabilities directly "
"in forms and records. When an |AI| field is configured, the system can "
"generate or suggest values automatically based on the record's context, "
"existing data, or external information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:11
msgid ""
"This feature is especially useful for creating product descriptions, "
"summarizing notes, or generating structured content from unstructured data."
msgstr "此功能特別適合用於建立產品描述、總結備註，或從非結構化資料產生結構化內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:17
msgid "Adding a new AI field"
msgstr "新增 AI 欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:19
msgid ""
"|AI| fields can be added to a record through the Studio app or property "
"field."
msgstr "|AI| 欄位可透過 Studio 應用程式或屬性欄位新增至記錄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:22
msgid ""
":ref:`Installing Studio <general/install>` may impact the current pricing "
"plan for a database. For more information, refer to `Odoo's pricing page "
"<https://www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_ or contact your account manager."
msgstr ""
":ref:`安裝 Studio <general/install>` 可能會影響資料庫目前的定價方案。詳情請參"
"閱 `Odoo 定價頁面 <https://www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_，或聯絡您的客戶經理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:26
msgid ""
"First, navigate to the page in the database where a new field is needed. "
"Then, click on the :icon:`oi-studio` :guilabel:`studio` icon to open the "
"app. On the left sidebar, click and drag the :guilabel:`AI Field` option and"
" place it in the desired location on the record."
msgstr ""
"首先，前往資料庫中需要新增欄位的頁面，然後點擊 :icon:`oi-studio` "
":guilabel:`Studio` 圖示以開啟應用程式。在左側邊欄中，點擊並拖曳 "
":guilabel:`AI 欄位` 選項，並將其放置於記錄上的目標位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:30
msgid "Adding a new field to a record."
msgstr "向記錄新增欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:33
msgid ""
"After the field is placed, an :guilabel:`Add an AI Field` pop-up opens. Use "
"the :guilabel:`Field Type` drop-down menu to select a  :doc:`field type "
"<../../studio/fields>`:"
msgstr ""
"放置欄位後，系統會開啟 :guilabel:`新增 AI 欄位` 彈出視窗。使用 :guilabel:`欄"
"位類型` 下拉式選單，選取 :doc:`欄位類型 <../../studio/fields>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:36
