#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:48
msgid ""
"Next is the :guilabel:`Prompt` field. In Odoo, :ref:`prompts "
"<ai/agents/prompts-in-odoo>` define the instructions that guide the |AI| "
"when generating or improving the content of the |AI| field. The prompt tells"
" the system what kind of information to produce, how to format it, and what "
"tone or style to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:53
msgid ""
"When creating a prompt, use the `/field` command to reference specific "
"fields in the database. For example, to reference the :guilabel:`Company` "
"field on a record, enter `/field`, and click the :guilabel:`Field Selector` "
"option. Type `Company` in the search bar, and select :guilabel:`Company` "
"from the list."
msgstr ""
"建立提示詞時，可使用 `/field` 指令來參照資料庫中的特定欄位。例如，要參照記錄"
"上的:guilabel:`公司`欄位，請輸入 `/field`，並點擊:guilabel:`欄位選擇器`選項。"
"在搜尋欄輸入 `公司`，然後從清單中選取:guilabel:`公司`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:58
msgid "The add a field pop-up where the ai prompt is entered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:61
msgid ""
"Once the prompt is complete, click :guilabel:`Add Field`. Before closing "
"**Studio**, click on the left sidebar and update the :guilabel:`Label` field"
" with a title for the new |AI| field. Then click :guilabel:`Close` to exit "
"**Studio**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:65
msgid ""
"After the field is added, click the |AI| icon to refresh the field value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:68
msgid ""
"If the |AI| is unable to complete the request, a warning message is "
"generated. This could mean that the prompt is asking for information that is"
" not available, in the given context, or that the prompt is providing "
"unclear instructions. Use this as an indication to revisit the prompt and "
"add additional context or instructions."
msgstr ""
"如果 |AI| 無法完成請求，系統便會產生警告訊息。這可能代表提示詞所請求的資訊在"
"目前上下文中無法取得，或者提示詞提供了不明確的指示。請藉此重新檢視提示詞，並"
"補充更多背景資料或指示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:73
msgid ""
"A warning message indicating the AI was unable to complete the request."
msgstr "表示 AI 無法完成請求的警告訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:79
msgid "Add via edit properties"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:81
msgid ""
"|AI| fields can also be added as property fields without opening the "
"**Studio** app. Click on the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` icon and "
"select :icon:`fa-cogs` :guilabel:`Edit Properties`. Tick the :guilabel:`AI` "
"checkbox, confirm the field should be |AI|-enabled, then follow the steps "
":ref:`above <ai/add-a-new-field>` to define the field type and enter the "
"prompt."
msgstr ""
"|AI| 欄位亦可作為屬性欄位新增，無需開啟 **Studio** 應用程式。點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`動作` 圖示並選擇 :icon:`fa-cogs` :guilabel:`編輯屬性`。剔選 "
":guilabel:`AI` 複選框，確認該欄位應啟用 |AI|，然後按照:ref:`上文 <ai/add-a-"
"new-field>`的步驟定義欄位類型並輸入提示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:86
msgid "The edit properties pop-up on a form view."
msgstr "表單檢視上的編輯屬性彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:90
msgid ""
":ref:`Property fields <essentials/property-fields/add>` can only be added to"
" form views."
msgstr ":ref:`屬性欄位 <essentials/property-fields/add>` 只可新增至表單檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:93
msgid "Computing AI fields"
msgstr "計算 AI 欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:95
msgid ""
"To compute, or refresh, an |AI| field, click on the |AI| icon next to the "
"field. Clicking the button updates the field based on the prompt."
msgstr ""
"要計算或重新整理 |AI| 欄位，請按一下欄位旁邊的 |AI| 圖示。按一下該按鈕會根據"
"提示更新欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:98
msgid ""
"Additionally, a scheduled action runs once a day to fill text and property "
"|AI| fields that are currently empty. This action is active by default."
msgstr ""
"此外，系統每日會執行一次排程動作，以填寫目前為空的文字及屬性 |AI| 欄位。此動"
"作預設為啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/fields.rst:102
msgid ""
"To run the scheduled action manually, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings "
"app --> Technical --> Automation --> Scheduled Actions`. Click on "
":guilabel:`AI Fields\\:\\ Compute AI fields` to open it, then click "
":guilabel:`Run Manually`."
msgstr ""
"要手動執行排程動作，請前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 技術 --> 自動"
"化 --> 排程動作`。點擊 :guilabel:`AI 欄位\\:\\ 計算 AI 欄位` 開啟項目，然後點"
"擊 :guilabel:`手動執行`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:3
msgid "Generate images with AI"
msgstr "使用 AI 生成圖片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo |AI| can generate images directly from natural language prompts. AI-"
"generated images can be used throughout the database for product visuals, "
"website content, marketing campaigns, *Knowledge* articles, and other "
"business workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:11
msgid ""
"Image generation is available in supported image fields and editors, "
"allowing visuals to be created and refined directly within Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:15
msgid "Generate an image"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:17
msgid ""
"To generate an image, navigate to the :menuselection:`AI app` and click on "
"the :guilabel:`Odoo Image Generation Agent` to open a conversation. Enter a "
":ref:`prompt <ai/effective-prompts>` describing the desired image, then "
"press Enter."
msgstr ""
"要生成圖片，請前往 :menuselection:`AI 應用程式` 並點擊 :guilabel:`Odoo 圖片生"
"成代理` 以開啟對話。輸入描述所需圖片的 :ref:`提示詞 <ai/effective-prompts>`，"
"然後按 Enter 鍵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:21
msgid ""
"The prompt can describe the subject, environment, lighting, perspective, "
"style, or intended usage scenario. More detailed prompts generally produce "
"more accurate and consistent results."
msgstr ""
"提示詞可描述主體、環境、光線、視角、風格或預期使用情境。提示詞越詳細，通常能"
"產生更準確及一致的結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:24
msgid ""
"After processing is complete, the generated image appears directly in the "
"conversation window. If the generated image does not match the intended "
"result, the prompt can be refined and the image regenerated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:28
msgid "An example conversation with the agent."
msgstr "與代理對話的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:33
msgid ""
"If text, branding, or logos are required in the generated image, these "
"elements must be **explicitly** included in the prompt. Otherwise, generated"
" images exclude visible text by default, according to the rules defined in "
"both the image generation agent and the *Generate Images* skill."
msgstr ""
"如生成的圖片需要包含文字、品牌元素或標誌，必須在提示詞中 **明確** 列出這些元"
"素。否則，根據圖片生成代理及 *生成圖片* 技能中定義的規則，生成的圖片預設不會"
"包含可見文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:39
msgid "Generate an image on a webpage"
msgstr "在網頁上生成圖片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:41
msgid ""
"To generate an image to add directly to a webpage, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Website` app and click :guilabel:`Edit`. Either click on an "
"existing block or add a new one."
msgstr ""
"要產生圖片並直接加至網頁，請前往 :menuselection:`網站` 應用程式，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`編輯`。點擊現有區塊或新增區塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:44
msgid ""
"In the webpage editor, under the *Image* drop-down menu, click "
":guilabel:`Replace` next to the :guilabel:`Media` field to open the "
":guilabel:`Select a media` pop-up. On the pop-up, click the AI icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:48
msgid "The Select a media pop-up window."
msgstr "「選擇媒體」彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:51
msgid ""
"On the resulting conversation window, either click one of the :doc:`default "
"prompts <default_prompts>`, or enter a custom :ref:`prompt <ai/effective-"
"prompts>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:57
msgid "Write effective prompts"
msgstr "撰寫有效的提示詞"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:59
msgid ""
"Prompts describe the subject and context of the generated image. More "
"detailed prompts generally produce more accurate and consistent results."
msgstr ""
"提示詞用於描述所生成圖像的主題和背景內容。愈詳細的提示詞通常會產生愈準確且一"
"致的結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:62
msgid "Effective prompts often include:"
msgstr "有效的提示詞通常包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:64
msgid "The subject of the image."
msgstr "圖片的主體。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:65
msgid "The environment or setting."
msgstr "環境或設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:66
msgid "The perspective or composition."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:67
msgid "The intended visual style."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:69
msgid ""
"For example, instead of using a short prompt such as, `Office Chair` a more "
"descriptive prompt may produce stronger results:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:72
msgid ""
"`Modern ergonomic office chair in a collaborative workspace with natural "
"daylight and a side-angle product photography composition`"
msgstr "`採用自然日光及側面產品攝影構圖、置於協作工作空間內的現代人體工學辦公椅`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:75
msgid ""
"When generating variations from an existing image, prompts work best when "
"describing how the subject should be presented or used, rather than "
"redefining the subject itself."
msgstr ""
"從現有圖片生成變化版本時，提示詞最好描述主體應如何呈現或使用，而非重新定義主"
"體本身。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:79
msgid "How AI image generation works"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:81
msgid ""
"AI image generation in Odoo is powered by a dedicated AI agent called the "
"*Odoo Image Generation Agent*. This agent interprets prompts, generates "
"images, and applies the rules that guide image quality, consistency, and "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 AI 圖像生成功能由名為 *Odoo 圖像生成代理* 的專屬 AI 代理程式驅動。此"
"代理程式會解讀提示詞、生成圖像，並套用規範圖像質素、一致性及行為的規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:85
msgid ""
"The image generation agent works together with a skill called *Generate "
"Images*. The agent prompt defines the high-level behavior of the image "
"generation workflow, while the skill instructions provide more detailed "
"guidance regarding how images should be generated and refined."
msgstr ""
"圖片生成代理程式會與名為 *生成圖片* 的技能協作。代理程式提示詞負責定義圖片生"
"成工作流程的整體行為，而技能指令則就如何生成和優化圖片提供更詳細的指引。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:89
msgid ""
"The agent prompt primarily controls how text and branding are handled in "
"generated images. By default, generated images do not contain visible text, "
"labels, logos, signage, or watermarks unless these are explicitly requested "
"in the prompt. This helps reduce unintended visual artifacts and improves "
"overall image consistency."
msgstr ""
"代理程式提示主要控制系統在生成圖像時如何處理文字與品牌標誌。預設情況下，除非"
"在提示中明確要求，否則生成的圖像不會包含可見文字、標籤、標誌、招牌或浮水印。"
"這樣有助減少非預期的視覺瑕疵，並提升整體圖像的一致性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:94
msgid ""
"The *Generate Images* skill contains the detailed image-generation "
"instructions used during the creation process. These instructions guide how "
"the AI should preserve the identity of a subject, how new environments "
"should be generated, and how each image variation should remain visually "
"distinct from previous generations."
msgstr ""
"*生成圖片* 技能包含創作過程中使用的詳細圖片生成指示。這些指示會引導 AI 如何保"
"留主體的特徵、如何生成新環境，以及如何確保每個圖片變化版本在視覺上與先前生成"
"的圖片保持明顯區別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/generate_images.rst:99
msgid ""
"Together, the agent and skill ensure that generated images remain both "
"visually coherent and contextually relevant while still allowing for "
"creative variation."
msgstr ""
"代理程式與技能相輔相成，確保生成的圖片在視覺上保持連貫且符合情境，同時仍保留"
"創作變化的空間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:3
msgid "Write and improve text with AI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo |AI| can assist with writing and refining text across the database. "
"This makes it easier to draft emails, improve existing content, and quickly "
"extract key information from discussions or notes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:11
msgid ""
"|AI| writing features are available in most rich-text environments in Odoo, "
"including:"
msgstr "|AI| 寫作功能適用於 Odoo 大部分富文本環境，包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:13
msgid "*Description* and *Notes* fields on records"
msgstr "記錄上的 *描述* 及 *備註* 欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:14
msgid "Email composers and email templates"
msgstr "電郵編輯器及電郵範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:15
msgid "**Knowledge** articles"
msgstr "**知識** 文章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:17
msgid ""
"These features are accessible through the text editor and the :ref:`powerbox"
" <essentials/html_editor/commands>`, depending on the context."
msgstr ""
"視乎情況，這些功能可透過文字編輯器及 :ref:`Powerbox <essentials/html_editor/"
"commands>` 使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:20
msgid "A knowledge article with the AI improve text option visible."
msgstr "顯示「AI 改善文字」選項的知識文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:24
msgid "Writing with AI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:26
msgid ""
"|AI| can generate new text based on a short prompt or partial input. This is"
" useful for drafting content such as emails, task descriptions, or internal "
"notes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:29
msgid ""
"To generate text, either click the |AI| icon, or type `/` to open the "
"powerbox, and select :guilabel:`AI` from the drop-down menu. Both options "
"open a conversation window. Enter a short prompt describing the desired "
"content, then click the :icon:`fa-paper-plane-o` :guilabel:`(paper plane)` "
"icon. After the text is generated, hover over the response and click "
":guilabel:`Use this` to add the content to the desired field or document. "
"Alternatively, click the :icon:`fa-copy` :guilabel:`(copy)` icon to copy the"
" text to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"若要生成文字，請按一下 |AI| 圖示，或輸入 `/` 開啟 Powerbox，然後從下拉選單中"
"選擇 :guilabel:`AI`。兩種方式都會開啟對話視窗。輸入簡短的提示詞來描述所需內容"
"，然後按一下 :icon:`fa-paper-plane-o` :guilabel:`（紙飛機）` 圖示。文字生成後"
"，將滑鼠懸停在回覆上並按一下 :guilabel:`使用此內容`，即可將內容加入所需欄位或"
"文件中。或者，按一下 :icon:`fa-copy` :guilabel:`（複製）` 圖示，將文字複製到"
"剪貼簿。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:36
msgid "A conversation window with an AI agent generating content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:39
msgid ""
"If unsatisfied with the content, send a follow-up message to the agent with "
"an expanded prompt or suggested changes."
msgstr "如果對內容不滿意，可向代理發送跟進訊息，並附上更詳細的提示詞或修改建議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:43
msgid "Improving existing text"
msgstr "改善現有文字"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:45
msgid ""
"|AI| can also be used to rewrite or improve existing text. This includes:"
msgstr "|AI| 亦可用於重寫或改善現有文字，這包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:47
msgid "Making text clearer or more concise"
msgstr "使文字更清晰或更簡潔"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:48
msgid "Adjusting tone or structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:49
msgid "Correcting grammar or phrasing"
msgstr "修正文法或措辭"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:51
msgid ""
"Select the text to improve, then click the |AI| icon to open a conversation "
"window. Click the :guilabel:`Rewrite selected` prompt. After the text is "
"generated, hover over the response and click :guilabel:`Use this` to add the"
" content to the desired field or document. Alternatively, click the "
":icon:`fa-copy` :guilabel:`(copy)` icon to copy the text to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"選取要優化的文字，然後按一下 |AI| 圖示以開啟對話視窗。按一下:guilabel:`重寫所"
"選內容`提示。文字生成後，將滑鼠移至回覆上方並按一下:guilabel:`使用此內容`，將"
"內容加入目標欄位或文件。或者，按一下 :icon:`fa-copy` :guilabel:`（複製）` 圖"
"示，將文字複製至剪貼簿。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:56
msgid "The rewrite selected text in a conversation window."
msgstr "在對話視窗中重寫所選文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:60
msgid ""
"To add custom instructions to the prompt, such as suggestions on tone or "
"content, write the prompt directly in the conversation window. For example, "
"`Rewrite the selected text in a more professional tone`."
msgstr ""
"如要在提示中加入自訂指示（例如語氣或內容建議），請直接在對話視窗中輸入提示。"
"例如：`以更專業的語氣重寫所選文字`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:65
msgid "Best practices for AI-assisted writing"
msgstr "AI 輔助寫作的最佳實踐"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:67
msgid "For best results when using |AI| to write or improve text:"
msgstr "如要使用 |AI| 撰寫或改進文字並獲得最佳效果："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:69
msgid "Provide clear and specific context in prompts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:70
msgid "Review AI-generated content before saving or sending"
msgstr "在儲存或傳送前，請先檢閱 AI 生成的內容"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:71
msgid "Adjust wording to match the company's tone and communication standards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/improve_text.rst:73
msgid ""
"|AI|-assisted writing is designed to support productivity, while final "
"review and validation remain essential."
msgstr "|AI| 輔助撰寫旨在提升生產力，但最終審閱與驗證仍然至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:3
msgid "AI live chat"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **AI** application can be integrated with **Live Chat** to enable "
"agents to automatically respond to customer inquiries, qualify "
"conversations, and generate leads. When connected to a live chat channel, an"
" AI agent can answer common questions, request additional information, and "
"determine when a conversation needs to be escalated to a human operator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:10
msgid ""
"AI responses are generated in real-time and follow the rules and "
"instructions defined in the assigned agent and skills."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:14
msgid "Connecting an agent to live chat"
msgstr "將客服人員連接至線上客服"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:16
msgid ""
"First, confirm that both the **Live Chat** and **AI** applications are "
"installed."
msgstr "首先，請確認已安裝 **線上客服** 及 **AI** 應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:19
msgid ""
"When both the **AI** and **Live Chat** apps are installed, a *Livechat AI "
"Agent* is added to the **AI** app. Other agents can be created and used for "
"live chat conversations, if desired."
msgstr ""
"當同時安裝 **AI** 及 **線上客服** 應用程式時，**AI** 應用程式會新增一個 *即時"
"聊天 AI 代理*。如有需要，你亦可以建立其他代理並用於即時聊天對話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:22
msgid "The preconfigured AI Live Chat agent in the AI app."
msgstr "AI 應用程式中預先設定的 AI 即時聊天代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:25
msgid ""
"Navigate to the **Live Chat** application and select a live chat channel. On"
" the channel card, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical "
"ellipsis)` icon, then click :guilabel:`Configure Channel`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:29
msgid ""
"On the channel page, click on the :guilabel:`Rules` tab. Click on an "
"existing rule, or click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a new rule. On the "
"*Open: Rules* pop-up, click in the :guilabel:`AI Agent` field, and select an"
" agent from the drop-down."
msgstr ""
"在頻道頁面上，點擊 :guilabel:`規則` 分頁。點擊現有規則，或點擊 :guilabel:`新"
"增資料行` 以新增規則。在 *開啟：規則* 彈出視窗中，點擊 :guilabel:`AI 代理程"
"式` 欄位，然後從下拉式選單中選擇代理程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:33
msgid "The rules pop-up window in the live chat app."
msgstr "線上客服應用程式中的規則彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:37
msgid ""
"If a channel has both a chatbot and an AI Agent assigned, the priority is "
"given to the AI agent workflow."
msgstr "如果頻道同時指派了聊天機械人及 AI 代理，系統會優先執行 AI 代理工作流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:41
msgid "Configuring AI behavior in live chat"
msgstr "設定即時通訊中的 AI 行為"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:43
msgid ""
"The behavior and actions of the AI agent during a live chat conversation are"
" controlled through the agent's settings.  To configure the :doc:`agent "
"<agents>`, navigate to the :menuselection:`AI app --> Agents`. On the agent "
"card, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon, "
"then click :guilabel:`Configuration`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:48
msgid ""
"As the default *Livechat AI Agent* is configured to work with live chat, "
"this section lays out how the agent's prompt is used in a live chat "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"由於預設的 *線上客服 AI 代理* 已設定為與線上客服配合使用，本節將說明代理的提"
"示詞如何在線上客服對話中使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:52
msgid "Agent identity and goals"
msgstr "代理身份及目標"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:54
msgid ""
"The *Livechat AI Agent* identity helps define the agent's communication "
"style and conversation goals. At a high level, the agent is focused on "
"answering customer questions accurately, while also being responsible for "
"initiating lead creation when a request cannot be handled confidently."
msgstr ""
"*線上客服 AI 代理* 身份有助於定義代理的溝通風格及對話目標。整體而言，該代理專"
"注於準確解答客戶問題，同時亦負責在無法有把握地處理請求時，啟動建立線索的程序"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:58
msgid ""
"Rather than reacting message-by-message, the agent evaluates each "
"interaction against its defined priorities."
msgstr "代理不會逐則訊息作出反應，而是會根據已定義的優先順序評估每次互動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:62
msgid "How the agent answers questions"
msgstr "代理如何回答問題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:64
msgid ""
"During a conversation, each incoming message is evaluated against the "
"agent's decision rules. When sufficient information is available, the agent "
"responds directly with a clear and concise answer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:67
msgid ""
"If the available information is incomplete or uncertain, the agent does not "
"guess or fabricate a response. Instead, it acknowledges the limitation and "
"prepares to transition the conversation toward human follow-up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:71
msgid "This ensures that automated responses remain accurate and trustworthy."
msgstr "這可確保自動回覆保持準確及值得信賴。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:74
msgid "How escalation is triggered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:76
msgid ""
"Escalation to human follow-up is defined explicitly in the agent's prompt "
"and delegated to a dedicated skill."
msgstr "升級至真人跟進會在代理程式的提示詞中明確定義，並委派給專屬技能處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:79
msgid "Conversations are escalated when one of the following occurs:"
msgstr "當發生以下任何一種情況時，對話會升級處理："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:81
msgid ""
"The request requires custom pricing, contracts, or implementation work."
msgstr "此要求需要自訂定價、合約或實施工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:82
msgid "The request involves account changes or troubleshooting."
msgstr "此請求涉及帳戶變更或疑難排解。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:83
msgid "The user explicitly asks to be contacted or requests a demo."
msgstr "用戶明確要求與其聯絡，或要求進行示範。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:84
msgid "The agent cannot respond with high confidence."
msgstr "代理無法以高確信度回應。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:86
msgid ""
"When one of these conditions is met, the agent activates the *Lead Creation*"
" :ref:`skill <ai/agents/skills>`."
msgstr ""
"符合上述其中一項條件時，代理程式便會啟用 *建立潛在客戶* :ref:`技能 <ai/"
"agents/skills>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:90
msgid "Lead creation skill"
msgstr "建立潛在客戶技能"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:92
msgid ""
"The Lead Creation skill defines a structured, multi-step workflow that "
"governs how contact information is collected and how a lead is created."
msgstr ""
"「建立潛在客戶」技能定義了一個結構化的多步驟工作流程，用以規範聯絡資料的收集"
"方式及建立潛在客戶的流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:95
msgid "This skill specifies:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:97
msgid "when lead creation is appropriate"
msgstr "何時適合建立潛在客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:98
msgid "what information must be collected"
msgstr "必須收集哪些資料"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:99
msgid "how the conversation should progress"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:100
msgid "what language the agent may and may not use"
msgstr "代理可以使用及不可使用的語言"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:102
msgid ""
"Rather than immediately creating a lead, the agent completes the following "
"steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:104
msgid "Suggests human follow-up when appropriate"
msgstr "在適當時候建議由人工跟進"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:105
msgid "Collects missing contact details one at a time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:106
msgid "Confirms known details before proceeding"
msgstr "在繼續之前確認已知詳情"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:107
msgid "Calls the lead creation tool exactly once"
msgstr "恰好呼叫一次建立潛在客戶工具"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/live-chat.rst:109
msgid ""
"The skill also enforces strict constraints to prevent system-centric "
"language, duplicate lead creation, or premature promises of follow-up."
msgstr ""
"此技能亦會強制執行嚴格限制，以防止出現以系統為中心的用語、重複建立潛在客戶，"
