#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:5
msgid "AI MCP server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:12
msgid ""
"Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open-source standard that allows large "
"language models (LLMs) to securely interact with external applications and "
"access their data. In Odoo **AI**, users can connect an external |AI| agent "
"directly to their Odoo database through an Odoo |MCP| server in order to "
"read or modify the database using their own local |AI| workflows."
msgstr ""
"模型上下文協定（MCP）是一個開源標準，讓大型語言模型（LLM）能夠安全地與外部應"
"用程式互動並存取其數據。在 Odoo **AI** 中，用戶可將外部 |AI| 代理透過 Odoo "
"|MCP| 伺服器直接連接至其 Odoo 資料庫，以便使用自己的本地 |AI| 工作流程讀取或"
"修改資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:17
msgid ""
"The following documentation provides an overview of Odoo |MCP| servers, how "
"to connect |AI| agents to them, and how to read or write data through the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"以下文件概述了 Odoo |MCP| 伺服器、如何將 |AI| 代理程式連接至伺服器，以及如何"
"透過伺服器讀取或寫入資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:21
msgid ""
"This documentation uses the following terms with some flexibility and may "
"differ from their proper technical usage, either in Odoo or externally:"
msgstr ""
"本說明文件會以較具彈性的方式使用以下術語，其用法可能與 Odoo 內部或外部的正式"
"技術定義有所不同："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:24
msgid ""
"*Client*: Refers broadly to the |AI| application with which the user "
"interacts. For example, the |LLM| prompted by the user is also referred to "
"as the *client*."
msgstr ""
"*用戶端*：泛指用戶與之互動的 |AI| 應用程式。例如，由用戶下達提示的 |LLM| 亦稱"
"為 *用戶端*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:30
msgid "MCP workflow"
msgstr "MCP 工作流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:32
msgid ""
"In the |MCP| workflow, an Odoo database acts as a remote |MCP| *server* that"
" communicates with the |MCP| *client* (the user's external |AI| agent) to "
"execute :doc:`tools <server-actions>` such as reading data or editing "
"records in the database. This process occurs internally and is invisible to "
"the user, who interacts with the |MCP| client **only** by prompting it with "
"specific tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:37
msgid "The following sequence outlines the |MCP| workflow in Odoo:"
msgstr "以下順序概述 Odoo 中的 |MCP| 工作流程："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:39
msgid ""
"The user :ref:`configures the client <ai/mcp/configuration>` with server "
"details and an authentication key. Once connected, the client automatically "
"makes an initial request to the server for any available :doc:`AI tools "
"<mcp_server/mcp_tools>` (or *Server Actions*) exposed to it in the database."
" If successful, the client caches the tools for the remainder of the "
"session."
msgstr ""
"使用者會使用伺服器詳細資料及驗證金鑰來 :ref:`設定用戶端 <ai/mcp/"
"configuration>`。連線後，用戶端會自動向伺服器發出初始請求，以取得資料庫中向其"
"公開的所有可用 :doc:`AI 工具 <mcp_server/mcp_tools>` （或 *伺服器動作* ）。若"
"請求成功，用戶端會在該工作階段的餘下時間內快取這些工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:43
msgid ""
"The user prompts the client in plain language. A list of :ref:`example "
"prompts <ai/mcp/use-cases>` is provided in this documentation."
msgstr ""
"使用者以淺白語言向用戶端發出提示。本說明文件提供了 :ref:`提示範例 <ai/mcp/"
"use-cases>` 列表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:45
msgid "The client requests that the server invoke the correct tools."
msgstr "客戶端要求伺服器呼叫正確的工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/mcp_server.rst:46
msgid ""
"After executing the tool, the server returns the results to the client."
msgstr "執行工具後，伺服器會將結果傳回用戶端。"

