#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Use Odoo AI in automated workflows. Learn how to trigger AI agents "
"automatically and how AI server actions evaluate records and select tools to"
" execute, with a document sorting example and guidance on choosing the right"
" approach."
msgstr ""
"在自動化工作流程中使用 Odoo AI。了解如何自動觸發 AI 代理，以及 AI 伺服器動作"
"如何評估記錄並選擇要執行的工具，當中亦包含文件分類範例及選擇合適方法的指引。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:8
msgid "AI server actions"
msgstr "AI 伺服器動作"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:12
msgid ""
"Odoo |AI| can be used in automated workflows in two ways: an automated or "
"scheduled action can trigger an |AI| agent to perform a task, or an AI "
"server action can make decisions and select tools to execute within a "
"workflow."
msgstr ""
"Odoo |AI| 可透過兩種方式用於自動化工作流程：自動化動作或排程動作可觸發 |AI| "
"代理執行任務，或由 AI 伺服器動作在工作流程中作出決策並選擇工具執行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:16
msgid "These approaches serve different purposes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:18
msgid ""
"*AI agent triggers*: Summon a configured :doc:`agent <agents>` to perform a "
"task based on its instructions, Skills, and Sources."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:20
msgid ""
"*AI server actions*: Use |AI| to interpret a prompt, evaluate a record, and "
"select an appropriate server action to execute."
msgstr "*AI 伺服器動作*：使用 |AI| 解讀提示詞、評估記錄，並選擇適當的伺服器動作執行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:24
msgid "Trigger an AI agent"
msgstr "觸發 AI 代理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:26
msgid ""
"An |AI| agent can be launched interactively by a user through an AI chat or "
"triggered automatically as part of an Odoo workflow."
msgstr ""
"用戶可透過 AI 對話互動式啟動 |AI| 代理，或將其作為 Odoo 工作流程的一部分自動"
"觸發。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:29
msgid ""
"To configure an automatic trigger, open the agent and navigate to the "
"*Trigger* tab. Click :icon:`add` :guilabel:`Add`. On the *When should your "
"agent be triggered?* pop-up, choose one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"要設定自動觸發條件，請開啟代理程式並前往 *觸發條件* 分頁，然後按一下 "
":icon:`add` :guilabel:`新增`。在 *應於何時觸發代理程式？* 彈出視窗中，請選擇"
"以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:33
msgid ""
"*On a schedule*: Run the agent automatically according to a set frequency."
msgstr "*按排程*：根據設定的頻率自動執行代理程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:34
msgid ""
"*Based on a Date Field*: Run the agent once per record when a specific date "
"is reached."
msgstr "*根據日期欄位*：當到達特定日期時，為每項記錄執行一次代理程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:35
msgid "*After creation*: Run the agent whenever a new record is created."
msgstr "*建立後*：每當建立新記錄時執行代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:36
msgid "*After update*: Run the agent whenever a specified field is updated."
msgstr "*更新後*：每當指定欄位更新時執行代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:38
msgid ""
"Configure the additional options for the selected trigger, then save the "
"agent."
msgstr "為所選觸發器設定額外選項，然後儲存代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:41
msgid ""
"For long-running tasks, such as extensive web searches, use a scheduled "
"trigger rather than an immediate, event-driven trigger. This allows the task"
" to run in the background instead of blocking the user interface while the "
"operation executes."
msgstr ""
"對於需要長時間執行的任務（例如大規模網頁搜尋），請使用排程觸發條件，而非即時"
"的事件驅動觸發條件。這樣可讓任務在背景執行，而不會在執行操作期間阻塞使用者介"
"面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:45
msgid ""
"When the trigger conditions are met, the agent executes the instructions "
"using its configured Skills, Tools, and Sources."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:49
msgid ""
"Agents triggered automatically perform their tasks directly, without "
"requesting user approval before creating or updating records. Configure the "
"agent's instructions and available tools carefully, particularly when the "
"workflow can modify important business data."
msgstr ""
"自動觸發的代理會直接執行任務，在建立或更新記錄前不會要求用戶核准。請謹慎設定"
"代理的指示及可用工具，特別是當工作流程可能修改重要業務數據時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:54
msgid "How AI server actions work"
msgstr "AI 伺服器動作的運作方式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:56
msgid ""
"|AI| server actions extend Odoo's automation framework by allowing |AI| to "
"make decisions during a workflow. They are useful when a task requires "
"interpreting information or selecting an appropriate action, but the actual "
"execution should remain controlled by standard server actions."
msgstr ""
"|AI| 伺服器動作擴展了 Odoo 的自動化框架，讓 |AI| 能夠在工作流程中作出決策。當"
"任務需要解讀資料或選擇合適的動作，但實際執行仍應由標準伺服器動作控制時，此功"
"能便十分有用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:60
msgid ""
"AI-driven workflows use two components: *the Manager* and *the Worker*."
msgstr "AI 驅動的工作流程使用兩個組件：*管理者* 與 *工作者*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:63
msgid "AI server action: the manager"
msgstr "AI 伺服器動作：經理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:65
msgid "An |AI| server action acts as a decision-maker, or Manager. It:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:67
msgid "Reads the record and its context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:68
msgid "Interprets the AI prompt."
msgstr "解讀 AI 提示詞。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:69
msgid "Selects an appropriate tool."
msgstr "選取合適的工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:70
msgid "Provides the arguments required by the selected tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:72
msgid ""
"The Manager does not enforce business rules or execute the underlying "
"operation itself. Its role is limited to deciding which tool to call and "
"what arguments to provide."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:78
msgid "AI tool: the worker"
msgstr "AI 工具：工作者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:80
msgid ""
"A *Tool* is a standard server action configured for use by |AI|. To make a "
"server action available as a tool, enable the *Use in AI* option in its "
"*Usage* tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:83
msgid ""
"Tools contain the execution logic and perform operations such as updating "
"records, moving documents, or writing data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:86
msgid ""
"The tool must enforce any required business rules in its own execution "
"logic. When called by the server action, it executes without requesting "
"additional user approval, unless its code explicitly prevents the operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:91
msgid "AI server action workflow"
msgstr "AI 伺服器動作工作流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:93
msgid "The |AI| server action workflow follows this sequence:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:95
msgid "A record triggers an |AI| server action."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:96
msgid "The server action evaluates the prompt using the record as context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:97
msgid "The server action selects an available tool."
msgstr "伺服器動作會選取可用的工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:98
msgid "The server action supplies the arguments required by the tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:99
msgid "The tool executes its configured logic."
msgstr "該工具會執行其已設定的邏輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:102
msgid ""
"|AI| server actions do not automatically enforce business rules or validate "
"whether an operation is appropriate. The server action must contain the "
"necessary checks and safeguards. If a server action is called, its execution"
" logic runs unless the code itself prevents the operation."
msgstr ""
"|AI| 伺服器動作不會自動執行業務規則，亦不會驗證操作是否適當。伺服器動作必須包"
"含必要的檢查及保護措施。只要伺服器動作被呼叫，除非程式碼本身阻止操作，否則其"
"執行邏輯便會運作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:107
msgid "Use case: Sort documents in the Inbox"
msgstr "使用案例：在收件箱整理文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:109
msgid ""
"The *Auto-sort documents in Inbox* example demonstrates the full |AI| Server"
" Action pattern. Navigate to the *Server Actions* menu by going to "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Server Actions`. Then search for "
"`Auto-sort documents in Inbox`."
msgstr ""
"*自動分類收件匣文件*範例展示了完整的 |AI| 伺服器動作模式。前往 "
":menuselection:`設定 --> 技術 --> 伺服器動作`，進入*伺服器動作*選單，然後搜"
"尋 `Auto-sort documents in Inbox`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:114
msgid ""
"This server action is designed to review documents for their content and add"
" tags. The action itself does **not** move documents or add tags. It only "
"decides which tool should be used, based on the documents' content."
msgstr ""
"此伺服器動作旨在檢視文件內容並加入標籤。該動作本身 **不會** 移動文件或加入標"
"籤，只會根據文件內容決定應使用哪個工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:118
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Model` for the action is listed as *Document*, and the "
":guilabel:`Type` is *AI*."
msgstr "此動作的 :guilabel:`模型` 列為 *文件*，而 :guilabel:`類型` 為 *AI*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:120
msgid "The record for the Auto-sort documents in inbox server action."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:123
msgid ""
"The prompt for this action provides context about the document, as well as "
"the intent of the action."
msgstr "此動作的提示詞會提供有關文件的背景資訊，以及該動作的意圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:125
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tools` field includes several actions that may be taken based"
" on this prompt, including moving a document, adding tags, or creating "
"invoices or bills."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:129
msgid ""
"*AI Tool: Link Document to Vehicle*, *AI Tool: Move to Folder*, and *AI "
"Tool: Rename File* are all *Execute Code* server actions, meaning they "
"trigger Python code."
msgstr ""
"*AI 工具：將文件連結至車輛*、*AI 工具：移動至資料夾*及*AI 工具：重新命名檔"
"案*全屬*執行程式碼*伺服器動作，即會觸發 Python 程式碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:132
msgid ""
"For example, if the action determines, based on the content of the document,"
" that the most appropriate tool is *AI Tool: Move to Folder*, the Python "
"code performs the following operation:"
msgstr ""
"例如，若動作根據文件內容判斷最適合的工具為 *AI 工具：移至資料夾*，Python 程式"
"碼便會執行以下操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:139
msgid ""
"This code executes unconditionally when called and performs the move using "
"an existing method."
msgstr "此程式碼在呼叫時會無條件執行，並使用現有方法執行移動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:142
msgid ""
"The |AI| does not infer arguments from the Python code or from the method "
"signature. Instead, arguments passed to a tool are determined entirely by "
"the tool's configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:145
msgid ""
"For the *AI: Move to Folder* tool, the Python code expects a variable named "
"`folder_id`. The |AI| knows to provide `folder_id` because it is explicitly "
"declared as an argument in the configuration. This can be found on the "
"*Usage* tab of the server action, in the :guilabel:`AI Schema` field. The "
":guilabel:`Name` column under *AI Schema* must match the variable name used "
"in the Python code exactly."
msgstr ""
