#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:3
msgid "AI in support workflows"
msgstr "支援工作流程中的 AI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:7
msgid ""
"Utilizing Odoo's |AI| features in the **Helpdesk** app assists support "
"agents with their tasks, rather than replacing existing workflows. The goal "
"is to reduce repetitive tasks, accelerate ticket handling, and improve "
"consistency by allowing |AI| to analyze ticket content and suggest or "
"execute actions automatically."
msgstr ""
"在 **服務台** 應用程式中使用 Odoo 的 |AI| 功能，旨在協助支援專員處理日常工作"
"，而非取代現有工作流程。其目標是讓 |AI| 自動分析工單內容並建議或執行操作，從"
"而減少重複性工作、加快工單處理速度並提升一致性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:12
msgid ""
"Instead of manually categorizing, prioritizing, and responding to every "
"request, support teams can rely on |AI| to interpret incoming information "
"and perform preliminary processing. Agents remain in control of decisions "
"and customer communication, while |AI| handles repetitive analysis and "
"drafting."
msgstr ""
"支援團隊毋須人手分類、排定優先次序及回覆每個請求，而是可以依賴 |AI| 解讀收到"
"的資訊並進行初步處理。專員仍可掌控決策及客戶溝通，而 |AI| 則負責處理重複性的"
"分析及草擬工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:18
msgid "How AI works in Helpdesk"
msgstr "AI 在「技術支援」中的運作方式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:20
msgid "|AI| capabilities in **Helpdesk** are built around three core ideas:"
msgstr "|AI| 在 **服務台** 中的功能圍繞三個核心理念而建構："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:22
msgid ""
"|AI| agents that interact with users or agents and generate responses based "
"on knowledge sources."
msgstr "|AI| 與用戶或代理互動，並根據知識來源生成回覆的代理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:23
msgid ""
"|AI| automations that update tickets automatically when records are created "
"or modified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:24
msgid ""
"|AI| enabled fields that generate structured information, such as summaries,"
" from unstructured text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:30
msgid ""
"An |AI| agent is a configurable assistant that operates using prompts and "
"contextual knowledge. The agent itself does not contain business logic; "
"instead, it follows instructions defined by users and relies on provided "
"documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:34
msgid ""
"When an agent receives a request, it combines its system :ref:`prompt "
"<ai/agents/prompts-in-odoo>`, the current record context (such as a ticket),"
" and its knowledge :ref:`sources <ai/sources>`."
msgstr ""
"當代理收到請求時，會結合其系統:ref:`提示詞 <ai/agents/prompts-in-odoo>`、目前"
"記錄的上下文（例如支援工單），以及其知識:ref:`來源 <ai/sources>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:37
msgid ""
"This allows the agent to provide responses grounded in internal "
"documentation rather than generic language model output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:40
msgid ""
"Agents can be restricted to specific sources or granted permissions to "
"perform actions using skills. This ensures that support assistants behave "
"predictably and remain aligned with organizational rules."
msgstr ""
"可限制代理僅存取特定來源，或授予其使用技能執行動作的權限。這可確保支援助理的"
"表現符合預期，並遵守機構的規範。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:45
msgid "AI automations"
msgstr "AI 自動化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:47
msgid ""
"Automation rules allow |AI| to act during record lifecycle events. Instead "
"of waiting for an agent to categorize or prioritize tickets, |AI| can "
"perform these tasks automatically as soon as a ticket is created."
msgstr ""
"自動化規則可讓 |AI| 在記錄生命週期事件期間執行操作。無需等待專員為工單分類或"
"設定優先順序，在建立工單後，|AI| 即可自動執行這些任務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:51
msgid ""
"The key principle is that |AI| does not understand Odoo models directly. It "
"receives text extracted from fields and produces an output based on prompt "
"instructions. Users guide |AI| behavior through clear prompting and "
"carefully selected input fields."
msgstr ""
"關鍵原則在於 |AI| 並不直接理解 Odoo 模型。它只會接收從欄位擷取的文字，並根據"
"提示詞指令產生輸出。用戶可透過清晰的提示詞及仔細挑選的輸入欄位，引導 |AI| 的"
"運作行為。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:58
msgid ""
"|AI| enabled fields extend standard Odoo fields by allowing their values to "
"be generated automatically through prompts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:61
msgid ""
"These fields are useful when large amounts of text need to be condensed into"
" actionable information. For example, a long customer message can "
"automatically be summarized into a short list of key points, allowing agents"
" to understand issues quickly without reading full descriptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:69
msgid "Configuring an AI agent for support"
msgstr "設定支援用途的 AI 代理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:71
msgid ""
"|AI| :doc:`agents <agents>` are configured in the **AI** application. To "
"configure an existing agent, navigate to :menuselection:`AI app` and click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon, then click "
":guilabel:`Configuration` on the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:75
msgid ""
"Configuring begins by selecting a language model and defining a system "
"prompt describing how the agent should behave. The prompt determines tone, "
"scope, and responsibility. A support-focused agent might be instructed to "
"analyze issues and provide concise technical responses."
msgstr ""
"設定從選擇語言模型及定義系統提示詞開始，用以描述代理程式的行為方式。提示詞決"
"定代理程式的語氣、範圍及職責。例如，專注於技術支援的代理程式可獲指示分析問題"
"並提供簡潔的技術回覆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:79
msgid ""
"The next step is defining the agent's *sources*. These :ref:`sources "
"<ai/sources>` form the agent's memory and should contain trusted "
"documentation such as product guides or FAQs. The quality of these sources "
"directly impacts the quality of AI responses."
msgstr ""
"下一步是定義代理的 *來源* 。這些 :ref:`來源 <ai/sources>` 構成代理的記憶，應"
"包含產品指南或常見問題等受信任的文件。這些來源的質素會直接影響 AI 回應的質素"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:84
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Restrict to Sources` to require the agent to **only** base"
" their responses on the supplied resources."
msgstr "選擇 :guilabel:`限制為來源`，要求代理 **僅** 根據所提供的資源作出回應。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:87
msgid ""
"Users may also define *skills*, which grant the agent permission to perform "
"specific actions. :ref:`Skills <ai/agents/skills>` allow advanced scenarios "
"such as record creation or automation triggers."
msgstr ""
"用戶亦可定義 *技能*，授予代理執行特定操作的權限。:ref:`技能 <ai/agents/"
"skills>` 支援建立記錄或自動化觸發條件等進階應用場景。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:90
msgid "An example support AI agent."
msgstr "支援 AI 代理範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:93
msgid ""
"Once an agent exists, *default prompts* can be used to initiate a "
"conversation."
msgstr "建立代理後，即可使用*預設提示詞*發起對話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:95
msgid ""
"A default prompt defines where and when the |AI| appears inside Odoo. In the"
" **Helpdesk** app, this typically means allowing the |AI| button to appear "
"on ticket records. The default prompt specifies the model where it is "
"available, which agent is called, and additional contextual instructions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:99
msgid "A list of default prompts assigned to the Support Agent."
msgstr "指派予支援專員的預設提示詞清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:102
msgid ""
"These instructions act as a second layer on top of the agent prompt, "
"adapting the agent's behavior to **Helpdesk** scenarios."
msgstr ""
"這些指示作為代理程式提示之上的第二層設定，讓代理程式的行為配合 **支援中心** "
"情境。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:106
msgid "Configuring AI automations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:108
msgid ""
"|AI| :doc:`server actions <server-actions>` are configured using standard "
"automated actions, with |AI| used as the update mechanism."
msgstr ""
"|AI| :doc:`伺服器動作 <server-actions>`是透過標準自動化動作進行設定，並使用 "
"|AI| 作為更新機制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:111
msgid ""
"When defining a server action, users specify when the action should run, "
"such as when a new ticket is created. The |AI| prompt then explains how the "
"ticket should be interpreted and which field should be updated."
msgstr ""
"定義伺服器動作時，使用者須指定動作應於何時執行（例如：建立新支援工單時）。然"
"後，|AI| 提示詞會說明應如何解讀工單，以及應更新哪個欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:115
msgid ""
"This approach keeps automation predictable while allowing |AI| to make "
"contextual decisions."
msgstr "這種方式可保持自動化流程的可預測性，同時讓 |AI| 根據情境作出決策。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:118
msgid "Configuring AI fields"
msgstr "設定 AI 欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:120
msgid ""
"|AI| :doc:`fields <fields>` are configured by enabling the |AI| option on a "
"custom or property field and providing a prompt describing the expected "
"result. Once configured, the field updates automatically when the record "
"changes, giving agents instant access to structured information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:125
msgid ""
"|AI| fields can be added to a record through the **Studio** app or property "
"field. :ref:`Installing Studio <general/install>` may impact the current "
"pricing plan for a database."
msgstr ""
"|AI| 欄位可透過 **Studio** 應用程式或屬性欄位新增至記錄。:ref:`安裝 Studio "
"<general/install>` 可能會影響資料庫目前的定價方案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:132
msgid ":doc:`AI Fields <fields>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/support_operations.rst:134
msgid ":doc:`AI Server Actions <server-actions>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:3
msgid "AI voice transcription"
msgstr "AI 語音轉錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo |AI| can transcribe spoken audio into text and generate summaries from "
"that transcript. This feature supports both meeting recordings and real-time"
" dictation, making it easier to capture notes, decisions, and action items "
"without manual typing."
msgstr ""
"Odoo |AI| 可將語音轉錄為文字，並根據該逐字稿產生摘要。此功能同時支援會議錄音"
"及即時聽寫，無需手動輸入即可輕鬆記錄筆記、決議及待辦事項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:11
msgid ""
"Voice transcription converts spoken audio into a written transcript. Once a "
"transcript is available, Odoo |AI| can generate a summary that highlights "
"key information, such as:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:14
msgid "key discussion points"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:15
msgid "decisions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:16
msgid "action items"
msgstr "行動項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:17
msgid "next steps"
msgstr "後續步驟"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:19
msgid ""
"Transcription and summarization can be used for meetings, calls, quick "
"dictations, and internal notes."
msgstr "轉錄及摘要功能可用於會議、通話、快速口述筆記及內部備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:23
msgid ""
"Voice transcripts can be created in the *Description* and *Notes* fields of "
"most records, as well as in **Knowledge** articles."
msgstr ""
"大部分記錄的 *描述* 和 *備註* 欄位，以及 **知識庫** 文章中，皆可建立語音逐字"
"稿。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:26
msgid "The powerbox in the description tab of a task in the Projects app."
msgstr "「專案」應用程式任務「描述」分頁中的 Powerbox。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:29
msgid ""
"Voice transcription works by temporarily recording audio during the session,"
" replaying it for transcription, and generating a written transcript and "
"summary. Once the transcription process is complete, the audio recording is "
"automatically discarded. The recorded audio is not stored, replayable, or "
"accessible from the database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:35
msgid "Transcribe a meeting"
msgstr "轉錄會議"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:37
msgid ""
"To create a voice transcript, type `/` to open the :ref:`powerbox "
"<essentials/html_editor/commands>`. Select :guilabel:`Voice Transcript` from"
" the drop-down list. This creates a new text block. Click :icon:`fa-bars` "
":guilabel:`Notes` to add notes and details regarding the meeting. This is "
"where information, such as a meeting agenda and attendees, can be added. "
"Click :icon:`fa-microphone` :guilabel:`Transcript` to switch to a live view "
"of the transcript being created in real-time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:44
msgid ""
"When the meeting is ready to begin, click :icon:`fa-circle` :guilabel:`Start"
" Recording`."
msgstr "準備好開始會議時，請按一下 :icon:`fa-circle` :guilabel:`開始錄音`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:47
msgid ""
"Clicking :icon:`fa-circle` :guilabel:`Start Recording` may cause a pop-up in"
" the browser, requesting access to a microphone. If permission is not given,"
" the recording stops, and an error message appears. To combat this error, "
"refresh the page and allow Odoo access to the microphone."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-circle` :guilabel:`開始錄音` 可能會導致瀏覽器彈出視窗，請求存"
"取咪高峰。如果未授予權限，錄音便會停止，並顯示錯誤訊息。如要解決此錯誤，請重"
"新整理頁面並允許 Odoo 存取咪高峰。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:51
msgid ""
"When the meeting has ended, click :icon:`fa-stop` :guilabel:`Stop "
"Recording`. The recorded audio is then processed to generate a transcript "
"and an |AI| summary. Once processing is complete, the audio recording is "
"automatically discarded, leaving only the transcript and summary available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:55
msgid "The AI summary of a meeting transctipt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/voice.rst:58
msgid ""
"The |AI| summary can be manually edited to provide additional insight, such "
"as identifying meeting attendees by name, or specifying key points. The "
"meeting notes can then be converted into an email recap, or shared directly "
"via email by clicking the :guilabel:`Share by email` button."
msgstr ""
"你可手動編輯 |AI| 摘要以補充更多細節，例如標明會議出席者姓名或列出重點。之後"
"，你可將會議筆記轉換為電郵摘要，或點擊 :guilabel:`透過電郵分享` 按鈕直接透過"
"電郵分享。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments.rst:6
msgid "Appointments"
msgstr "預約"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments.rst:8
msgid ""
"The **Appointments** app is a self-service scheduling tool that lets clients"
" and prospects book meetings, consultations, or services directly from an "
"online booking page. Integrated with **CRM**, **Calendar**, and other Odoo "
"apps, it allows companies to automate appointment scheduling based on the "
"real-time availability of users' calendars or shared resources, such as "
"meeting rooms or equipment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:28
msgid "Appointment types"
msgstr "預約類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:5
msgid ""
"The main :menuselection:`Appointments` app dashboard displays all "
"appointment types in a default Kanban view. Each row shows the appointment "
"title, duration, the assigned users or resources, and counters for upcoming "
"and total meetings or bookings."
msgstr ""
"主要的 :menuselection:`預約` 應用程式儀表板會以預設的看板檢視模式顯示所有預約"
"類型。每行都會顯示預約標題、時長、已指派的用戶或資源，以及即將舉行的會議及總"
"會議或預訂數量的計數器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:10
msgid ""
"User-based appointment types display their counters as :guilabel:`Meetings`,"
" while resource-based types display them as :guilabel:`Bookings`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:13
msgid "Each appointment type has two action buttons on the right:"
msgstr "每個預約類型右側都有兩個操作按鈕："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:15
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Share`: Click this button to copy the appointment link to the "
"clipboard, which can be shared."
msgstr ":guilabel:`分享`：點擊此按鈕可將預約連結複製到剪貼簿，以便分享。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:17
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Configure`: Click this to open the appointment type form to edit "
"its settings."
msgstr ":guilabel:`設定`：按一下此項目以開啟預約類型表單，並編輯其設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:19
msgid ""
"Published appointment types display a :guilabel:`Published` ribbon. "
"Unpublished types do not have a ribbon and are not visible to customers on "
"the website."
msgstr ""
"已發佈的預約類型會顯示 :guilabel:`已發佈` 橫幅標籤。未發佈的類型不會顯示橫幅"
"標籤，顧客亦無法在網站上看見。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:22
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new appointment type, or click "
":guilabel:`Share` in the top toolbar to share multiple appointment types at "
"once."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`新增` 以建立新的預約類型，或按一下頂部工具列中的 "
":guilabel:`分享` 以一次分享多個預約類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Appointment types** represent a bookable service. An appointment type "
"defines *what* can be booked, *when* it is available, *who* (or which "
"resource) handles it, and what information the customer must provide."
msgstr ""
"**預約類型** 代表可預訂的服務。預約類型會定義可預訂的 *內容*、可用的 *時間*、"
"負責處理的 *人員*（或資源），以及客戶必須提供的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:34
msgid ""
"To create or manage appointment types, open the "
":menuselection:`Appointments` app dashboard and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"要建立或管理預約類型，請開啟 :menuselection:`預約` 應用程式儀表板，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:40
msgid "Resources"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:42
msgid ""
"The **Appointments** app allows new appointments to be scheduled based on "
"user or resource availability, such as meeting rooms or seating areas. To "
"create a new resource, or manage existing resources, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Appointments --> Configuration --> Resources`."
msgstr ""
"**預約** 應用程式可讓您根據使用者或資源（例如會議室或座位區）的可用情況來排程"
"新預約。如要建立新資源或管理現有資源，請前往 :menuselection:`預約 --> 設"
"定 --> 資源`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:46
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a resource. On the blank record, enter a "
":guilabel:`Name` for the new resource (e.g., ``Court 1``). In the "
":guilabel:`Capacity` field, enter the maximum number of people the resource "
"can accommodate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:50
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Opening Hours` field defines the working calendar for this "
"resource. By default, it is set to :guilabel:`Appointment Resource Default "
"Calendar`. Select a different calendar to customize the resource's own "
"availability independently from the appointment type's Availabilities tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:56
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Opening Hours` field only appears when :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode/activation>` is activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:59
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Linked Resource` field, select how this resource combines "
"with others. By default, a resource is set to :guilabel:`Does not combine`, "
"meaning it operates independently. To allow the resource to be used in "
"combination with others to handle larger groups, select one or more "
"resources to link."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`連結資源` 欄位中，選擇此資源如何與其他資源組合使用。預設情況下"
"，資源設為 :guilabel:`不組合`，表示其獨立運作。若要允許此資源與其他資源組合使"
"用以應對較大規模的群組，請選擇一個或多個要連結的資源。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:65
msgid ""
"Linked resources are only used when the appointment type's "
":guilabel:`Assignment` is set to :guilabel:`Automatically`."
msgstr ""
"只有當預約類型的 :guilabel:`指派` 設為 :guilabel:`自動` 時，才會使用關聯資源"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:68
msgid ""
"Lastly, in the :guilabel:`Description` tab, add a description for this "
"resource. The contents of this tab are visible to customers when booking an "
"appointment online and can be used to describe the space, amenities, or "
"equipment available."
msgstr ""
"最後，在 :guilabel:`描述` 分頁中，為此資源新增描述。此分頁的內容會於客戶在網"
"上預約時顯示，可用作介紹所提供的空間、設施或設備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:72
msgid ""
"The resource form for a tennis court with capacity, opening hours, and "
"timezone."
msgstr "網球場的資源表單，包含容量、開放時間及時區。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:78
msgid "Increase the maximum displayed capacity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:80
msgid ""
"When booking an appointment based on resource availability, the website only"
" displays capacity up to ``20``. This occurs even if the resource has a "
"higher capacity. To raise this limit, a new system parameter needs to be "
"added to the database."
msgstr ""
"根據資源可用性預約時，網站只會顯示最多 ``20`` 的容量，即使資源擁有更高容量亦"
"然。如要提高此上限，必須在資料庫中新增系統參數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:84
msgid ""
"First, ensure that :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` is enabled. Then, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> Parameters --> "
"System Parameters`. Click :guilabel:`New` to add a new parameter."
msgstr ""
"首先，請確保已啟用 :ref:`開發者模式 <developer-mode>`。然後，前往 "
":menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 技術 --> 參數 --> 系統參數`。點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增` 以加入新參數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:88
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Key` field, enter "
"``appointment.resource_max_capacity_allowed``. In the :guilabel:`Value` "
"field, enter the desired maximum capacity. Click the :guilabel:`Save` button"
" when finished."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`鍵`欄位輸入 ``appointment.resource_max_capacity_allowed``。"
"在:guilabel:`值`欄位輸入所需的最大容量。完成後，點擊:guilabel:`儲存`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:95
msgid "Appointment settings"
msgstr "預約設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:97
msgid ""
"On the new record, enter an :guilabel:`Appointment Title`, then set a "
":guilabel:`Duration` for this appointment type (e.g., ``1h``)."
msgstr ""
"在新記錄中，輸入 :guilabel:`預約標題`，然後為此預約類型設定 :guilabel:`持續時"
"間`（例如：``1h``）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:100
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Location` field, select where the appointment takes place."
" For user-based appointments, this defaults to :guilabel:`Online Meeting`. "
"Select a different option to switch to an in-person venue. The "
":guilabel:`Video Link` field defines which videoconference provider is used "
"for online meetings; leave it as :guilabel:`None` to let attendees join "
"without a pre-generated link via Odoo's **Discuss** app."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`地點` 欄位中，選擇預約的舉行地點。對於以使用者為基礎的預約，此"
"欄位預設為 :guilabel:`線上會議`。選擇其他選項可切換至實體場地。:guilabel:`視"
"像連結` 欄位用於指定線上會議所使用的視像會議供應商；如保持為 :guilabel:`無`，"
"參與者便可透過 Odoo 的 **討論** 應用程式加入會議，而無需預先產生連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:106
msgid ""
"Next, designate whether this appointment type is based on :guilabel:`Users` "
"or :guilabel:`Resources`, by selecting the appropriate option in the "
":guilabel:`Book` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:109
msgid ""
"If set to :guilabel:`Users`, select one or more users in the field below. "
"Their calendar availability determines the open slots."
msgstr ""
"如設為 :guilabel:`用戶`，請在下方欄位選擇一名或多名用戶。系統會根據其日曆的空"
"閒時間決定可預約時段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:111
msgid ""
"If set to :guilabel:`Resources`, select one or more :ref:`resources "
"<appointments/resources>` (e.g., rooms, equipment)."
msgstr ""
"如設為 :guilabel:`資源`，請選擇一項或多項 :ref:`資源 <appointments/resources>"
"`（例如：房間、設備）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:115
msgid ""
"User-based appointment types can be used for scheduling sales meetings and "
"demos, as well as recruiting interviews."
msgstr "以使用者為基礎的預約類型可用於安排銷售會議、產品示範及招聘面試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:118
msgid ""
"Resource-based appointment types can be used for scheduling time in specific"
" rooms or locations."
msgstr "基於資源的預約類型可用於安排特定房間或地點的時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:120
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Assignment` field determines how a user or resource is "
"matched to the booking:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Automatically`: Odoo assigns a user or resource based on "
"availability."
msgstr ":guilabel:`自動`：Odoo 會根據可用情況指派使用者或資源。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:123
msgid ""
":guilabel:`By visitor`: the customer picks a specific user or resource "
"themselves."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:125
msgid ""
"When :guilabel:`Assignment` is set to :guilabel:`By visitor`, and more than "
"one option is selected in the :guilabel:`Users` field the :guilabel:`Starts "
"with` field controls the booking flow order:"
msgstr ""
"當 :guilabel:`指派` 設為 :guilabel:`由訪客決定`，且在 :guilabel:`用戶` 欄位中"
"選擇了多於一個選項時，:guilabel:`開始方式` 欄位會控制預約流程的順序："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: the customer first selects a date and time, then chooses "
"from the available users or resources."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`日期`：客戶會先選擇日期和時間，然後再從可用的用戶或資源中進行選擇"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`User / Resource`: the customer first picks a person or resource, "
"then selects an available time slot."
msgstr ":guilabel:`用戶 / 資源`：客戶會先選擇人員或資源，然後再選擇可用的時段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:133
msgid ""
"Lastly, tick the :guilabel:`Manage Capacities` checkbox to limit how many "
"simultaneous appointments each user can have in the same time slot."
msgstr ""
"最後，請勾選 :guilabel:`管理容量` 核取方塊，以限制每位用戶在同一時段內可同時"
"擁有的預約數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:139
msgid "Availabilities tab"
msgstr "可用時段分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:141
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Availabilities` tab is used to define when this appointment "
"type can be booked. Each row represents a recurring time window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:144
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to create an availability window. Select a day "
"of the week from the :guilabel:`Every` drop-down, then set the "
":guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`To` times. Optionally, use the "
":guilabel:`Restrict to Users` column to limit a specific time window to one "
"or more users; if left empty, the window applies to all assigned users."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`新增資料行` 以建立可用時段。從 :guilabel:`每逢` 下拉式選單"
"選取星期幾，然後設定 :guilabel:`由` 及 :guilabel:`至` 時間。你亦可選擇使用 "
":guilabel:`限制特定用戶` 直欄，將特定時段限制為僅限一名或多名用戶使用；若留空"
"，該時段將適用於所有指派的用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:149
msgid ""
"Multiple entries per day are supported. Click the :icon:`fa-trash-o` "
":guilabel:`(trash)` icon to delete an entry."
msgstr ""
"系統支援每日輸入多個項目。按一下 :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(垃圾桶)` 圖示"
"即可刪除項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:153
msgid ""
"To block out a lunch break, create two entries for the same day: one before "
"the break (e.g., ``9h`` to ``12h``) and one after (e.g., ``14h`` to "
"``17h``)."
msgstr ""
"如要預留午休時間，請為同一天建立兩個項目：一個在休息前（例如 ``9h`` 至 "
"``12h``），另一個在休息後（例如 ``14h`` 至 ``17h``）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:157
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Employee Schedule` option is enabled in the :ref:`Options "
"tab <appointments/appointment-types/options-tab>`, availability is the "
"**intersection** of the time windows defined here and the user's working "
"schedule in the **Employees** app. A slot is only bookable if it falls "
"within both. For example, if the Availabilities tab allows Monday ``9h`` to "
"``17h`` but the employee's schedule is Monday ``10h`` to ``16h``, only "
"``10h`` to ``16h`` is shown to customers."
msgstr ""
"若啟用 :guilabel:`員工時間表` 選項（位於 :ref:`選項分頁 <appointments/"
"appointment-types/options-tab>`），可用時間為此處定義的時段與使用者在 **員"
"工** 應用程式中工作時間表的 **交集**。只有同時符合兩者的時段才可供預約。例如"
"，若「可用時間」分頁允許星期一 ``9h`` 至 ``17h``，但員工的時間表為星期一 "
"``10h`` 至 ``16h``，則只會向客戶顯示 ``10h`` 至 ``16h``。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:167
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:204
msgid "Questions tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:169
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Questions` tab can be used to collect customer information "
"during the booking process."
msgstr "您可使用 :guilabel:`問題` 分頁，在預約過程中收集客戶資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:172
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a question directly in the list, and an "
"*Add: Questions* pop-up window loads. Click :guilabel:`Create New`, and a "
"*Create Questions* pop-up window loads. Enter the :guilabel:`Question` text,"
" then select an :guilabel:`Answer Type` (e.g., :guilabel:`Text`, "
":guilabel:`Phone Number`, :guilabel:`Email`). Configure predefined "
":guilabel:`Answers` if the answer type requires them. Tick the "
":guilabel:`Mandatory` checkbox to require an answer before the customer can "
"confirm the booking."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行` 以直接在清單中新增問題，系統隨即載入 *新增：問"
"題* 彈出視窗。點擊 :guilabel:`建立新項目`，系統會載入 *建立問題* 彈出視窗。輸"
"入 :guilabel:`問題` 文字，然後選擇 :guilabel:`答案類型`（例如 :guilabel:`文"
"字`、:guilabel:`電話號碼`、:guilabel:`電郵`）。如該答案類型需要預設答案，請設"
"定預先定義的 :guilabel:`答案`。勾選 :guilabel:`必填` 核取方塊，以要求客戶在確"
"認預約前必須作答。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:182
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:219
msgid "Communication tab"
msgstr "通訊分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:184
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Communication` tab is used to manage the messages shown to "
"customers on the booking page and the automated notifications sent around "
"the appointment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:188
msgid ""
"The content in the :guilabel:`Introduction Page` and :guilabel:`Confirmation"
" Page` fields is visible to customers and website visitors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:191
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Introduction Page` field, add a short description "
"displayed on the booking page before the customer selects a time slot. This "
"can include the topic of the appointment, a meeting agenda, or an "
"introduction to the team."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`簡介頁面` 欄位中，新增一段簡短描述，該描述會在客戶選擇時段前顯"
"示於預約頁面上。內容可包括預約主題、會議議程或團隊簡介。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:195
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Confirmation Page` field is displayed to a customer after "
"they have booked a meeting. Add any additional information here that the "
"customer should be aware of. This can include parking instructions, "
"preparation steps, or venue-specific rules."
msgstr ""
"系統會在客戶預訂會議後向其顯示 :guilabel:`確認頁面` 欄位。請在此新增客戶應了"
"解的任何額外資訊，例如泊車指示、準備步驟或場地特定規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:199
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Reminders` field is used to set how customers are to be "
"contacted before the appointment time. Select one or more options from the "
"drop-down, based on the communication channel (e.g., :guilabel:`Email`, "
":guilabel:`SMS Text Message`) and the lead time (e.g., ``3 Hours``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:203
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Booking Email` field sets the email template sent to "
"attendees when a booking is confirmed. The :guilabel:`Cancellation Email` "
"field sets the email template sent when a booking is canceled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:208
msgid ""
"Internal users who need to be notified whenever a booking is created or "
"canceled can **follow** the appointment type using the :guilabel:`Follow` "
"button in the chatter at the bottom of the record. Followers receive Odoo "
"notifications (and optionally emails) for each new booking and cancellation,"
" without being listed as attendees."
msgstr ""
"每當建立或取消預約時，需要接收通知的內部用戶可使用記錄底部訊息區中的 "
":guilabel:`追蹤` 按鈕，**追蹤** 該預約類型。追蹤者會在每次有新預約或取消預約"
"時收到 Odoo 通知（亦可選擇接收電郵），而不會被列為參加者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:214
msgid ""
"For information on configuring the :guilabel:`Google Bookings` tab, see "
":doc:`google_reserve`."
msgstr "有關設定 :guilabel:`Google 預訂` 分頁的資訊，請參閱 :doc:`google_reserve`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:219
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:234
msgid "Options tab"
msgstr "選項分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:221
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Options` tab is used to configure advanced settings for the "
"appointment type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:223
msgid ""
"Tick the :guilabel:`Allow invitations` checkbox to let users send "
"appointment invitations directly to contacts."
msgstr "勾選 :guilabel:`允許邀請` 核取方塊，讓用戶可直接向聯絡人發送預約邀請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:226
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Auto Confirm` checkbox, when enabled, automatically accepts "
"bookings up to the specified percentage of total capacity. For example, if "
"set to ``100%``, all bookings within available capacity are accepted "
"immediately. If set to ``50%``, only half the available slots are auto-"
"confirmed; the remaining bookings require manual approval. Disable "
":guilabel:`Auto Confirm` entirely to require manual confirmation for every "
"booking. While awaiting confirmation, the time slot is still considered "
"*reserved* and is not shown as available to other customers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:233
msgid ""
"Tick :guilabel:`Display pictures` to publish the default photos of the "
"assigned users or resources on the booking page."
msgstr "勾選 :guilabel:`顯示圖片`，即可在預約頁面上發佈已指派用戶或資源的預設相片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:236
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Up-front Payment` to require customers to pay at the time "
"of booking."
msgstr "啟用 :guilabel:`預先付款`，要求客戶在預約時付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:238
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Create Opportunity` checkbox adds an opportunity to the "
"**CRM** app for each scheduled appointment, which is assigned to the "
"responsible user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:242
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Create Opportunity` field is only visible if the **CRM** app "
"is installed on the database."
msgstr ""
"只有當資料庫已安裝 **CRM** 應用程式時，系統才會顯示 :guilabel:`建立商機` 欄位"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:246
msgid ":doc:`create-opps`"
msgstr ":doc:`create-opps`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:248
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Website` field selects which website this appointment type is"
" published on, in a multi-website environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:251
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Schedule` field offers two modes: :guilabel:`Weekly` for "
"fixed recurring availability, and :guilabel:`Flexible` for custom date "
"ranges."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:254
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Allow Bookings` field is used to control the booking window. "
"Set how many days into the future customers can book, and the minimum lead "
"time before the start time (e.g., ``Within the next 15 days, at least 1h "
"before start time``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:259
msgid ""
"An appointment type is created for `Tennis Courts`, with a "
":guilabel:`Duration` of ``1h``, and the :guilabel:`Allow Bookings` field set"
" to ``at least 1h before start time``. At ``02:00`` PM, a customer attempts "
"to book an appointment for the same day at ``02:45`` PM. The first available"
" time is ``04:00`` PM."
msgstr ""
"系統為 `網球場` 建立了一個預約類型，其 :guilabel:`持續時間` 為 ``1h``，且 "
":guilabel:`允許預約` 欄位設為 ``at least 1h before start time``。在下午 "
"``02:00``，一位客戶嘗試預約同一天下午 ``02:45`` 的時段。系統提供的首個可用時"
"間為下午 ``04:00``。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:264
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Create slot every` field sets the interval between available "
"time slots (e.g., ``1h``). This determines the granularity of the booking "
"calendar shown to customers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:267
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Cancellation` field is used to set the minimum time before "
"the appointment at which customers can still cancel on their own (e.g., ``up"
" to 1h before the booking``). If a customer attempts to cancel within the "
"restricted window, they see an error message with contact information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:271
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Timezone` field sets the timezone used for displaying "
"available slots on the booking page. For resource-based appointments, this "
"is populated automatically based on the resource."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:274
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Allowed Countries` field to restrict bookings to "
"customers from specific countries. Leave it empty to allow bookings from "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`允許的國家/地區` 欄位，可將預約限制為僅限特定國家/地區的客戶"
"。留空則允許來自任何地方的預約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:277
msgid ""
"Tick the :guilabel:`Employee Schedule` checkbox to additionally constrain "
"user availability by their working schedule defined in the **Employees** "
"app. When enabled, a slot is only bookable if it falls within **both** the "
"time windows in the :ref:`Availabilities tab <appointments/appointment-"
"types/availabilities-tab>` and the user's employee working schedule."
msgstr ""
"勾選 :guilabel:`員工時間表` 核取方塊，即可根據在 **員工** 應用程式中定義的工"
"作時間表，進一步限制用戶的可預約時間。啟用後，只有 **同時** 符合 :ref:`可用時"
"段分頁 <appointments/appointment-types/availabilities-tab>` 內的時段以及用戶"
"的員工工作時間表，該時段才可預訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:283
msgid "Publishing an appointment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:285
msgid "To publish a bookable appointment, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:287
msgid "Open the :menuselection:`Appointments` app and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr "開啟 :menuselection:`預約` 應用程式，然後按一下 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:288
msgid ""
"Choose the appointment preset that matches the desired format. All options "
"remain accessible, no matter the preset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:290
msgid "Enter an :guilabel:`Appointment Title` and set a :guilabel:`Duration`."
msgstr "輸入 :guilabel:`預約標題` 並設定 :guilabel:`持續時間`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:291
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Book` field, select :guilabel:`Users` and pick one or more"
" team members. Or select :guilabel:`Resources` and select the relevant rooms"
" or equipment."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`預約`欄位中，選擇:guilabel:`使用者`並挑選一名或多名團隊成員；或"
"選擇:guilabel:`資源`並選取相關房間或設備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:293
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Availabilities` tab, ensure at least one time window "
"appears."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`可用時段` 分頁中，確保至少顯示一個時段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:294
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button at the top of the record, "
"then toggle the switch to :icon:`fa-toggle-on` :guilabel:`Published`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/appointment_types.rst:297
msgid ""
"The appointment is now live. Share the booking link with customers using the"
" :guilabel:`Share` button on the appointment Kanban card, or let them find "
"it on the website."
msgstr ""
"預約現已上線。您可以使用預約看板卡片上的 :guilabel:`分享` 按鈕與客戶分享預約"
"連結，或讓客戶在網站上自行查找。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:3
msgid "Create opportunities from appointments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:5
msgid ""
"When creating a new appointment type in the **Appointments** application, "
"users have the option to create new *opportunities* with information from "
"new bookings. This option captures information from scheduled appointments "
"and creates opportunities in the **CRM** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:10
msgid ""
"This option is only available if the **CRM** application is installed on the"
" database."
msgstr "此選項僅在資料庫已安裝 **CRM** 應用程式時才可使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:15
msgid ""
"Navigate to the **Appointments** app dashboard. Click :guilabel:`New` to "
":doc:`create a new appointment type <../appointments>`. To edit an existing "
"appointment type, click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Action` at the far-right "
"of the appointment line, to open the drop-down menu, then click :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr ""
"前往 **預約** 應用程式儀表板。點擊:guilabel:`新增`以:doc:`建立新預約類型 <../"
"appointments>`。要編輯現有預約類型，請點擊預約行最右側的 :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`動作` 以開啟下拉式選單，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`編"
"輯`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:20
msgid "The edit button on an appointment type record."
msgstr "預約類型記錄上的編輯按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:23
msgid ""
"On the appointment type record, click the :guilabel:`Options` tab, and tick "
"the :guilabel:`Create Opportunities` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"在預約類型記錄中，按一下 :guilabel:`選項` 分頁，然後勾選 :guilabel:`建立商"
"機` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:26
msgid "The options tab on an appointment type form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:30
msgid "Add questions"
msgstr "新增問題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:32
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Questions` tab allows users to :ref:`add questions "
"<appointments/questions>` to the appointment booking page. When customers "
"are booking an appointment slot, they are prompted to answer these "
"questions. The information provided by customers is available in the "
":ref:`new opportunity <appointments/new-opp>`. Adding questions to the "
"appointment type is optional. However, the additional information captured "
"by the questions can be useful later in the sales pipeline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:39
msgid ""
"A furniture company creates a new appointment type for sales demos. "
"Customers reserve time with salespeople to discuss their furniture and "
"design needs. However, because the time is limited to only thirty minute "
"increments, salespeople do not have the time to show all of the available "
"furniture styles in every call. They add questions to the appointment type "
"to prompt customers to provide additional information about the products and"
" services they are interested in. Not only does this help when preparing for"
" the demo, it also provides clarity further along in the sales process."
msgstr ""
"一間傢俬公司為銷售示範建立了新的預約類型。客戶可預約銷售人員的時間，討論其傢"
"俬及設計需求。然而，由於每次預約時間僅限 30 分鐘，銷售人員無法在每次通話中展"
"示所有可供選擇的傢俬款式。因此，他們在預約類型中加入問題，提示客戶提供感興趣"
"產品及服務的額外資訊。這不僅有助於準備示範，亦能在後續銷售流程中提供更清晰的"
"資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:47
msgid "An appointment booking form with custom questions."
msgstr "包含自訂問題的預約表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:53
msgid "Viewing the new opportunity"
msgstr "檢視新商機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:55
msgid ""
"To view opportunities created from appointments, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`CRM` app dashboard. If necessary, remove any filters from "
"the search bar. Then, click the Kanban card for the appropriate opportunity "
"to open it."
msgstr ""
"要查看透過預約建立的商機，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM` 應用程式儀表板。如有需"
"要，請從搜尋欄移除所有篩選條件。然後，點擊對應商機的看板卡片以將其開啟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:59
msgid ""
"The contact information from the appointment is added to the opportunity "
"record. The answers the customer provided to the optional questions are "
"included in the :guilabel:`Internal Notes` tab. The scheduled appointment is"
" listed in the *Chatter* of the record, and can be edited from there."
msgstr ""
"預約的聯絡資訊會加入至商機記錄中。客戶對選填問題的回答會包含在 :guilabel:`內"
"部備註` 分頁中。已安排的預約會列於該記錄的 *Chatter* 中，並可從該處進行編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:63
msgid ""
"The chatter of an opportunity in the CRM with the scheduled appointment "
"information."
msgstr "CRM 中顯示已安排預約資訊的商機溝通欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/create-opps.rst:67
msgid ""
"If an opportunity is created from a :ref:`resource based "
"<appointments/resources>` appointment type, the user who created the "
"appointment type is listed as the :guilabel:`Salesperson` for the "
"opportunity. If it is created from a user based appointment, the user the "
"appointment is scheduled with is assigned as the :guilabel:`Salesperson`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:3
msgid "Google reserve integration"
msgstr "Google 預訂整合"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:5
msgid ""
"Google Reserve lets customers book appointments directly from Google Search,"
" Google Maps, and the Google Assistant. By connecting Odoo **Appointments** "
"to Google Reserve, bookings are added directly into Odoo without customers "
"needing to visit the company website."
msgstr ""
"透過 Google Reserve，客戶可直接從 Google 搜尋、Google 地圖及 Google 助理預約"
"。將 Odoo **預約** 連接至 Google Reserve 後，預約會直接新增至 Odoo，客戶無需"
"瀏覽公司網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:14
msgid ""
"First, navigate to the :guilabel:`Apps` application. Then, remove the "
":guilabel:`Apps` filter from the search bar and type in `Google`. Click "
":guilabel:`Install` on the :guilabel:`Appointment Google Reserve` module."
msgstr ""
"首先，前往 :guilabel:`應用程式` 應用程式，然後從搜尋列移除 :guilabel:`應用程"
"式` 篩選條件，並輸入 `Google`。點擊 :guilabel:`安裝`，以安裝 :guilabel:`預約 "
"Google Reserve` 模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:18
msgid "The Google Reserve module in the Odoo apps application."
msgstr "Odoo 應用程式中的 Google Reserve 模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:21
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to the :menuselection:`Appointments` application. Open an "
"existing appointment type, or click :guilabel:`New` to :ref:`create a new "
"one <appointments/configure>`. Then click the :guilabel:`Google Bookings` "
"tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:25
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Google Reserve Merchant` field, and select an option "
"from the drop-down, or click :guilabel:`Create` to open the "
":guilabel:`Create Google Reserve Merchant` form."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`Google Reserve 商戶` 欄位並從下拉式選單中選擇一個選項，或按"
"一下 :guilabel:`建立` 以開啟 :guilabel:`建立 Google Reserve 商戶` 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:28
msgid ""
"On the form, enter all required information. The business address **must** "
"match exactly what appears on Google Maps. Click :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:31
msgid "A create new google merchant form in the Appointments app."
msgstr "在「預約」應用程式中建立新 Google Merchant 的表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:34
msgid ""
"Once the new merchant has been created, click :guilabel:`Synchronize with "
"Google Reserve`. The initial synchronization can take up to 24 hours to "
"propagate to Google's systems."
msgstr ""
"建立新商戶後，點擊 :guilabel:`與 Google Reserve 同步`。首次同步可能需要最多 "
"24 小時才能傳播至 Google 系統。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/appointments/google_reserve.rst:38
msgid ""
"Ensure that the business address matches the Google Maps listing precisely, "
"including formatting and unit numbers. Mismatches may cause synchronization "
"to fail or prevent the listing from appearing on Google."
msgstr ""
"請確保商業地址與 Google 地圖商家資訊完全一致，包括格式及單位編號。如資料不符"
"，可能會導致同步失敗，或令商家資訊無法顯示於 Google。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:5
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo **Calendar** is a scheduling app that allows users to integrate a "
"company's business flow into a single management platform. By integrating "
"with the other apps in Odoo's ecosystem, **Calendar** allows users to "
"schedule and organize meetings, schedule events, plan employee appraisals, "
"coordinate projects, and more."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **日曆** 是一款排程應用程式，讓用戶將公司的業務流程整合至單一管理平台。"
"透過與 Odoo 生態系統中的其他應用程式整合，**日曆** 可讓用戶預約及安排會議、編"
"排活動、規劃員工評核、協調項目等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:12
msgid ""
"Upon opening the :menuselection:`Calendar app`, users have an overview of "
"their current meetings. The selected view option appears as a "
":guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, or :guilabel:`Year` "
"drop-down menu. Under the view options drop-down menu, users can also enable"
" or disable :guilabel:`Show weekends`."
msgstr ""
"開啟 :menuselection:`日曆應用程式` 後，用戶可概覽目前的會議。所選檢視選項會"
"以 :guilabel:`日`、:guilabel:`週`、:guilabel:`月` 或 :guilabel:`年` 下拉式選"
"單形式顯示。在檢視選項下拉式選單下，用戶亦可啟用或停用 :guilabel:`顯示週末`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:17
msgid "Overview of Calendar app."
msgstr "「日曆」應用程式概覽。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:21
msgid ""
"Depending on the selected view option, users can click the :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"left` :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(left or right arrow)` buttons to "
"switch between days, weeks, etc., and switch back to the current day with "
"the :guilabel:`Today` button."
msgstr ""
"視乎所選的檢視選項，用戶可點擊 :icon:`oi-arrow-left` :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`（左或右箭頭）` 按鈕以切換日、週等時間範圍，並可使用 :guilabel:`今"
"天` 按鈕切換回當天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:26
msgid "Sync third-party calendars"
msgstr "同步第三方日曆"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:28
msgid ""
"Users can sync Odoo with existing :doc:`Outlook <calendar/outlook>` and/or "
":doc:`Google <calendar/google>` calendars, by heading to "
":menuselection:`Calendar app --> Configuration --> Settings`. From here, "
"enter :guilabel:`Client ID` and :guilabel:`Client Secret`. There is also an "
"option to pause synchronization by ticking the checkbox, or automating "
"synchronization by keeping it blank."
msgstr ""
"使用者可將 Odoo 與現有的 :doc:`Outlook <calendar/outlook>` 及/或 "
":doc:`Google <calendar/google>` 日曆同步。只需前往 :menuselection:`日曆應用程"
"式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，然後在此輸入 :guilabel:`用戶端 ID` 及 :guilabel:`用戶"
"端密鑰`。此外，亦可選擇勾選核取方塊以暫停同步，或留空以自動同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:34
msgid ""
"Once the desired configurations are complete, click :guilabel:`Save` before "
"moving on."
msgstr "完成所需設定後，請先點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`，再繼續操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:36
msgid ""
"Events created in synced calendars automatically appear across the "
"integrated platforms."
msgstr "在已同步日曆中建立的活動會自動顯示於各個整合平台。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:39
msgid ":doc:`Synchronize Outlook calendar with Odoo <calendar/outlook>`"
msgstr ":doc:`將 Outlook 日曆與 Odoo 同步 <calendar/outlook>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:40
msgid ":doc:`Synchronize Google calendar with Odoo <calendar/google>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:43
msgid "Create activities from chatter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:45
msgid ""
"Instantly create new meetings anywhere in Odoo through an individual "
"record's chatter, like in a **CRM** opportunity card or task in the "
