"確認才能最終確定會議的規定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:243
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display pictures`: Tick the checkbox to display user or resource "
"images across the entire booking flow."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`顯示圖片`：勾選此核取方塊，即可在整個預約流程中顯示用戶或資源圖片"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:245
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create Opportunity`: When this is selected, each scheduled "
"appointment creates a new **CRM** opportunity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:247
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Up-front Payment`: Tick the checkbox to require users to pay "
"before confirming their booking. Once this is ticked, a link appears to "
":icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Configure Payment Providers`, which "
"enables online payments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:250
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Website`: Specify which website this meeting invitation will be "
"published on."
msgstr ":guilabel:`網站`：指定此會議邀請將發佈至哪個網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:251
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Schedule`: Select :guilabel:`Weekly` or :guilabel:`Flexible` "
"scheduling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:252
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allow Bookings`: set a minimum hour window to ensure appointments"
" are confirmed a specified amount of time in advance. For example, set "
"`01:00` to require attendees to confirm at least one hour before their "
"appointment time."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`允許預約`：設定最少小時數區間，以確保預約須於指定時間前預先確認。"
"例如，設定 `01:00` 即要求出席者在預約時間前至少一小時確認。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:255
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cancellation`: set a maximum hour window before the appointment "
"that attendees are able to cancel."
msgstr ":guilabel:`取消`：設定參加者在預約前可取消預約的小時數上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar.rst:257
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timezone`: This defaults to the company's timezone selected in "
"the **Settings** app. To change the timezone, select the desired option from"
" the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`時區`：預設為在 **設定** 應用程式中選擇的公司時區。如需變更時區，"
"請從下拉式選單中選擇所需選項。"

