#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:18
msgid ""
"Create a new Google API project and enable the Google Calendar API. First, "
"go to the `Google API Console <https://console.developers.google.com>`_ and "
"log into the Google account."
msgstr ""
"建立新的 Google API 專案並啟用 Google 日曆 API。首先，前往 `Google API 控制"
"台 <https://console.developers.google.com>`_ 並登入 Google 帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:22
msgid ""
"If this is the first time visiting this page, Google will prompt the user to"
" enter a country and agree to the Terms of Service. Select a country from "
"the drop-down list and agree to the :abbr:`ToS (Terms of Service)`."
msgstr ""
"如果這是首次造訪此頁面，Google 會提示用戶輸入國家/地區並同意《服務條款》。請"
"從下拉式清單選擇國家/地區，並同意 :abbr:`ToS (服務條款)` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:26
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Select a project` and select (or create) an API "
"project to configure OAuth in, and store credentials. Click :guilabel:`New "
"Project`."
msgstr ""
"接著，點擊 :guilabel:`選取專案`，然後選取（或建立）用於設定 OAuth 及儲存憑證"
"的 API 專案。點擊 :guilabel:`新增專案`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:29
msgid "Create a new API project to store credentials."
msgstr "建立新的 API 項目，以儲存憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:32
msgid ""
"Give the API project a clear name, like `Odoo Sync`, so it can be "
"identified. Then click the :guilabel:`Create` button."
msgstr ""
"為 API 專案設定一個清晰易辨的名稱，例如 `Odoo Sync`。然後按一下 :guilabel:`建"
"立` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:36
msgid "Enable Google Calendar API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:38
msgid ""
"Now, click :guilabel:`Enable APIs and Services` in the side menu. If the "
"search bar does not appear, click :guilabel:`Enable APIs and Services` "
"again."
msgstr ""
"現在，請在側邊選單按一下 :guilabel:`啟用 API 和服務`。如果搜尋列未有顯示，請"
"再次按一下 :guilabel:`啟用 API 和服務`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:41
msgid "Enable APIs and Services on the API Project."
msgstr "在 API 專案上啟用 API 及服務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:44
msgid ""
"After that, search for `Google Calendar API` using the search bar and select"
" :guilabel:`Google Calendar API` from the search results. Click "
":guilabel:`Enable`."
msgstr ""
"然後，使用搜尋欄搜尋 `Google Calendar API`，並在搜尋結果中選擇 "
":guilabel:`Google Calendar API`。點擊 :guilabel:`啟用`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:47
msgid "Enable the Google Calendar API."
msgstr "啟用 Google 日曆 API。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:51
msgid "OAuth consent screen"
msgstr "OAuth 同意畫面"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:53
msgid ""
"Now that the API project has been created, OAuth should be configured. To do"
" that, click on :guilabel:`OAuth consent screen` in the left menu, then "
"click the :guilabel:`Get started` button."
msgstr ""
"建立 API 專案後，接下來需設定 OAuth。在左側選單點擊 :guilabel:`OAuth 同意畫"
"面` 後，再點擊 :guilabel:`開始使用` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:57
msgid ""
"*Personal* Gmail Accounts are only allowed to be **External** User Type, "
"which means Google may require an approval, or for *Scopes* to be added on. "
"However, using a *Google WorkSpace* account allows for **Internal** User "
"Type to be used."
msgstr ""
"*個人* Gmail 帳戶只可設為 **外部** 使用者類型，這表示 Google 可能會要求審批，"
"或需要加入 *範圍（Scopes）*。不過，使用 *Google WorkSpace* 帳戶即可使用 **內"
"部** 使用者類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:61
msgid ""
"Note, as well, that while the API connection is in the *External* testing "
"mode, then no approval is necessary from Google. User limits in this testing"
" mode is set to 100 users."
msgstr ""
"亦請注意，當 API 連線處於 *外部* 測試模式時，無須經 Google 批准。此測試模式的"
"用戶上限為 100 人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:64
msgid "Follow the proceeding steps, in order:"
msgstr "請按順序執行以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:66
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`App Information`, type `Odoo` in the :guilabel:`App name` "
"field, then enter the email address for the :guilabel:`User support email` "
"field and click the :guilabel:`Next` button."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`應用程式資訊` 中，於 :guilabel:`應用程式名稱` 欄位輸入 `Odoo`，"
"然後在 :guilabel:`用戶支援電郵` 欄位輸入電郵地址，最後點擊 :guilabel:`下一"
"步` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:68
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`Audience`, select :guilabel:`External`, then click the "
":guilabel:`Next` button."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`目標對象` 中，選擇 :guilabel:`外部`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`下一"
"步` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:69
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`Contact Information`, enter the email again, then click the "
":guilabel:`Next` button."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`聯絡資料` 中再次輸入電郵，然後按一下 :guilabel:`下一步` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:71
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`Finish`, click the checkbox to agree to :guilabel:`Google API "
"Services: User Policy`, then click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`完成` 中，勾選方格以同意 :guilabel:`Google API 服務：用戶政"
"策`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`繼續`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:74
msgid "For the last step, click the :guilabel:`Create` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:77
msgid "Authorized domain setup"
msgstr "已授權網域設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:79
msgid ""
"Next, any domains set to appear on the consent screen or in an OAuth "
"client's configuration must be pre-registered. To do so, navigate to "
":guilabel:`Branding` in the left menu. In the :guilabel:`Authorized domains`"
" section, click the :guilabel:`Add domain` button to create a field to enter"
" an authorized domain. Enter a domain, such as `odoo.com`, then click the "
":guilabel:`Save` button at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:86
msgid "Test users"
msgstr "測試用戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:88
msgid ""
"To give users the ability to sync with personal Gmail accounts, they must be"
" set as a test user. Setup test users by going to :guilabel:`Audience` in "
"the left-side menu and clicking the :guilabel:`Add users` button in the "
":guilabel:`Test users` section. Enter any desired user emails, and click the"
" :guilabel:`Save` button."
msgstr ""
"如要讓用戶能夠與個人 Gmail 帳戶同步，必須先將他們設為測試用戶。前往左側選單"
"的:guilabel:`目標對象`，點擊:guilabel:`新增用戶`按鈕（位於:guilabel:`測試用"
"戶`區段中），即可設定測試用戶。輸入所需的用戶電郵地址，然後點擊:guilabel:`儲"
"存`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:94
msgid "Create credentials"
msgstr "建立憑證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:96
msgid ""
"The *Client ID* and the *Client Secret* are both needed to connect Google "
"Calendar to Odoo. This is the last step in the Google console. Begin by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Clients` in the left menu. Then, click :guilabel:`Create"
" Credentials` and select :guilabel:`OAuth client ID`. This causes Google to "
"open a guide to create the credentials."
msgstr ""
"將 Google 日曆連接至 Odoo 需要同時使用 *用戶端 ID* 及 *用戶端密鑰*，這亦是 "
"Google 控制台中的最後一步。首先，在左側選單點擊 :guilabel:`用戶端`。然後，點"
"擊 :guilabel:`建立憑證` 並選擇 :guilabel:`OAuth 用戶端 ID`。此時 Google 會開"
"啟建立憑證的指引。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:101
msgid ""
"On the *Create OAuth client ID* page, select :guilabel:`Web application` for"
" the :guilabel:`Application Type` field, and type `My Odoo Database` for the"
" :guilabel:`Name`."
msgstr ""
"在 *建立 OAuth 用戶端 ID* 頁面上，選擇 :guilabel:`網頁應用程式` 作為 "
":guilabel:`應用程式類型` 欄位的選項，並輸入 `My Odoo Database` 作為 "
":guilabel:`名稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:104
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Authorized JavaScript Origins` section, click "
":guilabel:`+ Add URI` and type the company's Odoo full :abbr:`URL (Uniform "
"Resource Locator)` address."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`已授權的 JavaScript 來源` 部分中，點擊 :guilabel:`+ 新增 URI`，"
"然後輸入公司的完整 Odoo :abbr:`URL (統一資源定位符)` 地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:108
msgid ""
"When entering the *Authorized JavaScript Origins*, the exact URL of the Odoo"
" database must be used."
msgstr "輸入 *已授權的 JavaScript 來源* 時，必須使用 Odoo 資料庫的準確網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:111
msgid ""
"If the database is accessible through both an `.odoo.com` subdomain and a "
"custom domain, the custom domain configured as the primary domain should be "
"used. The `.odoo.com` subdomain may not work correctly in all cases and can "
"result in authentication errors."
msgstr ""
"如果資料庫可同時透過 `.odoo.com` 子網域和自訂網域存取，應使用已設定為主網域的"
"自訂網域。`.odoo.com` 子網域並非在所有情況下都能正常運作，並可能導致驗證錯誤"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:115
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Authorized redirect URIs` section, click :guilabel:`+ "
"Add URI` and type the company's Odoo :abbr:`URL (Uniform Resource Locator)` "
"address followed by `/google_account/authentication`. Finally, click "
":guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`已授權的重新導向 URI` 部分下，點擊 :guilabel:`+ 新增 URI`，然後"
"輸入公司的 Odoo :abbr:`URL (統一資源定位符)` 位址，並在後方加上 `/"
"google_account/authentication`。最後，點擊 :guilabel:`建立`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:119
msgid ""
"Add the authorized JavaScript origins and the authorized redirect URIs."
msgstr "新增已授權的 JavaScript 來源及已授權的重新導向 URI。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:122
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Client ID` and :guilabel:`Client Secret` will appear, save "
"these somewhere safe."
msgstr ""
"畫面會顯示 :guilabel:`用戶端 ID` 及 :guilabel:`用戶端密鑰`，請將它們妥善儲存"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:125
msgid "Setup in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 中設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:127
msgid ""
"Once the *Client ID* and the *Client Secret* are located, open the Odoo "
"database and go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Calendar` to find the "
":guilabel:`Google Calendar` feature. Tick the checkbox labeled "
":guilabel:`Google Calendar`."
msgstr ""
"找到 *用戶端 ID* 及 *用戶端密鑰* 後，開啟 Odoo 資料庫並前往 "
":menuselection:`設定 --> 日曆`，尋找 :guilabel:`Google 日曆` 功能，然後勾選標"
"示為 :guilabel:`Google 日曆` 的核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:131
msgid "The Google Calendar checkbox in General Settings."
msgstr "一般設定中的 Google 日曆複選框。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:134
msgid ""
"Next, copy and paste the *Client ID* and the *Client Secret* from the Google"
" Calendar API credentials page into their respective fields below the "
":guilabel:`Google Calendar` checkbox. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:139
msgid ""
"Tick the :guilabel:`Pause Synchronization` checkbox to temporarily pause "
"events from being updated. This allows for testing and troubleshooting "
"without removing credentials or uninstalling the synchronization. To resume "
"the sync, clear the checkbox and save."
msgstr ""
"勾選 :guilabel:`暫停同步` 核取方塊，即可暫時停止更新活動。這樣便可在無須移除"
"憑證或解除安裝同步功能的情況下進行測試及疑難排解。如要恢復同步，請取消勾選該"
"方塊並儲存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:144
msgid "Sync calendar in Odoo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:146
msgid ""
"Finally, open the :menuselection:`Calendar` app in Odoo and click the "
":guilabel:`Google` sync button to sync Google Calendar with Odoo."
msgstr ""
"最後，在 Odoo 中開啟 :menuselection:`日曆` 應用程式，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`Google` 同步按鈕，將 Google 日曆與 Odoo 同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:149
msgid ""
"Click the Google sync button in Odoo Calendar to sync Google Calendar with "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:153
msgid ""
"When syncing Google Calendar with Odoo for the first time, the page will "
"redirect to the Google Account. From there, select the :guilabel:`Email "
"Account` that should have access, then select :guilabel:`Continue` (should "
"the app be unverified), and finally select :guilabel:`Continue` (to give "
"permission for the transfer of data)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:158
msgid "Give Odoo permission to access Google Calendar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:161
msgid "Now, Odoo Calendar is successfully synced with Google Calendar!"
msgstr "Odoo 日曆現已成功與 Google 日曆同步！"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:164
msgid ""
"Odoo highly recommends testing the Google calendar synchronization on a test"
" database and a test email address (that is not used for any other purpose) "
"before attempting to sync the desired Google Calendar with the user's "
"production database."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 強烈建議在嘗試將目標 Google 日曆與用戶的正式資料庫同步之前，先在測試資料"
"庫和測試電郵地址（未作任何其他用途）上測試 Google 日曆同步功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:168
msgid "Once a user synchronizes their Google calendar with the Odoo calendar:"
msgstr "當用戶將其 Google 日曆與 Odoo 日曆同步後："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:170
msgid ""
"Creating an event in Odoo causes Google to send an invitation to all event "
"attendees."
msgstr "在 Odoo 建立活動時，Google 會向所有活動參與者發送邀請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:171
msgid ""
"Deleting an event in Odoo causes Google to send a cancellation to all event "
"attendees."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中刪除活動會導致 Google 向所有活動參加者傳送取消通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:172
msgid ""
"Adding a contact to an event causes Google to send an invitation to all "
"event attendees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:173
msgid ""
"Removing a contact from an event causes Google to send a cancellation to all"
" event attendees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:175
msgid ""
"Events can be created in *Google Calendar* without sending a notification by"
" selecting :guilabel:`Don't Send` when prompted to send invitation emails."
msgstr ""
"在 *Google 日曆* 中，當系統提示是否傳送邀請電郵時選擇 :guilabel:`不要傳送`，"
"即可建立活動而不發送通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:179
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:210
msgid "Troubleshoot sync"
msgstr "排解同步問題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:181
msgid ""
"There may be times when the *Google Calendar* account does not sync "
"correctly with Odoo. Sync issues can be seen in the database logs."
msgstr ""
"有時 *Google 日曆* 帳戶可能無法與 Odoo 正確同步。同步問題可在資料庫日誌中查看"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:184
msgid ""
"In these cases, the account needs troubleshooting. A reset can be performed "
"using the :guilabel:`Reset Account` button, which can be accessed by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Manage Users`. Then, select "
"the user to modify the calendar, and click the :guilabel:`Calendar` tab."
msgstr ""
"在這些情況下，需要為帳戶進行疑難排解。你可使用 :guilabel:`重設帳戶` 按鈕執行"
"重設。要存取此按鈕，請前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 管理用戶`。然後，"
"選取要修改行事曆的用戶，並按一下 :guilabel:`行事曆` 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:189
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:220
msgid "Reset buttons highlighted on the calendar tab of the user."
msgstr "用戶日曆分頁上已突顯重設按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:192
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:224
msgid "Next, click :guilabel:`Reset Account` under the correct calendar."
msgstr ""

