msgstr ":guilabel:`保持不變`：不會對活動進行任何更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:205
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delete from the current Google Calendar account`: delete the "
"events from *Google Calendar*."
msgstr ":guilabel:`從目前的 Google 日曆帳戶中刪除`：從 *Google 日曆* 刪除活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:207
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:241
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delete from Odoo`: delete the events from the Odoo calendar."
msgstr ":guilabel:`從 Odoo 刪除`：從 Odoo 日曆中刪除活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:208
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delete from both`: delete the events from both *Google Calendar* "
"and Odoo calendar."
msgstr ""

