#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:221
msgid "Google OAuth FAQ"
msgstr "Google OAuth 常見問題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:223
msgid ""
"At times there can be configuration errors that occur, and troubleshooting "
"is needed to resolve the issue. Below are the most common errors that may "
"occur when configuring the *Google Calendar* for use with Odoo."
msgstr ""
"有時可能會出現設定錯誤，需要進行疑難排解來解決問題。以下是設定 *Google 日曆* "
"以配合 Odoo 使用時最常發生的錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:228
msgid "Production vs. testing publishing status"
msgstr "正式環境與測試環境的發佈狀態"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:230
msgid ""
"Choosing :guilabel:`Production` as the :guilabel:`Publishing Status` "
"(instead of :guilabel:`Testing`) displays the following warning message:"
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`正式環境` 作為 :guilabel:`發佈狀態`（而非 :guilabel:`測試`）"
