#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:253
msgid "Application Type"
msgstr "應用程式類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:255
msgid ""
"When creating the credentials (OAuth *Client ID* and *Client Secret*), if "
":guilabel:`Desktop App` is selected for the :guilabel:`Application Type`, an"
" :guilabel:`Authorization Error` appears (:guilabel:`Error "
"400:redirect_uri_mismatch`)."
msgstr ""
"建立憑證（OAuth *用戶端 ID* 及 *用戶端密鑰*）時，若將 :guilabel:`桌面應用程"
"式` 選為 :guilabel:`應用程式類型`，系統便會顯示 :guilabel:`授權錯"
"誤`（:guilabel:`Error 400:redirect_uri_mismatch`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:259
msgid "Error 400 Redirect URI Mismatch."
msgstr "錯誤 400 重新導向 URI 不符。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:262
msgid ""
"To correct this error, delete the existing credentials, and create new "
"credentials, by selecting :guilabel:`Web Application` for the "
":guilabel:`Application Type`."
msgstr ""
"如要修正此錯誤，請刪除現有憑證，並在建立新憑證時選取 :guilabel:`網頁應用程"
"式` 作為 :guilabel:`應用程式類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:265
msgid ""
"Then, under :guilabel:`Authorized redirect URIs`, click :guilabel:`ADD URI`,"
" and type: `https://yourdbname.odoo.com/google_account/authentication` in "
"the field, being sure to replace *yourdbname* in the URL with the **real** "
"Odoo database name."
msgstr ""
"然後，在 :guilabel:`已授權的重新導向 URI` 下，點擊 :guilabel:`新增 URI`，並在"
"欄位中輸入 `https://yourdbname.odoo.com/google_account/authentication`，務必"
"將網址中的 *yourdbname* 替換為**真實的** Odoo 資料庫名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:270
msgid ""
"Ensure that the domain (used in the URI: "
"`https://yourdbname.odoo.com/google_account/authentication`) is the exact "
"same domain as configured in the `web.base.url` system parameter."
msgstr ""
"請確保該網域（用於 URI：`https://yourdbname.odoo.com/google_account/"
