#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/google.rst:274
msgid ""
"Access the `web.base.url` by activating :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>`, and navigating to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical header "
"menu --> Parameters section --> System Parameters`."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>` 後，前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程"
"式 --> 技術頂部選單 --> 參數區段 --> 系統參數` ，即可存取 `web.base.url`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:3
msgid "Outlook Calendar synchronization"
msgstr "Outlook 日曆同步"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:5
msgid ""
"Synchronizing a user's *Outlook Calendar* with Odoo is useful for keeping "
"track of tasks and appointments across all related applications."
msgstr ""
"將使用者的 *Outlook 行事曆* 與 Odoo 同步，有助於在所有相關應用程式中追蹤任務"
"及預約。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:9
msgid ":doc:`../../general/users/azure`"
