#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:13
msgid "Microsoft Azure setup"
msgstr "Microsoft Azure 設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:15
msgid ""
"To sync the *Outlook Calendar* with Odoo's *Calendar*, a Microsoft *Azure* "
"account is required. Creating an account is free for users who have never "
"tried, or paid for, *Azure*. For more information, view the account options "
"on the `Azure website <https://azure.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/free/?WT.mc_id=A261C142F>`_."
msgstr ""
"要將 *Outlook 日曆* 與 Odoo 的 *日曆* 同步，必須擁有 Microsoft *Azure* 帳戶。"
"從未試用或付費使用 *Azure* 的用戶可免費建立帳戶。如欲了解更多資訊，請前往 "
"`Azure 網站 <https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/free/?WT.mc_id=A261C142F>`_ 查"
"看帳戶選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:20
msgid ""
"Refer to `Microsoft's documentation <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/azure/active-directory/ develop/quickstart-create-new-tenant>`_ on how to"
" set up a Microsoft *Entra ID* (formally called Microsoft *Azure Active "
"Directory (Azure AD)*). This is an API console to manage and register "
"Microsoft applications."
msgstr ""
"有關如何設定 Microsoft *Entra ID*（前稱 Microsoft *Azure Active Directory "
"(Azure AD)*），請參閱 `Microsoft 說明文件 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"azure/active-directory/ develop/quickstart-create-new-tenant>`_。這是一個用於"
"管理及註冊 Microsoft 應用程式的 API 主控台。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:25
msgid ""
"Existing Microsoft *Entra ID* users should log in at the `Microsoft Azure "
"developer portal <https://portal.azure.com/#home>`_. Next, select "
":guilabel:`View` under the section labeled :guilabel:`Manage Microsoft Entra"
" ID`."
msgstr ""
"現有的 Microsoft *Entra ID* 用戶應在 `Microsoft Azure 開發人員入門網站 "
"<https://portal.azure.com/#home>`_ 登入。接著，選取:guilabel:`檢視`，其位"
"於:guilabel:`管理 Microsoft Entra ID`區段下。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:30
msgid "Register application"
msgstr "註冊應用程式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:32
msgid ""
"After logging in with the Microsoft *Entra ID*, `register an application "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/active-directory/develop/quickstart-"
"register-app>`_."
msgstr ""
"使用 Microsoft *Entra ID* 登入後，請`註冊應用程式 <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/active-directory/develop/quickstart-register-"
"app>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:35
msgid ""
"To create an application, click :guilabel:`+ Add` in the top menu. From the "
"resulting drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`App Registration`."
msgstr ""
"若要建立應用程式，請在頂部選單點擊 :guilabel:`+ 新增`。然後在下拉選單中選擇 "
":guilabel:`應用程式註冊`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:38
msgid ""
"Microsoft Azure management page with + Add and App Registration menu "
"highlighted."
msgstr "Microsoft Azure 管理頁面，當中已醒目顯示「+ 新增」及「應用程式註冊」選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:42
msgid "Enter a unique :guilabel:`Name` for the connected application."
msgstr "為已連結的應用程式輸入唯一的 :guilabel:`名稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:44
msgid ""
"Choosing the appropriate :guilabel:`Supported account type` is essential, or"
" else the connected application will not work. Users who wish to connect "
"their *Outlook Calendar* to Odoo should select the :guilabel:`Accounts in "
"any organizational directory (Any Microsoft Entra ID directory - "
"Multitenant) and personal Microsoft accounts (e.g. Skype, Xbox)` option for "
":guilabel:`Supported account types`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:50
msgid ""
"When configuring the :guilabel:`Redirect URI`, choose the :guilabel:`Web` "
"option from the first drop-down menu. Then, enter the Odoo database URI "
"(URL) followed by `/microsoft_account/authentication`."
msgstr ""
"設定 :guilabel:`重新導向 URI` 時，請在第一個下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`網"
"頁` 選項。然後，輸入 Odoo 資料庫 URI（網址），並加上 `/microsoft_account/"
"authentication`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:55
msgid ""
"Enter `https://yourdbname.odoo.com/microsoft_account/authentication` for the"
" :guilabel:`Redirect URI`. Replace `yourdbname.odoo.com` with the :abbr:`URL"
" (Uniform Resource Locator)`."
msgstr ""
"為 :guilabel:`重新導向 URI` 輸入 `https://yourdbname.odoo.com/"
"microsoft_account/authentication`。請將 `yourdbname.odoo.com` 替換為 "
":abbr:`URL (統一資源定位符)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:59
msgid ""
"Ensure the database's :abbr:`URL (Uniform Resource Locator)` (domain) used "
"in the URI is the exact same domain as the one configured on the "
"`web.base.url` system parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:62
msgid ""
"Access the `web.base.url` by activating :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>`, and navigating to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical header "
"menu --> Parameters section --> System Parameters`. Then, select it from the"
" :guilabel:`Key` list on the :guilabel:`System Parameters` page."
msgstr ""
"若要存取 `web.base.url`，請啟用 :ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>`，並前往 "
":menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 技術頂部選單 --> 參數區段 --> 系統參數`。然"
"後，從 :guilabel:`鍵` 清單（位於 :guilabel:`系統參數` 頁面）中選取該項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:67
msgid ""
"The \"Supported account type\" and \"Redirect URI\" settings in the "
"Microsoft Entra ID portal."
msgstr "Microsoft Entra ID 入口網站中的「支援的帳戶類型」及「重新導向 URI」設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:71
msgid ""
"For more information on the restrictions and limitations of URIs, check "
"Microsoft's `Redirect URI (reply URL) restrictions and limitations "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/active-directory/develop/reply-"
"url>`_ page."
msgstr ""
"有關 URI 限制的更多資料，請參閱 Microsoft 的 `重新導向 URI（回覆 URL）限制與"
"約束 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/active-directory/develop/reply-"
"url>`_ 頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:75
msgid ""
"Finally, on the application registration page, click :guilabel:`Register` "
"button to complete the application registration. The :guilabel:`Application "
"(client) ID` is produced. Copy this value, as it is needed later, in the "
":ref:`outlook_calendar/odoo_setup`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:79
msgid ""
"Application client ID highlighted in the essentials section of the newly created\n"
"application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:85
msgid "Create client secret"
msgstr "建立用戶端密鑰"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:87
msgid ""
"The second credential needed to complete the synchronization of the "
"Microsoft *Outlook Calendar* is the *Client Secret*. The user **must** add a"
" client secret, as this allows Odoo to authenticate itself, requiring no "
"interaction from the user's side. *Certificates* are optional."
msgstr ""
"完成同步 Microsoft *Outlook 日曆* 所需的第二個憑證是 *用戶端密鑰*。用戶 **必"
"須** 新增用戶端密鑰，讓 Odoo 能夠自行進行身份驗證，而無需用戶進行任何操作"
"。*證書* 則屬可選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:91
msgid ""
"To add a client secret, click :menuselection:`Certificates & secrets` in the"
" left menu. Then click :guilabel:`+ New client secret` to create the client "
"secret."
msgstr ""
"若要新增用戶端密碼，請在左側選單點擊 :menuselection:`憑證與密碼`。然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`+ 新增用戶端密碼` 以建立用戶端密碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:94
msgid ""
"New client secret page with certificates and secrets menu and new client secret option\n"
"highlighted."
msgstr ""
"「新增用戶端密碼」頁面，當中醒目顯示了「憑證及密碼」選單及\n"
"「新增用戶端密碼」選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:99
msgid ""
"Next, type a :guilabel:`Description`, and select when the client secret "
":guilabel:`Expires`. Available options include: :guilabel:`90 days (3 "
"months)`, :guilabel:`365 days (12 months)`, :guilabel:`545 days (18 "
"months)`, :guilabel:`730 days (24 months)` or :guilabel:`Custom`. The "
":guilabel:`Custom` option allows the administrator to set a "
":guilabel:`Start` and :guilabel:`End` date."
msgstr ""
"接下來，輸入 :guilabel:`描述`，並選擇用戶端密碼的 :guilabel:`到期時間`。可用"
"選項包括：:guilabel:`90 天（3 個月）`、:guilabel:`365 天（12 個月"
"）`、:guilabel:`545 天（18 個月）`、:guilabel:`730 天（24 個月）` 或 "
":guilabel:`自訂`。:guilabel:`自訂` 選項可讓管理員設定 :guilabel:`開始` 與 "
":guilabel:`結束` 日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:105
msgid "Finally, click :guilabel:`Add` to :guilabel:`Add a client secret`."
msgstr "最後，按一下 :guilabel:`新增` 以 :guilabel:`新增用戶端密鑰`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:108
msgid ""
"Since resetting the synchronization can be tricky, Odoo recommends setting "
"the maximum allowed expiration date for the client secret (24 months or "
"custom), so there is no need to re-synchronize soon."
msgstr ""
"由於重設同步過程可能較為繁複，Odoo 建議為用戶端密鑰設定允許的最長到期日（24 "
"個月或自訂），這樣便無需在短期內重新同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:112
msgid "Copy the :guilabel:`Value` for use in the next section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:115
msgid ""
"Client secret values cannot be viewed, except immediately after creation. Be"
" sure to save the secret when created *before* leaving the page."
msgstr ""
"除了剛建立時之外，系統無法檢視用戶端密鑰值。建立密鑰後，請務必在離開頁面 *之"
"前* 儲存密鑰。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:121
msgid "Configuration in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 中進行設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:123
msgid ""
"In the Odoo database, go to :menuselection:`Calendar app --> Configuration "
"--> Settings`, and tick the checkbox beside the :guilabel:`Outlook Calendar`"
" setting. Remember to click :guilabel:`Save` to implement the changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:127
msgid "The \"Outlook Calendar\" setting activated in Odoo."
msgstr "已在 Odoo 中啟用「Outlook 日曆」設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:130
msgid ""
"From the Microsoft *Azure* portal, under the :guilabel:`Overview` section of"
" the application, copy the :guilabel:`Application (Client) ID`, if it has "
"not already been copied, and paste it into the :guilabel:`Client ID` field "
"in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"在 Microsoft *Azure* 入口網站中，前往應用程式的 :guilabel:`概覽` 部分，複製 "
":guilabel:`應用程式 (用戶端) 識別碼`（如尚未複製），然後將其貼上至 Odoo 的 "
":guilabel:`用戶端識別碼` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:134
msgid "The \"Client ID\" in the Microsoft Azure portal."
msgstr "Microsoft Azure 入口網站中的「用戶端識別碼」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:138
msgid ""
"Copy the previously-acquired :guilabel:`Value` (Client Secret Value), and "
"paste it into the :guilabel:`Client Secret` field in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"複製先前取得的 :guilabel:`值`（用戶端密碼值），然後貼上至 Odoo 的 "
":guilabel:`用戶端密碼` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:141
msgid "The \"Client Secret\" token to be copied from Microsoft to Odoo."
msgstr "要從 Microsoft 複製到 Odoo 的「Client Secret」權杖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:145
msgid ""
"Finally, on the Odoo :menuselection:`Settings --> General Settings` page, "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"最後，在 Odoo 的 :menuselection:`設定 --> 一般設定` 頁面中，按一下 "
":guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:150
msgid "Sync with Outlook"
msgstr "與 Outlook 同步"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:154
msgid ""
"Odoo highly recommends testing the Outlook calendar synchronization on a "
"test database and a test email address (that is not used for any other "
"purpose) before attempting to sync the desired Outlook Calendar with the "
"user's production database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:158
msgid ""
"If the user has any past, present, or future events on their Odoo calendar "
"before syncing their Outlook calendar, Outlook will treat the events pulled "
"from Odoo's calendar during the sync as new events, causing an email "
"notification to be sent from Outlook to all the event attendees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:162
msgid ""
"To avoid unwanted emails being sent to all past, present, and future event "
"attendees, the user must add the events from the Odoo calendar to the "
"Outlook calendar before the first ever sync, delete the events from Odoo, "
"and then start the sync."
msgstr ""
"為避免向所有過去、現在及未來的活動出席者發送不必要的電郵，用戶必須在首次同步"
"前，先將 Odoo 日曆中的活動加至 Outlook 日曆，從 Odoo 刪除該等活動，然後才開始"
"同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:166
msgid ""
"Even after synchronizing the Odoo Calendar with the Outlook calendar, "
"Outlook will still send a notification to all event participants every time "
"an event is edited (created, deleted, unarchived, or event date/time "
"changed), with no exceptions. This is a limitation that cannot be fixed from"
" Odoo's side."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:171
msgid ""
"In summary, once a user synchronizes their Outlook calendar with the Odoo "
"calendar:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:173
msgid ""
"Creating an event in Odoo causes Outlook to send an invitation to all event "
"attendees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:174
msgid ""
"Deleting an event in Odoo causes Outlook to send a cancellation to all event"
" attendees."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中刪除活動，會導致 Outlook 向所有活動出席者傳送取消通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:175
msgid ""
"Unarchiving an event in Odoo causes Outlook to send an invitation to all "
"event attendees."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中取消封存活動會導致 Outlook 向所有活動參與者發送邀請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:176
msgid ""
"Archiving an event in Odoo causes Outlook to send a cancellation to all "
"event attendees."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中封存活動會導致 Outlook 向所有活動參與者發送取消通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:177
msgid ""
"Adding a contact to an event causes Outlook to send an invitation to all "
"event attendees."
msgstr "將聯絡人新增至活動會導致 Outlook 向所有活動參與者發送邀請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:178
msgid ""
"Removing a contact from an event causes Outlook to send a cancellation to "
"all event attendees."
msgstr "從活動中移除聯絡人會導致 Outlook 向所有活動出席者發送取消通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:181
msgid "Sync Odoo Calendar and Outlook"
msgstr "同步 Odoo 日曆與 Outlook"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:183
msgid ""
"In the Odoo database, open to the *Calendar* module, and click the "
":guilabel:`Outlook` sync button on the right-side of the page, beneath the "
"monthly calendar."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 資料庫中，開啟 *日曆* 模組，然後點擊頁面右側月曆下方的 "
":guilabel:`Outlook` 同步按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/calendar/outlook.rst:186
