#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:73
msgid "Filter and sort data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:75
msgid ""
"Filtering and sorting allow you to manage what data is displayed and how it "
"is displayed. This can help tailor the view to answer specific business "
"questions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:78
msgid ""
":ref:`Filtering <dashboards/use-dashboards/global-filters>` limits the data "
"presented in charts and tables, allowing you to focus only on records that "
"meet specific criteria,  e.g., viewing sales data only for a specific sales "
"team."
msgstr ""
":ref:`篩選 <dashboards/use-dashboards/global-filters>` 可限制圖表及表格顯示的"
"數據，讓您只專注於符合特定條件的記錄，例如只查看特定銷售團隊的銷售數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:81
msgid ""
":ref:`Sorting <dashboards/use-dashboards/sort>` reorders the data presented "
"in table columns, allowing you to see the data from different perspectives, "
"e.g., viewing products by sales revenue from highest to lowest."
msgstr ""
":ref:`排序 <dashboards/use-dashboards/sort>` 會重新排列表格直欄中顯示的數據，"
"讓您從不同角度查看數據，例如按銷售收入由高至低檢視產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:88
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:325
msgid "Apply global filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:90
msgid ""
"If :doc:`global filters <spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters>` have "
"been configured for a dashboard, a search bar is available above the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"如果已為儀表板設定 :doc:`全域篩選器 <spreadsheet/work_with_data/"
"global_filters>`，儀表板上方會顯示搜尋列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:93
msgid "Global filters on the Project dashboard"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:98
msgid ""
"Global filters are available for all :ref:`standard dashboards "
"<dashboards/standard>`. Additional :doc:`global filters can be added "
"<spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters>` by a user with the appropriate "
":ref:`access rights <dashboards/access-and-sharing/customize-configure-"
"build>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:102
msgid ""
"It is also possible to :ref:`search for values <search/values>` by typing "
"directly in the search bar; the search categories shown reflect the "
"available global filters."
msgstr ""
"亦可直接在搜尋欄中輸入內容以 :ref:`搜尋數值 <search/values>`；畫面顯示的搜尋"
"類別會反映可用的全域篩選條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:105
msgid "To apply global filters:"
msgstr "如要套用全域篩選條件："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:107
msgid ""
"Click within the search bar or click on the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon to access all filters available for that "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"點擊搜尋列，或點擊 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`（下拉式選單）` 圖示，以"
"存取該儀表板可用的所有篩選條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:109
msgid ""
"For the relevant filter, select a conditional operator from the first "
"dropdown, e.g., :guilabel:`is in`, then, as relevant, enter or select the "
"appropriate value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:111
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Filter`."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`篩選`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:113
msgid ""
"For dashboards with a date filter, this filter can be set via the search bar"
" or via the button with the :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`(calendar)` icon."
msgstr ""
"對於設有日期篩選器的儀表板，您可透過搜尋列或帶有 :icon:`fa-calendar` "
":guilabel:`（日曆）` 圖示的按鈕設定此篩選器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:116
msgid "Filtering a dashboard by date period"
msgstr "按日期期間篩選儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:119
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Custom Range` at the bottom of the period selector shows "
"either a manually entered custom range, if relevant, or the start and end "
"date of the selected period."
msgstr ""
"時期選擇器底部的:guilabel:`自訂範圍`會顯示手動輸入的自訂範圍（如適用），或所"
"選時期的開始及結束日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:122
msgid ""
"To remove a value from a filter, click the :icon:`fa-times` "
":guilabel:`(remove)` icon beside the name of the value; to empty a filter, "
"click the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(remove)` icon at the far right of the"
" filter."
msgstr ""
"如要從篩選條件中移除某個值，請點擊該值名稱旁邊的 :icon:`fa-times` "
":guilabel:`（移除）` 圖示；如要清空篩選條件，請點擊篩選條件最右側的 "
":icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`（移除）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:129
msgid "Sort data"
msgstr "排序資料"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:131
msgid ""
"Depending on the dashboard and the table in question, it may be possible to "
"sort the data by column, by clicking the column heading. A :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(caret down)` or :icon:`fa-caret-up` :guilabel:`(caret up)`"
" icon beside a column heading indicates that the column has been sorted in "
"descending or ascending order, respectively. If, when hovering over other "
"column headings, a :icon:`fa-sort` :guilabel:`(sort)` icon appears, the "
"column can be sorted."
msgstr ""
"視乎所查看的儀表板和表格，你或可透過點擊直欄標題來按欄排序資料。若直欄標題旁"
"出現 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(向下箭頭)` 或 :icon:`fa-caret-up` "
":guilabel:`(向上箭頭)` 圖示，分別代表該欄已按降序或升序排列。如果將滑鼠游標停"
"留在其他直欄標題上時出現 :icon:`fa-sort` :guilabel:`(排序)` 圖示，即表示該欄"
"可進行排序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:138
msgid ""
"If conditional formatting has been applied to a table, the original "
"formatting is maintained when the table is resorted by a different column."
msgstr ""
"如果表格已套用條件式格式設定，當以其他資料欄重新排序表格時，原本的格式設定將"
"會保留。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:142
msgid ""
"In this example, the table was originally sorted by revenue per CRM tag, in "
"decreasing order. Conditional formatting was defined to visualize the "
"proportional revenue using data bars. When the table is resorted by number "
"of leads in descending order, the data bars still reflect the revenue per "
"tag in decreasing order."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，表格原本按每個 CRM 標籤的收入遞減排序，並已設定條件格式，以數據橫"
"條將收入比例視覺化。當表格改為按潛在客戶數量遞減重新排序時，數據橫條仍會反映"
"各標籤的遞減收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:147
msgid "Sorting a table with conditional formatting using data bars"
msgstr "使用資料橫條對套用條件式格式的表格進行排序"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:154
msgid "Access underlying records"
msgstr "存取基礎記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:156
msgid ""
"While dashboards provide a user-friendly summary of key data, drilling down "
"to the underlying data allows a more detailed analysis. This can be useful "
"for investigating anomalies or providing the full context needed for "
"decision-making."
msgstr ""
"雖然儀表板提供清晰易懂的關鍵數據摘要，但深入檢視底層數據可進行更詳細的分析。"
"這有助於調查異常情況，或為決策提供所需的完整背景資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:160
msgid ""
"**Open underlying database records**: To access database records referenced "
"by a dashboard, click on the relevant value in a table or on a data point on"
" a chart. Doing so opens either the individual record, or, in the case of "
"charts or tables displaying consolidated data, a list of the referenced "
"records."
msgstr ""
"**開啟底層資料庫記錄** ：如要存取儀表板所參照的資料庫記錄，請點擊表格中的相關"
"數值或圖表上的數據點。這樣便會開啟個別記錄；若圖表或表格顯示的是彙總數據，則"
"會開啟所參照記錄的清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:165
msgid ""
"**Open underlying database views**: To access the view from which the data "
"for a specific chart or table is retrieved, click on the title of the chart "
"or table. Doing so opens the corresponding list view, pivot view or graph "
"view."
msgstr ""
"**開啟底層資料庫檢視**：要存取擷取特定圖表或表格資料的檢視，請點擊該圖表或表"
"格的標題。此操作會開啟相應的列表檢視、樞紐分析檢視或圖表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:170
msgid ""
"To return to a dashboard after drilling down to underlying records or views,"
" click the :guilabel:`Dashboards` breadcrumb in the upper-left corner."
msgstr ""
"在深入檢視底層記錄或檢視畫面後，如要返回儀表板，請按一下左上角的 "
":guilabel:`儀表板` 導覽路徑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:176
msgid "Expand, copy or download charts"
msgstr "展開、複製或下載圖表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:178
msgid ""
"To see charts in full screen, hover over a chart and click the :icon:`fa-"
"expand` icon."
msgstr ""
"若要以全螢幕檢視圖表，請將滑鼠游標停留在圖表上，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-expand` 圖"
"示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:180
msgid ""
"It is also possible to copy or download a chart by hovering over the chart "
"and clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (vertical ellipsis) icon, then "
"clicking :icon:`os-copy-as-image` :guilabel:`Copy as image` or :icon:`fa-"
"download` :guilabel:`Download` as relevant."
msgstr ""
"您亦可將滑鼠游標停留在圖表上，點擊 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`（垂直省略號）圖示，"
"再視乎需要點擊 :icon:`os-copy-as-image` :guilabel:`複製為圖片` 或 :icon:`fa-"
"download` :guilabel:`下載`，以複製或下載圖表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:185
msgid ""
":ref:`Expanding a time-series chart to full screen <dashboards/use-"
"dashboards/time-series-charts-zoom-scroll>` allows a more detailed analysis."
msgstr ""
":ref:`將時間序列圖表展開至全螢幕 <dashboards/use-dashboards/time-series-"
"charts-zoom-scroll>` 可進行更詳細的分析。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:191
msgid "Analyze time-series charts"
msgstr "分析時間序列圖表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:193
msgid ""
"Time-series charts, i.e., charts showing data over time, can be analyzed "
"more closely by:"
msgstr "時間序列圖表（即顯示隨時間變化資料的圖表）可透過以下方式進行更深入的分析："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:195
msgid ""
":ref:`adjusting the granularity <dashboards/use-dashboards/time-series-"
"charts-granularity>`;"
msgstr ":ref:`調整粒度 <dashboards/use-dashboards/time-series-charts-granularity>`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:196
msgid ""
":ref:`zooming in <dashboards/use-dashboards/time-series-charts-zoom-scroll>`"
" on a chosen time span."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:202
msgid "Adjust granularity"
msgstr "調整粒度"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:204
msgid ""
"For many time-series charts it is possible to adjust the granularity of the "
"unit of time on the x-axis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:207
msgid ""
"To do so, hover over the chart, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon, then select the desired granularity."
