"要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:14
msgid "Build a dashboard"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:16
msgid ""
"In its most simple terms, building a dashboard involves :doc:`inserting Odoo"
" data into a spreadsheet <../spreadsheet/insert>` then :ref:`converting that"
" spreadsheet into a dashboard <spreadsheet/get-started/convert-to-"
"dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"簡單來說，建立儀表板包括 :doc:`將 Odoo 資料插入試算表 <../spreadsheet/insert>"
"`，然後 :ref:`將該試算表轉換為儀表板 <spreadsheet/get-started/convert-to-"
"dashboard>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:20
msgid ""
"However, to build a dashboard that delivers relevant and valuable insights, "
"it is important to consider the process in terms of three key stages: "
":ref:`preparation <build_and_customize_dashboards/build-preparation>`, "
":ref:`data insertion and manipulation <build_and_customize_dashboards/build-"
"insertion-manipulation>`, and :ref:`data visualization "
"<build_and_customize_dashboards/build-visualization>`."
msgstr ""
"不過，要建立一個能提供相關且有價值見解的儀表板，必須從三個關鍵階段來規劃流程"
"：:ref:`準備工作 <build_and_customize_dashboards/build-preparation>"
"`、:ref:`資料插入與處理 <build_and_customize_dashboards/build-insertion-"
"manipulation>` 以及 :ref:`資料視覺化 <build_and_customize_dashboards/build-"
"visualization>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:29
msgid "Preparation"
msgstr "準備"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:31
