#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:33
msgid ""
"defining the purpose of the dashboard, in other words, the business "
"questions it needs to answer, and deciding what data would answer those "
"questions;"
msgstr ""
"確定儀表板的用途，換言之，即需要回答的業務問題，並決定哪些數據可以回答這些問"
"題；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:35
msgid ""
"determining where to find the relevant Odoo data and deciding which "
":doc:`type of view <../../studio/views>` (i.e., list, pivot table, or chart)"
" is most suited for the data analysis needed;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:38
msgid ""
"preparing the Odoo data by refining the views to focus on the most relevant "
"information, e.g., by using :doc:`search filters <../../essentials/search>`,"
" by making only certain list fields visible, or by deciding which dimensions"
" and measures a pivot table should use;"
