"透過調整檢視畫面準備 Odoo 資料，以集中顯示最相關的資訊，例如使用 :doc:`搜尋篩"
"選條件 <../../essentials/search>`、僅顯示特定清單欄位，或決定樞紐分析表應使用"
"的維度與量度；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:41
msgid "sourcing any other information needed to support the dashboard."
msgstr "蒐集支援儀表板所需的任何其他資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:46
msgid "Data insertion and manipulation"
msgstr "資料插入及處理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:50
msgid ""
"inserting the prepared :doc:`lists <../spreadsheet/insert/insert_list>`, "
":doc:`pivot tables <../spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table>` or "
":doc:`charts <../spreadsheet/insert/insert_chart>` into the spreadsheet you "
"will use to build your dashboard;"
msgstr ""
"將已準備好的:doc:`清單 <../spreadsheet/insert/insert_list>`、:doc:`數據透視"
"表 <../spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table>`或:doc:`圖表 <../spreadsheet/"
"insert/insert_chart>`插入至您將用於建立儀表板的試算表中；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:53
msgid ""
"manipulating the data, if needed, to be able to draw the necessary insights."
" This may involve performing calculations or creating custom metrics using "
":doc:`standard or Odoo-specific functions and formulas "
"<../spreadsheet/work_with_data/functions>`, referencing data from various "
"sources within the spreadsheet, or :ref:`converting static pivot tables to "
"dynamic pivot tables <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-convert>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:62
msgid "Data visualization"
msgstr "資料視覺化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:66
msgid ""
"presenting the data on at least the first sheet of your spreadsheet (i.e., "
"the sheet that will serve as the front end of your dashboard) in a clear, "
"visual, and meaningful way so it is easy to interpret. Concretely, this "
"means deciding on the layout and order of elements such as tables and "
"charts, as well as using tools and techniques to guide the user, such as "
"clear and descriptive headings, text formatting and colors, carefully chosen"
" chart types, and conditional formatting to highlight specific data "
"visually;"
msgstr ""
"以清晰、視覺化且具意義的方式，在試算表的至少第一張工作表（即作為儀表板前端的"
"工作表）呈現數據，使其易於解讀。具體而言，這包括決定表格與圖表等元素的版面配"
"置及排列順序，以及運用工具和技巧引導使用者，例如清晰且具描述性的標題、文字格"
"式與顏色、精心挑選的圖表類型，以及透過條件式格式設定在視覺上突顯特定數據；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:72
msgid ""
":doc:`inserting clickable links "
"<../spreadsheet/insert/insert_clickable_links>`, if relevant, to provide "
"access to Odoo menu items, URLs, or other sheets within the same spreadsheet"
" if these should also be accessible from the front end of your dashboard;"
msgstr ""
":doc:`插入可點擊連結 <../spreadsheet/insert/insert_clickable_links>`（如適用"
"），讓使用者亦能從儀表板前端存取 Odoo 選單項目、URL 或同一試算表中的其他工作"
"表；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:75
msgid ""
":doc:`creating global filters "
"<../spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters>` to allow users to tailor the"
" view to their needs;"
msgstr ""
":doc:`建立全域篩選器 <../spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters>`，讓用戶"
"根據需要自訂檢視畫面；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:77
msgid ""
":ref:`converting the spreadsheet into a dashboard <spreadsheet/get-"
"started/convert-to-dashboard>`, determining whether to add the dashboard to "
"an existing or new dashboard section, and :ref:`managing access rights to "
"the dashboard <dashboards/access-and-sharing/manage-view-access>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`將試算表轉換為儀表板 <spreadsheet/get-started/convert-to-dashboard>`、"
"決定將儀表板新增至現有或新的儀表板區段，以及 :ref:`管理儀表板的存取權限 "
"<dashboards/access-and-sharing/manage-view-access>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:83
msgid ""
"Use standard dashboards as inspiration for how to best present and visualize"
" data. For example, for charts, :ref:`open the underlying spreadsheet "
"<build_and_customize_dashboards/customize/open-spreadsheet>` of a standard "
"dashboard, hover over a chart and click the :icon:`fa-bars` "
":guilabel:`(menu)` icon, then :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Edit` to"
" see the chart properties on the right side of the screen."
msgstr ""
"你可參考標準儀表板，獲取最佳數據呈現及視覺化方式的靈感。例如，對於圖表，可從"
"標準儀表板:ref:`開啟底層試算表 <build_and_customize_dashboards/customize/"
"open-spreadsheet>`，將滑鼠游標停留在圖表上並點擊 :icon:`fa-bars` "
":guilabel:`（選單）` 圖示，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`編"
"輯`，即可在畫面右側查看圖表屬性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:89
msgid ""
"The possibility to link to other sheets within the same spreadsheet allows "
"the creation of a multi-page dashboard, with users able to navigate between "
"pages thanks to clickable links. Global filters apply across all pages of a "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"連結至同一試算表內其他工作表的功能，讓用戶可建立多頁面儀表板，並透過可點擊的"
"連結在各頁面之間導覽。全域篩選條件適用於儀表板的所有頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:94
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorial: Dashboard from scratch "
"<https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/dashboard-from-scratch-8957>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 教學課程：從零開始建立儀表板 <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"dashboard-from-scratch-8957>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:100
msgid "Customize a dashboard"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:102
msgid ""
"A dashboard can be customized by :ref:`opening its underlying spreadsheet "
"<build_and_customize_dashboards/customize/open-spreadsheet>`, i.e., the Odoo"
" spreadsheet from which the dashboard has been created, and :ref:`making any"
" desired changes <dashboards/customize-dashboard/edit-spreadsheet>`."
msgstr ""
"您可以透過:ref:`開啟儀表板的底層試算表 <build_and_customize_dashboards/"
"customize/open-spreadsheet>`（即建立該儀表板的 Odoo 試算表），並:ref:`作出任"
"何所需更改 <dashboards/customize-dashboard/edit-spreadsheet>`，以自訂儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:110
msgid "Open the underlying spreadsheet"
msgstr "開啟底層試算表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:113
msgid ""
"When customizing a :ref:`standard dashboard <dashboards/standard>`, it is "
"highly recommended to :ref:`duplicate the dashboard "
"<build_and_customize_dashboards/customize/duplicate-dashboard>` and make any"
" changes on the underlying spreadsheet of the duplicated version. Standard "
"dashboards are reinstalled at each Odoo version upgrade, meaning any "
"customizations on the original version are lost."
msgstr ""
"自訂 :ref:`標準儀表板 <dashboards/standard>` 時，強烈建議 :ref:`複製儀表板 "
"<build_and_customize_dashboards/customize/duplicate-dashboard>`，並在複製版本"
"的底層試算表上進行任何更改。每次升級 Odoo 版本時，系統都會重新安裝標準儀表板"
"，因此對原版本所作的任何自訂設定將會遺失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:119
msgid "To open a dashboard's underlying spreadsheet:"
msgstr "要開啟儀表板的基礎試算表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:122
msgid ""
"Open the relevant dashboard section, then, on the line of the relevant "
"dashboard, click :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr ""
"開啟相關的儀表板區段，然後在相關儀表板所在列上，按一下 :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`編輯`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:126
msgid ""
"To temporarily unpublish a dashboard while you make changes, disable "
":guilabel:`Is Published` *before* editing the dashboard, making note to "
"republish it when the customization has been finalized."
msgstr ""
"如要在進行更改時暫時取消發佈儀表板，請停用 :guilabel:`已發佈`，並在編輯儀表"
"板*之前*完成此操作，自訂完成後請緊記重新發佈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:129
msgid ""
"Users who do not have the appropriate :ref:`access rights "
"<dashboards/access-and-sharing/customize-configure-build>` to customize a "
"dashboard can still access a read-only version of the dashboard's underlying"
" spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"沒有適當 :ref:`存取權限 <dashboards/access-and-sharing/customize-configure-"
"build>` 自訂儀表板的用戶，仍可存取該儀表板底層試算表的唯讀版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:132
msgid ""
"With :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` activated, click on the "
":icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon beside the name of a dashboard in "
"the left panel to open its underlying spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>` 後，點擊左側面板中儀表板名稱旁的 "
":icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`（編輯）` 圖示，即可開啟其底層試算表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:136
msgid "The spreadsheet that opens typically consists of at least two sheets:"
msgstr "開啟的試算表通常包含至少兩個工作表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:138
msgid ""
"**The first sheet** always serves as the front end of your dashboard, and "
"contains the tables and charts used to structure and visualize the data."
msgstr ""
"**第一個工作表** 一律作為儀表板的前端，並包含用於組織及視覺化呈現數據的表格與"
"圖表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:141
msgid ""
"**The second and any subsequent sheets** typically contain data used for the"
" calculation of key metrics shown on the first sheet."
msgstr "**第二張及之後的工作表** 通常包含用於計算第一張工作表所顯示關鍵指標的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:145
msgid ""
"The :ref:`data sources <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>` that maintain the "
"connection between the spreadsheet and the relevant models in your database "
"can be viewed by clicking :menuselection:`Data` on the spreadsheet's menu "
"bar. These data sources are identified by their respective :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot table)`, :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(list)` or"
" :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(chart)` icon, followed by their ID and "
"name, e.g., :icon:`oi-view-pivot` *(#1) Sales Analysis by Product*."
msgstr ""
"如要查看維持試算表與數據庫中相關模型連線的 :ref:`數據源 <spreadsheet/insert/"
"data-sources>`，可點擊試算表選單列上的 :menuselection:`數據`。這些數據源會以"
"各自的 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`（數據透視表）`、:icon:`oi-view-"
"list` :guilabel:`（列表）` 或 :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`（圖表）` 圖示"
"識別，後面附有其 ID 及名稱，例如 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` *(#1) 按產品分析銷"
"售*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:152
msgid ""
"For :ref:`standard dashboards <dashboards/standard>`, while the data sources"
" are still active and visible in the :menuselection:`Data` menu, the "
"corresponding lists and pivot tables have been removed from the spreadsheet "
"for better performance and a neater appearance."
msgstr ""
"就 :ref:`標準儀表板 <dashboards/standard>` 而言，雖然資料來源仍處於啟用狀態並"
"會顯示於 :menuselection:`資料` 選單中，但為了提升效能並令版面更整潔，相應的清"
"單及樞紐分析表已從試算表中移除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:159
msgid "Duplicate a dashboard"
