msgid ""
"With the relevant list view, pivot view or graph view open in your database,"
" proceed as follows:"
msgstr "在資料庫中開啟相關的清單檢視、樞紐分析檢視或圖表檢視後，請按以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:217
msgid ""
"For a list view, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon beside "
"the name of the view, then :guilabel:`Spreadsheet -->` :icon:`oi-view-list` "
":menuselection:`Insert list in spreadsheet`."
msgstr ""
"對於清單檢視，點擊檢視名稱旁邊的 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(操作)` 圖示，然後"
"點擊 :guilabel:`試算表 -->` :icon:`oi-view-list` :menuselection:`在試算表中插"
"入清單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:220
msgid ""
"For a pivot or graph view, click :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` at the "
"top left of the view."
msgstr "對於樞紐分析表或圖表檢視，點擊檢視左上角的 :guilabel:`插入試算表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:222
msgid ""
"In the window that opens, edit the name if needed. For a list, edit the "
"number of records, i.e., rows to be inserted, if needed."
msgstr ""
