#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:224
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Dashboards` tab then select in which dashboard the "
"list, pivot table, or chart should be inserted."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`儀表板` 分頁，然後選擇要將清單、樞紐分析表或圖表插入哪個儀"
"表板。"

