msgstr "**變更頁面版面**：點擊右上角的 :guilabel:`變更版面`，然後選擇所需的版面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/my_dashboard.rst:69
msgid ""
"For multi-column layouts, the column limits are identified by :icon:`fa-"
"caret-left` :guilabel:`(left caret)` and :icon:`fa-caret-right` "
":guilabel:`(right caret)` icons at the bottom of the page. If needed, scroll"
