":guilabel:`（最小化）` 圖示。若要展開小工具，請按一下 :icon:`fa-window-"
"maximize` :guilabel:`（最大化）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/my_dashboard.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Move widgets**: Drag and drop widgets to the desired location in the same "
"column or a different column."
msgstr "**移動小工具**：將小工具拖放至同一欄或不同欄中的所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/dashboards/my_dashboard.rst:82
