#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:71
msgid "Deduplication"
msgstr "重複資料刪除"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:73
msgid ""
"The *Duplicates* dashboard groups similar records to be :ref:`merged "
"<data_cleaning/merge-records>` by matching conditions within the records set"
" by the :ref:`deduplication rules <data_cleaning/deduplication-rules>`."
msgstr ""
"*重複項目* 儀表板會將相似的記錄分組以便 :ref:`合併 <data_cleaning/merge-"
"records>`，做法是根據 :ref:`消除重複規則 <data_cleaning/deduplication-rules>"
"` 所設定的條件在記錄中進行配對。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:77
msgid ""
"Navigate to this dashboard by going to :menuselection:`Data Cleaning app -->"
" Deduplication`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`數據清理應用程式 --> 去除重複資料`，即可開啟此儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:79
msgid "Deduplication dashboard in the Data Cleaning application."
msgstr "「資料清理」應用程式中的去重複儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:82
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`RULE` sidebar lists each of the active deduplication rules, "
"and displays the total number of duplicates detected beside each rule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:85
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`All` rule is selected. Records are grouped by "
"their rule, with a :guilabel:`Similarity` rating (out of 100%), with the "
"following columns:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Created On`: the date and time the original record was created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:89
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: the name or title of the original record."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：原始記錄的名稱或標題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Field Values`: the original record's values for the fields used "
"to detect duplicates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Used In`: lists other models referencing the original record."
msgstr ":guilabel:`使用位置`：列出參照原始記錄的其他模型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:92
msgid ":guilabel:`ID`: the original record's unique ID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is Master`: the duplicates are merged into the *master* record. "
"There can only be **one** master record in a grouping of similar records."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`是主記錄`：重複的記錄會合併至 *主* 記錄中。在一組相似的記錄中，只"
"能有 **一個** 主記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:96
msgid ""
"Select a specific rule in the :guilabel:`RULE` sidebar to filter the "
"duplicate records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:101
msgid "Merge duplicate records"
msgstr "合併重複記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:103
msgid ""
"To merge records, first choose a *master* record within the grouping of "
"similar records. The master record acts as the base, at which any additional"
" information from similar records are merged into."
msgstr ""
"如要合併記錄，請先在相似記錄群組中選擇一項*主要*記錄。該主要記錄將作為基礎，"
"其他相似記錄中的額外資料均會合併至其中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:106
msgid ""
"Optionally, no master record can be set, leaving Odoo to choose a record at "
"random to merge into."
msgstr "您亦可選擇不設定主要紀錄，由 Odoo 隨機選擇一項紀錄作為合併目標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:108
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`Merge` button at the top of the similar records "
"grouping. Then, click :guilabel:`Ok` to confirm the merge."
msgstr ""
"接下來，點擊相似記錄分組頂部的 :guilabel:`合併` 按鈕。然後，點擊 "
":guilabel:`確定` 以確認合併。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:111
msgid ""
"Once a record is merged, a message is logged in the chatter of the master "
"record, describing the merge. Certain records, like **Project** tasks, are "
"logged in the chatter with a link to the old record as a convenient "
"reference of the merge."
msgstr ""
"合併記錄後，主記錄的通訊欄會記錄一則說明合併詳情的訊息。某些記錄（例如 **專"
"案** 任務）會在通訊欄中附上舊記錄的連結，方便查閱合併詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:116
msgid ""
"Discard groupings by clicking the :guilabel:`DISCARD` button. Upon doing so,"
" the grouping is hidden from the list and archived."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`捨棄` 按鈕以捨棄分組。完成後，該分組會從清單中隱藏並封存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:119
msgid ""
"View discarded groupings by selecting the :guilabel:`Discarded` filter from "
"the :ref:`search bar <search/filters>`."
msgstr ""
"請選取 :guilabel:`已捨棄` 篩選條件（位於 :ref:`搜尋欄 <search/filters>` 內）"
"，即可查看已捨棄的分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:125
msgid "Deduplication rules"
msgstr "刪除重複項規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:127
msgid ""
"The *Deduplication Rules* set the conditions for how records are detected as"
" duplicates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:129
msgid ""
"These rules can be configured for each model in the database, and with "
"varying levels of specificity. To get started, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Data Cleaning app --> Configuration --> Deduplication`."
msgstr ""
"這些規則可針對資料庫中的每個模型進行設定，並可指定不同層級的精確度。要開始使"
"用，請前往:menuselection:`資料清理應用程式 --> 設定 --> 刪除重複資料`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:134
msgid ""
"The deduplication rules run once every day, by default, as part of a "
"scheduled action cron (*Data Merge: Find Duplicate Records*). However, each "
"rule can be :ref:`ran manually <data_cleaning/run-deduplication-rule>` "
"anytime."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，去重規則會透過排程動作（*資料合併：尋找重複記錄*）每日執行一次。"
"不過，每條規則亦可隨時:ref:`手動執行 <data_cleaning/run-deduplication-rule>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:139
msgid "Modify a deduplication rule"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:141
msgid ""
"Select a default rule to edit, or create a new rule by clicking on the "
":guilabel:`New` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:143
msgid ""
"First, choose a :guilabel:`Model` for this rule to target. Selecting a model"
" updates the rule title to the chosen model."
msgstr ""
"首先，為此規則選擇目標 :guilabel:`模型` 。選擇模型後，規則標題會隨即更新為所"
"選模型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:146
msgid ""
"Optionally, configure a :guilabel:`Domain` to specify the records eligible "
"for this rule. The number of eligible records is shown in the :icon:`oi-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`# record(s)` link."
msgstr ""
"您亦可以設定 :guilabel:`網域`，以指定符合此規則的記錄。符合條件的記錄數量會顯"
"示在 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`# 筆記錄` 連結中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:149
msgid ""
"Depending on the selected :guilabel:`Model`, the :guilabel:`Duplicate "
"Removal` field appears. Choose whether to :guilabel:`Archive` or "
":guilabel:`Delete` merged records."
msgstr ""
"視乎所選的 :guilabel:`模型`，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`移除重複項` 欄位。選擇將已"
"合併的記錄 :guilabel:`封存` 或 :guilabel:`刪除`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:152
msgid "Next, select a :guilabel:`Merge Mode`:"
msgstr "接下來，請選取 :guilabel:`合併模式`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual`: requires each duplicate grouping to be manually merged, "
"also enables the :guilabel:`Notify Users` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`手動`：需要手動合併每個重複群組，同時亦會啟用 :guilabel:`通知用"
"戶` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Automatic`: automatically merges duplicate groupings, without "
"notifying users, based on the records with a similarity percentage above the"
" threshold set in the :guilabel:`Similarity Threshold` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`自動`：根據相似度百分比高於 :guilabel:`相似度門檻` 欄位所設門檻的"
"記錄，自動合併重複分組，而不會通知用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:160
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Active` toggle to start capturing duplicates with this"
" rule as soon as it is saved."
msgstr ""
"開啟 :guilabel:`有效` 切換開關，即可在儲存此規則後立即開始使用此規則擷取重複"
"項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:163
msgid ""
"Lastly, create at least one deduplication rule in the "
":guilabel:`Deduplication Rules` field, by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`, "
"under the :guilabel:`Unique ID Field` column."
msgstr ""
"最後，在 :guilabel:`重複資料刪除規則` 欄位中點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，並"
"於 :guilabel:`唯一識別碼欄位` 一欄下建立至少一項重複資料刪除規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:166
msgid ""
"Select a field in the model from the :guilabel:`Unique ID Field` drop-down "
"menu. This field is referenced for similar records."
msgstr ""
"從 :guilabel:`唯一 ID 欄位` 下拉式選單中選取模型中的欄位。系統會參照此欄位以"
"識別相似記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:168
msgid ""
"Select a matching condition in the :guilabel:`Match If` field to apply the "
"deduplication rule, depending on the text in the :guilabel:`Unique ID "
"Field`:"
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`符合條件` 欄位中選擇配對條件，以根據 :guilabel:`唯一 ID 欄位` "
"中的文字套用重複資料刪除規則："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:171
msgid ":guilabel:`Exact Match`: the characters in the text match exactly."
msgstr ":guilabel:`完全相符`：文字中的字元完全相符。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:172
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Case/Accent Insensitive Match`: the characters in the text match,"
" regardless of casing and language-specific accent differences."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`不區分大小寫／重音符號相符`：文字中的字元相符，不論大小寫及特定語"
"言的重音符號差異。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:176
msgid ""
"At least one :guilabel:`Deduplication Rules` must be set for the rule to "
"capture duplicates."
msgstr "必須設定至少一項 :guilabel:`刪除重複項規則`，規則才能偵測重複項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:179
msgid "A few more fields are available for an advanced configuration."
msgstr "另外還有幾個欄位可供進階設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:181
msgid ""
"If on a multi-company database, the :guilabel:`Cross-Company` field is "
"available. When enabled, duplicates across different companies are "
"suggested."
msgstr ""
"如果在多公司資料庫中，可使用 :guilabel:`跨公司` 欄位。啟用後，系統會建議不同"
"公司之間的重複項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:184
msgid ""
"Activate :ref:`developer-mode` to display the :guilabel:`Suggestion "
"Threshold` field. Duplicates with a similarity below the threshold set in "
"this field are **not** suggested."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :ref:`developer-mode`，即可顯示 :guilabel:`建議閾值` 欄位。系統 **不"
"會** 建議相似度低於此欄位所設閾值的重複項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:187
msgid ""
"With the rule's configuration complete, either close the rule form, or "
":ref:`run the rule manually <data_cleaning/run-deduplication-rule>` to "
"instantly capture duplicate records."
msgstr ""
"完成規則設定後，可關閉規則表單，或 :ref:`手動執行規則 <data_cleaning/run-"
"deduplication-rule>`，以即時擷取重複記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:193
msgid "Manually run a deduplication rule"
msgstr "手動執行重複資料刪除規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:195
msgid ""
"To manually run a specific deduplication rule at any time, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Data Cleaning app --> Configuration --> Deduplication`, and "
"select the rule to run."
msgstr ""
"要隨時手動執行特定的重複資料刪除規則，請前往 :menuselection:`資料清理應用程"
"式 --> 配置 --> 重複資料刪除`，然後選擇要執行的規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:198
msgid ""
"Then, on the rule form, select the :guilabel:`Deduplicate` button on the "
"top-left. Upon doing so, the :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`Duplicates` smart "
"button displays the number of duplicates captured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:201
msgid ""
"Click on the :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`Duplicates` smart button to "
":ref:`manage these records <data_cleaning/merge-records>`."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`重複項目` 智能按鈕，即可 :ref:`管理這些記"
"錄 <data_cleaning/merge-records>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:207
msgid "Recycle records"
msgstr "回收紀錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:209
msgid ""
"Use the *recycle records* feature to rid the database of old and outdated "
"records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:211
msgid ""
"The *Field Recycle Records* dashboard displays records that can be archived "
"or deleted, by matching conditions within the records set by the "
":ref:`recycle record's rules <data_cleaning/recylce-rule>`."
msgstr ""
"*欄位回收記錄* 儀表板會顯示可封存或刪除的記錄，系統會根據 :ref:`回收記錄規則 "
"<data_cleaning/recylce-rule>` 所設定的條件進行記錄配對。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:214
msgid ""
"Navigate to this dashboard by going to :menuselection:`Data Cleaning app -->"
" Recycle Records`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`資料清理應用程式 --> 回收記錄`，即可開啟此儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:216
msgid "Field Recycle Records dashboard in the Data Cleaning application."
msgstr "資料清理應用程式中的欄位回收記錄控制面板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:219
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`RECYCLE RULES` sidebar lists each of the active recycle "
"record rules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:221
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`All` option is selected. Records are displayed "
"with the following columns:"
msgstr "預設會選取 :guilabel:`全部` 選項。記錄會顯示以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:224
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:339
msgid ":guilabel:`Record ID`: the ID of the original record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:225
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:340
msgid ":guilabel:`Record Name`: the name or title of the original record."
msgstr ":guilabel:`記錄名稱`：原始記錄的名稱或標題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:227
msgid ""
"Select a specific rule in the :guilabel:`RECYCLE RULES` sidebar to filter "
"the records."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`回收規則` 側邊欄中選擇特定規則，以篩選記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:229
msgid ""
"To recycle records, click the :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Validate` button "
"on the row of the record."
msgstr "要回收記錄，請點擊該記錄列上的 :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`驗證` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:231
msgid ""
"Upon doing so, the record is recycled, depending on how the rule is "
"configured, to be either archived or deleted from the database."
msgstr "完成此操作後，系統會視乎規則的設定方式回收該紀錄，將其封存或從資料庫刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:235
msgid ""
"Discard groupings by clicking the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`Discard` "
"button. Upon doing so, the record is hidden from the list, and is not "
"detected by the recycle rule again in the future."
