#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:238
msgid ""
"View discarded records by selecting the :guilabel:`Discarded` filter from "
"the :ref:`search bar <search/filters>` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"選擇:guilabel:`已捨棄`篩選條件（位於:ref:`搜尋欄 <search/filters>`下拉式選單"
"中），即可檢視已捨棄的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:244
msgid "Recycle record rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:246
msgid ""
"The *Recycle Records Rules* set the conditions for how records are recycled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:248
msgid ""
"These rules can be configured for each model in the database, and with "
"varying levels of specificity. To get started, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Data Cleaning app --> Configuration --> Recycle Records`."
