"rule>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:257
msgid ""
"By default, no recycle record rules exist. Click the :guilabel:`New` button "
"to create a new rule."
msgstr "預設情況下沒有任何回收記錄規則。點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕以建立新規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:259
msgid ""
"On the recycle record rule form, first choose a :guilabel:`Model` for this "
