msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:268
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delta`: type the length of time, which must be a whole number "
"(e.g. `7`)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Delta`：輸入時間長度，必須為整數（例如 `7`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:269
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delta Unit`: select the unit of time (:guilabel:`Days`, "
":guilabel:`Weeks`, :guilabel:`Months`, or :guilabel:`Years`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:272
msgid "Then, select a :guilabel:`Recycle Mode`:"
msgstr "然後，選擇 :guilabel:`循環模式`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:274
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual`: requires each detected record to be manually recycled, "
"and enables the :guilabel:`Notify Users` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`手動`：要求手動回收每筆偵測到的記錄，並啟用:guilabel:`通知用戶`欄"
"位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:276
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Automatic`: automatically merges recycled groupings, without "
"notifying users."
msgstr ":guilabel:`自動`：自動合併已回收的分組，而不會通知用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:278
msgid ""
"Lastly, select a :guilabel:`Recycle Action` to either :guilabel:`Archive` or"
" :guilabel:`Delete` records. If :guilabel:`Delete` is selected, choose "
"whether or not to :guilabel:`Include Archived` records in the rule."
msgstr ""
"最後，選擇 :guilabel:`回收操作` ，以決定 :guilabel:`封存` 或 :guilabel:`刪"
