"封存` 記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:282
msgid ""
"With the rule's configuration complete, either close the rule form, or "
":ref:`run the rule manually <data-cleaning/run-recycle-rule>` to instantly "
