#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:3
msgid "Chatter"
msgstr "Chatter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:9
msgid ""
"The *Chatter* feature is integrated throughout Odoo to streamline "
"communication, maintain traceability, and provide accountability among team "
"members. Chatter windows, known as *composers*, are located on almost every "
"record within the database, and allow users to communicate with both "
"internal users and external contacts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:14
msgid ""
"Chatter composers also enable users to log notes, upload files, and schedule"
" activities."
msgstr "Chatter 編輯器亦讓用戶記錄備註、上載檔案及安排活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:17
msgid "Chatter thread"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:19
msgid ""
"A *chatter thread* can be found on most pages in the database, and serves as"
" a record of the updates and edits made to a record. A note is logged in the"
" chatter thread when a change is made to the record. The note includes "
"details of the change, and a time stamp."
msgstr ""
"資料庫中的大多數頁面都設有*通訊討論串*，用以記錄對項目所作的更新與編輯。每當"
"記錄有所變更時，系統會在通訊討論串中登記一則備註，當中包含變更詳情及時間戳記"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:24
msgid ""
"A user, Mitchell Admin, needs to update the email address of a contact. "
"After they save the changes to the contact record, a note is logged in the "
"chatter of the contact record with the following information:"
msgstr ""
"用戶 Mitchell Admin 需要更新聯絡人的電郵地址。他們儲存對聯絡人記錄的變更後，"
"系統會在該聯絡人記錄的通訊欄中記錄一則包含以下資訊的備註："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:28
msgid "The date when the change occurred."
msgstr "發生變更的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:29
msgid "The email address as it was previously listed."
msgstr "先前所列的電郵地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:30
msgid "The updated email address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:32
msgid "A close up of a chatter thread with an update to a contact record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:35
msgid ""
"If a record was created, or edited, via an imported file, or was otherwise "
"updated through an intervention by the system, the chatter thread creates a "
"log note, and credits the change to OdooBot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:39
msgid "A close up of a chatter thread of an OdooBot created contact record."
msgstr "由 OdooBot 建立的聯絡人記錄之對話串特寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:45
msgid "Add followers"
msgstr "新增追蹤者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:47
msgid ""
"A *follower* is a user or contact that is added to a record and is notified "
"when the record is updated, based on specific :ref:`follower subscription "
"settings <discuss/edit-subscription>`. Followers can add themselves, or can "
"be added by another user."
msgstr ""
"*追蹤者* 是已新增至記錄的使用者或聯絡人；當記錄更新時，系統會根據特定的 "
":ref:`追蹤者訂閱設定 <discuss/edit-subscription>` 通知對方。追蹤者可自行加入"
"，或由其他使用者新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:52
msgid ""
"If a user creates, or is assigned to a record, they are automatically added "
"as a follower."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:54
msgid ""
"To follow a record, navigate to any record with a chatter thread. For "
"example, to open a *Helpdesk* ticket, navigate to :menuselection:`Helpdesk "
"app --> Tickets --> All Tickets`, and select a ticket from the list to open "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:58
msgid ""
"At the top-right, above the chatter composer, click :guilabel:`Follow`. "
"Doing this changes the button to read :guilabel:`Following`. Click it again "
"to :guilabel:`Unfollow`."
msgstr ""
"在右上角通訊欄撰寫區上方，點擊 :guilabel:`關注`。點擊後，按鈕會變為顯示 "
":guilabel:`正在關注`。再次點擊即可 :guilabel:`取消關注`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:62
msgid "Manage followers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:64
msgid ""
"To add another user, or contact, as a follower, click the |user|. This opens"
" a drop-down list of the current followers. Click :guilabel:`Add Followers` "
"to open an :guilabel:`Invite Follower` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"如要將其他使用者或聯絡人新增為追蹤者，請按一下 |user|，這會開啟目前追蹤者的下"
"拉式清單。按一下 :guilabel:`新增追蹤者`，即可開啟 :guilabel:`邀請追蹤者` 彈出"
"視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:68
msgid ""
"Select one or more contacts from the :guilabel:`Recipients` drop-down list. "
"To notify the contacts, tick the :guilabel:`Send Notification` checkbox. "
"Edit the message template as desired, then click :guilabel:`Add Followers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:72
msgid ""
"To remove followers, click the |user| to open the current followers list. "
"Find the name of the follower to be removed, and click the :icon:`fa-remove`"
" :guilabel:`(remove)` icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:78
msgid "Edit follower subscription"
msgstr "編輯追蹤者訂閱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:80
msgid ""
"The updates a follower receives can vary based on their subscription "
"settings. To see the type of updates a follower is subscribed to, and to "
"edit the list, click the |user|. Find the appropriate follower in the list, "
"then click the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(pencil)` icon. This opens the "
":guilabel:`Edit Subscription` pop-up window for the follower."
msgstr ""
"追蹤者收到的更新可能會因其訂閱設定而異。要查看追蹤者所訂閱的更新類型並編輯清"
"單，請點擊 |user|。在清單中找出相關追蹤者，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`（鉛筆）` 圖示。這將會為該追蹤者開啟 :guilabel:`編輯訂閱` 彈出視窗"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:85
msgid ""
"The list of available subscription settings varies depending on the record "
"type. For example, a follower of a *Helpdesk* ticket may be informed when "
"the ticket is rated. This option would not be available for the followers of"
" a *CRM* opportunity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:89
msgid ""
"Tick the checkbox for any updates the follower should receive, and clear the"
" checkbox for any updates they should **not** receive. Click "
":guilabel:`Apply` when finished."
msgstr ""
"勾選追蹤者應接收的更新項目核取方塊，並取消勾選其**不應**接收的更新項目核取方"
"塊。完成後點擊 :guilabel:`套用`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:92
msgid "The Edit Subscription window on a Helpdesk ticket."
msgstr "支援服務工單上的「編輯訂閱」視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:95
msgid ""
"The Edit Subscription options vary depending on the record type. These are "
"the options for a Helpdesk ticket."
msgstr "「編輯訂閱」選項會視乎記錄類型而有所不同。以下為服務台工單可用的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:101
msgid "Log notes"
msgstr "記錄備註"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:103
msgid ""
"The chatter function includes the ability to log internal notes on "
"individual records. These notes are only accessible to internal users, and "
"are available on any records that feature a chatter thread."
msgstr ""
"Chatter 功能支援在個別記錄上記錄內部備註。這些備註僅供內部用戶查閱，並適用於"
"任何設有 Chatter 對話串的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:107
msgid ""
"To log an internal note, first navigate to a record. For example, to open a "
"*CRM* opportunity, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --> My "
"Pipeline`, and click on the Kanban card of an opportunity to open it. Then, "
"at the top-right, above the chatter composer, click :guilabel:`Log note`."
msgstr ""
"要記錄內部備註，請先前往相關記錄。例如，要開啟 *CRM* 商機，請前往 "
":menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 銷售 --> 我的銷售管道`，並點擊商機的看板卡片"
"以將其開啟。然後，點擊右上方對話區編寫器上方的 :guilabel:`記錄備註`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:112
msgid ""
"Enter the note in the chatter composer. To tag an internal user, type `@`, "
"and begin typing the name of the person to tag. Then, select a name from the"
" drop-down menu. Depending on their notification settings, the user is "
"notified by email, or through Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:117
msgid ""
"Outside contacts can also be tagged in an internal log note. The contact "
"then receives an email with the contents of the note they were tagged in, "
"including any attachments added directly to the note. If they respond to the"
" email, their response is logged in the chatter, and they are added to the "
"record as a follower."
msgstr ""
"外部聯絡人亦可在內部記錄備註中被標記。該聯絡人隨後會收到一封電郵，當中包含其"
"被標記的備註內容，以及直接附加至該備註的任何附件。如果他們回覆該電郵，其回覆"
"會記錄在通訊欄中，他們亦會被新增為該記錄的關注者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:122
msgid ""
"Outside contacts are **not** able to log in to view the entire chatter "
"thread, and are only notified of specific updates, based on their "
":ref:`follower subscription settings <discuss/edit-subscription>`, or when "
"they are tagged directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:129
msgid "Send messages"
msgstr "傳送訊息"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:131
msgid ""
"Chatter composers can send messages to outside contacts, without having to "
"leave the database, or open a different application. This makes it easy to "
"communicate with potential customers in the *Sales* and *CRM* applications, "
"or vendors in the *Purchase* app."
msgstr ""
"通訊欄訊息撰寫器可向外部聯絡人發送訊息，無需離開資料庫或開啟其他應用程式。這"
"讓您可以輕鬆與*銷售*及*CRM*應用程式中的潛在客戶，或*採購*應用程式中的供應商溝"
"通。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:135
msgid ""
"To send a message, first navigate to a record. For example, to send a "
"message from a *CRM* opportunity, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Sales --> My Pipeline`, and click on the Kanban card of an opportunity to "
"open it. Then, at the top-right, above the chatter composer, click "
":guilabel:`Send message`."
msgstr ""
"要傳送訊息，請先前往一筆記錄。例如，要從 *CRM* 商機傳送訊息，請前往 "
":menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 銷售 --> 我的銷售渠道`，然後按一下商機的看板"
"卡片將其開啟。接著，在右上角通訊欄撰寫器上方按一下 :guilabel:`傳送訊息`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:141
msgid ""
"Press :command:`Ctrl + Enter` to send a message, instead of using the "
":guilabel:`Send` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:143
msgid ""
"If any :ref:`followers <discuss/add-followers>` have been added to the "
"record, they are added as recipients of the message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:147
msgid ""
":ref:`Followers <discuss/add-followers>` of a record are added as recipients"
" of a message automatically. If a follower should **not** receive a message,"
" they must be removed as a follower before the message is sent, or a note is"
" logged."
msgstr ""
":ref:`追蹤者 <discuss/add-followers>` 會自動加為記錄訊息的收件人。若某位追蹤"
"者 **不應** 接收訊息，必須在發送訊息或記錄備註前，將其從追蹤者中移除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:151
msgid ""
"A chatter composer preparing to send a message to the followers of a CRM opportunity and\n"
"the customer listed on the opportunity record."
msgstr ""
"準備向 CRM 商機關注者及\n"
"商機記錄中所列客戶發送訊息的溝通欄撰寫器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:156
msgid "Expand full composer"
msgstr "展開完整編輯器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:158
msgid ""
"The chatter composer can be expanded to a larger pop-up window, allowing for"
" additional customizations."
msgstr "訊息欄的撰寫視窗可展開為較大的彈出式視窗，以便進行更多自訂設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:161
msgid ""
"To open the full composer, click the :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`(expand)` "
"icon in the bottom-right corner of the composer window."
msgstr ""
"若要開啟完整編寫器，請點擊編寫器視窗右下角的 :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`（"
"展開）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:164
msgid "A chatter composer with emphasis on the expand icon."
msgstr "突顯展開圖示的對話編寫器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:167
msgid "The expand icon in a chatter composer."
msgstr "對話紀錄撰寫器中的展開圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:169
msgid ""
"Doing this opens a :guilabel:`Compose Email` pop-up window. Confirm or edit "
"the intended :guilabel:`Recipients` of the message, or add additional "
"recipients. The :guilabel:`Subject` field auto-populates based on the title "
"of the record, though it can be edited, if desired."
msgstr ""
"這樣做會開啟:guilabel:`撰寫電郵`彈出視窗。請確認或編輯訊息的目標:guilabel:`收"
"件人`，或新增其他收件人。:guilabel:`主旨`欄位會根據記錄的標題自動填入，但如有"
"需要亦可進行編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:173
msgid ""
"To use an :doc:`email template <../../general/companies/email_template/>` "
"for the message, click the |ve| icon, then select a template from the list. "
"Existing templates can also be overwritten or deleted from this menu."
msgstr ""
"如要為訊息使用 :doc:`電子郵件範本 <../../general/companies/email_template/>"
"`，請點擊 |ve| 圖示，然後從清單中選擇範本。您亦可在這個選單中覆寫或刪除現有範"
"本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:178
msgid ""
"The number and type of templates available vary, based on the record the "
"message is created from."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:180
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`(paperclip)` icon to add any files to "
"the message, then click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`（迴紋針）` 圖示以將任何檔案加入訊息，然"
"後點擊 :guilabel:`傳送`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:183
msgid "The expanded full chatter composer in the CRM application."
msgstr "CRM 應用程式中展開的完整通訊欄訊息編輯器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:187
msgid "Generate text with AI"
msgstr "使用 AI 生成文字"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:189
msgid ""
"To generate message text using AI, click the AI icon from the expanded "
"chatter composer. This opens a :guilabel:`Generate Text with AI` pop-up."
msgstr ""
"要使用 AI 生成訊息文字，請在展開的 Chatter 訊息撰寫器中點擊 AI 圖示。這會開"
"啟 :guilabel:`使用 AI 生成文字` 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:192
msgid ""
"Enter a prompt in the :guilabel:`Send a message` field to instruct the AI on"
" the type of content needed, then press enter, or click the :icon:`fa-paper-"
"plane` :guilabel:`(paper plane)` icon."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`傳送訊息` 欄位中輸入提示，指示 AI 所需的內容類型，然後按 Enter "
"鍵，或點擊 :icon:`fa-paper-plane` :guilabel:`（紙飛機）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:195
msgid "The generate text with AI popup."
msgstr "「使用 AI 生成文字」彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:198
msgid ""
"After the text is generated, click :guilabel:`Insert` to insert the text "
"into the message composer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:201
msgid ""
"Before sending the final message, be sure to edit any commentary from the "
"AI, or any text in brackets."
msgstr "傳送最終訊息前，請務必編輯 AI 產生的任何註釋，或括號內的任何文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:204
msgid "A draft of an email with text generated by AI."
msgstr "包含由 AI 生成文字的電郵草稿。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:208
msgid "Edit sent messages"
msgstr "編輯已傳送的訊息"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:210
msgid ""
"Messages can be edited after they are sent, to fix typos, correct mistakes, "
"or add missing information."
msgstr "訊息發送後仍可編輯，以修正錯字、更正錯誤或補充遺漏的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:214
msgid ""
"When messages are edited after they have been sent, an updated message is "
"**not** sent to the recipient."
msgstr "如果在發送訊息後進行編輯，系統 **不會** 向收件人發送更新後的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:217
msgid ""
"To edit a sent message, click the |ve| menu to the right of the message. "
"Then, select :guilabel:`Edit`. Make any necessary adjustments to the "
"message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:220
msgid "The edit message option in a chatter thread."
msgstr "通訊欄對話串中的編輯訊息選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:223
msgid ""
"To save the changes, press :command:`Ctrl + Enter`. To discard the changes, "
"press :command:`Escape`."
msgstr ""
"要儲存變更，請按 :command:`Ctrl + Enter`。要捨棄變更，請按 "
":command:`Escape`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:226
msgid ""
"Users with Admin-level access rights can edit any sent messages. Users "
"without Admin rights can **only** edit messages they created."
msgstr ""
"擁有管理員級別存取權限的用戶，可編輯任何已發送的訊息。沒有管理員權限的用戶， "
"**只可** 編輯自己建立的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:232
msgid "Search messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:234
msgid ""
"Chatter threads can become long after a while, because of all the "
"information they contain. To make it easier to find a specific entry, users "
"can search the text of messages and notes for specific keywords."
msgstr ""
"一段時間後，通訊欄的討論串可能會因包含大量資訊而變得很長。為方便尋找特定紀錄"
"，用戶可在訊息及備註的文字中搜尋特定關鍵字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:238
msgid ""
"First, select a record with a chatter thread. For example, to search a *CRM*"
" opportunity, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --> My "
"Pipeline`, and click on the Kanban card of an opportunity to open it. Then, "
"at the top-right, above the chatter composer, click the :icon:`oi-search` "
":guilabel:`(search)` icon to open the search bar."
msgstr ""
"首先，選擇一個包含對話串的記錄。例如，若要搜尋 *CRM* 商機，請前"
"往:menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 銷售 --> 我的銷售管道`，然後點擊其中一張商"
"機看板卡片以將其開啟。接著，在右上角、對話輸入框上方，點擊:icon:`oi-search` "
":guilabel:`(搜尋)`圖示以開啟搜尋列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:243
msgid ""
"Enter a keyword or phrase into the search bar, then hit :command:`Enter`, or"
" click the :icon:`oi-search` :guilabel:`(search)` icon to the right of the "
"search bar. Any messages or notes containing the keyword or phrase entered "
"are listed below the search bar, with the keyword highlighted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:248
msgid ""
"To be taken directly to a particular message in the chatter thread, hover "
"over the upper-right corner of the result to reveal a :guilabel:`Jump` "
"button. Click this button to be directed to that message's location in the "
"thread."
msgstr ""
"如要直接前往對話串中的特定訊息，請將滑鼠游標移至搜尋結果的右上角，即可顯示 "
":guilabel:`跳轉` 按鈕。點擊此按鈕即可跳至該訊息在對話串中的位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:252
msgid ""
"Search results in a chatter thread emphasising the search icon and the jump "
"button."
msgstr "通訊記錄討論串中的搜尋結果，重點標示搜尋圖示及跳轉按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:255
msgid ""
"Search results in a chatter thread. Hover over the upper-right corner of a "
"result to see the **Jump** option. Click it to be taken directly to that "
"message in the chatter thread."
msgstr ""
"在通訊欄對話串中搜尋結果。將滑鼠游標移至結果的右上角，即可看到 **跳至** 選項"
"；按一下即可直接前往通訊欄對話串中的該則訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:261
msgid "Schedule activities"
msgstr "安排活動"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:263
msgid ""
"*Activities* are follow-up tasks tied to a record in an Odoo database. "
"Activities can be scheduled on any database page that contains a chatter "
"thread, Kanban view, list view, or activities view of an application."
msgstr ""
"*活動* 是與 Odoo 資料庫中某項記錄相關聯的跟進任務。你可以在任何包含通訊欄討論"
"串、看板檢視、清單檢視或應用程式活動檢視的資料庫頁面中安排活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:267
msgid ""
"To schedule an activity through a chatter thread, click the "
":guilabel:`Activities` button, located at the top of the chatter on any "
"record. On the :guilabel:`Schedule Activity` pop-up window that appears, "
"select an :guilabel:`Activity Type` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:272
msgid ""
"Individual applications have a list of *Activity Types* dedicated to that "
"application. For example, to view and edit the activities available for the "
"*CRM* application, go to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> "
"Activity Types`."
msgstr ""
"每個應用程式都有專屬的 *活動類型* 清單。例如，如要檢視及編輯 *CRM* 應用程式可"
"用的活動，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 配置 --> 活動類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:276
msgid ""
"Enter a title for the activity in the :guilabel:`Summary` field, located in "
"the :guilabel:`Schedule Activity` pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:279
msgid ""
"Select a name from the :guilabel:`Assigned to` drop-down menu to assign the "
"activity to a different user. Otherwise, the user creating the activity is "
"automatically assigned."
msgstr ""
"從 :guilabel:`指派給` 下拉式選單中選擇名稱，即可將活動指派給其他使用者。否則"
"，系統會自動指派給建立該活動的使用者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:282
msgid ""
"Add any additional information in the optional :guilabel:`Log a note...` "
"field."
msgstr "在可選填的 :guilabel:`記錄備註...` 欄位中加入任何額外資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:285
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Due Date` field on the :guilabel:`Schedule Activity` pop-up "
"window auto-populates based on the configuration settings for the selected "
":guilabel:`Activity Type`. However, this date can be changed by selecting a "
"day on the calendar in the :guilabel:`Due Date` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:289
msgid "Lastly, click one of the following buttons:"
msgstr "最後，點擊以下其中一個按鈕："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:291
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Schedule`: adds the activity to the chatter under "
":guilabel:`Planned activities`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`安排`：將活動加至溝通紀錄的 :guilabel:`已計劃活動` 下。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:292
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Schedule & Mark as Done`: adds the details of the activity to the"
" chatter under :guilabel:`Today`. The activity is added to "
":guilabel:`Today`, and is automatically marked as done."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`安排並標記為完成`：將活動詳細資料新增至通訊欄的 :guilabel:`今天` "
"底下。該活動會新增至 :guilabel:`今天`，並自動標記為已完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:295
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Done \\& Schedule Next`: adds the task under :guilabel:`Today` "
"marked as done, and opens a new activity window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:297
msgid ":guilabel:`Cancel`: discards any changes made on the pop-up window."
msgstr ":guilabel:`取消`：放棄在彈出視窗中所作的任何更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:299
msgid ""
"Scheduled activities are added to the chatter for the record under "
":guilabel:`Planned activities`, and are color-coded based on their due date."
msgstr ""
"已排程的活動會加至該記錄通訊欄中的 :guilabel:`已規劃活動` 下方，並會根據到期"
"日以不同顏色標示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:302
msgid "**Red** icons indicate an overdue activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:303
msgid ""
"**Yellow** icons indicate an activity with a due date scheduled for the "
"current date."
msgstr "**黃色** 圖示表示到期日安排在當天的活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:304
msgid ""
"**Green** icons indicate an activity with a due date scheduled in the "
"future."
msgstr "**綠色**圖示表示活動的到期日設於未來。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:306
msgid "A chatter thread with planned activities with varying due dates."
msgstr "包含不同到期日已規劃活動的交流區對話串。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:310
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`(info)` icon next to a planned "
"activity to see additional details."
msgstr ""
"點擊已計劃活動旁邊的 :icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`(資訊)` 圖示，即可查看"
"其他詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:313
msgid "A detailed view of a planned activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:316
msgid ""
"After completing an activity, click :guilabel:`Mark Done` under the activity"
" entry in the chatter. This opens a :guilabel:`Mark Done` pop-up window, "
"where additional notes about the activity can be entered. After adding any "
"comments to the pop-up window, click: :guilabel:`Done \\& Schedule Next`, "
":guilabel:`Done`, or :guilabel:`Discard`."
msgstr ""
"完成活動後，請按一下通訊欄中該活動項目下方的 :guilabel:`標記為完成`。這會開"
"啟 :guilabel:`標記為完成` 彈出式視窗，你可以在其中輸入有關該活動的額外備註。"
"在彈出式視窗中加入任何備註後，請按一下：:guilabel:`完成並安排下一"
"個`、:guilabel:`完成` 或 :guilabel:`放棄`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:321
msgid ""
"After the activity is marked complete, an entry with the activity type, "
"title, and any other details that were included in the pop-up window are "
"listed in the chatter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:324
msgid ""
"A chatter thread with a completed activity, included additional details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:330
msgid "Attach files"
msgstr "附加檔案"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:332
msgid ""
"Files can be added as attachments in the chatter, either to send with "
"messages, or to include with a record."
msgstr "檔案可作為附件加入溝通欄，以隨訊息傳送，或附於記錄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:336
msgid ""
"After a file has been added to a chatter thread, it can be downloaded by any"
" user with access to the thread. Click the |paperclip| to make the files "
"header visible, if necessary. Then, click the :icon:`fa-download` "
":guilabel:`(download)` icon the file to download it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:340
msgid ""
"To attach a file, click the |paperclip| located at the top of the chatter "
"composer of any record that contains a chatter thread."
msgstr ""
"若要附加檔案，請在任何設有通訊欄訊息串的記錄中，按一下通訊欄編寫器頂部的 "
"|paperclip|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:343
msgid ""
"This opens a file explorer pop-up window. Navigate to the desired file, "
"select it, then click :guilabel:`Open` to add it to the record. "
"Alternatively, files can be dragged and dropped directly onto a chatter "
"thread."
msgstr ""
"此操作會開啟檔案總管彈出視窗。瀏覽至所需檔案並選取，然後點擊 :guilabel:`開"
"啟`，即可將檔案新增至記錄。你亦可直接將檔案拖放至通訊欄對話串。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:347
msgid ""
"After files have been added, they are listed in the chatter thread, under a "
":guilabel:`Files` heading."
msgstr "新增檔案後，系統會在通訊欄對話串的 :guilabel:`檔案` 標題下列出這些檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:351
msgid ""
"After at least one file has been added to a chatter record, a new button "
"labeled :guilabel:`Attach files` appears below the :guilabel:`Files` "
"heading. To attach any additional files, this is the button that **must** be"
" used, instead of the |paperclip| at the top of the chatter thread."
msgstr ""
"在討論區記錄加入至少一個檔案後，系統會顯示標示為 :guilabel:`附加檔案` 的新按"
"鈕，位於 :guilabel:`檔案` 標題下方。如要附加任何其他檔案，**必須** 使用此按鈕"
"，而非討論區頂部的 |paperclip|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:356
msgid ""
"After the :guilabel:`Files` section heading appears in the thread, clicking "
"the |paperclip| no longer opens a file explorer pop-up window. Instead, "
"clicking the |paperclip| toggles the :guilabel:`Files` section from visible "
"to invisible in the chatter thread."
msgstr ""
"當對話串中出現 :guilabel:`檔案` 區塊標題後，點擊 |paperclip| 將不再開啟檔案總"
"管彈出視窗。相反，點擊 |paperclip| 會在通訊對話串中將 :guilabel:`檔案` 區塊從"
"顯示切換為隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/chatter.rst:360
msgid ""
"A chatter thread with a file attached and the Attach files button added."
msgstr "已附加檔案並新增「附加檔案」按鈕的溝通欄對話串。"

