#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:3
msgid "Configure ICE servers with Twilio"
msgstr "使用 Twilio 設定 ICE 伺服器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo Discuss uses WebRTC API and peer-to-peer connections for voice and "
"video calls. If one of the call attendees is behind a symmetric NAT, you "
"need to configure an ICE server to establish a connection to the call "
"attendee. To set up an ICE server, first, create a Twilio account for video "
"calls, and then, connect that Twilio account to Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 討論使用 WebRTC API 及點對點連線進行語音和視像通話。如果其中一位通話參與"
"者位於對稱 NAT 後方，你需要設定 ICE 伺服器才能與該參與者建立連線。要設定 ICE "
"伺服器，請先為視像通話建立 Twilio 帳戶，然後將該 Twilio 帳戶連接至 Odoo。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:11
msgid "Create a Twilio account"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:13
msgid ""
"First, go to `Twilio <https://www.twilio.com>`_ and click :guilabel:`Sign "
"up` to create a new Twilio account. Next, enter your name and email address,"
" create a password, and accept Twilio's terms of service. Then, click "
":guilabel:`Start your free trial`. Verify your email address with Twilio, as"
" per their instructions."
msgstr ""
"首先，前往 `Twilio <https://www.twilio.com>`_ 並按一下 :guilabel:`註冊` 以建"
"立新的 Twilio 帳戶。接著輸入您的姓名及電郵地址、設定密碼，並接受 Twilio 的服"
"務條款。然後按一下 :guilabel:`開始免費試用`。請按照 Twilio 的指示驗證您的電郵"
"地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:18
msgid ""
"Next, enter your phone number into Twilio. Then, Twilio will send you an SMS"
" text message containing a verification code. Enter the verification code "
"into Twilio to verify your phone number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:22
msgid ""
"After that, Twilio redirects to a welcome page. Use the following list to "
"answer Twilio's questions:"
msgstr "之後，Twilio 會重新導向至歡迎頁面。請參考以下清單回答 Twilio 的問題："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:25
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Which Twilio product are you here to use?`, select "
":guilabel:`Video`."
msgstr "對於 :guilabel:`您準備使用哪款 Twilio 產品？`，請選擇 :guilabel:`視像`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:26
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`What do you plan to build with Twilio?`, select "
":guilabel:`Other`."
msgstr "對於 :guilabel:`您計劃使用 Twilio 建立什麼？`，請選擇 :guilabel:`其他`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:27
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`How do you want to build with Twilio?`, select "
":guilabel:`With no code at all`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`您想如何透過 Twilio 進行建置？` 一項，選擇 :guilabel:`完全不使"
"用程式碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:28
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`What is your goal today?`, select :guilabel:`3rd party "
"integrations`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:30
msgid "The Twilio welcome page."
msgstr "Twilio 歡迎頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:34
msgid ""
"If necessary, change the billing country. Finally, click :guilabel:`Get "
"Started with Twilio`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:37
msgid "Locate the Twilio Account SID and Auth Token"
msgstr "尋找 Twilio Account SID 及 Auth Token"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:39
msgid ""
"To locate the Account SID and Auth Token, go to the Twilio account "
"dashboard. Then, click :guilabel:`Develop` on the sidebar. In the "
":guilabel:`Account Info` section, locate the :guilabel:`Account SID` and the"
" :guilabel:`Auth Token`. Both of these are needed to connect Twilio to Odoo."
msgstr ""
"要尋找 Account SID 及 Auth Token，請前往 Twilio 帳戶儀表板，然後點擊側邊欄的 "
":guilabel:`開發`。在 :guilabel:`帳戶資料` 部分中，找出 :guilabel:`Account "
"SID` 及 :guilabel:`Auth Token`。連接 Twilio 至 Odoo 時需要使用這兩項資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:44
msgid ""
"The Twilio Account SID and Auth Token can be found uner the Account Info "
"section."
msgstr "Twilio 帳戶 SID 及驗證權杖可在帳戶資料部分找到。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:49
msgid "Connect Twilio to Odoo"
msgstr "將 Twilio 連接至 Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:51
msgid ""
"Open the Odoo database and go to :menuselection:`Settings --> General "
"Settings --> Discuss`. Check the box next to :guilabel:`Use Twilio ICE "
"servers` and enter the Twilio account's :guilabel:`Account SID` and "
":guilabel:`Auth Token`. Finally, click :guilabel:`Save` to apply these "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"開啟 Odoo 資料庫，前往 :menuselection:`設定 --> 一般設定 --> 討論`。勾選 "
":guilabel:`使用 Twilio ICE 伺服器` 旁的方格，並輸入 Twilio 帳戶的 "
":guilabel:`帳戶 SID` 及 :guilabel:`驗證權杖`。最後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存` 以"
"套用這些變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:56
msgid "Enable the \"Use Twilio ICE servers\" option in Odoo General Settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:61
msgid "Define a list of custom ICE servers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:63
msgid ""
"This step is not required for the Twilio configuration. However, if Twilio "
"is not configured or is not working at any given moment, Odoo will fall back"
" on the custom ICE servers list. The user must define the list of custom ICE"
" servers."
msgstr ""
"設定 Twilio 時並不需要此步驟。然而，若未設定 Twilio 或 Twilio 在任何時刻無法"
"運作，Odoo 將改用自訂 ICE 伺服器清單。用戶必須定義自訂 ICE 伺服器清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:67
msgid ""
"In :menuselection:`Settings --> General Settings --> Discuss`, click the "
":guilabel:`ICE Servers` button under :guilabel:`Custom ICE server list`."
msgstr ""
"在 :menuselection:`設定 --> 一般設定 --> 討論` 中，點擊 :guilabel:`ICE 伺服"
"器` 按鈕（位於 :guilabel:`自訂 ICE 伺服器清單` 下方）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:70
msgid "The \"ICE Servers\" button in Odoo General Settings."
msgstr "Odoo 一般設定中的「ICE 伺服器」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:74
msgid ""
"Odoo will redirect to the :guilabel:`ICE servers` page. Here you can define "
"your own list of ICE servers."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 將重新導向至 :guilabel:`ICE 伺服器` 頁面。你可以在此定義自己的 ICE 伺服"
"器清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:77
msgid "The \"ICE servers\" page in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo 中的「ICE 伺服器」頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/ice_servers.rst:82
msgid ""
"For on-premise instances of Odoo, the package `python3-gevent` is necessary "
"for the Discuss module to run calls/video calls on Ubuntu (Linux) servers."
msgstr ""
"對於本地部署的 Odoo 實例，Ubuntu（Linux）伺服器必須安裝 `python3-gevent` 套件"
"，討論模組才可進行語音通話／視像通話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:3
msgid "Use channels for team communication"
msgstr "使用頻道進行團隊溝通"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:5
msgid ""
"Use channels in the Odoo **Discuss** app to organize discussions between "
"individual teams, departments, projects, or any other group that requires "
"regular communication. With channels, employees can communicate inside "
"dedicated spaces within the Odoo database around specific topics, updates, "
"and latest developments having to do with the organization."
msgstr ""
"使用 Odoo **討論** 應用程式中的頻道，組織個別團隊、部門、專案或任何其他需要定"
"期溝通的群組之間的討論。透過頻道，員工可在 Odoo 資料庫內的專用空間，圍繞特定"
"主題、更新及組織的最新動態進行溝通。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:11
msgid "Create a new channel"
msgstr "建立新頻道"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:13
msgid ""
"To create a new channel, navigate to the :menuselection:`Discuss` app, and "
"then click on the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon next to the "
":guilabel:`Channels` heading in the left-side menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:17
msgid "View of discuss's sidebar and a channel being created in Odoo Discuss."
msgstr "Odoo 討論的側邊欄及正在建立頻道的畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:20
msgid ""
"The channel's :guilabel:`Group Name`, :guilabel:`Description`, and "
":guilabel:`Privacy` settings can be modified by clicking on the channel's "
"settings, represented by a :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon in the "
"left sidebar menu, next to the channel's name."
msgstr ""
"如要修改頻道的 :guilabel:`群組名稱`、:guilabel:`描述` 及 :guilabel:`私隱` 設"
"定，請在左側邊欄選單中頻道名稱旁邊，點擊代表頻道設定的 :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:25
msgid "Privacy tab"
msgstr "私隱分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:27
msgid ""
"To control which users can join a channel, open the channel's setting page "
"and navigate to the :guilabel:`Privacy` tab."
msgstr ""
"要控制哪些用戶可以加入頻道，請開啟頻道的設定頁面，並前往 :guilabel:`私隱` 分"
"頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:30
msgid "View of a channel's settings form in Odoo Discuss."
msgstr "Odoo 討論中頻道設定表單的檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:33
msgid ""
"To limit access of the channel to a specific group, select an option from "
"the :guilabel:`Authorized Group` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"如要將頻道存取權限限制為特定群組，請從 :guilabel:`授權群組` 下拉式選單中選擇"
"一個選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:36
msgid ""
"To automatically add members of a group as followers of the channel, click "
"the :guilabel:`Auto Subscribe Groups` field, and select one or more groups "
"from the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:40
msgid ""
"Users who are automatically added as followers can manually edit their "
"subscription to the channel, if necessary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:43
msgid ""
"The option to :guilabel:`Auto Subscribe Groups` automatically adds users of "
"that particular user group as followers. In other words, while "
":guilabel:`Authorized Groups` limits which users can access the channel, "
":guilabel:`Auto Subscribe Groups` automatically adds users as members as "
"long as they are part of a specific user group. The same is true for "
":guilabel:`Auto Subscribe Departments`."
msgstr ""
"啟用:guilabel:`自動訂閱群組`選項會自動將該特定用戶群組的用戶新增為追蹤者。換"
"句話說，:guilabel:`已授權群組`會限制哪些用戶可存取頻道，而:guilabel:`自動訂閱"
"群組`則會將屬於特定用戶群組的用戶自動新增為成員。:guilabel:`自動訂閱部門`亦遵"
"循相同邏輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:49
msgid "Invite members to a channel"
msgstr "邀請成員加入頻道"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:51
msgid ""
"To invite members to a channel, click on the :guilabel:`Members` tab. Click "
":guilabel:`Add a line`, then select either a :guilabel:`Partner` or "
":guilabel:`Guest` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:54
msgid ""
"Inviting members can also be done from the **Discuss** app's main dashboard,"
" by selecting the channel, clicking the :icon:`fa-user-plus` :guilabel:`(add"
" user)` icon in the top-right corner of the dashboard, and finally clicking "
":guilabel:`Invite to Channel` once all the users have been added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:59
msgid "View of Discuss' option to invite members in Odoo Discuss."
msgstr "Odoo 討論中邀請成員選項的檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:63
msgid "Quick search bar"
msgstr "快速搜尋列"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:65
msgid ""
"Once at least 20 channels, direct messages, or live chat conversations are "
"pinned in the sidebar, a :guilabel:`Quick search…` bar is displayed. This "
"feature is a convenient way to filter conversations and find relevant "
"communications."
msgstr ""
"當側邊欄置頂了至少 20 個頻道、直接訊息或即時聊天對話後，系統會顯"
"示:guilabel:`快速搜尋…`列。此功能方便你篩選對話，快速找出相關通訊內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:69
msgid ""
"View of the Discuss' sidebar emphasizing the quick search bar in Odoo "
"Discuss."
msgstr "Odoo 討論側邊欄檢視，重點顯示快速搜尋欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:73
msgid "Finding channels"
msgstr "尋找頻道"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:75
msgid ""
"To view all available channels, click on the :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(gear)` icon to the right of the :guilabel:`CHANNELS` menu. Users"
" can join or leave channels on this screen by clicking the :guilabel:`Join` "
"or :guilabel:`Leave` buttons that appear in the channel boxes."
msgstr ""
"要檢視所有可用頻道，請點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示，該圖示位"
"於 :guilabel:`頻道` 選單右側。用戶可在此畫面點擊頻道方塊中出現的 "
":guilabel:`加入` 或 :guilabel:`離開` 按鈕，以加入或離開頻道。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:79
msgid ""
"There is also the ability to apply filtering criteria and save them for "
"later use. The :guilabel:`Search...` function accepts wildcards by using the"
" underscore character [ `_` ], and specific searches can be saved by using "
"the :menuselection:`Favorites --> Save Current Search` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"系統亦支援套用篩選條件並將其儲存，以便日後使用。:guilabel:`搜尋...` 功能支援"
"使用底線字元 [ `_` ] 作為萬用字元，而特定搜尋則可透過 :menuselection:`收"
"藏 --> 儲存目前搜尋` 下拉式選單儲存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:85
msgid "Linking channel in chatter"
msgstr "在通訊欄連結頻道"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:87
msgid ""
"Channels can be linked in the *chatter* of a record to share relvant "
"discussions. To do so, type: `#` and the channel name. Click or press enter "
"on the *Channel* name. Upon logging the note a link to the channel appears. "
"After clicking on the link a chat window with the channel conversation pops "
"up in the lower right corner of the screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:92
msgid ""
"Users are able to contribute to this group channel by typing messages in "
"window and pressing *enter*."
msgstr "用戶可透過在視窗中輸入訊息並按 *enter* 鍵，在此群組頻道中發言。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication.rst:95
msgid "Channel linked in chatter."
msgstr "已在通訊欄連結頻道。"

