#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:36
msgid ":doc:`Sign documentation <sign>`"
msgstr ":doc:`簽署說明文件 <sign>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:44
msgid "Deletion delay"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:46
msgid ""
"By default, items moved to the trash remain there for 30 days before being "
"permanently deleted. To adjust this delay, go to :menuselection:`Documents "
"--> Configuration --> Settings` and edit the :guilabel:`Deletion delay "
"(days)` field."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，移至垃圾桶的項目會在永久刪除前保留 30 天。如要調整此延遲時間，請"
"前往 :menuselection:`文件 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並編輯 :guilabel:`刪除延遲（天"
"）` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:53
msgid "File centralization"
msgstr "檔案集中管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:55
msgid ""
"File centralization allows for automatically organizing all files associated"
" with a specific app into dedicated folders. It is enabled by default for "
"each app upon installation. To disable file centralization, modify the "
"default folder, or configure the tags to be added to the app-specific files,"
" go to :menuselection:`Documents --> Configuration --> Settings`, and edit "
"the relevant setting under the :guilabel:`File Centralization` section."
msgstr ""
"檔案集中管理功能可自動將與特定應用程式相關的所有檔案整理至專屬資料夾。每個應"
"用程式在安裝時均會預設啟用此功能。如要停用檔案集中管理、修改預設資料夾，或設"
"定要新增至應用程式專屬檔案的標籤，請前往 :menuselection:`文件 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定` ，並在 :guilabel:`檔案集中管理` 部分編輯相關設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:62
msgid ""
"File centralization cannot be disabled for :guilabel:`Accounting` documents."
" A sub-folder is automatically created for each journal type (e.g., Sales, "
"Purchase, Bank, etc.), and the journal name is added as a tag on each "
"document. Click :guilabel:`Journals` to edit the list of journals to "
"synchronize and define their corresponding folders and tags."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:66
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Human Resources` files, a sub-folder is automatically created"
" for each employee, and specific tags are added to the files based on the "
"document type (e.g., :guilabel:`Contracts`, :guilabel:`Payslips`, etc.). You"
" can also create additional :guilabel:`Employee Subfolders` automatically by"
" entering the desired folder names, separated by commas."
msgstr ""
"對於 :guilabel:`人力資源` 檔案，系統會自動為每位員工建立一個子資料夾，並根據"
"文件類型為檔案新增特定標籤（例如 :guilabel:`合約`、:guilabel:`糧單` 等）。您"
"亦可輸入所需的資料夾名稱（以逗號分隔），自動建立額外的 :guilabel:`員工子資料"
"夾`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:73
msgid ""
"Changing the folder or tags only affects new files; existing files remain "
"unchanged."
msgstr "更改資料夾或標籤只會影響新檔案；現有檔案會維持不變。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:74
msgid ""
"When file centralization is enabled for an app, deleting a record in that "
"app moves its attachments to the trash in the Documents app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:80
msgid "Folders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:82
msgid ""
"You can organize files in folders available in the :icon:`fa-building` "
":guilabel:`Company` or :icon:`fa-hdd-o` :guilabel:`My Drive` sections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:85
msgid ""
"To create a folder, select the desired section in the tree, click "
":guilabel:`New`, and select :guilabel:`Folder`. In the pop-up, enter the "
"folder's :guilabel:`Name` and click :guilabel:`Save`. To create a sub-"
"folder, select the parent folder first, then follow the same steps."
msgstr ""
"如要建立資料夾，請在樹狀結構中選取所需的區段，點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，然後選"
"擇 :guilabel:`資料夾`。在彈出視窗中，輸入資料夾的 :guilabel:`名稱`，再點擊 "
":guilabel:`儲存`。如要建立子資料夾，請先選取上層資料夾，然後按照相同步驟操作"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:90
msgid ""
"Some folders and sub-folders are created automatically based on the "
":ref:`file centralization settings <documents/file-centralization>`."
msgstr ""
"部分資料夾及子資料夾會根據 :ref:`檔案集中管理設定 <documents/file-"
"centralization>` 自動建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:93
msgid ""
"To manage a folder or sub-folder, select it and click the :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`Actions`) icon above the tree. The following options are "
"available in the menu:"
msgstr ""
"要管理資料夾或子資料夾，請選擇該資料夾，然後點擊樹狀檢視上方的 :icon:`fa-"
