#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:96
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Download`: Download the folder as a .zip "
"file, including its files and sub-folders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:98
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Rename`: Modify the folder's name."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`重新命名`：修改資料夾名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:99
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-share-alt` :guilabel:`Share`: :ref:`Share the folder and manage "
"its access rights <documents/access-rights>`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-share-alt` :guilabel:`分享`：:ref:`分享資料夾並管理其存取權限 "
"<documents/access-rights>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:101
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`Add star`: Mark a folder as a favorite for "
"quicker access. This setting is user-specific and does not affect other "
"users' workspaces. You can then use the :ref:`Starred filter "
"<search/favorites>` to navigate to your favorite folders quickly."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`加星號`：將資料夾標記為最愛，以便快速存取。此設"
"定僅適用於個別用戶，不會影響其他用戶的工作區。之後，你可以使用 :ref:`已加星號"
"篩選條件 <search/favorites>` 快速瀏覽你最愛的資料夾。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:104
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`Info & Tags`: View the folder's "
":ref:`details <documents/details-panel>` and chatter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:106
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Move to trash`: Move the folder and its content "
"to the :ref:`trash <documents/deletion-delay>`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`移至垃圾桶`：將資料夾及其內容移至 :ref:`垃圾桶 "
"<documents/deletion-delay>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:108
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions on Select`: Define the server actions that"
" are available (as buttons) for the files in the folder. Click an action to "
"add or remove it. Click :guilabel:`Add Custom Action` to :ref:`create a new "
"one <reference/actions/server>`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`選取時動作`：定義資料夾內檔案可用的伺服器動作（以按"
"鈕形式顯示）。點選動作即可加入或移除。點擊 :guilabel:`新增自訂動作` 以 "
":ref:`建立新動作 <reference/actions/server>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:111
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Automations`: Create :doc:`automation rules "
"</applications/studio/automated_actions>`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`自動化`：建立 :doc:`自動化規則 </applications/"
"studio/automated_actions>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:115
msgid ""
"Setting up automation rules requires activating :doc:`/applications/studio`,"
" which may impact your `pricing plan <https://www.odoo.com/pricing>`_."
msgstr ""
"設定自動化規則需要啟用 :doc:`/applications/studio`，這可能會影響您的 `定價方"
"案 <https://www.odoo.com/pricing>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`AI Auto-sort`: Use Odoo AI to automatically organize the files in"
