msgid "The details panel allows the following:"
msgstr "詳細資料面板允許執行以下操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:289
msgid "Change the file's folder or the folder's name."
msgstr "更改檔案所屬的資料夾，或更改資料夾名稱。"

