msgid ""
"To view a file from their user profile, a user must be set as the contact "
"and have at least :guilabel:`Viewer` :ref:`access <documents/access-"
"rights>`."
msgstr ""
"如要從用戶個人檔案檢視檔案，用戶必須設為聯絡人，並至少擁有 :guilabel:`檢視"
"者` :ref:`存取權限 <documents/access-rights>`。"

