"Enter the :guilabel:`Tag Name`, select a :guilabel:`Color`, and optionally "
"add a :guilabel:`Tooltip` that appears when hovering over the tag."
msgstr ""
"標籤有助整理及分類檔案，方便搜尋和篩選。要為檔案設定標籤，請前往 "
