"增圖示`，以產生隨機表情符號。按一下該表情符號即可選擇另一個。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:164
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`(page)` icon next"
" to the article's name in the sidebar or the top bar and select the "
"preferred emoji."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:170
msgid "Views and links from other apps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:172
msgid "To insert a view or a view link into an article, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如要在文章中插入檢視畫面或檢視畫面連結，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:174
msgid "Go to the desired app and select the preferred view."
msgstr "前往所需的應用程式，並選擇偏好的檢視方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:175
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(cog)` icon, then select "
":menuselection:`Knowledge --> Insert view in article` or :guilabel:`Insert "
"link in article`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示，然後選擇 :menuselection:`知識"
"庫 --> 在文章中插入視圖` 或 :guilabel:`在文章中插入連結`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:177
msgid "Choose the article to insert the view or link to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:180
msgid "Once the view or link is inserted:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:182
msgid ""
"Users without access to the view cannot see it in Knowledge, even if they "
"can access the article."
msgstr ""
"沒有該檢視存取權限的使用者，即使能夠存取該文章，亦無法在「知識」中看到該檢視"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:184
msgid ""
"Clicking the inserted link opens a pop-up with the view's name next to the "
":icon:`fa-clipboard` (:guilabel:`Copy Link`), :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` "
"(:guilabel:`Edit Link`), and :icon:`fa-chain-broken` (:guilabel:`Remove "
"Link`) icons. Click the name inside the pop-up to open the linked view."
msgstr ""
"按一下已插入的連結會開啟一個彈出視窗，當中會顯示檢視名稱，其旁邊設有 "
":icon:`fa-clipboard`（:guilabel:`複製連結`）、:icon:`fa-pencil-square-"
"o`（:guilabel:`編輯連結`）及 :icon:`fa-chain-broken`（:guilabel:`移除連結`）"
"圖示。按一下彈出視窗內的名稱，即可開啟已連結的檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:188
msgid ""
"When multiple views are added to an article, the :icon:`oi-draggable` "
"(:guilabel:`drag handle`) icon may disappear, preventing the views from "
"being reordered. To restore it, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`More actions`) icon, then toggle the :icon:`oi-arrows-h` "
":guilabel:`Full Width` off."
msgstr ""
"將多個檢視加入文章時，:icon:`oi-draggable`（:guilabel:`拖曳控制點`）圖示可能"
"會消失，導致無法重新排列檢視。要恢復顯示，請點擊 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v`（:guilabel:`更多動作`）圖示，然後將 :icon:`oi-arrows-h` :guilabel:`全寬` "
"關閉。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:194
msgid "Article management"
msgstr "文章管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:196
msgid ""
"Knowledge allows for managing articles, which consists of :ref:`structuring "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/structure>`, :ref:`sharing "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/share>`, :ref:`removing "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/remove>`, and :ref:`retrieving "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/retrieve>` them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:202
msgid "Basic management"
msgstr "基本管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:204
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`More actions`) icon and select "
"one of the following actions for basic article management:"
msgstr ""
"按一下 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` （:guilabel:`更多操作`）圖示，並選擇以下其中一項"
"操作以進行基本文章管理："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Move To`: Select the article to move under a category or another "
"article, then click :guilabel:`Move Article`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`移至`：選取要移至某個類別或其他文章下方的文章，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`移動文章`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lock Content`: Lock the article to stop edits. Click "
":guilabel:`Unlock` to edit again."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`鎖定內容`：鎖定文章以停止編輯。按一下 :guilabel:`解鎖` 即可重新編"
"輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create a Copy`: Copy the article under the :guilabel:`Private` "
"section."
msgstr ":guilabel:`建立複本`：將文章複製至 :guilabel:`私人` 區域。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Open Version History`: Restore a previous version of the article."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:212
msgid ":guilabel:`Download PDF`: Open the browser's print function."
msgstr ":guilabel:`下載 PDF`：開啟瀏覽器的列印功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add to Templates`: Add the article to the list of templates."
msgstr ":guilabel:`新增至範本`：將文章新增至範本列表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:214
msgid ":guilabel:`Send to Trash`: Move the article to the trash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:217
msgid ""
"The following actions only apply to :ref:`nested articles "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/create-article>` and :ref:`article items "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/items>`:"
msgstr ""
"以下操作僅適用於 :ref:`巢狀文章 <knowledge/articles_editing/create-article>` "
"及 :ref:`文章項目 <knowledge/articles_editing/items>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:221
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Convert into Article Item`: Convert the nested article into an "
":ref:`article item <knowledge/articles_editing/items>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`轉換為文章項目`：將巢狀文章轉換為:ref:`文章項目 <knowledge/"
"articles_editing/items>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:223
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Convert into Article`: Convert the article item into a "
":ref:`nested article <knowledge/articles_editing/create-article>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`轉換為文章`：將文章項目轉換為 :ref:`巢狀文章 <knowledge/"
"articles_editing/create-article>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:227
msgid ""
"Move an article directly from the sidebar tree by dragging and dropping it "
"under another article or category."
msgstr "直接從側邊欄樹狀目錄將文章拖放至另一篇文章或類別下，即可移動文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:229
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-search` (:guilabel:`search`) icon in the top-left corner"
" or press `CTRL` / `CMD` + `K` to open the command palette, then type `?` to"
" search for visible articles or `$` for :ref:`hidden articles "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/visibility>`. Alternatively, hover over the "
":guilabel:`Workspace` category and click the :icon:`fa-eye` "
"(:guilabel:`eye`) icon to find hidden articles."
msgstr ""
"點擊左上角的 :icon:`fa-search`（:guilabel:`搜尋`）圖示，或按 `CTRL` / `CMD` "
"+ `K` 開啟指令面板，然後輸入 `?` 搜尋可見文章，或輸入 `$` 搜尋 :ref:`隱藏文"
"章 <knowledge/articles_editing/visibility>`。您亦可將滑鼠懸停在 :guilabel:`工"
"作區` 類別上，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-eye`（:guilabel:`眼睛`）圖示以尋找隱藏文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:238
msgid "Structuring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:241
msgid "Sidebar structure"
msgstr "側邊欄結構"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:243
msgid ""
"The sidebar structure follows a hierarchy with parent and nested articles "
"organized within the following categories:"
msgstr "側邊欄結構採用階層式設計，母文章與巢狀文章會按以下類別整理："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:246
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Favorites` category displays all articles marked as "
"favorites."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:247
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Workspace` category displays articles accessible to all "
"internal users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:248
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Shared` category displays articles shared with specific "
"users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:249
msgid "The :guilabel:`Private` category displays personal articles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:252
msgid ""
"To mark an article as a favorite and display the :guilabel:`Favorites` "
"category, click the :icon:`fa-star-o` (:guilabel:`star`) icon in the top-"
"right menu."
msgstr ""
"要將文章標記為最愛並顯示 :guilabel:`最愛` 類別，請點擊右上角選單中的 "
":icon:`fa-star-o`（:guilabel:`星號`）圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:256
msgid "Article structure"
msgstr "文章結構"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:258
msgid ""
"Nested articles inherit their parent's :ref:`access rights "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/rights>`, and :ref:`properties "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/properties>` are applied to a group of nested "
"articles under the same parent."
msgstr ""
"巢狀文章會繼承其上層文章的:ref:`存取權限 <knowledge/articles_editing/rights>"
"`，而:ref:`屬性 <knowledge/articles_editing/properties>`則會套用至同一上層文"
"章下的一組巢狀文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:265
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:267
msgid ""
"Sharing an article involves configuring :ref:`access rights "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/rights>`, inviting :ref:`users "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/invite>`, providing :ref:`online access "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/share-online>`, and determining its visibility "
"in the :ref:`sidebar tree <knowledge/articles_editing/structure>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:272
msgid ""
"Articles listed under a category in the sidebar tree are **visible**. "
"Articles that certain users must search for through the command palette due "
"to restricted access rights are **hidden**."
msgstr ""
"在側邊欄樹狀目錄中列於類別下的文章為 **可見** 狀態。部分使用者因存取權限受限"
"，而必須透過指令面板搜尋的文章則屬 **隱藏** 狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:276
msgid ""
"To copy a specific section of an article, hover over the header (`H1`, `H2`,"
" and `H3`), and click the :icon:`fa-link` (:guilabel:`link`) icon. Clicking "
"the shared link leads to the selected section of the article."
msgstr ""
"要複製文章的特定章節，請將滑鼠懸停在標題（`H1`、`H2` 及 `H3`）上，然後按一下 "
":icon:`fa-link`（:guilabel:`連結`）圖示。按一下分享的連結，即可前往該文章的所"
"選章節。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:283
msgid "Configure access rights"
msgstr "設定存取權限"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:285
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Share` in the top-right menu to configure access rights."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:288
msgid "General access"
msgstr "一般存取權限"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:297
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:319
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:299
msgid ":guilabel:`Can Edit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`可編輯`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:300
msgid "Allow all internal users to edit the article."
msgstr "允許所有內部用戶編輯文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:301
msgid ":guilabel:`Can Read`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`可讀取`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:302
msgid "Allow all internal users to read the article only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:303
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:323
msgid ":guilabel:`Members only`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:304
msgid ""
"Allow only members to access the article from the sidebar tree or by "
"searching for it in the command palette."
msgstr "僅允許成員透過側邊欄樹狀目錄或在指令面板中搜尋來存取該文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:310
msgid "Show in workspace"
msgstr "在工作區顯示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:321
msgid ":guilabel:`Everyone`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`所有人`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:322
msgid "The article is visible in the sidebar tree to all internal users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:324
msgid ""
"The article is only visible in the sidebar tree to :ref:`members "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/invite>`, while other users can find it using "
"the hidden article search by pressing `CTRL` / `CMD` + `K` and typing `$`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:329
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Default Access Rights` apply to all internal users except "
"invited users; specific access rights override default access rights."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:331
msgid ""
"Selecting `Can edit` or `Can read` in the :guilabel:`Default Access Rights` "
"moves the article to the :guilabel:`Workspace` category while selecting `No "
"access` moves it to the :guilabel:`Private` category if it is not shared "
"with an invited user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:334
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Visibility` setting only applies to :guilabel:`Workspace` "
"articles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:339
msgid "Invite specific users"
msgstr "邀請指定用戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:341
msgid ""
"To grant specific internal or portal users access to a private nested "
"article or to share a :guilabel:`Workspace` article with a portal user, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:344
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Share` in the top-right menu."
msgstr "點擊右上方選單中的 :guilabel:`分享`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:345
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:347
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Invite`."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`邀請`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:346
msgid ""
"Select the preferred :guilabel:`Permission` and add users in the "
":guilabel:`Recipients` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:352
msgid "Generate article URL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:354
msgid ""
"To generate a URL and share an article, click :guilabel:`Share` and activate"
" the :guilabel:`Share to web` toggle. Click :guilabel:`Copy Link` to copy "
"the article's URL."
msgstr ""
"如要產生網址並分享文章，請點擊 :guilabel:`分享` 並啟用 :guilabel:`分享至網"
"頁` 開關。點擊 :guilabel:`複製連結` 即可複製文章的網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:358
msgid ""
"If an article contains :ref:`inserted views "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/views>`, users with the URL do not see them "
"unless they can access the inserted content."
msgstr ""
"如果文章包含 :ref:`已插入的檢視畫面 <knowledge/articles_editing/views>`，擁有"
"網址的用戶除非具備所插入內容的存取權限，否則無法看見這些內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:360
msgid "Having the Website app is necessary to share an article's URL."
msgstr "必須安裝網站應用程式，才可分享文章網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:365
msgid "Removal"
msgstr "移除"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:367
msgid "Removing an article involves deleting or archiving it."
msgstr "移除文章包括將其刪除或封存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:370
msgid "Delete an article"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:372
msgid ""
"Select an article in the sidebar tree and click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`More actions`) icon, then :guilabel:`Send to Trash`. "
"Alternatively, drag and drop the article under :guilabel:`Drop here to "
"delete this article` at the bottom left corner. The article is moved to the "
"trash for 30 days before being permanently deleted."
msgstr ""
"在側邊欄樹狀目錄中選取一篇文章，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`（:guilabel:`更"
"多操作`）圖示，再點擊 :guilabel:`移至垃圾桶`。或者，將文章拖放至左下角的 "
":guilabel:`拖放至此處以刪除此文章` 下方。文章會移至垃圾桶保留 30 天，之後才會"
"永久刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:377
msgid ""
"To permanently delete an article, click :guilabel:`Articles` in the top-left"
" menu, select an article, and click :menuselection:`Actions --> Delete`. In "
"the pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Delete` to confirm the deletion of the "
"article."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:382
msgid ""
"To restore a trashed article, click :guilabel:`Open the Trash` at the bottom"
" of the sidebar tree, select an article, and click :guilabel:`Restore`. "
"Alternatively, click :guilabel:`Articles` in the top-left menu. In the "
"search bar, click :menuselection:`Filters --> Trashed`. Click the article, "
"then :guilabel:`Restore`."
msgstr ""
"要還原已移至垃圾桶的文章，請按一下側邊欄樹狀目錄底部的 :guilabel:`開啟垃圾"
"桶`，選取文章，然後按一下 :guilabel:`還原`。或者，在左上角選單中按一下 "
":guilabel:`文章`。在搜尋列中，按一下 :menuselection:`篩選條件 --> 已移至垃圾"
"桶`。按一下該文章，然後按一下 :guilabel:`還原`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:388
msgid "Archive an article"
msgstr "封存文章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:390
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Articles`, select an article, and click "
":menuselection:`Actions --> Archive`. In the pop-up window, click "
":guilabel:`Archive` to confirm the article's archival."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`文章`，選擇一篇文章，然後點擊 :menuselection:`操作 --> 封"
"存`。在彈出視窗中，點擊 :guilabel:`封存` 以確認封存文章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:394
msgid ""
"To restore an archived article, click :guilabel:`Articles`. In the search "
"bar, click :menuselection:`Filters --> Archived`. Select the article and go "
"to :menuselection:`Actions --> Unarchive`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:401
msgid "Retrieval"
msgstr "檢索"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:403
msgid ""
"Retrieving Knowledge articles consists of accessing them from Odoo apps or "
"restoring previous versions."
msgstr "檢索「知識」文章包括從 Odoo 應用程式中存取文章，或還原舊版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:407
msgid "Access articles from Odoo apps"
msgstr "從 Odoo 應用程式存取文章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:409
msgid ""
"Knowledge articles are accessible from the :ref:`form view "
"<studio/views/general/form>` of various apps. Click the :icon:`fa-bookmark` "
":guilabel:`(Knowledge)` icon in the top right corner to open the command "
"palette, then choose one of the following search methods:"
msgstr ""
"你可在各個應用程式的 :ref:`表單檢視 <studio/views/general/form>` 存取「知識」"
"文章。點擊右上角的 :icon:`fa-bookmark` :guilabel:`(知識)` 圖示以開啟指令面板"
"，然後選擇以下其中一種搜尋方法："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:413
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Search for an article`: start typing the text to execute a "
"semantic search that identifies relevant article information."
msgstr ":guilabel:`搜尋文章`：開始輸入文字以執行語意搜尋，找出相關的文章資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:415
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Advanced Search`: after typing the text in the search bar, click "
":guilabel:`Advanced Search` to perform a parametric search with options to "
"filter, group, or save articles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:419
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:269
msgid "Version history"
msgstr "版本紀錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:421
msgid ""
"To retrieve a previous version of an article, select it in the sidebar tree "
"and click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`More actions`) icon, then "
":guilabel:`Open Version History`. Select a version and click "
":guilabel:`Restore history`."
msgstr ""
"如要擷取文章的較早版本，請在側邊欄樹狀目錄中選擇該文章，按一下 :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v`（:guilabel:`更多操作`）圖示，然後選擇 :guilabel:`開啟版本記錄`。"
"選擇所需版本，再按一下 :guilabel:`還原記錄`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:426
msgid ""
"In the version history, the :guilabel:`Content` tab shows the selected "
"version, while the :guilabel:`Comparison` tab displays the differences "
"between the article's previous and current versions."
msgstr ""
"在版本歷史記錄中，:guilabel:`內容` 分頁會顯示所選版本，而 :guilabel:`比較` 分"
"頁則顯示文章上一版本與目前版本之間的差異。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:433
msgid "Properties"
msgstr "屬性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:435
msgid ""
"Properties are custom fields for storing and managing information that "
"members can add to :ref:`nested articles <knowledge/articles_editing/create-"
"article>` or :ref:`article items <knowledge/articles_editing/items>`."
msgstr ""
"屬性是用於儲存及管理資訊的自訂欄位，成員可將其新增至 :ref:`巢狀文章 "
"<knowledge/articles_editing/create-article>` 或 :ref:`文章項目 <knowledge/"
"articles_editing/items>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:439
msgid ""
"To add a property, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`More "
"actions`) icon, then :menuselection:`Add Properties --> Add a Property`, "
"enter a :guilabel:`Label`, and select a :guilabel:`Field Type`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:444
msgid ":doc:`/applications/essentials/property_fields`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/essentials/property_fields`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:447
msgid "Click outside the property field window to save a property."
msgstr "點擊屬性欄位視窗外部，即可儲存屬性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:448
msgid ""
"To remove a property, hover over its name, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`pencil`) icon, then click :menuselection:`Delete --> Delete`. "
"Deleting a property is permanent, and deleting all properties removes the "
"property sidebar panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:453
msgid ""
"Hover over the property name and click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`pencil`) icon to edit it or the :icon:`oi-draggable` "
"(:guilabel:`drag handle`) icon to move it above or below another property."
msgstr ""
"將滑鼠懸停在屬性名稱上，然後按一下 :icon:`fa-pencil`（:guilabel:`鉛筆`）圖示"
"以編輯屬性，或按一下 :icon:`oi-draggable`（:guilabel:`拖曳控點`）圖示將其移至"
"另一屬性的上方或下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:456
msgid ""
"Tick :guilabel:`Display in Cards` to show the properties in an :ref:`article"
" item's view <knowledge/articles_editing/items>` that is visible from a "
"parent article."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:458
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cogs` (:guilabel:`cogs`) icon to hide the property "
"sidebar panel. Exiting and returning to the article causes the panel to "
"reappear."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-cogs`（:guilabel:`齒輪`）圖示以隱藏屬性側邊欄面板。退出並返回"
"文章後，該面板會重新顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:7
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:293
msgid "Phone"
msgstr "電話"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:10
msgid "As of Odoo 19.0, the *VoIP* module has been renamed to *Odoo Phone*."
msgstr "從 Odoo 19.0 起，*VoIP* 模組已更名為 *Odoo 電話*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:12
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Phone** app enables businesses to handle calls over the internet "
"by integrating directly with Odoo apps like **CRM** and **Helpdesk**. The "
"**Phone** app can :doc:`link calls and messages to customer interactions "
"<../essentials/activities>`, log communication history, and automate call "
"routing based on predefined rules. Features like :ref:`call recording "
"<productivity/phone/recording-transcription>` and analytics provide insights"
" into call volume and response times, helping businesses streamline external"
" communication and track team performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:20
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:5
msgid "Phone widget"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:20
msgid ""
"Get started with the Phone widget essentials, including actions that can be "
"taken during a call."
msgstr "快速掌握電話小工具的基礎操作，包括在通話期間可執行的動作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:27
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:3
msgid "Devices and integrations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:27
msgid ""
"Learn how to access the Phone widget from different devices (like phones) "
"and apps (like Linphone)."
msgstr "了解如何透過不同裝置（如手機）及應用程式（如 Linphone）存取電話小工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:35
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Phone <https://www.odoo.com/slides/voip-voice-over-"
"ip-315>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 教學課程：電話 <https://www.odoo.com/slides/voip-voice-over-ip-315>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:40
msgid "About VoIP"
msgstr "關於 VoIP"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:42
msgid ""
"The **Phone** app uses the following technologies to make and receive calls "
"in Odoo:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Voice over Internet Protocol (VoIP)**: Technology that is used to handle "
"calls that are not made from a phone line."
msgstr "**網絡電話 (VoIP)**：用於處理並非透過電話線進行的通話之技術。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Session Initiation Protocol (SIP)**: Technology included in |VOIP| that "
"specifically handles the setup, management, and termination of calls."
msgstr ""
"**會話起始協定（SIP）**：包含在 |VOIP| 中的技術，專門處理通話的建立、管理及終"
"止。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Call queue**: A system to route calls (usually in a support team). This "
"allows customers to wait for help if no support agents are available."
msgstr ""
"**通話佇列**：用於分派來電的系統（通常用於支援團隊）。此功能可讓顧客在沒有支"
"援專員空閒時，在線等候協助。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Dial plans**: A system to define how |VOIP| calls are routed, based on set"
" rules."
msgstr "**撥號計劃**：根據預設規則定義如何轉接 |VOIP| 通話的系統。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:55
msgid "Configure the Phone app"
msgstr "設定電話應用程式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:57
msgid ""
"To make |VOIP| calls in Odoo, first :ref:`install <general/install>` the "
"**Phone** app."
msgstr ""
"要在 Odoo 撥打 |VOIP| 通話，請先 :ref:`安裝 <general/install>` **電話** 應用"
"程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:59
msgid ""
"Once the app is installed, a :icon:`oi-voip` (:guilabel:`Phone`) icon will "
"appear at the top of the screen. When this icon is clicked, a **Phone** pop-"
"up widget appears on the screen. This is where users can make and receive "
"calls, send emails, edit user and employee info, and manage activities. The "
"widget stays open when navigating other Odoo apps."
msgstr ""
"安裝應用程式後，畫面頂部會顯示 :icon:`oi-voip`（:guilabel:`電話`）圖示。點擊"
"該圖示後，畫面上會出現 **電話** 彈出式小工具。用戶可在此撥打及接聽電話、發送"
"電郵、編輯用戶及員工資料，以及管理活動。瀏覽其他 Odoo 應用程式時，該小工具會"
"保持開啟狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:67
msgid "Assign user permissions"
msgstr "指派用戶權限"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:69
msgid ""
"By default, users can receive their own calls, and managers can receive "
"calls for their team members. To grant additional **Phone** app permissions "
"to a user, go to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users \\& Companies --> "
"Users` and search for the user. Open the user's contact card and navigate to"
" the *Access Rights* tab. Go to the *Productivity* section, and in the "
"|VOIP| field, select the desired access role."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，用戶可接聽自己的來電，而經理則可為團隊成員接聽來電。若要為用戶授"
"予額外的 **電話** 應用程式權限，請前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 用戶"
"及公司 --> 用戶` 並搜尋該用戶。開啟該用戶的聯絡人卡片並前往 *存取權限* 分頁。"
"在 *生產力* 區段中的 |VOIP| 欄位內，選取所需的存取角色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:75
msgid "The **Phone** app has three access roles:"
msgstr "**電話** 應用程式設有三個存取角色："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:77
msgid ":guilabel:`No`: cannot access **Phone** app features."
msgstr ":guilabel:`否`：無法存取 **電話** 應用程式功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:78
msgid ":guilabel:`Officer`: can view and report on all calls."
msgstr ":guilabel:`專員`：可檢視所有通話並製作報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:79
msgid ":guilabel:`Administrator`: can view, report, and manage call settings."
msgstr ":guilabel:`管理員`：可檢視、建立報表及管理通話設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:0
msgid ""
"Database administrators are not automatically granted administrator rights "
"for the **Phone** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:0
msgid "Make sure to set the correct access role for each **Phone** app user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:86
msgid ""
"To modify these roles or add custom roles, see :ref:`Create and modify "
"groups <access-rights/groups>`."
msgstr ""
"要修改這些角色或新增自訂角色，請參閱 :ref:`建立及修改群組 <access-rights/"
"groups>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:92
msgid "Connect to a VoIP provider"
msgstr "連接至 VoIP 供應商"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:94
msgid ""
"Making calls through the **Phone** app also requires a |VOIP| service "
"provider. Odoo supports three verified providers by default: :doc:`Axivox "
"<phone/axivox>`, :doc:`DIDWW <phone/didww>`, and :doc:`OnSIP <phone/onsip>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:99
msgid "Axivox configuration"
msgstr "Axivox 配置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:99
msgid ""
"Learn how to set up Axivox in Odoo. This includes adding users to Axivox, "
"setting up call queues, and more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:106
msgid "DIDWW configuration"
msgstr "DIDWW 設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:106
msgid ""
"Learn how to set up DIDWW in Odoo. This includes entering DIDWW credentials "
"into Odoo and purchasing new numbers."
msgstr "了解如何在 Odoo 中設定 DIDWW。這包括在 Odoo 中輸入 DIDWW 憑證及購買新號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:113
msgid "OnSIP configuration"
msgstr "OnSIP 設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:113
msgid ""
"Learn how to set up OnSIP in Odoo. This includes entering OnSIP credentials "
"into Odoo and handling troubleshooting."
msgstr "了解如何在 Odoo 中設定 OnSIP，包括在 Odoo 輸入 OnSIP 登入憑證及進行疑難排解。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:120
msgid "Other providers must meet two requirements to connect with Odoo:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:122
msgid ""
"The |VOIP| host must provide access to a SIP server via a WebSocket "
"connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:123
msgid "The |VOIP| host must support WebRTC protocol."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:127
msgid ""
"If these requirements are met, it should be possible to add the alternate "
"provider to Odoo. However, Odoo recommends using a verified provider and "
"cannot guarantee compatibility with every alternate provider."
msgstr ""
"如果符合這些要求，應該可以將替代供應商加入至 Odoo。不過，Odoo 建議使用已驗證"
"的供應商，並無法保證與每個替代供應商兼容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:131
msgid ""
"To add credentials for an alternate provider, go to the "
":menuselection:`Phone app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Click "
":guilabel:`New`, then enter the provider information (such as the "
"websocket's URL). Enter the domain created by the alternate provider in the "
":guilabel:`OnSIP Domain` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:135
msgid ""
"For issues setting up the |VOIP| service provider in Odoo, follow the "
":ref:`relevant troubleshooting steps <phone/phone_widget/troubleshooting>`. "
"For any other issues with the |VOIP| service provider, contact their support"
" team directly."
msgstr ""
"如在 Odoo 設定 |VOIP| 服務供應商時遇到問題，請按照:ref:`相關疑難排解步驟 "
"<phone/phone_widget/troubleshooting>`操作。如遇到 |VOIP| 服務供應商的任何其他"
"問題，請直接聯絡其支援團隊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:140
msgid "Configure PBX settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:142
msgid ""
"Configure a Private Branch Exchange (PBX) system for call routing directly "
"in Odoo."
msgstr "直接在 Odoo 中設定專用交換機（PBX）系統以進行通話路由。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:145
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:10
msgid "Call flows"
msgstr "通話流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:145
msgid ""
"Design visual call flows to route incoming calls to users, groups, queues, "
"menus, voicemail, or external numbers."
msgstr "設計可視化通話流程，將來電轉接至用戶、群組、隊列、選單、語音信箱或外部號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:155
msgid "Record and transcribe calls"
msgstr "錄製並轉錄通話"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:157
msgid ""
"Calls made through the **Phone** app can be recorded, and recordings can be "
"transcribed into text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:162
msgid "Configure call recording"
msgstr "設定通話錄音"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:164
msgid ""
"To configure call recording and transcription, go to :menuselection:`Phone "
"app --> Configuration --> Providers`. For each |VOIP| provider, select the "
"desired setting:"
msgstr ""
"要設定通話錄音及轉錄功能，請前往 :menuselection:`電話應用程式 --> 設定 --> 供"
"應商`。為每個 |VOIP| 供應商選擇所需設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:167
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Call Recording`: Select :guilabel:`Disabled`, :guilabel:`Let "
"users decide`, or :guilabel:`Force for all users`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`通話錄音`：選擇 :guilabel:`停用`、:guilabel:`由用戶決定`，或 "
":guilabel:`強制所有用戶啟用`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:169
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transcription`: Select :guilabel:`Disable` or :guilabel:`Force "
"for all users`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`轉錄`：選擇 :guilabel:`停用` 或 :guilabel:`對所有用戶強制執行`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:171
msgid ""
"The Call Recording and Transcription columns on the VoIP Providers settings "
"page."
msgstr "VoIP 供應商設定頁面上的「通話錄音」及「轉錄」欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:174
msgid ""
"Recordings are stored using the :doc:`Cloud Storage "
"<../general/integrations/cloud_storage>` integration. If it is not "
"configured, a warning is shown on this page, and call recording cannot be "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"錄音會透過 :doc:`雲端儲存 <../general/integrations/cloud_storage>` 整合儲存。"
"若尚未配置該整合，此頁面將顯示警告，且無法啟用通話錄音功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:181
msgid "Request a transcription"
msgstr "請求轉錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:183
msgid ""
"After a call has been recorded, its recording can be transcribed into text. "
"A :guilabel:`Transcription pending...` banner appears at the top of the "
"call's record, with a :guilabel:`Request Transcription` button. "
"Transcription is only available when enabled for the call's |VOIP| provider "
"(see :ref:`productivity/phone/configure-recording` above)."
msgstr ""
"通話錄音後，系統可將錄音轉錄為文字。通話記錄頂部會顯示 :guilabel:`待轉錄...` "
"橫額，並附有 :guilabel:`要求轉錄` 按鈕。僅當為該通話的 |VOIP| 供應商啟用轉錄"
"功能時，方可使用此功能（請參閱上文 :ref:`productivity/phone/configure-"
"recording`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:188
msgid ""
"The Transcription pending banner with the Request Transcription button."
msgstr "顯示「要求轉錄」按鈕的「等待轉錄」橫幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:191
msgid ""
"If the transcription fails, the banner displays an error message instead."
msgstr "如轉錄失敗，橫幅會改為顯示錯誤訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:196
msgid "Call Debrief panel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:198
msgid ""
"Once a call has a recording or transcript, a **Call Debrief** panel with a "
"timestamped transcript and audio player appears. The transcript and audio "
"player are synced. Click a line in the transcript to jump to that moment in "
"the recording, or play the recording to highlight each corresponding line as"
" it plays."
msgstr ""
"通話有錄音或逐字稿後，畫面會顯示 **通話摘要** 面板，當中附有時間標記的逐字稿"
"及音訊播放器。逐字稿與音訊播放器會保持同步。點擊逐字稿中的任何一行，即可跳轉"
"至錄音中的相應時間點；播放錄音時，系統亦會同步反白顯示正在播放的對應文字行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:203
msgid "The Call Debrief panel with a synced transcript and audio player."
msgstr "設有同步逐字稿及音訊播放器的通話摘要面板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone.rst:206
msgid ""
"The audio player has a timeline with a marker for each transcript line and "
"the following controls:"
msgstr "音訊播放器設有時間軸，為每行逐字稿標示位置，並提供以下控制項："

