#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:94
msgid ""
"To manually log a dynamic agent out of a call queue, navigate to the `Axivox"
" management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_, and click "
":guilabel:`Queues` from the left-hand menu. Then, click the green "
":guilabel:`Refresh` button at the top of the :guilabel:`Connected agents` "
"column. From here, click the red :guilabel:`Disconnect` button, and they are"
" immediately disconnected. This can be helpful in situations where agents "
"forget to log out at the end of the day."
msgstr ""
"如要手動將動態專員登出通話佇列，請前往 `Axivox 管理控制台 <https://"
"manage.axivox.com>`_ ，並在左側選單按一下 :guilabel:`佇列` 。接著，按一下綠"
"色 :guilabel:`重新整理` 按鈕，該按鈕位於 :guilabel:`已連線專員` 欄位頂部。然"
"後按一下紅色的 :guilabel:`中斷連線` 按鈕，專員便會立即中斷連線。如果專員在工"
"作日結束時忘記登出，此操作會相當有用。"

