msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Report` to open a :guilabel:`Queue report` page that shows "
"queue activity. This report includes who connected and when when, as well as"
" what phone calls were handled by the queue.f This information is showcased "
"on a separate :guilabel:`Queue report` page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:111
msgid ""
"Set the report's date in the :guilabel:`Period` field. To pick a specific "
"date range, use the :guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`to` fields. The "
"information can be organized by :guilabel:`Event type` (covered below), and "
":guilabel:`Call ID`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`期間` 欄位設定報表日期。如要選取特定日期範圍，請使用 "
":guilabel:`由` 及 :guilabel:`至` 欄位。資料可按 :guilabel:`事件類型`（下文將"
"作說明）及 :guilabel:`通話 ID` 進行整理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:115
msgid "Generate the report by clicking :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`套用` 以產生報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:117
msgid ""
"Each report can be exported to a :abbr:`CSV (comma separated value)` file "
"for further use and analysis, via the :guilabel:`Export to CSV` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:120
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Event type` field is clicked, a drop-down menu appears "
"with the following options:"
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`活動類型` 欄位後，下拉選單會顯示以下選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:123
msgid ":guilabel:`The caller quit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`來電者已退出`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:124
msgid ":guilabel:`An agent is connecting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`專員正在連線`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:125
msgid ":guilabel:`An agent is disconnecting`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:126
msgid ":guilabel:`The call was terminated (agent hangs up)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`通話已終止（客服人員掛線）`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:127
msgid ":guilabel:`The call was terminated (caller hangs up)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`The caller is connected to an agent.`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`來電者已連接至專員。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:129
msgid ":guilabel:`Someone is entering the queue`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`有人正在進入隊列`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:130
msgid ":guilabel:`The caller exits the queue (no agent is connected)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:131
msgid ":guilabel:`The caller exits the queue (timeout)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:132
msgid ":guilabel:`No one is answering`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:133
msgid ":guilabel:`No one is answering, the caller hangs up`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`無人接聽，來電者掛斷`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:134
msgid ":guilabel:`Transfer`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`轉接`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Blind Transfer` (when the caller is transferred without "
"interacting with an agent)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`盲轉`（即致電者在不與客服人員互動的情況下直接被轉接）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:137
msgid ""
"Any or all of the thirteen options can be selected from the :guilabel:`Event"
" type` drop-down menu. Clicking :guilabel:`Check all` selects all the "
"available options from the drop-down menu, and clicking :guilabel:`Uncheck "
"all` removes all selections from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"您可以從 :guilabel:`活動類型` 下拉式選單中選取十三個選項中的任何或全部選項。"
"點按 :guilabel:`全選` 會選取下拉式選單中的所有可用選項，而點按 :guilabel:`取"
"消全選` 則會移除下拉式選單中的所有選取項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:141
msgid ""
"To select an individual :guilabel:`Event type`, click on the desired option "
"in the drop-down menu."
msgstr "要選擇單個 :guilabel:`活動類型` ，請在下拉式選單中點擊所需選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:143
msgid "Axivox queue report with result, event type, and period highlighted."
msgstr "已醒目顯示結果、事件類型及期間的 Axivox 佇列報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:147
msgid "Connect to queue on Odoo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:149
msgid ""
"Dynamic agents can connect manually to the Axivox call queue from the Odoo "
"**VoIP** widget once the **VoIP** app is configured for the individual user "
"in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:152
msgid ""
"To access the Odoo **VoIP** widget, click the :icon:`oi-voip` "
":guilabel:`(VoIP)`  icon in the upper-right corner of the screen anywhere in"
" an Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"如要存取 Odoo **VoIP** 小工具，請在 Odoo 資料庫的任何位置，按一下畫面右上角"
"的 :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`(VoIP)` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:156
msgid ":doc:`axivox_config`"
msgstr ":doc:`axivox_config`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:157
msgid ":doc:`../phone_widget`"
msgstr ":doc:`../phone_widget`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:159
msgid ""
"For an agent to connect to the call queue, dial the :guilabel:`Agent "
"connection` number, and then press the green call button :icon:`fa-phone` "
":guilabel:`(phone)` icon in the **VoIP** widget. Then, the agent hears a "
"short, two-second message indicating the agent is logged in. The call "
"automatically ends."
msgstr ""
"專員要連線至通話佇列，請撥打 :guilabel:`專員連線` 號碼，然後在 **VoIP** 小工"
"具中按下綠色通話按鈕 :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`（電話）` 圖示。接著，專員會"
"聽到一段兩秒的簡短訊息，表示已登入。通話隨後會自動結束。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:164
msgid ""
"To view the connected agents in a call queue, navigate to the `Axivox "
"management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_, and click "
":guilabel:`Queues` from the left-hand menu."
msgstr ""
"要查看通話隊列中已連線的代理，請前往 `Axivox 管理主控台 <https://"
"manage.axivox.com>`_ ，然後點擊左側選單中的 :guilabel:`隊列`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:167
msgid ""
"Then, click the green :guilabel:`Refresh` button at the top of the "
":guilabel:`Connected agents` column. Any agent, static or dynamic, that is "
"connected to the queue currently appears in the column next to the queue "
"they are logged into."
msgstr ""
"然後，點擊綠色的 :guilabel:`重新整理` 按鈕（位於 :guilabel:`已連線專員` 欄位"
"頂部）。任何已連線至該佇列的靜態或動態專員，目前都會顯示在他們所登入佇列旁邊"
"的欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:171
msgid ""
"To log out of the queue, open the Odoo **VoIP** widget, dial the "
":guilabel:`Agent disconnection` number, and then press the green call button"
" :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`(phone)` icon. The agent is disconnected from "
"the queue after a short, two-second message."
msgstr ""
"要登出佇列，請開啟 Odoo **VoIP** 小工具，撥打 :guilabel:`專員中斷連線` 號碼，"
"然後按下綠色通話按鈕 :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`（電話）` 圖示。在播放簡短的"
"兩秒訊息後，專員便會從佇列中斷連線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:3
msgid "Conference calls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:5
msgid ""
"Conference calls help employees connect quickly and efficiently, so matters "
"can be discussed in an open forum of sorts. Attendees can be limited, via a "
"sign-in code. That way, confidential matters stay private."
msgstr ""
"電話會議有助員工快速高效地聯繫，讓大家可在類似公開論壇的環境中討論事項。透過"
"登入代碼，可限制參與人數，從而確保機密事項不會外洩。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:9
msgid ""
"This document covers the configuration of conference calls in Axivox for use"
" in Odoo *VoIP*."
msgstr "本文件說明如何在 Axivox 中設定電話會議，以於 Odoo *VoIP* 中使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:12
msgid "Add a virtual conference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:14
msgid ""
"To add a virtual conference room, navigate to the `Axivox management console"
" <https://manage.axivox.com>`_. After logging in, click on "
":guilabel:`Conferences` in the menu on the left."
msgstr ""
"要新增虛擬會議室，請前往 `Axivox 管理控制台 <https://manage.axivox.com>`_。登"
"入後，按一下左側選單中的 :guilabel:`會議`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:18
msgid ""
"Next, click the green button labeled, :guilabel:`Add a conference`, and a "
":guilabel:`New conference` form appears."
msgstr ""
"接著，按一下標示為 :guilabel:`新增會議` 的綠色按鈕，畫面便會顯示 "
":guilabel:`新會議` 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:21
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:61
msgid "New conference form on Axivox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:25
msgid ""
"From here, fill in the :guilabel:`Name` field, and set an "
":guilabel:`Internal extension`."
msgstr "在此處填寫 :guilabel:`名稱` 欄位，並設定 :guilabel:`內部分機`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:27
msgid ""
"The internal extension is what everyone in the network uses to quickly dial "
"into the conference call, instead of typing in the whole phone number."
msgstr "內部分機號碼讓網絡內的每個人都能快速撥入電話會議，而無需輸入完整的電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:31
msgid ""
"Pick a number between three and five digits long, making it easy to remember"
" and dial."
msgstr "選擇一個三至五位數的號碼，方便記憶及撥號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:33
msgid ""
"Next, set the :guilabel:`Access code`, if the conference room requires "
"security. This is a password to get into the conference, once the extension "
"for the conference is dialed. Immediately after dialing the extension, a "
"digital receptionist prompts for the :guilabel:`Access code`."
msgstr ""
"接著，若會議室需要安全保護，請設定 :guilabel:`存取碼`。此為撥打會議室分機後進"
"入會議的密碼。撥打分機後，數碼接待員會立即提示輸入 :guilabel:`存取碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:37
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Administrator extension` field, click the drop-down menu, "
"and select the user's extension that manages the call."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:40
msgid ""
"Finally, in the :guilabel:`Wait for the administrator to start the "
"conference` field, click the drop-down menu, and select :guilabel:`Yes` or "
":guilabel:`No`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:43
msgid ""
"Should the selection be :guilabel:`Yes`, then nobody is allowed to utilize "
"the virtual conference room until the administrator is present, and logged "
"into the conference call."
msgstr ""
"如選擇 :guilabel:`是`，則在管理員出席並登入視像會議通話前，任何人都不得使用該"
"虛擬會議室。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:46
msgid ""
"When all fields are filled in, be sure to :guilabel:`Save` the "
"configuration. Then, click :guilabel:`Apply changes` in the upper-right "
"corner to implement the change in production."
msgstr ""
"填寫所有欄位後，請務必 :guilabel:`儲存` 設定。然後，按一下右上角的 "
":guilabel:`套用變更`，以在正式環境中實施變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:49
msgid ""
"Upon doing so, the conference is added, and the Axivox administrator has the"
" option to :guilabel:`Delete` or :guilabel:`Edit` the conference from the "
"Axivox :guilabel:`Conference` main dashboard."
msgstr ""
"完成後，會議便會新增，Axivox 管理員便可 :guilabel:`刪除` 或 :guilabel:`編輯` "
"該會議，此操作可於 Axivox :guilabel:`會議` 主儀表板進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:53
msgid ""
"To invite an Axivox user to a specific conference call, click "
":guilabel:`Invite` to the right of the desired conference, and proceed to "
"enter the extension or phone number of the invitee in the pop-up window that"
" appears."
msgstr ""
"要邀請 Axivox 用戶加入特定電話會議，請點擊所需會議右側的 :guilabel:`邀請`，然"
"後在彈出的視窗中輸入受邀者的分機或電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:57
msgid ""
"Once the extension or number is added into the :guilabel:`Please enter the "
"phone number of the person you want to invite` field, click the green "
":guilabel:`Invite` button, and the recipient immediately receives a phone "
"call, automatically linking them to the conference."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`請輸入您想邀請的人員之電話號碼` 欄位加入分機或號碼後，按一下綠"
"色的 :guilabel:`邀請` 按鈕。收件人會立即收到來電，並自動連線至會議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:66
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/manage_users.rst:32
msgid "Incoming numbers"
msgstr "來電號碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:68
msgid ""
"To open a conference to a wider audience, an Axivox conference can be linked"
" to *Incoming numbers*."
msgstr "要向更多聽眾開放會議，可將 Axivox 會議連結至 *來電號碼*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:70
msgid ""
"To do that, log into the `Axivox management console "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_, and click :guilabel:`Incoming numbers` in the"
" menu on the left."
msgstr ""
"為此，請登入 `Axivox 管理控制台 <https://manage.axivox.com>`_，然後點擊左側選"
"單中的 :guilabel:`來電號碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:73
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Incoming numbers` dashboard, click :guilabel:`Edit` to the"
" far-right of the :guilabel:`Number` to which the conference should be "
"attached."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:76
msgid ""
"Then, under the first field, labeled, :guilabel:`Destination type for voice "
"call`, click the drop-down menu, and select :guilabel:`Conference`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:79
msgid ""
"Next, in the :guilabel:`Conference` field, click the drop-down menu, and "
"select the specific conference that should be attached to this incoming "
"number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:82
msgid ""
"Now, whenever this incoming number is dialed, the caller is let into the "
"conference, if there is not an :guilabel:`Access code` required. If there "
"*is* an :guilabel:`Access code` required, the caller is then prompted to "
"enter the :guilabel:`Access code` to enter the conference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:87
msgid "Start call in Odoo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:89
msgid ""
"Anywhere in the Odoo database, open the *VoIP* widget, by clicking the "
":guilabel:`☎️ (phone)` icon, located in the upper-right corner. Then, dial "
"the specific extension number for the conference, and click the :guilabel:`📞"
" (phone)` icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:93
msgid "Connecting to a conference extension using the Odoo VoIP widget."
msgstr "使用 Odoo VoIP 小工具連接至會議分機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/conference_calls.rst:97
msgid ""
"Once the digital receptionist answers, enter the :guilabel:`Access code` (if"
" needed), and press the :guilabel:`# (pound)` icon/key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:3
msgid "Advanced dial plans"
msgstr "進階撥號計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:5
msgid ""
"Typically, companies have a lot of incoming calls every day, but many do not"
" want their teams to answer calls 24 hours a day, 7 days a week."
msgstr ""
"一般而言，公司每日都會收到大量來電，但許多公司並不希望團隊每星期 7 日、每日 "
"24 小時全天候接聽來電。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:8
msgid ""
"By using Axivox advanced dial plan features, the process can be automated, "
"and routing can be set up for all scenarios. This way, customers are never "
"left waiting, or frustrated, because they cannot get in touch with anyone."
msgstr ""
"透過使用 Axivox 進階撥號計劃功能，您可將流程自動化，並為各種情況設定通話轉接"
"。這樣一來，客戶便不會因為無法聯絡任何人而苦等或感到沮喪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:12
msgid ""
"By utilizing the advanced elements in dial plans, companies can automate "
"call routing for certain days or times, like company holidays. Companies can"
" also allow callers to enter extensions themselves, and get transferred "
"automatically using a digital receptionist. This way, an administrative team"
" does **not** have to be available around the clock."
msgstr ""
"善用撥號計劃中的進階元素，公司可為特定日期或時段（例如公司假期）自動設定來電"
"轉駁。公司亦可讓來電者自行輸入內線號碼，並透過數碼接待員自動轉接。這樣，行政"
"團隊便 **無須** 全天候當值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:17
msgid ""
"There is even the option to route callers, depending on where they are "
"calling from in the world, thus maximizing efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:21
msgid ""
"For more information on basic dial plans, and how to add elements, visit "
":doc:`dial_plan_basics`."
msgstr ""
"如欲了解更多關於基本撥號計劃及如何新增元素的資訊，請瀏覽 "
":doc:`dial_plan_basics`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:24
msgid ""
"Using a browser add-on for spelling may hinder the use of the visual editor "
"in dial plans. Do **not** use a translator with the Axivox management "
"console."
msgstr ""
"使用瀏覽器的拼字檢查附加元件可能會妨礙撥號計劃中視覺化編輯器的正常運作。"
"請**勿**在 Axivox 管理控制台使用翻譯工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:160
msgid "Advanced elements"
msgstr "進階元素"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:30
msgid ""
"In Axivox dial plans (as described in :doc:`dial_plan_basics`), there are "
"two advanced elements that can be used."
msgstr ""
"在 Axivox 撥號計劃中（如 :doc:`dial_plan_basics` 所述），有兩個可使用的進階元"
"素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:164
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Record`: recording feature is enabled (requires plan change, "
"enabled in Axivox settings)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`錄音`：已啟用錄音功能（需變更計劃，並於 Axivox 設定中啟用）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Caller ID`: replace the caller ID by the called number or free "
"text."
msgstr ":guilabel:`來電顯示`：以被叫號碼或自訂文字取代來電顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:37
msgid ""
"To add one of these elements, navigate to the :guilabel:`Dial plans` page, "
"located in the menu on the left side of the `Axivox management console "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:40
msgid ""
"Next, click on the :guilabel:`Visual Editor` button to the right of the "
"desired dial plan to edit it. Finally, open the :guilabel:`New element` "
"drop-down menu, select the element, and click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"接下來，點擊所需撥號計劃右側的 :guilabel:`視覺化編輯器` 按鈕進行編輯。最後，"
"開啟 :guilabel:`新元素` 下拉式選單，選取該元素，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:44
msgid ""
"Visual editor for a dial plan in Axivox, with Add and the dispatcher element"
" highlighted."
msgstr "Axivox 撥號計劃的視覺化編輯器，當中突出顯示了「新增」及分配器元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:99
msgid "For more information, visit :ref:`voip/axivox/dial_plans`."
msgstr "如需更多資訊，請參閱 :ref:`voip/axivox/dial_plans`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:51
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Record` element records calls that are routed through this "
"element, and requires an additional plan change in Axivox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:54
msgid ""
"To enable recording on Axivox, navigate to :guilabel:`Settings` in the "
"`Axivox management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_. Then, go to the "
":guilabel:`Recording` drop-down menu, near the bottom of the page. From "
"there, select :guilabel:`Enabled` from the drop-down menu to enable "
"recording using the :guilabel:`Record` element in a dial plan."
msgstr ""
"要在 Axivox 啟用錄音功能，請前往 :guilabel:`設定`（位於 `Axivox 管理控制台 "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_ 內）。然後，前往頁面底部附近的 :guilabel:`錄"
"音` 下拉式選單。在該下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`已啟用`，即可在撥號計劃中使"
"用 :guilabel:`錄音` 元素啟用錄音。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:60
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Recording` drop-down menu is unavailable and unable to "
"change, then consult Axivox to enable the feature."
msgstr "如果無法使用或更改 :guilabel:`錄音` 下拉式選單，請聯絡 Axivox 以啟用該功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:63
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Caller ID` element allows for the replacement of the caller "
"ID downstream, after routing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:66
msgid ""
"Upon adding the :guilabel:`Caller ID` element to the dial plan, and double-"
"clicking it to configure it, two options appear."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`來電顯示` 元素加入至撥號計劃並雙擊進行設定後，系統會顯示兩個選"
"項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:69
msgid ""
"The first is a :guilabel:`Free text` field, where any text can be input to "
"replace the caller ID. The second option is :guilabel:`Replace the caller ID"
" by the called number`. This option replaces the caller's ID with the "
":guilabel:`Incoming number`."
msgstr ""
"第一個是 :guilabel:`自由文字` 欄位，您可以在此輸入任何文字以取代來電顯示。第"
"二個選項是 :guilabel:`以被叫號碼取代來電顯示`。此選項會將來電者的識別碼取代"
"為 :guilabel:`來電號碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:74
msgid ""
"A company may want to use the :guilabel:`Caller ID` element to replace the "
":guilabel:`Incoming number`, so employees, or outside transfers, cannot see "
"the number, and information is kept private."
msgstr ""
"公司可能會想使用 :guilabel:`來電顯示` 元素來取代 :guilabel:`來電號碼`，使員工"
"或外部轉接對象無法看到該號碼，從而保障資料私隱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:79
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:135
msgid "Basic routing elements"
msgstr "基本路由元素"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:81
msgid ""
"Basic routing elements in Axivox dial plans provide extension-based routing."
" This can be done by adding either a *Menu* to numerically link the dial-by-"
"numbers to an action, or by using a *Digital Receptionist* to automatically "
"route or listen for an extension, based on a key input from the caller."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:86
msgid ""
"The main difference between the two elements is that the *Digital "
"Receptionist* does **not** need to be pre-configured numerically with "
"actions. Instead, it acts as a virtual receptionist."
msgstr ""
"兩者之間的主要分別在於，*數碼接待員***不**需要預先以數字設定動作，而是充當虛"
"擬接待員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Menu`: add a dial-by-number directory and configured downstream "
"actions (not terminal). For example, a dial-by-numbers function could "
"feature an element, wherein clicking '2' takes the caller to the element "
"linked to '2' on the Menu element in the dial plan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`選單`：新增按鍵撥號目錄及已設定的下游操作（非終端項目）。例如，按"
"鍵撥號功能可包含一個元素，當來電者按下「2」時，便會轉接至撥號計劃中選單元素上"
"連結至「2」的元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Digital Receptionist`: attach a virtual dispatcher to listen for "
"extensions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`數碼接待員`：附加虛擬調度程式以監聽分機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:94
msgid ""
"To add one of these elements, navigate to the :guilabel:`Dial plans` page, "
"located in the menu on the left side of the `Axivox management console "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_. Next, click on the :guilabel:`Visual Editor` "
"button to the right of the dial plan, to edit the dial plan. Then, open the "
":guilabel:`New element` drop-down menu, select the element, and click "
":guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:102
msgid "Digital receptionist scenario"
msgstr "數碼接待員情境"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:104
msgid ""
"The *Digital Receptionist* element is a listen-feature that accurately "
"routes callers through a dial plan, based on the extension they enter, via "
"the key pad."
msgstr ""
"*數碼接待員* 元素是一項聆聽功能，可根據來電者透過按鍵盤輸入的分機號碼，經撥號"
"計劃準確轉駁來電。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:107
msgid ""
"Set a *Digital Receptionist* to eliminate the need of a team, or live "
"receptionist, to be on-call all the time. With that element in place, calls "
"now reach their destination, without a real person interjecting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:111
msgid ""
"After adding the :guilabel:`Digital Receptionist` element to a dial plan, "
"connect the appropriate endpoints, and double-click on the element to set "
"the :guilabel:`Timeout` on the :guilabel:`receptionist` pop-up window that "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`數碼接待員` 元素新增至撥號計劃後，連接適當的端點，然後雙擊該元"
"素設定 :guilabel:`逾時`（位於隨即顯示的 :guilabel:`接待員` 彈出視窗中）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:115
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Timeout` can be set in `5` second increments, from `5` "
"seconds to `60` seconds."
msgstr "可將 :guilabel:`逾時` 設定為 `5` 秒至 `60` 秒，以 `5` 秒為增量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:118
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Digital Receptionist` element **requires** a :guilabel:`Play "
"a file` element on either side of it, to explain what action to take, and "
"when a wrong extension is entered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:122
msgid ""
"While customizing a dial plan in a :guilabel:`Dialplan Editor` pop-up "
"window, add a :guilabel:`Menu` element, with a :guilabel:`Greeting message` "
"that might read, `Press star to dial an extension`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:126
msgid ""
"Then, on the :guilabel:`Menu` element, for the :guilabel:`* (star)` option, "
"link a :guilabel:`Play a file` element, that plays an :guilabel:`Audio "
"message` saying, 'Enter the extension of the person you are trying to "
"reach'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:130
msgid ""
"Following the first :guilabel:`Play a file` element, add the "
":guilabel:`Digital Receptionist` element, followed by another "
":guilabel:`Play a file` element, which states, 'That is not a valid "
"extension'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:134
msgid ""
"This last element is in place to close the loop, should the caller not enter"
" a correct extension."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:136
msgid ""
"Finally, this last :guilabel:`Play a file` element is looped back into the "
":guilabel:`Menu` element."
msgstr ""
"最後，這個最後的 :guilabel:`播放檔案` 元素會循環返回至 :guilabel:`選單` 元素"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:139
msgid "A digital receptionist element highlighted in an example dial plan."
msgstr "範例撥號計劃中反白顯示的數碼接待員元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:144
msgid ""
"Dial plan elements can be configured by double-clicking them, and selecting "
"different features of the Axivox console to them."
msgstr "要設定撥號計劃元素，可以雙擊該元素，並為其選取 Axivox 主控台的不同功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:147
msgid ""
"For example, an :guilabel:`Audio message` needs to be made, and then "
"selected in a :guilabel:`Play a file` or :guilabel:`Menu` element."
msgstr ""
"例如，需要先建立一個 :guilabel:`音訊訊息`，然後在 :guilabel:`播放檔案` 或 "
":guilabel:`選單` 元素中選取它。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:150
msgid ""
"For more information, see this documentation "
":ref:`voip/axivox/audio_messages`."
msgstr "如需更多資料，請參閱此說明文件 :ref:`voip/axivox/audio_messages`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:153
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:147
msgid "Advanced routing elements"
msgstr "進階路由元素"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:155
msgid ""
"Advanced routing elements route calls automatically as they are received "
"into the incoming number(s). This can be configured using geo-location, "
"whitelisting, or time-based variables. Calls pass through a filter prior to "
"their final destination, and are routed, based on the set variable(s)."
msgstr ""
"進階路由元素會在來電接入來電號碼時自動進行路由。此功能可使用地理位置、白名單"
"或基於時間的變數進行配置。通話在到達最終目的地前會先經過篩選器，並根據已設定"
"的變數進行路由。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:160
msgid "The following are advanced routing elements:"
msgstr "以下為進階路由元素："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:162
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dispatcher`: create a call filter to route traffic, based on the "
"geo-location of the caller ID."
msgstr ":guilabel:`調度器`：建立通話篩選條件，根據來電顯示的地理位置分配通話流量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:164
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Access List`: create a tailored access list, with VIP customer "
"preference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:165
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Condition`: create time conditions to route incoming traffic"
" around holidays, or other sensitive time-frames."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:169
msgid ""
"Whitelisting is a technical term used to create a list of allowed numbers. "
"Conversely, blacklisting is used to create a list of denied numbers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:172
msgid ""
"To add one of these elements, navigate to the :guilabel:`Dial plans` page, "
"located in the menu on the left side of the `Axivox management console "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_. Next, click on the :guilabel:`Visual Editor` "
"button to the right of the dial plan, to edit the dial plan. Then, open the "
":guilabel:`New element` drop-down menu, select the element, and click "
":guilabel:`Add`. For more information, visit :ref:`voip/axivox/dial_plans`."
msgstr ""
"如要加入其中一個元素，請前往 :guilabel:`撥號計劃` 頁面（位於 `Axivox 管理控制"
"台 <https://manage.axivox.com>`_ 左側選單）。接著，點擊撥號計劃右側的 "
":guilabel:`視覺化編輯器` 按鈕以編輯該撥號計劃。然後，開啟 :guilabel:`新增元"
"素` 下拉式選單，選擇所需元素，再點擊 :guilabel:`加入`。詳情請參閱 :ref:`voip/"
"axivox/dial_plans`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:179
msgid "Dispatcher scenario"
msgstr "調度員情境"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:181
msgid ""
"A *Dispatcher* element is a dial plan feature that directs calls, based on "
"region or geo-location. In most cases, the :guilabel:`Dispatcher` element in"
" a dial plan is linked to the :guilabel:`Start` element, in order to filter "
"or screen calls as they come into an incoming number."
msgstr ""
"*調度器*元素是一項撥號計劃功能，可根據地區或地理位置轉接通話。在大多數情況下"
"，撥號計劃中的 :guilabel:`調度器` 元素會連結至 :guilabel:`開始` 元素，以便在"
"通話進入來電號碼時進行過濾或篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:185
msgid ""
"Double-click the :guilabel:`Dispatcher` element in the :guilabel:`Dialplan "
"Editor` pop-up window to configure it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:188
msgid ""
"This element checks numbers (routed through this element), according to "
"regular expressions. To add a regular expression, click :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` on the bottom of the :guilabel:`Dispatcher` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"此元素會根據正規表達式檢查（透過此元素路由的）號碼。如要新增正規表達式，請點"
"擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`（位於 :guilabel:`分派器` 彈出視窗底部）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:192
msgid ""
"Then, under :guilabel:`Name`, enter a recognizable name to identify this "
"expression. This is the name that appears in the :guilabel:`Dispatcher` "
"element on the dial plan showcased in the :guilabel:`Dialplan Editor` pop-up"
" window."
msgstr ""
"然後，在 :guilabel:`名稱` 下輸入易於辨識的名稱以識別此運算式。此名稱會顯示於"
"撥號計劃的 :guilabel:`調度器` 元素中，該撥號計劃會展示在 :guilabel:`撥號計劃"
"編輯器` 彈出視窗內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:196
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Regular expression` field, enter the country code, or area"
" code, which Axivox should route for incoming calls. This is especially "
"helpful when a company would like to filter their customers to certain "
"queues, or users based on the customer's geo-location."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`正規表示式` 欄位中，輸入 Axivox 應為來電進行路由的國家代碼或區"
"號。如公司希望根據客戶的地理位置，將客戶篩選並分配至特定佇列或使用者，此功能"
"會特別有用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:200
msgid ""
"To specify all numbers behind a certain country code, or area code, include "
"`\\d+` after the country code, or country code + area code."
msgstr ""
"如要指定某個國家代碼或區號之後的所有號碼，請在國家代碼（或國家代碼 + 區號）後"
"面加上 `\\d+`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:203
msgid ""
"Dispatcher configuration panel, with name, regular expression and add a line"
" highlighted."
msgstr "調度器設定面板，其中突出顯示了名稱、正規表達式及「新增資料行」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:208
msgid "`02\\\\d+`: validates the numbers starting with `02`"
msgstr "`02\\\\d+`：驗證以 `02` 開頭的號碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:209
msgid "`00\\\\d+`: validates all numbers beginning with `00`"
msgstr "`00\\\\d+`：驗證所有以 `00` 開頭的數字"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:210
msgid ""
"`0052\\\\d+` validates all numbers beginning with `0052` (Mexico country "
"code)"
msgstr "`0052\\\\d+` 會驗證所有以 `0052`（墨西哥國家代碼）開頭的號碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:211
msgid ""
"`001716\\\\d+`: validates all numbers beginning with `001716` (USA country "
"code + Western New York area code)"
msgstr "`001716\\\\d+`：驗證所有以 `001716` 開頭的號碼（美國國家代碼 + 紐約西部區號）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:215
msgid ""
"A regular expression (shortened to \"regex\" or \"regexp\"), sometimes "
"referred to as a \"rational expression,\" is a sequence of characters that "
"specifies a match pattern in text. In other words, a match is made within "
"the given range of numbers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:219
msgid ""
"When the desired configurations are complete on the :guilabel:`Dispatcher` "
"pop-up window, be sure to click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`分派器` 彈出視窗完成所需配置後，請緊記點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:222
msgid ""
"Upon doing so, the :guilabel:`Dispatcher` element appears with different "
"routes available to configure, based on the :guilabel:`Regular Expressions` "
"that were set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:225
msgid ""
"Attach these routes to any :guilabel:`New element` in the "
":guilabel:`Dialplan Editor` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"將這些路由附加至任何 :guilabel:`新元素`（位於 :guilabel:`撥號計劃編輯器` 彈出"
"視窗內）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:227
msgid ""
"By default, there is an :guilabel:`Unknown` path that appears on the "
":guilabel:`Dispatcher` element after setting at least one :guilabel:`Regular"
" Expression`."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，系統設有一條 :guilabel:`未知` 路徑顯示於 :guilabel:`分派器` 元素"
"上，只要設定至少一個 :guilabel:`正則表達式` 便會出現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:230
msgid ""
"Calls follow this route/path when their number does not match any "
":guilabel:`Regular Expression` set on the :guilabel:`Dispatcher` element."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:233
msgid "Dial plan with dispatcher element highlighted."
msgstr "已反白顯示分發器元素的撥號計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:238
msgid "Time condition scenario"
msgstr "時間條件情境"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:240
msgid ""
"When a :guilabel:`Time Condition` element is added to a dial plan, it has a "
"simple :guilabel:`True` and :guilabel:`False` routing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:243
msgid ""
"After adding the :guilabel:`Time Condition` element to a dial plan, double-"
"click it to configure the variables. :guilabel:`Hour/Minute`, "
":guilabel:`Days of the week`, :guilabel:`Day of the month`, and "
":guilabel:`Month` can all be configured."
msgstr ""
"將:guilabel:`時間條件`元素新增至撥號計劃後，連按兩下該元素以設定變數。可設定"
"的項目包括:guilabel:`小時/分鐘`、:guilabel:`星期幾`、:guilabel:`每月幾"
"號`及:guilabel:`月份`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:247
msgid ""
"If the time which the caller contacts the incoming number matches the set "
"time conditions, then the :guilabel:`True` path is followed, otherwise the "
":guilabel:`False` path is followed."
msgstr ""
"若來電者撥打來電號碼的時間符合設定的時間條件，系統會依循 :guilabel:`真` 路徑"
"執行；否則，會依循 :guilabel:`假` 路徑執行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:251
msgid ""
"For a company that is closed yearly for the American Independence Day "
"holiday (July 4th) the following time conditions should be set:"
msgstr "若公司每年於美國獨立日假期（7 月 4 日）休息，應設定以下時間條件："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:254
msgid ":guilabel:`Hour/Minute` - `0:0 to 23:59`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:255
msgid ":guilabel:`Day of the week` - `All to All`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:256
msgid ":guilabel:`Day of the month` - `From 4 to 4`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`每月日期` - `由 4 至 4`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:257
msgid ":guilabel:`Month` - `July`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`月份` - `七月`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:259
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Time Condition` element is especially useful for holidays, "
"weekends, and to set working hours. When a caller reaches a destination "
"where they can be helped, either with a real person or voicemail, this "
"reduces wasted time and hangups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:263
msgid ""
"Time condition element set in a dial plan on Axivox. Time condition is "
"highlighted."
msgstr "Axivox 撥號計劃中設定的時間條件元素。時間條件已反白顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:268
msgid ""
"To set the :guilabel:`Timezone` that the :guilabel:`Time Condition` operates"
" under, navigate to `Axivox management console "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_, and click :guilabel:`Settings` in the menu on"
" the left. Then, set the :guilabel:`Timezone` using the second field from "
"the bottom, by clicking the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"若要設定:guilabel:`時區`（即:guilabel:`時間條件`運作時所依據的時區），請前往 "
"`Axivox 管理控制台 <https://manage.axivox.com>`_，並在左側選單中點"
"擊:guilabel:`設定`。然後，點擊下拉式選單，透過倒數第二個欄位設定:guilabel:`時"
"區`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:274
msgid "Access list scenario"
msgstr "存取清單情境"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:276
msgid ""
"An *Access List* element in a dial plan allows for the routing of certain "
"numbers, and disallows (denies) other numbers."
msgstr "撥號計劃中的 *存取清單* 元素允許路由特定號碼，並禁止（拒絕）其他號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:279
msgid ""
"After adding an :guilabel:`Access List` element to a dial plan, it can be "
"configured by double-clicking on the element directly in the "
":guilabel:`Dialplan Editor` pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:282
msgid ""
"Two fields appear where regular expressions can based in the "
":guilabel:`Allow` and :guilabel:`Deny` fields of the :guilabel:`Access List`"
" pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:286
msgid ""
"For a very important customer, their number can be set in the "
":guilabel:`Allow` field, and these callers can be sent directly to "
"management."
msgstr ""
"對於非常重要的客戶，可將其電話號碼設定在 :guilabel:`允許` 欄位中，這些來電者"
"便可直接轉接至管理層。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:290
msgid ""
"A regular expression (shortened to \"regex\" or \"regexp\"), sometimes also "
"referred to as a \"rational expression,\" is a sequence of characters that "
"specifies a match pattern in text."
msgstr ""
"正規表示式（簡稱「regex」或「regexp」，有時亦稱為「理性表示式」）是一組字元序"
"列，用於指定文字中的比對模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:293
msgid ""
"Access list element configuration with the allow/deny fields highlighted."
msgstr "存取清單項目設定，當中已醒目提示允許/拒絕欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:298
msgid "`2\\\\d\\\\d`: validates numbers from `200 to 299`"
msgstr "`2\\\\d\\\\d`：驗證由 `200 至 299` 的號碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:299
msgid "`02\\\\d*`: validates all numbers beginning with `02`"
msgstr "`02\\\\d*`：驗證所有以 `02` 開頭的號碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:300
msgid "`0017165551212`: validates the number (`0017165551212`)"
msgstr "`0017165551212`：驗證該號碼（`0017165551212`）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:302
msgid ""
"After setting the :guilabel:`Allow` and :guilabel:`Deny` fields with regular"
" expressions or numbers, click :guilabel:`Save` on the :guilabel:`Access "
"List` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"使用正規表達式或數字設定 :guilabel:`允許` 及 :guilabel:`拒絕` 欄位後，點擊 "
":guilabel:`儲存`（在 :guilabel:`存取清單` 彈出視窗上）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:305
msgid ""
"Then, on the :guilabel:`Access list` element in the dial plan, three paths "
"(or routes) are available to link to further actions."
msgstr ""
"然後，在撥號計劃中的 :guilabel:`存取清單` 元素上，有三個路徑（或路由）可用於"
"連結至進一步動作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:308
msgid ""
"Unknown calls can be routed through the regular menu flow by adding a "
":guilabel:`Menu` element, and connecting it to the :guilabel:`Unknown` path."
" :guilabel:`Refused` calls can be routed to the :guilabel:`Hang up` element."
" Lastly, :guilabel:`Authorized` callers can be sent to a specific extension "
"or queue."
msgstr ""
"未知來電可透過加入:guilabel:`選單`元素，並將其連接至:guilabel:`未知`路徑，以"
"經由一般選單流程進行轉接。:guilabel:`已拒絕`的來電可轉接至:guilabel:`掛斷`元"
"素。最後，:guilabel:`已授權`的來電者可轉送至特定分機或通話佇列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:313
msgid "Access list element highlighted in an example dial plan."
msgstr "撥號計劃範例中反白顯示的存取清單項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:318
msgid "Switches"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:320
msgid ""
"A *Switch* element in Axivox is a simple activated/deactivated route action."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:322
msgid ""
"These can be activated or chosen quickly, allowing for quick routing "
"changes, without altering the dial plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:325
msgid ""
"Alternate routes can be configured, so that in a moments notice, they can be"
" switched to. This could be for new availability, or to adjust traffic flow "
"for any number of reasons."
msgstr ""
"系統可設定備用路線，以便隨時即時切換使用。這可用於配合新近開放的路線資源，或"
"因應各種原因調整流量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:328
msgid ""
"Axivox allows for a simple on/off switch, and a multi-switch, which can have"
" several paths to choose from."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:331
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Switch`: a manual on/off control that can divert traffic, based "
"on whether it is opened (on) or closed (off)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`開關`：一種手動開／關控制項，可根據其開啟（on）或關閉（off）狀態來"
"分流流量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:333
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Multi-Switch`: a mechanism to create paths, and turn them on and "
"off, to divert incoming calls."
msgstr ":guilabel:`多重開關`：建立路徑並將其開啟或關閉，以轉接來電的機制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:337
msgid "Basic switch"
msgstr "基本開關"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:339
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Switch` can be set in the `Axivox management console "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_ by navigating to :guilabel:`Switches` in the "
"left menu. To create a new switch click :guilabel:`Add a switch` from the "
":guilabel:`Switches` dashboard, configure a :guilabel:`Name` for it, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"若要設定 :guilabel:`開關`，可前往 `Axivox 管理主控台 <https://"
"manage.axivox.com>`_，並在左側選單導覽至 :guilabel:`開關`。如要建立新開關，請"
"按一下 :guilabel:`新增開關`（位於 :guilabel:`開關` 儀表板），為其設定 "
":guilabel:`名稱`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:344
msgid ""
"Then, toggle the desired switch to either :guilabel:`On` or :guilabel:`Off`,"
" from the :guilabel:`State` column on the :guilabel:`Switches` dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:347
msgid ""
"This :guilabel:`On` / :guilabel:`Off` state automatically routes traffic in "
"a dial plan, in which this switch is set."
msgstr ""
"此 :guilabel:`開啟` / :guilabel:`關閉` 狀態會在設有此開關的撥號計劃中自動路由"
"流量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:350
msgid ""
"The traffic travels to the :guilabel:`Active` route when :guilabel:`On` is "
"toggled in the switch. The call traffic travels to the :guilabel:`Inactive` "
"route when :guilabel:`Off` is toggled in the switch."
msgstr ""
"流量會經由:guilabel:`啟用`路線傳送（即開關設為:guilabel:`開啟`時）；通話流量"
"則會經由:guilabel:`停用`路線傳送（即開關設為:guilabel:`關閉`時）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:354
msgid ""
"Changes can be made on the fly, just be sure to click :guilabel:`Apply "
"changes` to implement the them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:358
msgid "Add a switch to dial plan"
msgstr "在撥號計劃中新增開關"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:360
msgid ""
"To add a :guilabel:`Switch` to a dial plan, navigate to `Axivox management "
"console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_, and click on :guilabel:`Dial plans` "
"in the left menu. Then, click :guilabel:`Visual Editor` next to the desired "
"dial plan to open the :guilabel:`Dialplan Editor` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"要在撥號計劃中加入:guilabel:`切換`，請前往 `Axivox 管理控制台 <https://"
"manage.axivox.com>`_，並在左側選單點擊:guilabel:`撥號計劃`。然後，在目標撥號"
"計劃旁點擊:guilabel:`視覺化編輯器`，以開啟:guilabel:`撥號計劃編輯器`彈出式視"
"窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:365
msgid ""
"Then, from the :guilabel:`New element` drop-down menu, select "
":guilabel:`Switch`, and then click :guilabel:`Add`. Double-click on the "
"element to further configure the :guilabel:`Switch` element."
msgstr ""
"然後，從 :guilabel:`新增元素` 下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`切換`，再按 "
":guilabel:`新增`。按兩下該元素即可進一步配置 :guilabel:`切換` 元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:368
msgid ""
"Switch configuration in a dial plan, with inactive and active routes "
"highlighted."
msgstr "撥號計劃中的切換設定，其中已標示停用及啟用的路由。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:373
msgid "Multi-switch"
msgstr "多重開關"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:375
msgid ""
"A *Multi-Switch* element in Axivox is a switch where multiple paths can be "
"configured, and switched between."
msgstr ""
"Axivox 中的 *Multi-Switch* 元素是一種切換開關，可設定多個路徑並在它們之間進行"
"切換。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:378
msgid ""
"To configure and set a :guilabel:`Multi-Switch` element, navigate to `Axivox"
" management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_. Then, click on the "
":guilabel:`Switches` menu item in the left menu."
msgstr ""
"如要配置及設定 :guilabel:`多重開關` 元素，請前往 `Axivox 管理控制台 <https://"
"manage.axivox.com>`_。然後，在左側選單中點擊 :guilabel:`開關` 選單項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:381
msgid ""
"Toggle to the :guilabel:`Multi-switch` tab to create, or set, a pre-"
"configured :guilabel:`Multi-Switch` element."
msgstr ""
"切換至 :guilabel:`多重切換` 分頁，以建立或設定預先配置好的 :guilabel:`多重切"
"換` 元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:384
msgid ""
"To create a new :guilabel:`Multi-Switch`, click :guilabel:`Create new`. "
"Then, enter a :guilabel:`Name` for the element, and then enter the "
":guilabel:`Available choice`. Enter one :guilabel:`Available choice` per "
"line. Do **not** duplicate any entries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:388
msgid "Remember to click :guilabel:`Save` when done."
msgstr "完成後記得按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:390
msgid ""
"To select the :guilabel:`State` of the :guilabel:`Multi-Switch`, click the "
"drop-down menu next to the :guilabel:`Multi-Switch` name, under the "
":guilabel:`Multi-switch` tab on the :guilabel:`Switches` dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:394
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`State` chosen is the route that is followed in the dial plan."
" The :guilabel:`State` can be edited on the fly, just be sure to click "
":guilabel:`Apply changes`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:398
msgid "Add a multi-switch to dial plan"
msgstr "為撥號計劃新增多重切換"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:400
msgid ""
"To add a :guilabel:`Multi-Switch` element to a dial plan, navigate to "
"`Axivox management console <https://manage.axivox.com>`_, and click "
":guilabel:`Dial plans` in the left menu."
msgstr ""
"如要在撥號計劃新增 :guilabel:`多重切換` 元素，請前往 `Axivox 管理主控台 "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_ ，並在左側選單點擊 :guilabel:`撥號計劃` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:403
msgid ""
"Then, select or create a dial plan. Next, click :guilabel:`Visual Editor` on"
" the desired dial plan."
msgstr ""
"然後，選擇或建立撥號計劃。接著，在所需的撥號計劃上按一下 :guilabel:`視覺化編"
"輯器`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:405
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Dialplan Editor` pop-up window that appears, click on the "
":guilabel:`New element` drop-down menu, and select :guilabel:`Multi-Switch`."
" Then, click :guilabel:`Add`. Double-click on the element to further "
"configure the :guilabel:`Switch` element."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_advanced.rst:409
msgid ""
"Multi-switch configuration in a dial plan, with chosen route highlighted."
msgstr "撥號計劃中的多交換器配置，並突顯所選路由。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:3
msgid "Dial plan basics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:5
msgid ""
"When someone calls a business, they might need to get in contact with "
"customer support, a sales team, or even a person's direct line. The caller "
"might also be in search of some information about the business, such as "
"store hours. Or, they might want to leave a voicemail, so someone from the "
"company can call them back. With dial plans in Axivox, a company can manage "
"how incoming calls like this are handled."
msgstr ""
"致電企業時，來電者可能需要聯絡客戶支援、銷售團隊，甚至是特定員工的直線電話。"
"來電者亦可能想查詢營業時間等公司資訊，或留下語音信箱以便公司人員回電。透過 "
"Axivox 的撥號計劃，企業可管理如何處理這類來電。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:11
msgid ""
"Using proper call architecture through a dial plan, callers get directed to "
"the right people, or to the right information, in a quick, efficient manner."
msgstr ""
"透過撥號計劃建立妥善的通話架構，來電者可快速且有效地被轉接至合適的人員或取得"
"正確資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:14
msgid "This document covers the basic configuration of dial plans in Axivox."
msgstr "本文件說明 Axivox 撥號計劃的基本設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:17
msgid ""
"For more information on advanced dial plans, visit "
":doc:`dial_plan_advanced`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:20
msgid ""
"Using a browser add-on for spelling may hinder the use of the visual editor "
"in dial plans. Do not use a translator with the Axivox management console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:26
msgid "Dial plans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:28
msgid ""
"Access dial plans by navigating to `Axivox management console "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_, and clicking on :guilabel:`Dial plans` from "
"the menu on the left."
msgstr ""
"前往 `Axivox 管理控制台 <https://manage.axivox.com>`_，然後在左側選單中按一"
"下 :guilabel:`撥號計劃`，即可存取撥號計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:31
msgid ""
"To add a new dial plan from the :guilabel:`Dial plan` page, click the green "
"button labeled, :guilabel:`Add a new dial plan`."
msgstr ""
"若要在:guilabel:`撥號計劃`頁面新增撥號計劃，請點擊標示為:guilabel:`新增撥號計"
"劃`的綠色按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:35
msgid ""
"Axivox has no limit to the number of dial plans that can be created. These "
"can be added, and improved upon, at any time. This allows for sandboxes to "
"be created with many different configurations."
msgstr ""
"Axivox 沒有限制可建立的撥號計劃數量，您可隨時新增及優化撥號計劃，從而建立採用"
"各種不同配置的沙盒環境。"

