"desired element."
msgstr "將 :guilabel:`（箭頭）` 圖示連接至所需元素左側的圓圈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:93
msgid ""
"Calls displayed in the dial plan flow from left-to-right in the element."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:95
msgid ""
