" element inside the dial plan, to reveal a subsequent pop-up window, wherein"
" additional customizations can be entered."
msgstr ""
"要進一步設定:guilabel:`新元素`，請雙擊撥號計劃中的該元素，開啟隨後的彈出視窗"
"，在當中輸入更多自訂設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:98
msgid ""
"Each element has a different configuration pop-up window that appears when "
"double-clicked."
msgstr "雙擊每個元素時，都會顯示各自不同的設定彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:101
msgid ""
"All elements **must** have a final destination in the dial plan in order to "
"close a loop. This can be accomplished by implementing the :guilabel:`Hang "
"up` element, or looping the element back to a :guilabel:`Menu` element or "
":guilabel:`Digital Receptionist` element elsewhere in the dial plan."
msgstr ""
"在撥號計劃中，所有元素都 **必須** 有最終目的地，以形成閉環。您可以透過加入 "
":guilabel:`掛斷` 元素，或將該元素迴圈連接至撥號計劃中其他位置的 :guilabel:`選"
"單` 元素或 :guilabel:`數碼接待員` 元素來實現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:106
msgid ""
"Dial plan, shown with highlight looping open end back to the beginning of the menu\n"
"element."
msgstr ""
"撥號計劃，圖中以重點標示從開放末端循環返回選單\n"
"元素的開頭。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/dial_plan_basics.rst:111
msgid ""
