"remember to click :guilabel:`Save` before exiting the :guilabel:`Dialplan "
"Editor` pop-up window. Then, click :guilabel:`Apply changes` on the "
":guilabel:`Dial plans` page to ensure they are implemented into Axivox "
"production."
msgstr ""

