"Then, add a member to the group by typing the first few letters of the "
"user's name into the :guilabel:`Members` field. The user populates in a "
"drop-down menu below the field. Then, click on the desired user, and they "
"are added to the user group."
msgstr ""
"接著，在 :guilabel:`名稱` 欄位輸入文字，為群組命名。然後，在 :guilabel:`成"
"員` 欄位輸入用戶名稱開首的幾個字母，以將成員加入群組。該用戶會顯示於欄位下方"
"的下拉式選單中。點擊所需用戶，即可將其加入用戶群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/manage_users.rst:343
msgid "Repeat this process to add more users to the group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:3
msgid "Voicemails and audio messages"
msgstr "語音信箱及音訊訊息"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:7
msgid ""
"Managing voicemail is an important part of any business. A company needs to "
"access their messages with ease, and stay on top of any missed calls. "
"Recording audio messages, like thanking a caller for reaching out, or "
"directing them to the right extension, is also a great way to personalize "
"the business interaction, and set the tone with the customer."
msgstr ""
"管理語音信箱是任何業務的重要一環。公司需要輕鬆存取留言，並緊貼所有未接來電。"
"錄製音訊訊息（例如感謝致電者聯絡，或將其轉駁至正確分機），亦是讓商務互動更個"
"人化並與客戶建立良好基調的絕佳方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:12
msgid ""
"This document covers the configuration of both voicemail and audio messages "
"in the Axivox administrative portal."
msgstr "本文件說明如何在 Axivox 管理員入口網站中設定語音信箱及音訊訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:18
msgid "Set global language"
msgstr "設定全域語言"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:20
msgid ""
"To start using voicemails and audio messages with Axivox, the global "
"language should be set in the Axivox admin portal settings. To do that, "
"navigate to `manage.axivox.com <axivox_admin_>`_. After logging into the "
"portal, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Global language (e.g.: voicemail "
"messages,...)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:25
msgid ""
"From here, set the language to either: :guilabel:`Francais`, "
":guilabel:`English`, :guilabel:`Espanol`, or :guilabel:`Deutsch`."
msgstr ""
"在此處，將語言設為：:guilabel:`法文`、:guilabel:`英文`、:guilabel:`西班牙文` "
"或 :guilabel:`德文`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:28
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Save`, followed by :guilabel:`Apply changes` in the "
"upper-right corner of the :guilabel:`General Settings` page to implement the"
" change into production."
msgstr ""
"然後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`，接著點擊 :guilabel:`套用變更`（位於 "
":guilabel:`一般設定` 頁面右上角），將變更套用至正式環境。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:34
msgid "Activate voicemail"
msgstr "啟用語音信箱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:36
msgid ""
"In order for a user to utilize voicemail in Axivox, the voicemail feature "
"**must** be turned on in the Axivox administrative portal. To begin using "
"voicemail with a user, navigate to `manage.axivox.com <axivox_admin_>`_. "
"Then, log in with the appropriate administrator credentials."
msgstr ""
"用戶要在 Axivox 使用語音信箱，就 **必須** 在 Axivox 管理門戶網站中開啟語音信"
"箱功能。要開始為用戶使用語音信箱，請前往 `manage.axivox.com <axivox_admin_>"
"`_，然後使用適當的管理員憑證登入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:40
msgid ""
"On the left menu of the Axivox administrative panel, click into "
":guilabel:`Users`."
msgstr "在 Axivox 管理面板的左側選單中，點選進入:guilabel:`用戶`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:42
msgid ""
"Then, click into the specific user the voicemail should be activated for. "
"Under the section marked, :guilabel:`Voicemail`, open the drop-down menu, "
"and click on :guilabel:`Yes`."
msgstr ""
"然後，點擊要啟用留言信箱的特定用戶。在標示為 :guilabel:`留言信箱` 的部分下，"
"開啟下拉式選單，然後點擊 :guilabel:`是`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:45
msgid ""
"Lastly, :guilabel:`Save` the change, then click :guilabel:`Apply changes` in"
" the upper-right corner of the screen."
msgstr "最後，:guilabel:`儲存` 變更，然後按一下畫面右上角的 :guilabel:`套用變更`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:49
msgid "Voicemail"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:51
msgid ""
"The next step is to set up the individual voicemail boxes on the Axivox "
"administrative portal. To access the portal, visit `manage.axivox.com "
"<axivox_admin_>`_ and log in. Then, navigate to :menuselection:`Voicemails`,"
" located in the menu on the left."
msgstr ""
"下一步是在 Axivox 管理員入口網站設定個別語音信箱。請前往 `manage.axivox.com "
"<axivox_admin_>`_ 登入，然後前往左側選單中的 :menuselection:`語音信箱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:55
msgid ""
"If the voicemail option was activated in the user profile, using this "
"process :ref:`voip/axivox/activate_voicemail`, then a voicemail is "
"automatically created on the :guilabel:`Voicemails` page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:60
msgid ""
"It should be noted that some of the administrative portal language is in "
"French, as Axivox is a Belgian company. The global language is still set to "
"one of the four options as seen here: :ref:`voip/axivox/global_language`."
msgstr ""
"請注意，由於 Axivox 是比利時公司，部分管理入口網站介面仍為法語。不過，全域語"
"言仍會設為此處所示的四個選項之一：:ref:`voip/axivox/global_language`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:65
msgid "Manually create voicemail"
msgstr "手動建立語音信箱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:67
msgid ""
"To manually create a new voicemail box, click :guilabel:`Add a voicemail` on"
" the :guilabel:`Voicemails` page. Or, edit an existing voicemail box, by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Edit` to the far-right of an existing voicemail box on "
"the :guilabel:`Voicemails` page."
msgstr ""
"要手動建立新的語音信箱，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增語音信箱`（位於 :guilabel:`語音"
"信箱` 頁面）。您亦可編輯現有的語音信箱：點擊 :guilabel:`編輯`（位於 "
":guilabel:`語音信箱` 頁面中現有語音信箱的最右側）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:72
msgid ""
"Suppose a sales or support team needs a general voicemail box. The voicemail"
" would need to be created manually, and attached to an incoming number."
msgstr ""
"假設銷售或支援團隊需要一個通用語音信箱，便須手動建立該語音信箱，並將其關聯至"
"來電號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:75
msgid ""
"The new, manually-created voicemail box should be attached to an incoming "
"number, so it can receive messages. To do so, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Incoming numbers`, located in the menu on the left. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Edit` to the far-right of the specific number the voicemail"
" should be linked to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:80
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Destination type for voice call` field, click the drop-"
"down menu, and select :guilabel:`Voicemail`. Then, open the drop-down menu "
"on the next line labeled, :guilabel:`Voicemail`, and select the manually-"
"created voicemail box."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:85
msgid ""
"If an incoming number is capable of receiving SMS/text messages, an "
"additional field, :guilabel:`Destination email address for Incoming SMS`, is"
" present."
msgstr ""
"如果來電號碼支援接收短訊 / 文字訊息，則會顯示額外的 :guilabel:`接收短訊的目標"
"電郵地址` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:88
msgid ""
"To determine whether an incoming number is capable of receiving SMS/text "
"messages, click :guilabel:`Incoming numbers` from the menu on the left, then"
" check the :guilabel:`SMS compatible` column for the incoming number."
msgstr ""
"若要確認來電號碼能否接收 SMS／文字短訊，請在左側選單按一下:guilabel:`來電號"
"碼`，然後查看該來電號碼的:guilabel:`支援 SMS` 欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:92
msgid ""
"Then, if applicable, in the field labeled, :guilabel:`Destination email "
"address for Incoming SMS`, enter an email to which incoming text messages "
"sent to the incoming number can be received. Some incoming numbers (US +1) "
"in Axivox are capable of receiving text messages from individuals and "
"automated numbers."
msgstr ""
"然後（如適用），在名為 :guilabel:`接收來電短訊的目標電郵地址` 的欄位中，輸入"
"一個電郵地址，用於接收發送至來電號碼的短訊。Axivox 中的部分來電號碼（美國 +1"
"）可接收來自個人及自動系統號碼的短訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:97
msgid ""
"Should this field be left empty, the default destination address is used, "
"instead (as previously set in the beginning of the process for manually "
"creating a voicemail)."
msgstr ""
"若此欄位留空，系統將改用預設目的地地址（即早前在手動建立語音信箱流程開始時所"
"設定的地址）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:100
msgid ""
"Once all desired configurations are complete, click :guilabel:`Save`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Apply changes` in the upper-right corner of the screen to "
"implement the change into production."
msgstr ""
"完成所有所需設定後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`，然後點擊畫面右上角的 :guilabel:`套"
"用變更`，將變更部署至正式環境。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:104
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:866
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:106
msgid ""
"Now, whenever a voicemail is received on any of the automatically pre-"
"configured or manually-linked voicemail boxes, an email is sent to the "
"user's email address, as listed in the :guilabel:`Voicemails` page, or in "
"the user's Axivox profile."
msgstr ""
"現在，每當任何自動預先設定或手動連結的語音信箱收到語音留言時，系統便會將電郵"
"傳送至使用者的電郵地址（即 :guilabel:`語音留言` 頁面或使用者 Axivox 個人資料"
"中列出的地址）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:110
msgid ""
"This information can be accessed by navigating to :menuselection:`Users` in "
"the left menu, and clicking :guilabel:`Edit` next to the specific user in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"在左側選單中前往 :menuselection:`用戶`，然後點擊特定用戶旁邊的 :guilabel:`編"
"輯`，即可存取此資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:116
msgid "Forwarding to voicemail"
msgstr "轉駁至語音信箱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:118
msgid ""
"In Axivox, there are also numerous forwarding settings for a user. To access"
" these forwarding settings, go to `manage.axivox.com <axivox_admin_>`_ and "
"log in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:121
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to :menuselection:`Users`, located in the menu on the left."
msgstr "接下來，前往位於左側選單的 :menuselection:`用戶`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:123
msgid ""
"From there, click into the specific user the forwarding should be added to. "
"Then, open the :guilabel:`Forwardings` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:126
msgid ""
"If the user is busy on another call, or away from the phone, there is an "
"option present in this tab to :guilabel:`Send to voicemail as a last "
"resort`, located in the :guilabel:`Forwarding on no answer` and "
":guilabel:`Forwarding on busy` fields."
msgstr ""
"如果用戶正在通話中或不在電話旁，此分頁提供 :guilabel:`作為最後手段傳送至語音"
"信箱` 選項，位於 :guilabel:`無人接聽時轉駁` 及 :guilabel:`忙線時轉駁` 欄位中"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:130
msgid ""
"Send to voicemail as a last resort options highlighted on the Forwardings "
"tab of the user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:134
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Send to voicemail as a last resort` box is ticked, when "
"the forwarding actions stated in each section are not successful, the caller"
" is routed to the voicemail set on the particular user."
msgstr ""
"如果勾選了:guilabel:`作為最後手段傳送至語音信箱`核取方塊，當各部分所述的轉接"
"動作未能成功時，來電者將會轉接至該特定使用者所設定的語音信箱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:139
msgid ""
"For more information on forwarding and transfers, visit "
":ref:`voip/axivox/forwardings_tab`."
msgstr "有關轉駁及轉接的更多資料，請瀏覽 :ref:`voip/axivox/forwardings_tab`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:141
msgid ""
"When all the desired configurations are complete, click :guilabel:`Save`, "
"then click :guilabel:`Apply changes` in the upper-right corner of the screen"
" to implement the change."
msgstr ""
"完成所有所需設定後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`，然後點擊畫面右上角的 :guilabel:`套"
"用變更` 以套用更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:147
msgid "Audio messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:149
msgid ""
"It is possible to add audio messages *before* a customer's call is even "
"taken, to inform them about the waiting time for deliveries, the "
"availability of a product, or any other important promotional messages."
msgstr ""
"系統可設定在接聽客戶來電 *之前* 播放語音訊息，以通知客戶送貨輪候時間、產品供"
"應情況或其他重要推廣訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:153
msgid ""
"To record an audio message in Axivox, navigate to `manage.axivox.com "
"<axivox_admin_>`_ and log in."
msgstr ""
"要在 Axivox 中錄製語音訊息，請前往 `manage.axivox.com <axivox_admin_>`_ 並登"
"入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:155
msgid ""
"Next, click on :guilabel:`Audio messages` in the menu on the left. From the "
":guilabel:`Audio messages` page, click :guilabel:`Add a message`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:158
msgid "Type in a :guilabel:`Name`, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "輸入 :guilabel:`名稱`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:160
msgid ""
"Upon clicking :guilabel:`Save`, the browser redirects back to the main "
":guilabel:`Audio messages` page, where the newly-created message can be "
"found on the list."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`儲存` 後，瀏覽器會重新導向回主要的 :guilabel:`音訊訊息` 頁面"
"，你可以在列表中找到新建的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:163
msgid ""
"There are two different ways to make the audio message. The user could "
"either record the message over the phone, or type the message (in text), and"
" select a computer-generated speaker to read the message."
msgstr ""
"製作語音訊息有兩種方法。用戶可以透過電話錄製訊息，或輸入文字訊息，並選擇電腦"
"生成的語音來讀出訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:168
msgid "Record audio message"
msgstr "錄製語音訊息"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:170
msgid ""
"To record an audio message over the phone, click the orange button labeled, "
":guilabel:`Record/Listen`, located to the right of the desired message on "
"the list to record, on the :guilabel:`Audio messages` page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:174
msgid ""
"When clicked, a :guilabel:`Record / listen to a message` pop-up window "
"appears. From here, the message is then recorded, via one of the extensions "
"that is associated with the user. Under :guilabel:`Extension to use for "
"message management` field, click the drop-down menu, and select the "
"extension where Axivox should call to record the message."
msgstr ""
"點擊後，會出現 :guilabel:`錄製／聆聽訊息` 彈出視窗。你可在此透過與用戶關聯的"
"其中一個分機錄製訊息。在 :guilabel:`用於訊息管理的分機` 欄位下，點擊下拉式選"
"單，並選擇 Axivox 應致電以錄製訊息的分機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:179
msgid "Then, click :guilabel:`OK` to begin the call."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:182
msgid ""
"The user **must** be active in the production database with :abbr:`VoIP "
"(Voice over Internet Protocol)` configured. To configure :abbr:`VoIP (Voice "
"over Internet Protocol)` for a user, see this documentation: "
":doc:`axivox_config`."
msgstr ""
"用戶 **必須** 在正式資料庫中為啟用狀態，並已設定 :abbr:`VoIP (網絡語音傳輸協"
"定)`。如要為用戶設定 :abbr:`VoIP (網絡語音傳輸協定)`，請參閱此文件"
"：:doc:`axivox_config`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:186
msgid ""
"Upon connecting to the Axivox audio recorder management line, a recorded "
"French-speaking operator provides the following options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:189
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:199
msgid "Press `1` to record a message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:190
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:200
msgid "Press `2` to listen to the current message."
msgstr "按 `2` 收聽目前訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:192
msgid ""
"Press either `1` or `2`, depending on whether or not there is already a "
"message present in the system for this particular audio message that "
"requires a review, before recording a new one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:195
msgid ""
"Record the new audio message after pressing `1`, then press `#` to end the "
"recording."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:197
msgid ""
"The French-speaking operator returns to the line presenting the first set of"
" questions again:"
msgstr "法語接線員再次返回顯示第一組問題的線路："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:202
msgid "Press `#` to end the call."
msgstr "按 `#` 結束通話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:205
msgid "Write audio message"
msgstr "撰寫語音訊息"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:207
msgid ""
"To type the message, and select a computerized speaker to say the text, "
"navigate to the :menuselection:`Audio messages` in the menu on the left."
msgstr ""
"要輸入訊息並選擇電腦語音讀出文字，請前往左側選單的 :menuselection:`語音訊"
"息`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:210
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Audio messages` page, select the blue button labeled, "
":guilabel:`Text message`, next to the corresponding audio message "
":guilabel:`Name` that the message should be attached to."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`音訊訊息` 頁面中，選擇標示為 :guilabel:`文字訊息` 的藍色按鈕，"
"該按鈕位於要附加訊息的相應音訊訊息 :guilabel:`名稱` 旁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:213
msgid "Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Convert text to message` pop-up window."
msgstr "這樣做會顯示 :guilabel:`將文字轉換為訊息` 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:215
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Convert to text message` pop-up window, click the drop-"
"down menu next to the field labeled, :guilabel:`Voice`, and select an option"
" for the :guilabel:`Text` to be read in."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`轉換為文字訊息`彈出式視窗中，按一下標示為:guilabel:`語音`欄位旁"
"邊的下拉式選單，然後選取用於朗讀:guilabel:`文字`的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:218
msgid ""
"After the :guilabel:`Voice` selection has been made, and the message has "
"been written in the :guilabel:`Text` field, click :guilabel:`Generate` to "
"process the audio file."
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`語音` 並在 :guilabel:`文字` 欄位輸入訊息後，按一下 "
":guilabel:`生成` 以處理音訊檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:221
msgid ""
"The text is read in the same language it is written in the :guilabel:`Text` "
"field. Should the language differ in the :guilabel:`Voice` field, then an "
"accent is used by the computerized speaker."
msgstr ""
"系統會以 :guilabel:`文字` 欄位所填寫的語言朗讀該段文字。如果 :guilabel:`語"
"音` 欄位的語言與之不同，電腦語音便會帶有所選語言的口音。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:224
msgid ""
"Finally, when these steps are complete, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the "
"audio message."
msgstr "最後，完成上述步驟後，按一下:guilabel:`儲存`以儲存語音訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:226
msgid ""
"To implement the changes, click :guilabel:`Apply changes` in the upper-right"
" corner of the screen."
msgstr "要實施變更，請點擊畫面右上角的 :guilabel:`套用變更`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:228
msgid ""
"Convert text to message window with voice, text, generate button and save "
"highlighted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:233
msgid ""
"To set a greeting or audio message in a dial plan element double-click on "
"the element. This could be a :guilabel:`Play a file` element, or a "
":guilabel:`Menu` element, in which the caller should encounter an urgent "
"message, or a dial-by-number directory."
msgstr ""
"要在撥號計劃元素中設定問候語或音訊訊息，請按兩下該元素。這可以是 "
":guilabel:`播放檔案` 元素，或是 :guilabel:`選單` 元素（致電者會在其中聽到緊急"
"訊息或按號碼撥號目錄）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:237
msgid ""
"For more information on dial plans see this documentation: "
":doc:`dial_plan_basics` or :doc:`dial_plan_advanced`."
msgstr ""
"有關撥號計劃的更多資訊，請參閱此文件：:doc:`dial_plan_basics` 或 "
":doc:`dial_plan_advanced`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:243
msgid "Music on-hold"
msgstr "等候音樂"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:245
msgid ""
"Axivox has the option to add custom hold music to the call whenever a caller"
" is waiting for their call to be answered. To add hold music to the Axivox "
"administrative portal, navigate to the `manage.axivox.com <axivox_admin_>`_,"
" and log in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:249
msgid ""
"Then, click on :guilabel:`Music on hold` from the menu on the left, and a "
":guilabel:`Change the music on hold` pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:252
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Change the music on hold` pop-up window, click the "
":guilabel:`Choose File` button to select an MP3 (MPEG Audio Layer 3) or WAV "
"(Waveform Audio File Format ) file to be uploaded."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`更改等候音樂` 彈出視窗中，點擊 :guilabel:`選擇檔案` 按鈕，選取"
"要上載的 MP3（MPEG Audio Layer 3）或 WAV（Waveform Audio File Format）檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:256
msgid ""
"Only :abbr:`MP3 (MPEG Audio Layer 3)` or :abbr:`WAV (Waveform Audio File "
"Format)` files can be uploaded to the Axivox administrative portal."
msgstr ""
"僅可將 :abbr:`MP3 (MPEG Audio Layer 3)` 或 :abbr:`WAV (Waveform Audio File "
"Format)` 檔案上載至 Axivox 管理員入口網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:259
msgid ""
"Once the file is selected, the :guilabel:`Progression` bar shows an upload "
"status. When this activity completes, the window can be closed, by clicking "
":guilabel:`Close`."
msgstr ""
"選擇檔案後，:guilabel:`進度` 欄會顯示上載狀態。完成後，您可按一下 "
":guilabel:`關閉` 以關閉視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/vm_audio_messages.rst:262
msgid ""
"When the desired changes are complete, click :guilabel:`Apply changes` in "
"the upper-right corner of the screen."
msgstr "完成所需變更後，點擊畫面右上角的 :guilabel:`套用變更`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Call flows route inbound calls to the appropriate users, groups, queues, "
"menus, voicemail, or external numbers. This page covers the configuration "
"required, the nodes available in the call flow builder, and the process of "
"designing a flow."
msgstr ""
"通話流程會將來電轉接至合適的使用者、群組、佇列、選單、語音信箱或外部號碼。本"
"頁面涵蓋所需的設定、通話流程建立器中可用的節點，以及設計流程的步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:12
msgid ""
"A *call flow* determines what happens to an inbound call when it reaches an "
"Odoo phone number: who it rings, which menu it plays, and where it goes if "
"nobody answers. The **Phone** app provides a *call flow builder* to design "
"call routes as a diagram of nodes."
msgstr ""
"*通話流程*決定來電到達 Odoo 電話號碼後的處理方式：響鈴通知哪位接聽人、播放哪"
"個選單，以及無人接聽時的轉接去向。**電話**應用程式提供*通話流程建立工具*，讓"
"您透過節點圖表設計通話路線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:16
msgid ""
"This documentation covers the :ref:`configuration "
"<phone/call_flows/configuration>` required to use call flows, the "
":ref:`nodes <phone/call_flows/nodes>` available in the *call flow builder*, "
"and the :ref:`process <phone/call_flows/design>` of designing a call flow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:25
msgid ""
"Call flows require at least one phone number purchased through the Odoo "
"Phone Service. To purchase a number, go to :menuselection:`Phone app --> "
"Phone Numbers --> Phone Numbers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:28
msgid ""
"The following resources can be attached to a call flow, and are managed "
"under :menuselection:`Configuration`:"
msgstr "以下資源可附加至通話流程，並可在 :menuselection:`配置` 下管理："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extensions`: Internal numbers used to reach an Odoo Phone user "
"directly."
msgstr ":guilabel:`分機`：用於直接聯絡 Odoo 電話用戶的內部號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Conditions`: Business hour schedules used to route calls "
"differently when the business is open or closed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:34
msgid ":guilabel:`Groups`: Sets of Odoo users that ring together."
msgstr ":guilabel:`群組`：會同時響鈴的一組 Odoo 用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Menus`: Interactive voice menus (IVRs) for self-service routing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Queues`: Agent queues that calls wait in until an agent is "
"available."
msgstr ":guilabel:`隊列`：在有客服人員可接聽前，通話所等候的隊列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Voice Mailboxes`: Voicemail boxes tied to a user or a queue."
msgstr ":guilabel:`語音信箱`：與用戶或隊列關聯的語音信箱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sounds` and :guilabel:`Music on Hold`: Audio played to the "
"inbound caller."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:41
msgid ""
"These resources do not need to be configured in advance. Every node in the "
"call flow builder can create a related record on the spot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:47
msgid "Design a call flow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:49
msgid ""
"To create a call flow, go to :menuselection:`Phone app --> Configuration -->"
" Call Flows` and click :guilabel:`New`. Enter a :guilabel:`Name` for the "
"flow, then complete the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"如要建立通話流程，請前往 :menuselection:`電話應用程式 --> 配置 --> 通話流"
"程`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。為流程輸入:guilabel:`名稱`，然後完成以下步驟"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Add nodes**: Click a :ref:`node <phone/call_flows/nodes>` in the sidebar, "
"or drag it to the canvas. Select an existing record in the pop-up window, or"
" click :guilabel:`Create New` to create a new record on the spot."
msgstr ""
"**新增節點**：點擊側邊欄中的 :ref:`節點 <phone/call_flows/nodes>`，或將其拖曳"
"至畫布。在彈出視窗中選擇現有記錄，或點擊 :guilabel:`新建` 即時建立新記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Connect nodes**: Click and drag between the small circles on each node to "
"create connections."
msgstr "**連接節點**：點擊並拖曳各節點上的小圓圈，即可建立連接。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Add ending nodes**: Make sure every branch ends with a node that has only "
"one connector (e.g., a :guilabel:`Call`, :guilabel:`Send to Voicemail`, or "
":guilabel:`Hang Up` node)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:61
msgid ""
"Use the zoom controls in the top corner of the canvas to navigate a large "
"flow:"
msgstr "使用畫布頂角的縮放控制項，瀏覽大型流程："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:63
msgid ":icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(Zoom out)`"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`（縮小）`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:64
msgid ":icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`(Fit to content)`"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`（符合內容大小）`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:65
msgid ":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(Zoom in)`"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(放大)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:68
msgid ""
"When the call flow is ready, click the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` "
":guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon, then open the phone number that should use"
" this flow and select the call flow in the :guilabel:`Call Flow` form field."
msgstr ""
"通話流程準備就緒後，請點擊 :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(手動儲存)` 圖"
"示。接著開啟應使用此流程的電話號碼，並在 :guilabel:`通話流程` 表單欄位中選擇"
"該通話流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:75
msgid "Call flow nodes"
msgstr "通話流程節點"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:77
msgid ""
"Every call flow starts with a circular green :guilabel:`Start` node, "
"representing the moment a call comes in."
msgstr "每個通話流程都由一個綠色的圓形:guilabel:`開始`節點啟動，代表來電接入的時刻。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:80
msgid ""
"The following nodes can be added from the sidebar, either by clicking or "
"dragging onto the canvas:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Call a User`: Rings a specific user, on their assigned extension "
"or device."
msgstr ":guilabel:`致電用戶`：使特定用戶所獲指派的分機或裝置響鈴。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Call a Contact`: Rings a phone number stored on a contact record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:84
msgid ":guilabel:`Call a Group`: Rings every member of a call group at once."
msgstr ":guilabel:`致電群組`：同時讓通話群組的每位成員響鈴。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send to a Queue`: Places the caller in an agent queue until an "
"agent is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Open a Menu`: Plays an interactive voice menu (IVR) that routes "
"the caller based on the keys they press."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`開啟選單`：播放互動式語音選單（IVR），根據來電者所按的按鍵進行轉接"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Play Audio`: Plays an uploaded or text-to-speech-generated audio "
"message."
msgstr ":guilabel:`播放音訊`：播放已上載或透過文字轉語音產生的音訊訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send to Voicemail`: Forwards the caller directly to a voicemail "
"box."
msgstr ":guilabel:`轉送至語音信箱`：直接將來電者轉送至語音信箱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Redirect to an Extension`: Transfers the call to an internal "
"extension number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`轉接至分機`：將通話轉接至內部分機號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Redirect to an External Number`: Transfers the call to a number "
"outside Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time Condition`: Routes the call differently depending on whether"
" it arrives during an :guilabel:`Open` period or a :guilabel:`Closed` "
"period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`時間條件`：根據來電是在 :guilabel:`開放` 時段還是 :guilabel:`關"
"閉` 時段接通，將通話路由至不同路徑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:94
msgid ":guilabel:`Hang Up`: Ends the call. Displays as a circular red node."
msgstr ":guilabel:`掛斷`：結束通話。顯示為紅色圓形節點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:96
msgid ""
"Use the pop-up window that appears to search for and select a related "
"record, or click :guilabel:`Create New` to add a record without leaving the "
"flow."
msgstr ""
"使用隨即顯示的彈出視窗搜尋並選取相關記錄，或點擊 :guilabel:`建立新項目` 以在"
"不離開流程的情況下新增記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:99
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Redirect to an External Number` node, enter a phone "
"number and click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:105
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/onsip.rst:95
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:181
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "疑難排解"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:110
msgid "No Phone numbers yet"
msgstr "尚未有電話號碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:112
msgid ""
"When no phone number has been purchased yet, node pop-up windows display the"
" :guilabel:`Buy a Number` button instead of a list of records. Purchase a "
"phone number using the Odoo Phone Service, then reopen the node."
msgstr ""
"如果尚未購買任何電話號碼，節點彈出視窗會顯示 :guilabel:`購買號碼` 按鈕，而非"
"紀錄清單。請使用 Odoo 電話服務購買電話號碼，然後重新開啟該節點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:119
msgid "Time Condition always takes the Closed branch"
msgstr "時間條件一律採用已關閉分支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:121
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Time Condition` node warns when it has no :guilabel:`Open` "
"period configured, because every call will default to the :guilabel:`Closed`"
" period flow regardless of when it arrives. Open the node and add at least "
"one open period to fix this."
msgstr ""
"當 :guilabel:`時間條件` 節點未配置任何 :guilabel:`開放` 時段時，系統會發出警"
"告，因為無論通話何時抵達，都會預設進入 :guilabel:`關閉` 時段流程。請開啟該節"
"點並至少新增一個開放時段，以修正此問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:128
msgid "A queue or group node still shows old members"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/configuration/call_flows.rst:130
msgid ""
"Nodes refresh after the configuration is saved. If a node still displays "
"outdated members or agents, close and reopen the call flow to force a "
"refresh."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Phone** app can be used on many different devices, such as a computer,"
" tablet, mobile phone, and many more. This is helpful in that it reduces "
"costs, and employees can work from anywhere in the world, so long as they "
"have a broadband internet connection."
msgstr ""
"**電話** 應用程式可在多種不同裝置上使用，例如電腦、平板電腦、手提電話等。此功"
"能有助降低成本，員工只要具備寬頻網絡連線，即可在世界各地工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:9
msgid ""
"Odoo **Phone** is SIP (Session Initiation Protocol) compatible, which means "
"it can be used with *any* :abbr:`SIP (Session Initiation Protocol)` "
"compatible application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:12
msgid ""
"This document covers the process of setting up *Odoo Phone* across different"
" devices and integrations."
msgstr "本文件涵蓋在不同裝置及整合項目中設定 *Odoo 電話* 的流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:15
msgid ""
"The **Phone** app is fully integrated with all Odoo apps, allowing users to "
"click into any app, and schedule a call as an activity in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"**電話** 應用程式與所有 Odoo 應用程式全面整合，讓用戶可按入任何應用程式，並在"
"通訊欄安排通話作為活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:19
msgid ""
"For example, in the **CRM** app, a user can click into an opportunity, and "
"click on :guilabel:`Activities` in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"例如，在 **CRM** 應用程式中，用戶可以點進一項商機，然後在 Chatter 中點擊 "
":guilabel:`活動`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:22
msgid ""
"Next, they can choose :guilabel:`Call`, and under :guilabel:`Due Date`, they"
" can select a date."
msgstr "接著，他們可以選擇 :guilabel:`通話`，並在 :guilabel:`到期日` 下方選擇日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:24
msgid "Once they click :guilabel:`Save`, an activity shows up in the chatter."
msgstr "對方點擊 :guilabel:`儲存` 後，通訊欄便會顯示一項活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:26
msgid ""
"Should the :guilabel:`Due Date` be for today's date, the activity shows up "
"in the **Phone** widget."
msgstr "如果:guilabel:`到期日`為今天日期，該活動會顯示在 **電話** 小工具中。"

