msgstr "再次點選 :icon:`oi-transfer` :guilabel:`轉接`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:112
msgid "Select one of three options:"
msgstr "請選擇以下三個選項之一："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Direct Transfer`: Transfer the call immediately without speaking "
"to the selected contact."
msgstr ":guilabel:`直接轉接`：無需先與所選聯絡人通話，即時轉接來電。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ask First`: Speak to the selected contact before transferring the"
" call. Click :icon:`oi-transfer` :guilabel:`Confirm Transfer` to complete "
"the transfer, or click :icon:`fa-phone fa-rotate-135` :guilabel:`Hang up` to"
" cancel the transfer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cancel transfer`: Cancel the transfer and return to the contact "
"selection screen. Click :icon:`oi-arrow-left` :guilabel:`(Back)` to return "
"to the active call."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:122
msgid ""
"If the user does not pick up the call or is busy with another call, calls "
"may be automatically transferred depending on the |VOIP| service provider "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"如果用戶未有接聽來電或正忙於其他通話，系統可能會根據 |VOIP| 服務供應商的配置"
"自動轉駁來電。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:128
msgid "Move a call to another device"
msgstr "將通話轉移至另一部裝置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:130
msgid ""
"Calls can be switched to another device signed into the same account. This "
"is helpful for moving a call from a desktop to a mobile device for portable "
"use, or moving a call from a mobile device to a desktop for screen sharing. "
"During a call, the **Phone** widget on other devices displays *Active "
"call(s) on another device*."
msgstr ""
"通話可切換至已登入同一帳戶的其他裝置。這有助於將通話從桌面電腦轉移至流動裝置"
"以便隨身攜帶，或從流動裝置轉移至桌面電腦以進行螢幕分享。通話期間，其他裝置上"
"的 **電話** 小工具會顯示 *其他裝置上有進行中的通話*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:135
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Switch here` on another device to move the call to that "
"device."
msgstr "在另一部裝置上點選 :guilabel:`切換至此處`，即可將通話轉移至該裝置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:140
msgid "Add and remove CRM calls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:142
msgid ""
"Call activities can be added and removed from the :doc:`CRM Pipeline "
"<../../sales/crm>` without opening the opportunity record."
msgstr ""
"無需開啟商機記錄，即可從 :doc:`CRM 銷售管道 <../../sales/crm>` 中新增及移除通"
"話活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:145
msgid ""
"To add a **CRM** call activity from the queue, open the **CRM** app and "
"select the :ref:`Kanban view <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>`. Hover "
"over the desired opportunity, then click the :icon:`fa-phone` "
":guilabel:`(phone)` icon with a green plus :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(Add "
"to Call Queue)`. The call activity for the opportunity appears in the "
":guilabel:`Activities` tab."
msgstr ""
"如要從佇列新增 **CRM** 通話活動，請開啟 **CRM** 應用程式並選擇 :ref:`看板檢視"
"畫面 <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>`。將滑鼠游標停留在所需的商機上，"
"然後點擊 :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`（電話）` 圖示（帶有綠色加號 :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`（加入至通話佇列）`）。該商機的通話活動隨即會顯示在 "
":guilabel:`活動` 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:150
msgid ""
"To remove a **CRM** call activity from the queue, hover over the opportunity"
" and click the :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`(phone)` icon with a red minus "
":icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(Remove from Call Queue)` icon. The call "
"activity for the opportunity disappears from the :guilabel:`Activities` tab."
msgstr ""
"要從佇列中移除 **CRM** 通話活動，請將滑鼠游標停留在商機上，然後點擊 "
":icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`（電話）` 圖示（帶有紅色減號 :icon:`fa-minus` "
":guilabel:`（從通話佇列移除）` 圖示）。該商機的通話活動隨即會從 :guilabel:`活"
"動` 分頁消失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:156
msgid "Moving calls to another device is not supported in demo mode."
msgstr "示範模式不支援將通話轉移至其他裝置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:161
msgid "Manage related records"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:163
msgid ""
"Select a record in the :guilabel:`Recent`, :guilabel:`Contacts`, or "
":guilabel:`Activities` tab to view the following drop-down action menus:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:166
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Create`: Create a lead, ticket, applicant, or "
"task related to the contact record."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`建立`：建立與聯絡人記錄相關的潛在客戶、支援單、應"
"徵者或任務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:168
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`Go to`: Send an email or SMS, and open "
"records related to the contact. Depending on the type of contact, this can "
"include call details, contacts, leads, tickets, tasks, sales, and "
"subscriptions."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`前往`：傳送電郵或短訊，並開啟與該聯絡人相關"
"的記錄。視乎聯絡人類型而定，當中可包括通話詳情、聯絡人、潛在客戶、支援單、任"
"務、銷售及訂閱項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:171
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-history` :guilabel:`History (Recents tab, Keypad tab)`: View the "
"call history for the selected contact."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-history` :guilabel:`歷史記錄（最近分頁、鍵盤分頁）`：查看所選聯絡人"
"的通話記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:173
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`Log (Recents tab only)`: Log the call as a "
"completed activity in a related record."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`記錄（僅限「最近項目」分頁）`：將通話記錄為相關"
"記錄中已完成的活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:175
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`Activity (Activities tab only)`: Complete, "
"edit, or cancel the activity."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`活動（僅限「活動」分頁）`：完成、編輯或取消該活"
"動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:183
msgid ""
"Each section below goes through common issues with the **Phone** widget and "
"how to resolve them."
msgstr "以下各節將會介紹 **Phone** 小工具的常見問題及其解決方法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:188
msgid "Missing parameter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:190
msgid ""
"If a *Missing Parameter* error message appears in the **Phone** widget, "
"refresh the window, and try again."
msgstr ""
"如果 **電話** 小工具中出現 *遺失參數* 錯誤訊息，請重新整理視窗，然後再試一次"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:198
msgid ""
"If an *Incorrect Number* error message appears in the **Phone** widget, make"
" sure to use the international format, leading with the :icon:`fa-plus` "
":guilabel:`(plus)`, followed by the international country code (e.g., "
"+15555555555, where `+1` is the international prefix for the United States.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:206
msgid "The websocket connection with the server has been lost"
msgstr "與伺服器的 WebSocket 連線已中斷"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:208
msgid ""
"If a *The websocket connection with the server has been lost. Please try to "
"refresh the page.* error message appears in the **Phone** widget, then "
"refresh the page close other browser tabs."
msgstr ""
"如果 **電話** 小工具中出現 *與伺服器的 WebSocket 連線已中斷。請嘗試重新整理頁"
"面。* 錯誤訊息，請重新整理頁面並關閉其他瀏覽器分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:211
msgid ""
"This error is caused by returning to the database after a period of "
"inactivity, like lunch, or if there are too many browser tabs open."
msgstr ""
"此錯誤是因為閒置一段時間（例如午休）後返回資料庫，或開啟了過多瀏覽器分頁所致"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:217
msgid "Failed to start the user agent"
msgstr "無法啟動使用者代理程式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:219
msgid ""
"If a *Failed to start the user agent. The URL of the websocket may be wrong."
" Please have an administrator verify the websocket server URL in the General"
" Settings.* error message appears in the *Phone* widget, then update the "
"browser and computer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:223
msgid ""
"This error is caused by the browser or computer not being up-to-date (and "
"can also cause issues with the microphone)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:229
msgid "Grayed-out Phone widget"
msgstr "變灰的電話小工具"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:231
msgid ""
"If the **Phone** widget is completely grayed out and cannot be interacted "
"with, then update the browser and computer, and delete the Google Chrome "
"extension causing the problem."
msgstr ""
"如果 **電話** 小工具完全變成灰色且無法互動，請更新瀏覽器及電腦，並刪除導致問"
"題的 Google Chrome 擴充功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:237
msgid "Cannot connect to the VoIP phone number"
msgstr "無法連接至 VoIP 電話號碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/phone_widget.rst:239
msgid ""
"If the user cannot connect to their |VOIP| phone number, then their Odoo "
"profile is missing their |VoIP| :guilabel:`Secret`. To add it, "
":menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & Companies --> Users` select the "
"user, and click the *VoIP* tab. Under the *Credentials* section, enter the "
"user's :guilabel:`Secret`. This is the user's password to their account for "
"their |VOIP| service provider."
msgstr ""
"如果使用者無法連接其 |VOIP| 電話號碼，即表示其 Odoo 個人檔案缺少 |VoIP| "
":guilabel:`密鑰`。要加入此密鑰，請前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 使用"
"者及公司 --> 使用者`，選取該使用者，然後點擊 *VoIP* 分頁。在 *憑證* 部分中，"
"輸入使用者的 :guilabel:`密鑰`。這是使用者在其 |VOIP| 服務供應商帳戶的密碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:5
msgid "Sales calls with Odoo Phone"
msgstr "使用 Odoo 電話進行銷售通話"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:7
msgid ""
"Using Odoo **Phone** increases call efficiency, reduces costs, and allows a "
"salesperson to access the Odoo database while on a call. Instead of relying "
"on a separate phone for sales calls, a salesperson can make calls directly "
"from the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"使用 Odoo **電話** 可提升通話效率、降低成本，並讓銷售員在通話期間存取 Odoo 資"
"料庫。銷售員無需依賴獨立電話進行銷售通話，可以直接從 Odoo 資料庫撥打電話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:11
msgid ""
"This article goes over setting up Odoo **Phone** for a sales team that "
"already has the **Phone** app configured. If it is **not** configured, refer"
" to the :doc:`Phone <../phone>` documentation to get started."
msgstr ""
"本文介紹如何為已配置 **電話** 應用程式的銷售團隊設定 Odoo **電話**。如果 **尚"
"未** 配置，請參閱 :doc:`電話 <../phone>` 文件以開始使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:16
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorial: Sales calls with VoIP "
"<https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/sales-calls-with-voip-4562>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 教學：透過 VoIP 進行銷售通話 <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/sales-"
"calls-with-voip-4562>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:20
msgid "Make a sales call"
msgstr "撥打銷售電話"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:22
msgid ""
"This workflow begins in the **CRM** app. As a salesperson, click into a "
"sales opportunity. If it does not already have a call activity scheduled, "
"click :guilabel:`Activities` in the opportunity's chatter, then set the "
"activity's :guilabel:`Activity Type` to :guilabel:`Call`, and then fill out "
"the rest of the activity form, and finally click :guilabel:`Schedule`."
msgstr ""
"此工作流程從 **CRM** 應用程式開始。作為銷售人員，請點擊進入一個銷售商機。如果"
"該商機尚未排程通話活動，請在商機的通訊記錄中點擊 :guilabel:`活動`，將活動的 "
":guilabel:`活動類型` 設為 :guilabel:`通話`，填寫活動表單的其餘部分，最後點擊 "
":guilabel:`排程`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:27
msgid ""
"From here, there are three ways to begin a phone call with the customer:"
msgstr "在此處，可透過三種方式與客戶開始通話："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:29
msgid ""
"Hover over the :guilabel:`Phone` field in the opportunity form, then click "
":icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`Call`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:31
msgid "In the opportunity's chatter, click the customer's phone number."
msgstr "在商機的通訊記錄中，按一下客戶的電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:32
msgid ""
"In the upper-right corner, click the :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`(VoIP)` icon"
" to open the |VOIP| widget. From the :guilabel:`Next Activities` tab, select"
" the call, and finally click the :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`(phone)` icon "
"near the bottom of the widget."
msgstr ""
"在右上角點擊 :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`（VoIP）` 圖示以開啟 |VOIP| 小工具。"
"從 :guilabel:`下一個活動` 分頁中選取該通話，最後點擊小工具底部附近的 "
":icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`（電話）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:37
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:66
msgid "Work during a call"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:39
msgid ""
"Once the call with the customer begins, the salesperson can still move about"
" the Odoo database. Also, there are shortcut icons in the *Phone* widget "
"that the salesperson can use to access common actions, like sending an email"
" to the customer, or pulling up their profile. Learn more about :doc:`the "
"documents a salesperson can access <phone_widget>` during a call."
msgstr ""
"與客戶開始通話後，銷售人員仍可在 Odoo 資料庫中自由瀏覽其他頁面。此外，*電話* "
"小工具內亦設有捷徑圖示，讓銷售人員快速執行常見操作，例如向客戶傳送電郵或開啟"
"其個人檔案。進一步了解銷售人員在通話期間 :doc:`可存取的文件 <phone_widget>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:44
msgid "The salesperson can also take some actions during the call:"
msgstr "銷售人員亦可在通話期間執行部分操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:46
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:75
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-arrows-h` :guilabel:`(transfer)`: Transfer a call to another team "
"member."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:47
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-microphone` :guilabel:`(microphone)`: The salesperson can mute "
"themselves during a call."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-microphone` :guilabel:`（咪高峰）`：銷售員可在通話期間將自己靜音。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:78
msgid ":icon:`fa-pause` :guilabel:`(pause)`: Place the caller on hold."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-pause` :guilabel:`（暫停）`：將來電者置於保留狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:50
msgid ""
"The *Phone* widget opened to a call, showing the shortcut icons a salesperson has access\n"
"to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:55
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:81
msgid "Handle call follow-ups"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:57
msgid ""
"The *Phone* widget can handle some common follow-up tasks, but salespeople "
"can still navigate Odoo for tasks not available in the widget."
msgstr ""
"*電話* 小工具可處理一些常見的跟進任務，但如小工具未提供相關功能，銷售人員仍可"
"在 Odoo 中前往執行任務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:60
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:86
msgid ""
"Here are some of the common follow-up tasks that can be managed from the "
"*Phone* widget:"
msgstr "以下列出部分可透過 *電話* 小工具管理的常見跟進工作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:62
msgid ""
"Send a follow-up email sharing new product offerings to the customer using "
"the :icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`(envelope)` icon."
msgstr ""
"使用 :icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`（信封）` 圖示向客戶發送跟進電郵，分享新"
"產品資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:64
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:90
msgid ""
"Update the customer's mailing address by clicking on the :icon:`fa-user` "
":guilabel:`(user)` icon, which opens their profile."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-user` :guilabel:`（使用者）` 圖示，即可開啟客戶的個人檔案並更"
"新其郵寄地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:66
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:92
msgid ""
"Schedule a second call with the customer by clicking the :icon:`fa-clock-o` "
":guilabel:`(clock)` icon, setting the :guilabel:`Activity Type` field to "
":guilabel:`Call`, and then filling out the rest of the form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:71
msgid "Send a quotation while on a call"
msgstr "通話期間傳送報價單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:73
msgid ""
"If the customer is ready to see a sales quotation while on the call, the "
"salesperson can send that quotation without leaving the call."
msgstr "如果客戶在通話期間準備好查看銷售報價單，銷售員無需結束通話即可傳送該報價單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:76
msgid ""
"To send a quotation while on a call, the salesperson should be in the sales "
"opportunity they initiated the call from. From here, they will :doc:`send "
"the quotation as they normally would "
"<../../sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations>`."
msgstr ""
"要在通話期間傳送報價單，銷售人員應位於他們發起通話的銷售機會頁面中。之後，他"
"們只需 :doc:`按照平常的方式傳送報價單 <../../sales/sales/sales_quotations/"
"create_quotations>` 即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:80
msgid ""
"An added benefit of being on the call with the customer while the "
"salesperson is sending the quotation is that any specific questions are "
"answered in real-time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:84
msgid "End the sales call"
msgstr "結束銷售通話"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:86
msgid ""
"When it is time to end the call, the salesperson clicks the red :icon:`fa-"
"phone` :guilabel:`(phone)` icon in the lower-right corner of the *Phone* "
"widget. When they do, the call is logged in the opportunity's chatter."
msgstr ""
"需要結束通話時，銷售員可按一下 *電話* 小工具右下角的紅色 :icon:`fa-phone` "
":guilabel:`(電話)` 圖示。完成後，該通話會記錄在商機的訊息紀錄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/sales_calls.rst:90
msgid ""
"If they have not done so already, the salesperson then marks the phone call "
"activity as done. To do so, navigate to the opportunity's chatter and find "
"the :guilabel:`Planned Activities` section, then click :icon:`fa-check` "
":guilabel:`Mark Done` on the planned call to remove it from the "
":guilabel:`Next Activities` tab in the *Phone* widget."
msgstr ""
"若銷售人員尚未完成此步驟，隨後需將通話活動標記為完成。為此，請前往商機的通訊"
"欄並找出 :guilabel:`已計劃活動` 區域，然後在計劃通話上按一下 :icon:`fa-"
"check` :guilabel:`標記為完成`，以將其從 *電話* 小工具的 :guilabel:`下一步活"
"動` 分頁中移除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:5
msgid "Support calls with Odoo Phone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:7
msgid ""
"A useful tool for support teams, Odoo **Phone** is used as a way to get in "
"contact with customers who need some help. Using the **Phone** app can help "
"improve customer satisfaction, reduce support costs, and allows support "
"agents to navigate an Odoo database while on a call."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **電話**是支援團隊的實用工具，可用於聯絡需要協助的客戶。使用**電話**應用"
"程式有助提升客戶滿意度、降低支援成本，並讓支援人員在通話期間瀏覽 Odoo 資料庫"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:11
msgid ""
"Instead of being tied to their desks, support agents can take calls from "
"anywhere they have access to the Odoo :doc:`Phone <../phone>` app."
msgstr ""
"支援專員毋須受限於辦公桌，只要能夠存取 Odoo :doc:`電話 <../phone>` 應用程式，"
"即可隨時隨地接聽來電。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:15
msgid ""
"This feature requires at least one :doc:`call queue <axivox/call_queues>` to"
" be configured."
msgstr "此功能需要至少設定一個:doc:`通話隊列 <axivox/call_queues>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:18
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorial: Working as a Support Agent "
"<https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/working-as-a-support-agent-odoo-"
"voip-4617>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 教學課程：擔任支援專員 <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/working-as-a-"
"support-agent-odoo-voip-4617>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:22
msgid "Log into a support queue"
msgstr "登入支援佇列"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:24
msgid ""
"If :doc:`call queues <axivox/call_queues>` are set up, begin a support shift"
" by logging into a call queue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:27
msgid ""
"Begin by clicking :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`(Show Softphone)` in the top-"
"right corner of the Odoo database. From there, click :icon:`fa-keyboard-o` "
":guilabel:`(keyboard)`, then dial the *agent connection* number and click "
":icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`(phone)`."
msgstr ""
"首先，點擊 Odoo 資料庫右上角的 :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`（顯示軟電話）`。接"
"著點擊 :icon:`fa-keyboard-o` :guilabel:`（鍵盤）`，然後撥打*代理連線*號碼並點"
"擊 :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`（電話）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:31
msgid ""
"Once the support agent calls their *agent connection code*, they'll hear a "
"short message letting them know they are logged into the queue. From here, "
"the agent receives support calls according to the administrator's :doc:`call"
" queue strategy <axivox/call_queues>`. When a support agent receives a call,"
" the *Phone* widget appears in the bottom-right corner of their screen with "
"the caller's phone number, as well as their name if the number is tied to a "
"customer profile."
msgstr ""
"支援專員撥打其 *專員連線代碼* 後，會聽到一段簡短訊息，通知其已登入佇列。之後"
"，專員會根據管理員設定的 :doc:`通話佇列策略 <axivox/call_queues>` 接聽支援來"
"電。當支援專員接獲來電時，畫面右下角會顯示 *電話* 小工具，當中包含來電者的電"
"話號碼；若該號碼已關聯至客戶資料，亦會顯示其名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:38
msgid ""
"When support staff are added as :doc:`static agents <axivox/call_queues>` to"
" a call queue, they do not need to log into the queue to receive calls from "
"that queue."
msgstr ""
"當支援人員以 :doc:`靜態專員 <axivox/call_queues>` 身份加入通話佇列時，他們無"
"需登入該佇列即可接收來自該佇列的來電。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:42
msgid "Call a customer from a support ticket"
msgstr "從支援工單致電客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:44
msgid ""
"As part of a support agent's daily tasks, they might be asked to call "
"customers with open support tickets. With Odoo **Phone**, the support agent "
"can stay in the Odoo database throughout the entire workflow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:48
msgid ""
"From the database's home page, click the **Helpdesk** app, click into a "
"helpdesk, and then open a ticket. If the ticket does not already have a call"
" activity scheduled, click :guilabel:`Activities` in the ticket's chatter, "
"then set the activity's :guilabel:`Activity Type` to :guilabel:`Call`, and "
"then fill out the rest of the activity form, and finally click "
":guilabel:`Schedule`."
msgstr ""
"從資料庫的主頁點擊 **服務台** 應用程式，進入其中一個服務台，然後開啟一張服務"
"單。若服務單尚未安排通話活動，請在服務單的通訊欄中點擊 :guilabel:`活動`，將活"
"動的 :guilabel:`活動類型` 設為 :guilabel:`通話`，填寫活動表單的其餘部分，最後"
"點擊 :guilabel:`安排`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:53
msgid "Scheduling a call activity for a support ticket."
msgstr "為支援工單排程通話活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:56
msgid "From here, the agent has three ways to make a call:"
msgstr "由此處開始，客服人員可透過三種方式撥打電話："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:58
msgid ""
"Hover over the :guilabel:`Phone` field in the ticket, then click :icon:`fa-"
"phone` :guilabel:`Call`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:60
msgid "In the ticket's chatter, click the customer's phone number."
msgstr "在支援單的通訊欄中，點擊客戶的電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:61
msgid ""
"In the upper-right corner, click the :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`(Show "
"Softphone)` icon to open the *Phone* widget. From the :guilabel:`Activities`"
" tab, select the call, and finally click the :icon:`fa-phone` "
":guilabel:`(phone)` icon near the bottom of the widget."
msgstr ""
"在右上角，點擊 :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`(顯示軟電話)` 圖示以開啟 *電話* 小"
"工具。在 :guilabel:`活動` 分頁中，選擇該通話，最後點擊小工具底部附近的 "
":icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`(電話)` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:68
msgid ""
"Once the call with the customer begins, the support agent can still move "
"about the Odoo database. Also, there are shortcut icons in the *Phone* "
"widget that the support agent can use to access common actions, like sending"
" an email to the customer, or pulling up their profile. Learn more about "
":doc:`the documents a support agent can access <phone_widget>` during a "
"call."
msgstr ""
"與客戶開始通話後，支援專員仍可在 Odoo 資料庫中自由操作。此外，*電話* 小工具內"
"設有捷徑圖示，支援專員可用於存取常見操作，例如向客戶發送電郵，或調出客戶的個"
"人資料。深入了解支援專員在通話期間 :doc:`可存取的文件 <phone_widget>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:73
msgid "The support agent can also take some actions during the call:"
msgstr "支援專員亦可在通話期間執行以下操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:76
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-microphone` :guilabel:`(microphone)`: The support agent can mute "
"themselves during a call."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-microphone` :guilabel:`(咪高峰)`：支援專員可在通話期間將自己靜音。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:83
msgid ""
"The *Phone* widget can handle some common follow-up tasks, but support "
"agents can still navigate Odoo for tasks not available in the widget."
msgstr ""
"*電話* 小工具可處理部分常見的跟進工作，但如遇小工具未能支援的任務，客服人員仍"
"可瀏覽 Odoo 進行操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:88
msgid ""
"Send a follow-up email sharing troubleshooting steps with the customer using"
" the :icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`(envelope)` icon."
msgstr ""
"使用 :icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`（信封）` 圖示發送跟進電郵，與客戶分享疑"
"難排解步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:97
msgid "End the support call"
msgstr "結束支援通話"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:99
msgid ""
"When it is time to end the call, the support agent clicks the red :icon:`fa-"
"phone` :guilabel:`(phone)` icon in the lower-right corner of the *Phone* "
"widget. When they do, the call is logged in the ticket's chatter."
msgstr ""
"需要結束通話時，支援人員可按一下 *電話* 小工具右下角的紅色 :icon:`fa-phone` "
":guilabel:`（電話）` 圖示。完成後，該次通話便會記錄在工單的通訊欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:103
msgid ""
"If they have not done so already, the support agent then marks the phone "
"call activity as done. To do so, navigate to the ticket's chatter and find "
"the :guilabel:`Planned Activities` section, then click :icon:`fa-check` "
":guilabel:`Mark Done` on the planned call to remove it from the "
":guilabel:`Next Activities` tab in the *Phone* widget."
msgstr ""
"如果支援人員尚未處理，則需將通話活動標記為已完成。為此，請前往工單的溝通紀錄"
"，找到 :guilabel:`已計劃活動` 部分，然後在已計劃的通話上點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"check` :guilabel:`標記為完成`，將其從 *電話* 小工具中的 :guilabel:`下一步活"
"動` 分頁移除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:109
msgid "Log out of a support queue"
msgstr "登出支援佇列"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:111
msgid ""
"Once the agent's shift ends, or if they are taking a break, they can log out"
" of the support call queue."
msgstr "當客服專員的更期結束或需要休息時，他們可登出支援通話佇列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:114
msgid ""
"Begin by clicking :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`(Show Softphone)` in the top-"
"right corner of the Odoo database. From there, click :icon:`fa-keyboard-o` "
":guilabel:`(keyboard)`, then dial the *agent disconnection* number and click"
" :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`phone`."
msgstr ""
"首先，按一下 Odoo 資料庫右上角的 :icon:`oi-voip` :guilabel:`（顯示軟電話）`。"
"然後按一下 :icon:`fa-keyboard-o` :guilabel:`（鍵盤）`，再撥打 *代理斷線* 號碼"
"並按一下 :icon:`fa-phone` :guilabel:`電話`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/support_calls.rst:118
msgid ""
"Once the support agent calls their *agent disconnection code*, they'll hear "
"a short message letting them know they are logged out of the queue. From "
"here, the agent will no longer receive support calls until they log back in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:7
msgid "Sign"
msgstr "電子簽署"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Odoo Sign** allows you to sign, send, and approve documents online using "
"electronic signatures."
msgstr "**Odoo 簽署**讓您可使用電子簽署在網上簽署、傳送及核准文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:20
