"Just like a handwritten signature, an electronic signature represents a "
"person's agreement to the content of a document. Signatures generated using "
"the Sign app are considered as :doc:`valid electronic signatures "
"<sign/validity>` in the European Union and the United States of America, and"
" meet the requirements for electronic signatures in most countries."
