#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:46
msgid "`Odoo Sign: product page <https://www.odoo.com/app/sign>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 簽名：產品頁面 <https://www.odoo.com/app/sign>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:47
msgid "`Odoo Tutorials: Sign [video] <https://www.odoo.com/slides/sign-61>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 教學課程：簽署 [影片] <https://www.odoo.com/slides/sign-61>`_"

