#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:13
msgid ""
"add :ref:`Default Terms & Conditions <sign/configuration/settings-t-and-c>` "
"to the signature request email"
msgstr ""
"將 :ref:`預設條款及細則 <sign/configuration/settings-t-and-c>` 加入簽名請求電"
