msgstr "透過短訊管理身份驗證及 :ref:`購買點數 <in_app_purchase/credits>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:25
msgid ""
"upload a `.p12` or `.pfx` file containing a personal digital certificate, "
"allowing you to add a :ref:`cryptographic, or digital, signature "
"<sign/security/cryptographic>` to a document"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:31
msgid "Default terms and conditions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:33
msgid ""
"Terms and conditions allow a business to standardize the legal relationship "
"with its clients, define obligations and expectations, manage risk, and "
"protect its interests by setting clear rules for aspects such as liability "
"and dispute resolution."
msgstr ""
"條款及細則可讓企業標準化與客戶之間的法律關係、界定責任與期望、管理風險，並透"
"過就法律責任及爭議解決等方面訂立清晰規則，保障自身利益。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:37
msgid "To add default terms and conditions to signature requests:"
msgstr "要在簽署要求中加入預設條款及細則："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:39
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Sign --> Configuration --> Settings` and enable "
":guilabel:`Sign Default Terms & Conditions`."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`電子簽名 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並啟用:guilabel:`簽名預設條"
"款及細則`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:42
msgid "Choose the desired option:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Terms in Email`: This option is selected by default and places "
"the terms and conditions at the bottom of the signature request email. Add "
"your terms and conditions to the text box."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Terms as Web Page`: This option displays the terms and conditions"
" on a web page; the link to that page is then added as a link in the "
"signature request email. Click :guilabel:`Save`, then click "
":guilabel:`Update Terms`. Add your terms and conditions to the text box, "
"then click :guilabel:`Save`. Click :guilabel:`Preview` to see how the terms "
"and conditions will be displayed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`以網頁顯示條款`：此選項會在網頁上顯示條款及細則，並將該頁面的連結"
"加入簽署請求電郵中。點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`更新條款`。在"
"文字方塊中加入您的條款及細則，然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`。點擊 :guilabel:`預"
"覽`，即可查看條款及細則的顯示效果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:54
msgid ""
"In the text box, type `/` to open the :ref:`powerbox "
"<essentials/html_editor/commands>`, then use commands to insert headings, "
"bulleted lists, etc."
msgstr ""
"在文字框中輸入 `/`，即可開啟:ref:`Powerbox <essentials/html_editor/commands>"
"`，然後使用指令插入標題、項目符號清單等。"

