#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:60
msgid ""
"It is also possible to manually attach files, such as terms and conditions, "
"when :ref:`configuring a signature request <sign/request-"
"signatures/configure-request>`. For :ref:`templates <sign/request-"
"signatures/templates>`, files can be attached by default in the "
":guilabel:`Communication` section of the template :guilabel:`Configuration` "
"when creating or editing the template."
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`設定簽署請求 <sign/request-signatures/configure-request>`時，亦可手動"
"附加檔案（例如條款及細則）。至於:ref:`範本 <sign/request-signatures/"
"templates>`，在建立或編輯範本時，可於:guilabel:`通訊`部分（範本:guilabel:`設"
"定`內）預設附加檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:69
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:71
msgid ""
"Fields are :ref:`added to documents <sign/request-signatures/add-fields>` to"
" indicate what information must be completed by the signers. Various fields "
"are available by default. These fields can be :ref:`edited and additional "
"fields can be created <sign/configuration/create-edit-fields>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"系統會將欄位 :ref:`加入至文件 <sign/request-signatures/add-fields>`，以指示簽"
"署人必須填寫哪些資料。預設提供多種欄位。如有需要，可 :ref:`編輯這些欄位並建立"
"其他欄位 <sign/configuration/create-edit-fields>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:79
msgid "Create and edit fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:81
msgid "To create or edit a field:"
msgstr "要建立或編輯欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:83
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:152
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Sign --> Configuration --> Fields`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`簽名 --> 配置 --> 欄位`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:84
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new field or click on a field to open and "
"edit it."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`新增` 以建立新欄位，或按一下欄位以開啟及編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:85
msgid ""
"Choose the relevant :ref:`field type <sign/configuration/field-types>` by "
"clicking the corresponding button at the top of the form."
msgstr ""
"按一下表單頂部的相應按鈕，選擇相關的:ref:`欄位類型 <sign/configuration/field-"
"types>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:87
msgid "Complete or edit the following fields:"
msgstr "填寫或編輯以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Field Name`: Enter or edit the field name. This is visible in the"
" list of fields in the left panel when a document is being :ref:`prepared "
"for signature <sign/request-signatures/prepare-document>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`欄位名稱`：輸入或編輯欄位名稱。當文件正在 :ref:`準備簽署 <sign/"
"request-signatures/prepare-document>` 時，此名稱會顯示在左側面板的欄位清單中"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Placeholder`: Optionally, specify a placeholder text that "
"provides the signer with a hint or example :ref:`during the signing process "
"<sign/sign-document/signature-request>`. If this field is left blank, the "
":guilabel:`Field Name` is used as placeholder text."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預留位置`：此為選填項目，可指定預留位置文字，以便 :ref:`在簽署過程"
"中 <sign/sign-document/signature-request>` 為簽署人提供提示或範例。如將此欄位"
"留空，系統將使用 :guilabel:`欄位名稱` 作為預留位置文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tip`: Add a tip that will be displayed inside an arrow to the "
"left of the document during the signing process to help the signer "
"understand what action to take (e.g., \"Sign here\")."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mandatory`: Enable the checkbox to make the field mandatory by "
"default."
msgstr ":guilabel:`必填`：勾選此複選框，即可預設將該欄位設為必填。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Read Only`: Enable the checkbox to make the field read-only by "
"default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:102
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Mandatory` and :guilabel:`Read Only` attributes of a field "
"can be modified manually when :ref:`adding the field to a document "
"<sign/request-signatures/add-fields>`."
msgstr ""
"欄位的 :guilabel:`必填` 及 :guilabel:`唯讀` 屬性，可在 :ref:`將欄位加入文件 "
"<sign/request-signatures/add-fields>` 時手動修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:105
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Text`, :guilabel:`Multiline Text`, and :guilabel:`Date` "
"fields only, use the :guilabel:`Linked to` field to :ref:`configure auto-"
"completion <sign/configuration/auto-fill>` so the field is auto-completed "
"during the signing process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:112
msgid "Field types"
msgstr "欄位類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Signature`: Signers enter their signature either by generating an"
" automatic signature based on their name, drawing it using their mouse, or "
"uploading a local file (usually an image). Each subsequent "
":guilabel:`Signature` field in a document reuses the data entered in the "
"first field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`簽名`：簽署人可根據姓名自動產生簽名、使用滑鼠繪製，或上傳本機檔案"
"（通常為圖片）來輸入簽名。文件中的每個後續 :guilabel:`簽名` 欄位都會重複使用"
"第一個欄位中所輸入的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Initial`: Signers enter their initials, in a similar way to the "
":guilabel:`Signature` field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`簡簽`：簽署人輸入其姓名簡簽，方式與 :guilabel:`簽名` 欄位相似。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Text` and :guilabel:`Multiline Text`: Signers can enter text on a"
" single line or on multiple lines, respectively. These field types can be "
":ref:`configured to be auto-completed <sign/configuration/auto-fill>` during"
" the signing process."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`文字`及:guilabel:`多行文字`：簽署人可分別在單行或多行中輸入文字。"
"這些欄位類型可在簽署過程中:ref:`設定為自動完成 <sign/configuration/auto-fill>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:123
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Checkbox`: Signers can tick a box (e.g., to confirm they accept "
"the terms and conditions)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`核取方塊`：簽署人可剔選方塊（例如確認接受條款及細則）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:125
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Radio`: Signers can select a single option from a series of "
"options (defined when the field is :ref:`added to the document "
"<sign/request-signatures/add-fields>`) by clicking the radio button beside "
"the desired option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Selection`: Signers can select a single option from a series of "
"options (defined when the field is :ref:`added to the document "
"<sign/request-signatures/add-fields>`) via a dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`選擇`：簽署人可透過下拉式選單，從一系列選項中選擇單一項目（於將欄"
"位 :ref:`新增至文件 <sign/request-signatures/add-fields>` 時定義）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Strikethrough`: Signers can reject certain phrases by clicking "
"the strikethrough field, which adds a visible line through the text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stamp`: Signers can add a company stamp (defined when the field "
"is :ref:`added to the document <sign/request-signatures/add-fields>`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`印章`：簽署人可加入公司印章（於欄位 :ref:`加入至文件 <sign/"
"request-signatures/add-fields>` 時定義）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: When signers click a date field, today's date is filled in"
" by default. Clicking the field again allows a different date to be selected"
" in the date picker. This field type can also be :ref:`configured to be "
"auto-completed <sign/configuration/auto-fill>` during the signing process."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`日期`：當簽署人按一下日期欄位時，系統會預設填入今天的日期。再次按"
"一下該欄位，即可在日期選擇器中選擇其他日期。在簽署過程中，此欄位類型亦"
"可:ref:`設定為自動填寫 <sign/configuration/auto-fill>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:143
msgid "Configure auto-complete fields"
msgstr "設定自動完成欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:145
msgid ""
"To reduce the need for manual input and ensure accurate and consistent "
"information, it is possible to have certain fields automatically completed "
"with data from the database :ref:`during the signing process <sign/sign-"
"document/signature-request>`. This is done by linking a Sign field to a "
"field from a specific :doc:`Odoo model "
"</applications/studio/models_modules_apps>`."
msgstr ""
"為減少人手輸入並確保資訊準確一致，您可讓系統 :ref:`在簽署過程中 <sign/sign-"
"document/signature-request>` 自動以資料庫的數據填寫指定欄位。您只需將簽署欄位"
"連結至特定 :doc:`Odoo 模型 </applications/studio/models_modules_apps>` 中的欄"
"位即可實現此功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:150
msgid "To enable auto-completion for a Sign field:"
msgstr "要為簽名欄位啟用自動填寫："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:153
msgid "Open the relevant field."
msgstr "開啟相關欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:154
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Linked to` dropdown, select the model that contains the "
"field to link to, e.g., *Contact*."
msgstr ""
"從 :guilabel:`連結至` 下拉式選單中，選擇包含目標連結欄位的模型，例如 *聯絡"
"人*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:156
msgid ""
"Click beside :guilabel:`Field`, then use the field selector to select the "
"relevant field, e.g., *Email*."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`欄位` 旁邊，然後使用欄位選擇器選擇相關欄位，例如 *電郵*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:160
msgid ""
"In the example, the :icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`Email` field in the Sign "
"app is linked to the :guilabel:`Email` field in the *Contact* model. When "
"the contact completes the document, their email address, as it appears in "
"their record in the Odoo database, is automatically added to the document."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:165
msgid "Configuring a field to be auto-completed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:173
msgid ""
"Tags can be used to categorize and organize documents and templates within "
"the Sign app, allowing users to quickly search for and filter documents and "
"templates based on specific criteria."
msgstr ""
"標籤可用於分類及整理「簽署」應用程式中的文件與範本，讓使用者能根據特定條件快"
"速搜尋和篩選文件及範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:176
msgid "To create a new tag:"
msgstr "如要建立新標籤："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:178
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Sign --> Configuration --> Tags`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:179
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:180
msgid ""
"On the new line that is added at the bottom of the list of tags, type the "
":guilabel:`Tag Name` and select a :guilabel:`Color Index` for your tag."
msgstr ""
"在標籤清單底部新增的一行中，輸入 :guilabel:`標籤名稱`，並為標籤選擇 "
":guilabel:`顏色索引`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:3
msgid "Request a signature"
msgstr "要求簽署"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:5
msgid "Via the Odoo Sign app or directly from an Odoo record, you can:"
msgstr "透過 Odoo 電子簽名應用程式，或直接從 Odoo 記錄中，您可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:7
msgid ""
"request the signature of one or more signers on :ref:`a one-off document or "
"an envelope of multiple one-off documents <sign/request-signatures/one-off>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:9
msgid ""
":ref:`use templates <sign/request-signatures/templates>` to request the "
"signature of one or more signers on frequently used documents"
msgstr ""
":ref:`使用範本 <sign/request-signatures/templates>`，就常用文件向一名或多名簽"
"署人請求簽署"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:12
msgid ""
"Once a document or :ref:`document envelope <sign/request-signatures/create-"
"envelope>` has been fully signed, i.e., completed and signed by all signers,"
" the signed document(s) and the :ref:`certificate of completion "
"<sign/security/certificate-of-completion>` are sent via email to the "
"requestor, and to any contacts added in :guilabel:`CC` when the signature "
"request was :ref:`configured <sign/request-signatures/configure-request>`."
msgstr ""
"當文件或 :ref:`文件封套 <sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>` 完成全部簽"
"署（即所有簽署人均已完成並簽署）後，已簽署的文件及 :ref:`完成證明書 <sign/"
"security/certificate-of-completion>` 會透過電郵發送予請求者，以及任何已加入 "
":guilabel:`副本` 的聯絡人（於 :ref:`設定 <sign/request-signatures/configure-"
"request>` 簽署請求時指定）。"

