msgstr "從「簽署」應用程式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:28
msgid ""
"To request the signature of a one-off document or :ref:`document envelope "
"<sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>` from the Sign app:"
msgstr ""
"如要在「簽署」應用程式要求簽署單次文件或 :ref:`文件信封 <sign/request-"
"signatures/create-envelope>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:31
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Sign --> Documents --> My Documents` or "
":menuselection:`--> All Documents`, click :guilabel:`Upload PDF`, then "
"select and open the relevant `.pdf` document(s). If the document needs to be"
