"cog` :guilabel:`（操作）` 圖示，然後選擇 :menuselection:`從文件匯入`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you are creating a document envelope that includes one document saved in "
