msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`傳送`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:45
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:69
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:207
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:245
msgid ""
"Complete the relevant fields of the :ref:`New Signature Request "
"<sign/request-signatures/configure-request>` window."
msgstr ""
"填寫:ref:`新增簽署請求 <sign/request-signatures/configure-request>`視窗中的相"
"關欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:47
