#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:91
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:40
msgid "Templates"
msgstr "範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:93
msgid ""
"When the same single document or :ref:`envelope of multiple documents "
"<sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>` needs to be used regularly, "
"creating and using a template can save time and streamline the workflow. "
"Templates are prepared for signing in the same way as one-off documents, by "
"adding the necessary fields, signers, documents, and tags, as relevant."
msgstr ""
"如需要經常使用同一份單一文件或 :ref:`多份文件的信封 <sign/request-signatures/"
"create-envelope>`，建立並使用範本可節省時間並簡化工作流程。準備簽署範本的方式"
"與單次文件相同，只需按需要加入所需的欄位、簽署人、文件及標籤即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:101
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:49
msgid "Create a template"
msgstr "建立範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:103
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:53
msgid "To create a template:"
msgstr "要建立範本："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:105
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:204
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:218
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Sign --> Templates`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`電子簽署 --> 範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:106
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload PDF`, then select and open the relevant `.pdf` "
"document(s). If the document needs to be imported from the :doc:`Documents "
"<../documents>` app, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon "
"beside the name of the view, then :menuselection:`Import from Documents`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:112
msgid ""
"If you need to upload multiple documents, i.e., create a :ref:`document "
"envelope <sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>`, and one of the "
"documents is saved in the Documents app, import that document *before* "
":ref:`adding subsequent documents <sign/request-signatures/create-"
"envelope>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您需要上載多份文件，即建立:ref:`文件信封 <sign/request-signatures/create-"
"envelope>`，且其中一份文件已儲存在「文件」應用程式中，請在 :ref:`新增後續文"
"件 <sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>` *之前* 匯入該文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:117
msgid ""
"Once you have created the template, you can start :ref:`editing it "
"<sign/request-signatures/edit-template>`."
msgstr ""
"建立範本後，即可開始:ref:`編輯該範本 <sign/request-signatures/edit-template>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:123
msgid "Edit a template"
msgstr "編輯範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:125
msgid ""
"A template can be edited at any time, provided it has *not yet been used* to"
" send a signature request."
msgstr "只要範本 *尚未用於* 傳送簽署請求，即可隨時編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:128
msgid ""
"To edit a template, go to :menuselection:`Sign --> Templates` and click on "
"the relevant template to open it. Alternatively, hover over the template, "
"click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon in the "
"top-right corner of the card, then click :guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr ""
"要編輯範本，請前往 :menuselection:`簽署 --> 範本`，並點擊相關範本以將其開啟。"
"或者，將游標懸停在範本上，點擊卡片右上角的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
":guilabel:`（垂直省略號）` 圖示，然後點擊 :guilabel:`編輯`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:134
msgid ""
"When you open a template that has already been used to send a signature "
"request, the template is in :guilabel:`View only mode`. Click :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`Duplicate & Edit` to create a copy of the template, which"
" can then be edited."
msgstr ""
"開啟已用於發送簽名請求的範本時，該範本會處於 :guilabel:`唯讀模式`。點擊 "
":icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`複製並編輯`，即可建立範本副本並進行編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:138
msgid "Viewing a template that has been used to send a signature request"
msgstr "查看已用於發送簽署請求的範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:141
msgid "Edit the template:"
msgstr "編輯範本："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:143
msgid ""
":ref:`Prepare the document(s) for signing <sign/request-signatures/prepare-"
"document>` by adding or editing fields, and, if relevant, adding or removing"
" signers and/or documents."
msgstr ""
":ref:`準備文件以供簽署 <sign/request-signatures/prepare-document>`，方法是新"
"增或編輯欄位，並在相關情況下新增或移除簽署人及／或文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:145
msgid ""
"Optionally, :ref:`define or edit settings for specific signers "
"<sign/request-signatures/signer-settings>`, such as requiring additional "
"authentication, allowing a signer to :ref:`delegate their signature "
"<sign/sign-document/delegate>` or be :ref:`replaced <sign/request-"
"signatures/change-signers>`, or assigning a fixed signer."
msgstr ""
"你亦可按需要 :ref:`為特定簽署人定義或編輯設定 <sign/request-signatures/"
"signer-settings>`，例如要求額外身份驗證、允許簽署人 :ref:`委派其簽名 <sign/"
"sign-document/delegate>` 或 :ref:`由他人替代 <sign/request-signatures/change-"
"signers>`，或指派固定簽署人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:149
msgid ""
"Optionally, define or edit general settings for the template by clicking the"
" :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(cog)` icon beside the template name, then "
"clicking :icon:`fa-cog` :menuselection:`Configuration`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:153
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Name` of the template is the name of the file "
"that was uploaded, or, in the case of a :ref:`document envelope "
"<sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>`, the name of the first file "
"uploaded. If desired, edit the name of the template."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，範本的:guilabel:`名稱`會是所上載檔案的名稱；若是:ref:`文件信封 "
"<sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>`，則為第一個上載檔案的名稱。如有需"
"要，可編輯範本名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available in`: Select the :doc:`Odoo model "
"<../../studio/models_modules_apps>` to which the template is linked to "
"restrict the template to :ref:`signatures requests made from records of that"
" model <sign/request-signatures/template-odoo-record>`. Leave the field "
"empty to make the template available from any model."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`可用於`：選擇範本所連結的 :doc:`Odoo 模型 <../../studio/"
"models_modules_apps>`，以將該範本限制為僅用於 :ref:`從該模型的記錄發出的簽署"
"請求 <sign/request-signatures/template-odoo-record>`。如將此欄位留空，則任何"
"模型均可使用該範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Documents folder`: Define in which :ref:`folder in the Documents "
"app <documents/folders>` the documents using this template should be saved "
"once fully signed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`文件資料夾`：定義使用此範本的文件在完成簽署後，應儲存於哪個 "
":ref:`文件應用程式中的資料夾 <documents/folders>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:162
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`More options` to access and edit :ref:`advanced template "
"settings <sign/request-signatures/template-form>`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`更多選項`，以存取及編輯:ref:`進階範本設定 <sign/request-"
"signatures/template-form>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:166
msgid ""
"To replace a document in the template, such as with an updated version, "
"while preserving the fields already added, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) icon next to the relevant document, select "
":guilabel:`Replace document`, choose the new document, then click "
":guilabel:`Replace document`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:171
msgid ""
"Each replacement creates a duplicate of the template with the fields placed "
"at the same position as in the original. If the new document has a different"
" layout or added text, the fields may no longer align correctly. "
":ref:`Reposition them <sign/request-signatures/add-fields-edit>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"每次替換都會建立範本的複本，欄位會放置在與原始文件相同的位置。如果新文件的版"
"面配置不同或新增了文字，欄位可能會不再正確對齊。請按需要:ref:`重新調整其位置 "
"<sign/request-signatures/add-fields-edit>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:179
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:75
msgid "Use templates"
msgstr "使用範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:181
msgid ""
"Templates can be used when initiating a signature request :ref:`from the "
"Sign app <sign/request-signatures/template-sign-app>` or directly :ref:`from"
" an Odoo record <sign/request-signatures/template-odoo-record>`."
msgstr ""
"發起簽署請求時，可 :ref:`從「簽署」應用程式 <sign/request-signatures/"
"template-sign-app>` 或直接 :ref:`從 Odoo 記錄 <sign/request-signatures/"
"template-odoo-record>` 使用範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:190
msgid ""
"When using a template, there are two ways a signature request can be sent "
"from the Sign app:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:192
msgid "**via direct email** to one or more specific signers; or"
msgstr "**透過直接電郵**發送給一名或多名指定簽署人；或"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:193
msgid ""
"**via a shareable link**, provided the document or document envelope has "
"*only one signer*. This option is useful when multiple individuals need to "
"sign a personal copy of a document that requires a single signature, e.g., a"
" non-disclosure agreement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:198
msgid ""
"Each time a template is used to send a signature request via direct email, "
"and each time a recipient of a link signs a document, a new document is "
"created within Odoo Sign and appears in :menuselection:`Sign --> All "
"Documents`."
msgstr ""
"每次使用範本透過直接電郵傳送簽名請求，以及每次連結收件人簽署文件時，Odoo 簽名"
"應用程式內都會建立新文件，並顯示於 :menuselection:`簽名 --> 所有文件`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:202
msgid ""
"To send a signature request using a template to one or more specific signers"
" from the Sign app:"
msgstr "若要從「電子簽署」應用程式使用範本向一位或多位指定簽署人傳送簽署要求："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:205
msgid ""
"From the Kanban or list view, click :guilabel:`Send` on the line of the "
"relevant template. Alternatively, from the Kanban view, click on a template "
"to open it, then click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:216
msgid "To copy a link to a templated document or document envelope:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:219
msgid ""
"From the Kanban or list view, click :guilabel:`Share` on the line of the "
"relevant template. Alternatively, from the Kanban view, click on a template "
"to open it, then click :guilabel:`Share`."
msgstr ""
"在看板或列表檢視中，於相關範本的一行點擊 :guilabel:`分享`。或者，在看板檢視中"
"點擊範本將其開啟，然後點擊 :guilabel:`分享`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:222
msgid ""
"Optionally, update the :guilabel:`Valid Until` date if the signature request"
" link should expire; leave this blank if the signature request does not "
"expire."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:224
msgid "Click :icon:`fa-clone` to copy the link to your clipboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:227
msgid ""
"After a link has been shared, a :guilabel:`Shared` tag appears on the card "
"of the relevant template in the :guilabel:`Templates` Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"分享連結後，:guilabel:`已分享` 標籤會顯示在 :guilabel:`範本` 看板檢視中相關範"
"本的卡片上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:229
msgid ""
"To stop sharing a link, from the :guilabel:`Templates` Kanban view, click "
":guilabel:`Share` on the line of the relevant template, then click "
":guilabel:`Stop sharing`. Alternatively, hover over the relevant template, "
"click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon in the "
"top-right corner of the card, then click :guilabel:`Stop sharing`."
msgstr ""
"如要停止分享連結，請在 :guilabel:`範本` 看板視圖中，按一下相關範本所在行的 "
":guilabel:`分享`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`停止分享`。或者，將游標懸停在相關範本"
"上，按一下卡片右上角的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（垂直省略號）` 圖示"
"，然後按一下 :guilabel:`停止分享`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:240
msgid "To send a signature request using a template from an Odoo record:"
msgstr "要從 Odoo 記錄使用範本發送簽署請求："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:243
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Schedule Activity` popup, click :guilabel:`Request "
"Signature`, then select the relevant :guilabel:`Template` from the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`安排活動` 彈出視窗中，按一下 :guilabel:`請求簽署`，然後從下拉式"
"選單中選擇相關的 :guilabel:`範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:255
msgid ""
"To set a default template, :ref:`access the Request Signature activity type "
"form <activities/types>`, then select the relevant template in the "
":guilabel:`Default Signature Template` field."
msgstr ""
"如要設定預設範本，請 :ref:`前往「請求簽署」活動類型表單 <activities/types>`，"
"然後在 :guilabel:`預設簽署範本` 欄位中選擇相關範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:260
msgid ""
"Templates linked to the current :doc:`Odoo model "
