#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:317
msgid ""
"If the :doc:`../documents` app is installed, all signer responses related to"
" a specific template can be exported, which is useful, for example, for "
"parental consent forms, petitions, etc. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Sign"
" --> Templates`, click the relevant template's card, then click the "
":icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`Actions`) icon and select :guilabel:`Export "
"Answers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:322
msgid ""
"Responses are exported to an :doc:`Odoo spreadsheet <../spreadsheet>`, with "
"one column per :ref:`field <sign/request-signatures/add-fields>`, one line "
"per :ref:`signer <sign/request-signatures/signers>`, and one tab per "
"document for :ref:`document envelopes <sign/request-signatures/create-"
"envelope>`."
msgstr ""
"回覆會匯出至 :doc:`Odoo 試算表 <../spreadsheet>`，每個 :ref:`欄位 <sign/"
