"signatures/signers>` 佔一列；若是 :ref:`文件信封 <sign/request-signatures/"
"create-envelope>`，則每份文件佔一個分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:328
msgid ""
"The spreadsheet is saved in the :guilabel:`Sign Request Answers` folder in "
"Documents, with the template name referenced in the name of the spreadsheet."
