#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:336
msgid ""
"To access and modify a template's settings, go to :menuselection:`Sign --> "
"Templates`, hover over the relevant template's card, click the :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon, and select "
":guilabel:`Configuration`."
msgstr ""
"如要存取及修改範本設定，請前往 :menuselection:`簽名 --> 範本`，將游標懸停在相"
"關範本的卡片上，按一下 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（垂直省略號）` 圖示"
"，然後選擇 :guilabel:`配置`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:340
msgid "The following fields are available on the form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:342
msgid "the template's name"
msgstr "範本名稱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:343
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available in`: Select the :doc:`Odoo model "
"<../../studio/models_modules_apps>` to which the template is linked to "
"restrict the template to :ref:`signature requests made from records of that "
"model <sign/request-signatures/template-odoo-record>`. Leave the field empty"
" to make the template available from any model."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`可用於`：選擇範本所連結的 :doc:`Odoo 模型 <../../studio/"
"models_modules_apps>`，以限制範本僅用於 :ref:`從該模型記錄發起的簽署要求 "
"<sign/request-signatures/template-odoo-record>`。如將此欄位留空，則任何模型均"
"可使用該範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:347
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Authorized Users`: Specify the users authorized to view, use, and"
" modify the template."
msgstr ":guilabel:`授權用戶`：指定獲授權檢視、使用及修改範本的用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:348
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Authorized Groups`: If :guilabel:`Manage template access` is "
"enabled in the :ref:`main Sign settings <sign/configuration/settings>`, "
"define the user groups whose members are authorized to view and use this "
"template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:351
msgid ":guilabel:`Owner`: The user who created the template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:352
msgid ""
":guilabel:`CC`: Add contacts or email addresses to notify when the document "
"is fully signed or :ref:`refused <sign/sign-document/decline>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`副本`：加入聯絡人或電郵地址，以便在文件完成簽署或 :ref:`遭拒絕 "
"<sign/sign-document/decline>` 時通知他們。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:354
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Valid for`: Set a default number of days after which signature "
"requests using this template expire; enter `0` if signature requests should "
"not expire."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`有效期`：設定使用此範本的簽署請求在多少天後過期的預設天數；如簽署"
"請求不應過期，請輸入 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:358
msgid ""
"The expiry date and CC contacts of a signature request can always be "
"modified when :ref:`configuring the signature request <sign/request-"
"signatures/configure-request>`."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`設定簽名請求 <sign/request-signatures/configure-request>` 時，隨時都"
"可修改簽名請求的到期日及副本聯絡人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:361
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Add :ref:`tags <sign/configuration/tags>` to categorize "
"the template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:363
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Redirect Link`: Add a URL to redirect signers after signing the "
"document, such as a *Thank you* page, or the website's homepage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`重新導向連結`：新增一個網址，在簽署人簽署文件後將其重新導向，例如 "
"*感謝* 頁面或網站首頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:365
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Communication` tab, type a default text to include when a "
"signature request using this template is sent via email. The text can still "
"be edited before sending."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`通訊` 分頁中，輸入使用此範本透過電郵傳送簽署請求時所包含的預設"
"文字。傳送前仍可編輯該文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:367
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Signers` tab, view and edit any :ref:`signer settings "
"<sign/request-signatures/signer-settings>` defined for the template."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`簽署人` 分頁中，檢視並編輯為範本定義的任何 :ref:`簽署人設定 "
"<sign/request-signatures/signer-settings>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:371
msgid ""
"Access all signed documents related to the template by clicking the "
":guilabel:`Signed Document` smart button."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`已簽署文件` 智能按鈕，即可存取與該範本相關的所有已簽署文件"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:373
msgid ""
"Template settings can also be configured while :ref:`editing the template "
"<sign/request-signatures/edit-template>`."
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`編輯範本 <sign/request-signatures/edit-template>`期間，亦可配置範本設"
"定。"

