msgid ""
"See the overall :guilabel:`Status` of the signature request, e.g., "
":guilabel:`To Sign`, :guilabel:`Signed`, :guilabel:`Cancelled`."
msgstr ""
"查看簽署要求的整體:guilabel:`狀態`，例如:guilabel:`待簽署`、:guilabel:`已簽"
