msgid ":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Resend` a signature request manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:662
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Sign` a document or document envelope."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:663
msgid ":icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Download` the fully signed document(s)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:664
