"<sign/request-signatures/one-off-record>`發出的請求，亦可檢視相關聯的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:675
msgid "In the Kanban view:"
msgstr "在看板檢視中："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:677
