#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:685
msgid "See any tags added to the document(s)."
msgstr "查看已新增至文件的任何標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:686
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(clock)` icon to schedule an "
"activity related to the signature request."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`（時鐘）` 圖示，以安排與簽署請求相關的活動"
