#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:688
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon in the "
"top-right of the card to reveal more options:"
msgstr ""
"按一下卡片右上角的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（垂直省略號）` 圖示，以"
