msgid ""
":guilabel:`Signers`: the list of signers, including their :guilabel:`Role` "
"(i.e., the name given to the signer when the document was being "
":ref:`prepared for signing <sign/request-signatures/add-signers>`; by "
"default, `Signer 1`, `Signer 2`, etc.), email address, and signature status."
" Click :guilabel:`Resend` to manually resend the request to a signer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`簽署人`：簽署人清單，包括其 :guilabel:`角色`（即文件 :ref:`準備簽"
"署 <sign/request-signatures/add-signers>` 時為簽署人設定的名稱；預設為 "
"`Signer 1`、`Signer 2` 等）、電郵地址及簽署狀態。點擊 :guilabel:`重新傳送` 以"
"手動向簽署人重新傳送請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:735
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contacts in copy`: contacts added in the :guilabel:`CC` field "
"when the signature request was created"
msgstr ":guilabel:`副本聯絡人`：建立簽署請求時，在 :guilabel:`副本` 欄位新增的聯絡人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:737
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Activity Logs`: a complete log of actions performed on the "
"signature request, such as its creation, views, downloads, signatures, or "
":ref:`refusals <sign/sign-document/decline>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`活動紀錄`：記錄對簽署請求執行的所有操作，例如建立、檢視、下載、簽"
"署或 :ref:`拒絕 <sign/sign-document/decline>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:743
msgid "Replace a signer or update a signer's email address"
msgstr "更換簽署人或更新簽署人的電郵地址"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:745
msgid ""
"A signer can be replaced if the :guilabel:`Can delegate` option was "
":ref:`enabled for that signer <sign/request-signatures/signer-settings>` "
"when the document was being prepared for signing. To replace a signer, click"
