":guilabel:`簽署人` 分頁中點擊其名稱，然後再次點擊該名稱並選擇新的簽署人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:750
msgid ""
"To update a signer's email address, click the signer's name twice or, if the"
