" to it and update the email address in the contact form."
msgstr ""
"要更新簽署人的電郵地址，請連按兩下簽署人姓名；如已為該簽署人啟用 "
":guilabel:`可委派` 選項，則可按一下其姓名，再按旁邊的 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`（內部連結）` 圖示，然後在聯絡人表單中更新電郵地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:754
msgid ""
"The signature request is automatically sent to the new signer or email "
"address upon saving or navigating away from the signature request or contact"
" form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:3
msgid "Security and authentication"
msgstr "安全性與身份驗證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:5
msgid ""
"Various security features are integrated into Odoo Sign by default, such as:"
msgstr "Odoo 簽署預設整合了多項安全功能，例如："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:7
msgid ""
":ref:`email verification <sign/security/authentication>`, whereby the signer"
" receives a unique link to the document or :ref:`envelope of multiple "
"documents <sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>` via an email sent "
"directly to their email address"
msgstr ""
":ref:`電郵驗證 <sign/security/authentication>`，簽署人會透過直接傳送至其電郵"
"地址的電子郵件，收到該文件或 :ref:`多份文件信封 <sign/request-signatures/"
"create-envelope>` 的專屬連結"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:10
msgid ""
"a :ref:`signatory hash <sign/security/hash>` that links the signer's "
"identity to the exact content of the document at the moment of signing"
msgstr ""
"一組 :ref:`簽署人雜湊值 <sign/security/hash>`，用於將簽署人身份與簽署當刻的文"
"件確切內容連結起來"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:12
msgid ""
"a :ref:`certificate of completion <sign/security/certificate-of-completion>`"
" that provides details of the signing process"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:15
msgid "Additional security can be ensured by:"
msgstr "可透過以下方式確保額外安全性："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:17
msgid ""
"requiring other methods of :ref:`secured identification "
"<sign/security/authentication>`, such as SMS, Aadhaar eSign (India) or "
"itsme® (European Union, United Kingdom, Norway and Iceland)"
msgstr ""
"要求採用其他 :ref:`安全身份驗證 <sign/security/authentication>` 方式，例如短"
"訊、Aadhaar eSign（印度）或 itsme®（歐盟、英國、挪威及冰島）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:19
msgid ""
"using a :ref:`cryptographic signature <sign/security/cryptographic>` by "
"means of a digital certificate issued by a Certificate Authority (CA) or "
"generated yourself"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:25
msgid "Signatory hash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:27
msgid ""
"When someone signs a document, a *hash*, i.e., a unique digital signature of"
" the operation, is generated to link the signer's identity to the exact "
"content of the document at the moment of signing. This process guarantees "
"that any changes made after a signature has been added can be easily "
"detected, maintaining the document's authenticity and integrity throughout "
"its lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"當有人簽署文件時，系統會產生一個 *雜湊值*，即該次操作的唯一數碼簽署，將簽署人"
"的身份與簽署當刻的準確文件內容連結起來。此流程確保在加入簽署後對文件作出的任"
"何改動都可輕易偵測，從而在文件的整個生命週期內維持其真實性與完整性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:32
msgid ""
"A visual security frame displaying the beginning of the hash is added to "
"signatures and initials."
msgstr "簽名及簡簽會加入顯示雜湊值開頭部分的視覺安全框。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:34
msgid "Adding the visual security frame to a signature."
msgstr "為簽名加入視覺安全框。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:39
msgid ""
"Internal users can hide or show it by turning the :guilabel:`Frame` option "
"on or off when :ref:`adding their signature or initials to the document "
"<sign/sign-document/initials-signature>`."
msgstr ""
"內部用戶可開啟或關閉 :guilabel:`外框` 選項，以便在 :ref:`將簽名或簡簽加入文"
"件 <sign/sign-document/initials-signature>` 時隱藏或顯示外框。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:43
msgid ""
"The signatory hash of each signer is provided on the :ref:`certificate of "
"completion <sign/security/certificate-of-completion>` that is generated when"
" a document is fully signed."
msgstr ""
"當文件完成所有簽署後，系統會產生 :ref:`完成證書 <sign/security/certificate-"
"of-completion>`，當中載有每位簽署人的簽署人雜湊值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:49
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:65
msgid "Certificate of completion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:51
msgid ""
"Each time a document or document envelope is fully signed, i.e., completed "
"and signed by all signers, a certificate of completion is generated and sent"
" to all signers via email, along with the fully signed document(s)."
msgstr ""
"每當文件或文件信封完成全部簽署（即由所有簽署人完成並簽署）時，系統便會產生完"
"成證書，並連同已完全簽署的文件透過電郵發送給所有簽署人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:56
msgid ""
"When documents are :doc:`signed via an Odoo record's chatter "
"<sign_document>`, or when a signature request initiated from an Odoo record "
"is fully completed (whether a :ref:`one-off document <sign/request-"
"signatures/one-off-record>` or :ref:`using a template <sign/request-"
"signatures/template-odoo-record>`), the certificate of completion is also "
"added to the chatter, along with the fully signed document(s)."
msgstr ""
"當文件 :doc:`透過 Odoo 記錄的通訊欄簽署 <sign_document>` 時，或從 Odoo 記錄發"
"起的簽署請求完全完成時（無論是 :ref:`一次性文件 <sign/request-signatures/one-"
"off-record>` 還是 :ref:`使用範本 <sign/request-signatures/template-odoo-"
"record>`），完成證書亦會連同已完整簽署的文件一併加入通訊欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:62
msgid ""
"This certificate contains details of the signing process that support the "
"validity of the signatures and provide proof that the document has not been "
"altered after signing."
msgstr ""
"此證書包含簽署過程的詳細資料，有助證明簽名的有效性，並證實文件在簽署後未曾被"
"修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:69
msgid "The following information is provided:"
msgstr "系統會提供以下資訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document Details`, which include when the signature request was "
"created and by who, the file name of the `.pdf` document or documents that "
"were signed, the number of signers, and a unique reference hash that can "
"optionally be added to each page of a signed document."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`文件詳情`，其中包括建立簽署請求的時間及建立者、已簽署 `.pdf` 文件"
"的檔案名稱、簽署人數目，以及可選擇加入已簽署文件每一頁的獨特參考雜湊值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:74
msgid ""
"A list of :guilabel:`Participants` who have signed the document, including "
"the verification method and a unique :ref:`signatory hash "
"<sign/security/hash>` that ensures traceability and integrity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:76
msgid ""
"Timestamped, IP, and geographically traceable records of :guilabel:`Signing "
"Events` and :guilabel:`Access Logs`."
msgstr ""
"附有時間戳記、IP 及地理位置追蹤功能的 :guilabel:`簽署活動` 及 :guilabel:`存取"
"記錄` 記錄。"

