msgstr ""
"在彈出視窗中，選擇 :guilabel:`透過 itsme®`（位於 :guilabel:`身份驗證` 之下）"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:192
msgid ""
"Upon signing the document, an extra :guilabel:`Final verification` page is "
"displayed where authentication via itsme® is required."
msgstr ""
"簽署文件後，系統會顯示額外的 :guilabel:`最終驗證` 頁面，要求透過 itsme® 進行"
