#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:198
msgid "Cryptographic signature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:200
msgid ""
"Odoo Sign allows you to use your own digital certificate to sign documents. "
"A digital certificate uses cryptography, which relies on secure mathematical"
" algorithms, to ensure a signed document's authenticity and integrity."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 簽署讓您使用自己的數碼證書來簽署文件。數碼證書採用基於安全數學演算法的密"
"碼學技術，確保已簽署文件的真實性及完整性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:204
msgid ""
"Authenticity is ensured as your verified identity is linked to the "
"signature, while integrity is ensured as the document cannot be altered "
"without invalidating, or 'breaking', the cryptographic signature."
msgstr ""
"由於您已驗證的身份會與簽名連結，因此可確保真實性；而由於文件一旦被更改便會令"
"加密簽名失效（即「破壞」簽名），因此亦可確保完整性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:208
msgid ""
"A digital certificate is stored in a file such a `.p12` or `.pfx` file. This"
" is a secure container that contains:"
msgstr "數碼證書會儲存在 `.p12` 或 `.pfx` 等檔案中。這是一個安全容器，包含以下內容："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:211
msgid ""
"a *private key* that applies a unique cryptographic signature to a document;"
" and"
msgstr "一條 *私鑰*，用於為文件套用獨特的加密簽署；以及"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:212
msgid ""
"identifying information about the signer and a *public key* that is shared "
"with the recipient for signature validation"
msgstr "簽署人的身份識別資料，以及與收件人共享以作簽署驗證的 *公鑰*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:215
msgid ""
"The file is always protected by a password, which is never stored in plain "
"text. Odoo uses this password to decrypt the private key at the moment a "
"document is signed."
msgstr ""
"檔案一律受密碼保護，而密碼絕不會以純文字儲存。在簽署文件時，Odoo 會使用該密碼"
"解密私鑰。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:221
msgid "Obtain or create a digital certificate"
msgstr "取得或建立數碼證書"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:223
msgid ""
"Most businesses obtain their digital certificate from a trusted Certificate "
"Authority (CA). In many cases, the :abbr:`CA (Certificate Authority)` "
"provides the `.p12` or `.pfx` file directly, along with its password."
msgstr ""
"大多數企業都會向受信任的數碼證書認證機構（CA）取得數碼證書。在許多情況下"
"，:abbr:`CA (認證機構)` 會直接提供 `.p12` 或 `.pfx` 檔案及其密碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:227
msgid ""
"It is also possible to generate a certificate yourself. `Adobe Acrobat "
"<https://helpx.adobe.com/be_en/acrobat/desktop/protect-documents/manage-"
"digital-ids/create-self-signed-id.html>`_ and `Microsoft "
"<https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/obtain-a-digital-certificate-"
"and-create-a-digital-signature-e3d9d813-3305-4164-a820-2e063d86e512>`_, for "
"example, allow the creation of digital certificates."
msgstr ""
"你亦可自行生成憑證。例如，`Adobe Acrobat <https://helpx.adobe.com/be_en/"
"acrobat/desktop/protect-documents/manage-digital-ids/create-self-signed-"
"id.html>`_ 及 `Microsoft <https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/obtain-"
"a-digital-certificate-and-create-a-digital-signature-e3d9d813-3305-4164-a820-"
"2e063d86e512>`_ 均支援建立數碼憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:233
msgid ""
"Self-generated digital certificates do not provide the same level of trust "
"as a certificate obtained from a trusted :abbr:`CA (Certificate Authority)`."
" However, they can be useful if you need to provide a digital signature "
"urgently or for less official situations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:237
msgid ""
"Once you have obtained or created a digital certificate, you can then "
":ref:`upload it to your Odoo database <sign/security/cryptographic-upload>`."
msgstr ""
"取得或建立數碼證書後，你便可以 :ref:`將其上載至你的 Odoo 資料庫 <sign/"
"security/cryptographic-upload>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:243
msgid "Upload a digital certificate in Odoo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:245
msgid "To upload a digital certificate in Odoo:"
msgstr "要在 Odoo 上載數碼證書："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:247
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Sign --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`簽署 --> 配置 --> 設定`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:248
msgid ""
"Under :guilabel:`Cryptographic signature`, click the :guilabel:`Signing "
"certificate` dropdown and click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`加密簽署` 下，點擊 :guilabel:`簽署證書` 下拉式選單，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:250
msgid "In the pop-up, complete the relevant fields:"
msgstr "在彈出視窗中，填寫相關欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:252
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: Enter a name for the certificate."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：輸入證書的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:253
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate`: Click :guilabel:`Upload your file`, then select the"
" relevant certificate file in `.p12` or `.pfx` format."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`證書`：按一下 :guilabel:`上載您的檔案`，然後選擇 `.p12` 或 `.pfx` "
"格式的相關證書檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:255
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate Password`: Enter the certificate password for the "
"uploaded file; it must be minimum six characters. This password is used to "
"decrypt the private key during the signing process."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`證書密碼`：輸入已上載檔案的證書密碼；密碼須至少包含六個字元。此密"
