#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:18
msgid ""
"Documents prepared using Odoo Sign contain a series of fields to indicate "
"what information must be completed by the signer(s)."
msgstr "使用 Odoo 簽署準備的文件包含一系列欄位，用於指示簽署人必須填寫哪些資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:22
msgid ""
"Fields with a colored background are mandatory, while fields with a dotted "
"border and a white background are optional. Fields that have been "
":ref:`auto-completed <sign/sign-document/auto-complete>` and set to read-"
"only have a solid border and a white background; these fields are populated "
"as soon as the document is opened."
msgstr ""
"有色彩背景的欄位為必填欄位，而虛線邊框配白色背景的欄位則為選填欄位。已設定為 "
":ref:`自動填寫 <sign/sign-document/auto-complete>` 及唯讀的欄位會顯示實線邊框"
"配白色背景；這些欄位會在開啟文件時立即填入資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:28
msgid ""
"In the example below, the :guilabel:`Name` and :guilabel:`Signature` fields "
"are mandatory, while the :guilabel:`Job title` field is optional. The "
":guilabel:`Email` field has been auto-completed and set to read-only."
msgstr ""
