"Fields set to be auto-completed but *not* read-only are populated when "
"clicked or when arriving at the field using the navigational arrows; these "
"fields can still be edited."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:45
msgid ""
"When completing an :guilabel:`Initial` or :guilabel:`Signature` field, you "
"may need to :ref:`define the visual representation of your "
"initials/signature <sign/sign-document/initials-signature>`."
msgstr ""
"填寫 :guilabel:`簡簽` 或 :guilabel:`簽名` 欄位時，你可能需要 :ref:`定義簡簽/"
"簽名的視覺呈現方式 <sign/sign-document/initials-signature>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:49
msgid ""
"When all required fields have been completed, click :guilabel:`Validate & "
"Send Completed Document` at the bottom of the document."
msgstr "填妥所有必填欄位後，點擊文件底部的 :guilabel:`驗證及傳送已完成的文件`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:52
msgid ""
"If there are :ref:`multiple documents <sign/request-signatures/create-"
"envelope>` to sign, click :guilabel:`Next` at the bottom of the document, "
"enter the requested information for the next and any subsequent documents. "
"Once all documents have been signed, click :guilabel:`Validate & Send "
"Completed Document`."
msgstr ""
"若有 :ref:`多份文件 <sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>` 需要簽署，請點"
"擊文件底部的 :guilabel:`下一步`，並為下一份及其後所有文件輸入所需資料。簽署完"
"所有文件後，點擊 :guilabel:`驗證並傳送已完成文件`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:57
msgid "After signing the document:"
msgstr "簽署文件後："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:59
