msgstr "如果你是唯一或最後一位簽署人，可以直接 :guilabel:`下載` 該文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:62
msgid ""
"If you are an internal user, a list shows any other documents awaiting your "
