msgstr ""
"如果你是內部用戶，列表會顯示其他等待你簽署的文件；你隨後可以 :guilabel:`簽"
"署` 或 :guilabel:`檢視` 這些文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:65
msgid ""
"Once a document or document envelope has been fully signed, i.e., signed by "
"all signers, the signed document(s) and the :ref:`certificate of completion "
"<sign/security/certificate-of-completion>` are sent via email to the signers"
" and to any other parties defined by the sender."
msgstr ""
"當文件或文件封套完成全部簽署（即所有簽署人皆已簽署）後，已簽署的文件及 "
":ref:`完成證明 <sign/security/certificate-of-completion>` 將會透過電郵傳送給"
"簽署人及寄件人指定的其他相關人士。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:72
