#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:110
msgid ""
"Internal users can choose to keep or turn off the security :guilabel:`Frame`"
" that contains the beginning of the :ref:`signatory hash "
"<sign/security/hash>`, i.e., the unique digital signature of the operation."
