#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:124
msgid "Delegate signing"
msgstr "委派簽署"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:126
msgid ""
"A signer can delegate their signature to someone else if the :guilabel:`Can "
"delegate` option was :ref:`enabled for them <sign/request-signatures/signer-"
"settings>` when the document was being prepared for signing. The person to "
"whom signing is delegated then signs the document in their own name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:131
msgid ""
"To delegate the signing of a document or document envelope, click "
":guilabel:`Options` in the top-right corner next to the name(s) of the "
"signer(s), then select :guilabel:`Delegate`. Enter the :guilabel:`Name` and "
":guilabel:`Email` address of the person you are delegating to, then click "
":guilabel:`Delegate`. The signature request is then sent to the new signer."
msgstr ""
"若要委託他人簽署文件或文件封套，請按一下右上角簽署人姓名旁邊的 :guilabel:`選"
"項`，然後選取 :guilabel:`委託`。輸入受託人的 :guilabel:`姓名` 及 "
":guilabel:`電郵` 地址，再按一下 :guilabel:`委託`。系統隨即會將簽署要求傳送給"
"新的簽署人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:137
msgid ""
"Delegation is only available when accessing the signature request through "
"the link sent by email, not when the document is accessed directly from "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"只有在透過電郵傳送的連結存取簽署請求時，才可使用委託功能；直接從 Odoo 存取文"
"件時則無法使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:139
msgid ""
"It is not possible to delegate the signature of an individual document "
"within a document envelope."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:141
msgid ""
"The original signer is replaced by the new signer in the :guilabel:`Signers`"
" tab of the :ref:`signature request's details form <sign/request-"
"signatures/manage-form>`, moved to the :guilabel:`Contacts in copy` tab, and"
" the change is recorded in the chatter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:148
msgid "Decline a signature request"
msgstr "拒絕簽署要求"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:150
msgid ""
"To decline a signature request, click :guilabel:`Options` in the top-right "
"corner next to the name(s) of the signer(s), then select :guilabel:`Decline "
"to sign`. Enter the reason for the refusal, then click :guilabel:`Decline`. "
"The other signers are notified and any remaining signers can no longer sign "
"the document."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:156
msgid ""
"Declining is only available when accessing the signature request through the"
" link sent by email, not when the document is accessed directly from Odoo."
msgstr ""
"只有在透過電郵傳送的連結存取簽署請求時，才可使用拒絕功能；直接從 Odoo 存取文"
"件時，則無法使用此功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:158
msgid ""
"It is not possible to decline the signature of an individual document within"
" a document envelope."
msgstr "無法拒絕簽署文件封套內的單一文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:160
msgid ""
"Once a signer has declined to sign, the signature request is marked as "
":guilabel:`Cancelled` and the refusal is recorded in its :ref:`activity logs"
" and chatter <sign/request-signatures/manage-form>`."
msgstr ""
"當簽署人拒絕簽署時，該簽署請求會標記為 :guilabel:`已取消`，而該次拒絕亦會記錄"
"在其 :ref:`活動日誌及通訊欄 <sign/request-signatures/manage-form>` 中。"

