msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:202
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Sign Now`."
msgstr "點擊:guilabel:`立即簽署`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:205
msgid ""
"When signing a document that contains only :ref:`auto-completed fields "
"<sign/configuration/auto-fill>`, e.g., name, email, etc., click "
":guilabel:`Download` to immediately download a fully signed version, without"
" having to complete the fields manually."
msgstr ""
"簽署僅包含 :ref:`自動填寫欄位 <sign/configuration/auto-fill>`（例如姓名、電郵"
