msgstr ""
"已簽署的文件及完成證書會透過電郵發送給您，以及 :guilabel:`副本` 欄位中提及的"
"任何聯絡人；如要立即下載已簽署的文件，請點擊 :guilabel:`下載`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:216
msgid ""
"After signing, a list of any other documents awaiting your signature is "
