msgid ""
"In the Documents app, with the relevant folder or sub-folder open, click the"
" :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon beside the name of the folder."
msgstr ""
"在「文件」應用程式中，開啟相關資料夾或子資料夾後，點擊資料夾名稱旁邊的 "
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（操作）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/sign_document.rst:239
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-cog` :menuselection:`Actions on Select -->` :icon:`fa-caret-"
"right` :menuselection:`Sign`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :menuselection:`選取時的操作 -->` :icon:`fa-caret-right` "
":menuselection:`簽署`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:3
msgid "Validity of electronic signatures"
msgstr "電子簽署的有效性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:5
msgid ""
"The legal validity of electronic signatures generated by Odoo depends on "
"your country's legislation. Documents signed using the Sign app are "
"considered legally valid in the :ref:`European Union <sign/validity/eu>` and"
" the :ref:`United States of America <sign/validity/united-states>`. They "
"also meet the requirements for electronic signatures in :ref:`most countries"
" <sign/validity/other-countries>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 生成的電子簽署是否具備法律效力，取決於您所在國家或地區的法例。使用「簽署"
"」應用程式簽署的文件，在 :ref:`歐盟 <sign/validity/eu>` 及 :ref:`美國 <sign/"
"validity/united-states>` 均被視為具有法律效力，亦符合 :ref:`大多數國家 <sign/"
"validity/other-countries>` 對電子簽署的規定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:11
msgid ""
"Companies doing business abroad should also consider other countries' "
"electronic signature laws."
msgstr "在海外開展業務的公司亦應考慮其他國家的電子簽署法例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:14
msgid ""
"The below information has no legal value; it is only provided for general "
"informational purposes. As laws governing electronic signatures rapidly "
"evolve, we cannot guarantee that all information is up-to-date. We advise "
"contacting a local attorney for legal advice regarding electronic signature "
"compliance and validity."
msgstr ""
"以下資訊不具任何法律效力，僅供一般參考之用。由於規管電子簽名的法例演變迅速，"
"我們無法保證所有資訊均為最新。如需有關電子簽名合規性及有效性的法律意見，我們"
"建議聯絡當地律師。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:22
msgid "European Union"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:24
msgid ""
"The `eIDAS regulation <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/910/oj>`_ "
"establishes the framework for electronic signatures in the `27 member states"
" of the European Union <https://europa.eu/european-union/about-"
"eu/countries_en>`_. It distinguishes three types of electronic signatures:"
msgstr ""
"`eIDAS 法規 <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/910/oj>`_ 為 `歐盟 27 個成員"
"國 <https://europa.eu/european-union/about-eu/countries_en>`_ 的電子簽署建立"
"了法律框架，並區分了三種電子簽署類型："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:29
msgid "Simple Electronic Signatures"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:30
msgid "Advanced Electronic Signatures"
msgstr "進階電子簽署"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:31
msgid "Qualified Electronic Signatures"
msgstr "合資格電子簽署"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:33
msgid ""
"Odoo generates a signature that is equivalent to **Advanced Electronic "
"Signatures** by default; these signatures are legally valid in the EU, as "
"stated in the eIDAS regulation. If a higher level of certification is "
"needed, **itsme®** integration also makes it possible to use a **Qualified "
"Electronic Signature**  when signing. These are useful for high-value "
"contracts or sectors that require increased trust."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 預設產生的簽署相當於**進階電子簽署**；根據《eIDAS 法規》，此類簽署在歐盟"
"具有法律效力。如需要更高級別的認證，整合 **itsme®** 後亦可在簽署時使用**合資"
"格電子簽署**。這些簽署特別適用於高價值合約或對信任度要求較高的行業。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:39
msgid ""
"You may need to bring supporting evidence of a signature's validity. While "
"the Sign app provides an **Advanced Electronic Signature**, some supporting "
"evidence is automatically collected during the signature process, such as:"
msgstr ""
"你可能需要提供簽署有效性的佐證資料。雖然簽署應用程式提供 **進階電子簽署**，但"
"在簽署過程中系統亦會自動收集部分佐證資料，例如："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:43
msgid "Email validation and SMS validation (if enabled)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:44
msgid "Strong identity proof through itsme® (if enabled)"
msgstr "透過 itsme® 提供高強度身份認證（如有啟用）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:45
msgid ""
"Timestamped, IP and geographically traceable access logs to the documents "
"and their associated signatures"
msgstr "附有時間戳記，且可追蹤 IP 及地理位置的文件及其相關簽署存取記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:47
msgid ""
"Document traceability and inalterability (any alteration made to a signed "
"document is detected by Odoo with the use of cryptographic proofs)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:51
msgid ":doc:`Documentation for Germany <validity/germany>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:56
msgid "United States of America"
msgstr "美國"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:58
msgid ""
"The `ESIGN Act (Electronic Signatures in Global and National Commerce Act) "
"<https://www.fdic.gov/regulations/compliance/manual/10/X-3.1.pdf>`_, at the "
"interstate and international levels, and the `UETA (Uniform Electronic "
"Transactions Act) <https://www.uniformlaws.org/committees/community-"
"home/librarydocuments?communitykey=2c04b76c-2b7d-4399-977e-d5876ba7e034&tab=librarydocuments>`_,"
" at the state level, provide the legal framework for electronic signatures. "
"Note that `Illinois "
"<https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/ilcs5.asp?ActID=89&>`_ and `New York "
"<https://its.ny.gov/electronic-signatures-and-records-act-esra>`_ have not "
"adopted the UETA, but similar acts instead."
msgstr ""
"在州際及國際層面的 `《全球及國家商業電子簽署法》(ESIGN Act) <https://"
"www.fdic.gov/regulations/compliance/manual/10/X-3.1.pdf>`_，以及在州層面的 "
"`《統一電子交易法》(UETA) <https://www.uniformlaws.org/committees/community-"
"home/librarydocuments?communitykey=2c04b76c-2b7d-4399-977e-"
"d5876ba7e034&tab=librarydocuments>`_，共同為電子簽署提供了法律框架。請注意"
"，`伊利諾州 <https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/ilcs5.asp?ActID=89&>`_ 和 "
"`紐約州 <https://its.ny.gov/electronic-signatures-and-records-act-esra>`_ 並"
"未採用《統一電子交易法》，而是採用了類似的法案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:67
msgid ""
"Overall, to be recognized as valid, electronic signatures have to meet five "
"criteria:"
msgstr "整體而言，電子簽署必須符合五項準則，方會獲認可為有效："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:69
msgid ""
"The signer must show a clear **intent to sign**. For example, using a mouse "
"to draw a signature can show intent. The signer must also have the option to"
" opt out of the electronic document."
msgstr ""
"簽署人必須表現出明確的**簽署意圖**。例如，使用滑鼠繪製簽名即可顯示意圖。簽署"
"人亦必須有權選擇退出電子文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:71
msgid ""
"The signer must first express or imply their **consent to conduct business "
"electronically**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:72
msgid ""
"**The signature must be clearly attributed**. In Odoo, metadata, such as the"
" signer's IP address, is added to the signature, which can be used as "
"supporting evidence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:74
msgid ""
"**The signature must be associated with the signed document**, for example, "
"by keeping a record detailing how the signature was captured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/validity.rst:76
msgid ""
"Electronically signed documents need to be **retained and stored** by all "
"parties involved; for example, by providing the signer either a fully-"
"executed copy or the possibility to download a copy."
msgstr ""
"所有相關各方均須 **保留及儲存** 電子簽署文件；例如，向簽署人提供完整簽署副本"
"或下載副本的途徑。"

