msgid ""
":icon:`os-paint-format` :guilabel:`Change tab color`: select an existing or "
"custom color to add a colored bar to the bottom of the sheet's tab. Tab "
"colors appear as dots beside the sheet name when using the :icon:`fa-bars` "
":guilabel:`(menu)` icon to see a list of all sheets in the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":icon:`os-paint-format` :guilabel:`更改分頁顏色`：選擇現有或自訂顏色，在工作"
