msgid ""
":guilabel:`Change grid color`: select an existing or custom color to change "
"the color of the grid of the individual sheet."
msgstr ":guilabel:`更改格線顏色`：選擇現有或自訂顏色，以更改個別工作表的格線顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:179
msgid ""
":icon:`os-move-sheet-right` :guilabel:`Move sheet right` or :icon:`os-move-"
"sheet-left` :guilabel:`Move sheet left`: moves the sheet one position to the"
" right or left."
msgstr ""

