msgid ""
"Users with :guilabel:`Editor` rights can lock sheets to prevent accidental "
"modifications to the sheet's data."
msgstr ""
"擁有 :guilabel:`編輯者` 權限的用戶可鎖定工作表，以防止意外修改工作表中的資料"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:193
msgid ""
"To do so, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down caret)` on a "
"sheet's tab or right-click the tab, then click :icon:`fa-lock` "
":guilabel:`Lock sheet`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:196
msgid ""
"Any user with :guilabel:`Editor` rights can unlock the sheet by clicking "
":guilabel:`Unlock sheet` from the bottom bar menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:202
msgid "Hide sheets"
msgstr "隱藏工作表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:204
msgid ""
"Users with :guilabel:`Editor` rights can hide sheets that should not be "
"visible, for example, if data is not ready to be shared or is being used "
"only for calculations by other sheets."
msgstr ""
"擁有 :guilabel:`編輯者` 權限的使用者可隱藏不應顯示的工作表，例如尚未準備好分"
"享的資料，或僅供其他工作表用於計算的工作表。"

