msgid ""
"To do so, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down caret)` on a "
"sheet's tab or right-click the tab, then click :icon:`fa-eye-slash` "
":guilabel:`Hide sheet`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:210
msgid ""
"The sheet is then removed from the bottom bar, but still included, with its "
"name grayed out, in the list of all sheets accessible via the :icon:`fa-"
"bars` :guilabel:`(menu)` icon. Users with:"
