msgid ":guilabel:`Viewer` rights cannot open a hidden sheet."
msgstr ":guilabel:`檢視者` 權限無法開啟隱藏的工作表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Editor` rights can open a hidden sheet via the :icon:`fa-bars` "
":guilabel:`(menu)` icon; this restores the sheet's tab on the bottom bar."
