#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:240
msgid ""
"When you download a spreadsheet in `.xlsx` format, any spreadsheet formulas "
"that retrieve Odoo data from your database, e.g., via an :doc:`inserted list"
" <insert>` or via other :doc:`Odoo-specific functions "
"<work_with_data/functions>`, are converted to the values they would have "
"returned at the moment the spreadsheet was downloaded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:246
msgid ""
"Users with :guilabel:`Viewer` rights can also download a spreadsheet in "
"`.xlsx` format."
msgstr "擁有 :guilabel:`檢視者` 權限的使用者亦可下載 `.xlsx` 格式的試算表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:248
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`Print`: prints a copy of the spreadsheet on a "
"connected printer."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`列印`：在已連接的打印機上列印試算表副本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:249
msgid ""
":icon:`os-save` :guilabel:`Save as template`: allows the current spreadsheet"
" to be used as a :ref:`template <spreadsheet/get-started/templates>` for "
"future spreadsheets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:251
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Move to trash`: moves the spreadsheet to the "
"trash folder of the Documents app"
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`移至垃圾桶`：將試算表移至文件應用程式的垃圾桶資料"
"夾"

