msgid "Items in the trash folder are permanently deleted after 30 days."
msgstr "垃圾桶資料夾中的項目會在 30 天後永久刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:257
msgid ""
":icon:`os-add-to-dashboard` :guilabel:`Add to dashboard`: :ref:`converts "
"<spreadsheet/get-started/convert-to-dashboard>` the current spreadsheet into"
" an :doc:`Odoo dashboard <../dashboards>`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`os-add-to-dashboard` :guilabel:`加入至儀表板`：:ref:`轉換 "
"<spreadsheet/get-started/convert-to-dashboard>`目前的試算表為 :doc:`Odoo 儀表"
"板 <../dashboards>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:260
msgid ""
":icon:`os-version-history` :guilabel:`See version history`: provides read-"
"only :ref:`access to previous versions <spreadsheet/get-started/manage-"
"spreadsheets-versioning>` of the current spreadsheet, which can be named and"
" restored if needed."
msgstr ""
":icon:`os-version-history` :guilabel:`查看版本記錄`：為目前試算表提供唯讀的 "
":ref:`存取先前版本 <spreadsheet/get-started/manage-spreadsheets-versioning>` "
"功能，如有需要，可為先前版本命名及還原。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:263
msgid ""
":icon:`os-cog` :guilabel:`Settings`: allows you to view and change the "
":ref:`locale <spreadsheet/get-started/manage-spreadsheets-locale>` of the "
"current spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":icon:`os-cog` :guilabel:`設定`：讓你檢視及更改目前試算表的 :ref:`地區設定 "
"<spreadsheet/get-started/manage-spreadsheets-locale>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:271
msgid ""
"Odoo Spreadsheet automatically saves versions of spreadsheets as changes are"
" made, allowing users with :guilabel:`Editor` rights to browse and restore "
"previous versions."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 試算表會在作出變更時自動儲存試算表版本，讓擁有 :guilabel:`編輯者` 權限的"
"用戶瀏覽及還原先前版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:274
msgid ""
"To access the version history of a spreadsheet, click :menuselection:`File "
"-->` :icon:`os-version-history` :menuselection:`See version history` from "
"the menu bar. Saved versions appear in a panel on the right of the "
"spreadsheet. The name of the user who made the change is shown, as well as "
"the date and time of the change."
msgstr ""
"要查看試算表的版本紀錄，請在選單列按一下 :menuselection:`檔案 -->` :icon:`os-"
"version-history` :menuselection:`查看版本紀錄`。已儲存的版本會顯示在試算表右"
"側的面板中，並同時顯示作出更改的用戶名稱，以及更改的日期和時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:279
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:306
msgid "The following actions are possible:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:281
msgid ""
"**View an earlier version** in read-only format by clicking on the relevant "
"version."
msgstr "點擊相關版本，即可以唯讀格式**檢視較早版本**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:282
msgid ""
"**Restore an earlier version** by clicking :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
":guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` then :guilabel:`Restore this version`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:284
msgid ""
"**Copy an earlier version** by clicking :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
":guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` then :menuselection:`Make a copy`. A copy of"
" the version opens as a new spreadsheet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:286
msgid ""
"**Create named versions** by clicking on the date and time of the relevant "
"version and entering the desired name. The date and time of the version are "
"then displayed below the new name."
msgstr ""
"**建立具名版本**：點擊相關版本的日期和時間，並輸入所需名稱。之後，該版本的日"
"期和時間會顯示在新名稱下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:290
msgid ""
"When viewing an earlier, read-only version of a spreadsheet, the following "
"actions are still possible:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:293
msgid ""
"Search the spreadsheet by clicking :menuselection:`Edit -->` :icon:`fa-"
"search` :menuselection:`Find and replace` or using the shortcut `Ctrl` + "
"`H`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:295
msgid ""
"Copy an individual cell or selected area by clicking :menuselection:`Edit "
"-->` :icon:`fa-clipboard` :menuselection:`Copy` or using the shortcut `Ctrl`"
" + `C`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:301
msgid "Regional settings"
msgstr "地區設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:303
msgid ""
"To ensure data is displayed consistently for all users, the regional "
"settings (or locale) of a spreadsheet, are managed at spreadsheet level. "
"This locale affects the following settings and formats:"
msgstr ""
"為確保所有用戶看到的資料顯示方式一致，試算表的地區設定（或語言環境）會在試算"
"表層級進行管理。此地區設定會影響以下設定及格式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:307
msgid "thousand and decimal separators"
msgstr "千位及小數點分隔符號"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:308
msgid "date and time formats"
msgstr "日期及時間格式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:309
msgid "first day of the week"
msgstr "每週的第一天"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:311
msgid ""
"By default, a new spreadsheet inherits the regional settings of the user who"
" created it. For example, any spreadsheets created by a user whose language "
"is set to :guilabel:`French (BE) / Français (BE)` will follow Belgian French"
" conventions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:315
msgid ""
"A spreadsheet's locale can be viewed and changed at any time by a user with "
":guilabel:`Editor` rights. To view the locale of a spreadsheet, click "
":menuselection:`File -->` :icon:`os-cog` :menuselection:`Settings` from the "
"menu bar. The :guilabel:`Spreadsheet settings` panel opens on the right of "
"the spreadsheet. To change the locale, select the appropriate locale from "
"the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"擁有 :guilabel:`編輯者` 權限的用戶可隨時查看及更改試算表的地區設定。如要查看"
"試算表的地區設定，請在選單列點擊 :menuselection:`檔案 -->` :icon:`os-cog` "
":menuselection:`設定`。試算表右側會開啟 :guilabel:`試算表設定` 面板。如要更改"
"地區設定，請從下拉式選單中選擇合適的地區設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:321
msgid ""
"When you open a spreadsheet that has a different locale to that of your user"
" profile, a blue :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`(globe)` icon appears at the "
"top right of the spreadsheet. Hovering over the icon reveals a warning "
"message that indicates the spreadsheet locale and highlights formats that "
"differ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:326
msgid "Warning about difference between user and spreadsheet locale"
msgstr "用戶與試算表語言環境差異警告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:329
msgid ""
"If no :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`(globe)` icon is shown, this means the "
"spreadsheet's locale is the same as that of your user profile."
msgstr ""
"如果未有顯示 :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`（地球）` 圖示，即表示試算表的地區設"
"定與你的用戶個人資料相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:335
msgid "Convert a spreadsheet into a dashboard"
msgstr "將試算表轉換為儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:337
msgid ""
"A user with the appropriate :ref:`access rights <access-rights/groups>` can "
"convert an Odoo spreadsheet into a dashboard that is then accessible via "
":doc:`Odoo Dashboards <../../../applications/productivity/dashboards>`. To "
"do so:"
msgstr ""
"具備適當 :ref:`存取權限 <access-rights/groups>` 的用戶可將 Odoo 試算表轉換為"
"儀表板，之後可透過 :doc:`Odoo 儀表板 <../../../applications/productivity/"
"dashboards>` 存取該儀表板。步驟如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:341
msgid ""
"Click :menuselection:`File -->` :icon:`os-add-to-dashboard` "
":menuselection:`Add to dashboard` from the menu bar."
msgstr ""
"在選單列按一下 :menuselection:`檔案 -->` :icon:`os-add-to-dashboard` "
":menuselection:`新增至儀表板`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:343
msgid "Enter the :guilabel:`Dashboard Name`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:344
msgid ""
"Select the relevant :guilabel:`Dashboard Section` from the dropdown or, to "
"create a new dashboard section, type the name of the new section, then click"
" :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"從下拉式選單中選擇相關的 :guilabel:`儀表板區段`；若要建立新的儀表板區段，請輸"
"入新區段的名稱，然後按一下 :guilabel:`建立`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:346
msgid ""
"If necessary, modify the :guilabel:`Access Groups` to determine which "
":ref:`user groups <dashboards/access-and-sharing>` can access the dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:351
msgid ""
"By default, the first tab of the spreadsheet serves as the front end of the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:352
msgid ""
"It is also possible to convert a spreadsheet to a dashboard from within the "
":ref:`Dashboard configuration settings <dashboards/configuration>`, by "
"directly adding the spreadsheet to an existing or new dashboard section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:355
msgid ""
"After a spreadsheet has been converted to a dashboard, it is deleted from "
"Odoo Documents. Any subsequent :ref:`modifications "
"<build_and_customize_dashboards/customize>` need to be made via Odoo "
"Dashboards."
msgstr ""
"電子試算表轉換為儀表板後，便會從 Odoo 文件中刪除。之後的任何:ref:`修改 "
"<build_and_customize_dashboards/customize>`都必須透過 Odoo 儀表板進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:362
msgid "Sheet specifications and limits"
msgstr "工作表規格與限制"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:365
msgid ""
"The number of columns and rows per sheet can affect spreadsheet performance."
" However, the main factor is often the nature of the formulas used and the "
"ranges they need to scan. In particular, formulas that create quadratic "
"behavior, where formulas copied down many rows each scan a large range, can "
"severely impact performance in large datasets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:370
msgid ""
"A new sheet in an Odoo spreadsheet contains 26 columns (i.e., columns A-Z) "
"and 100 rows by default. Additional columns and rows can be added according "
"to your needs, keeping the following points in mind:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:374
msgid ""
"**Columns**: While there is no technical limit on the number of columns that"
" can be *displayed* in a sheet, formulas in Odoo Spreadsheet only support "
"3-letter column references, which means that a formula referencing, e.g., "
"column AAAA, will result in an error."
msgstr ""
"**欄數**：雖然工作表中可 *顯示* 的欄數在技術上沒有上限，但 Odoo 試算表中的公"
"式僅支援 3 個字母的欄參照，這意味著如果公式參照例如 AAAA 欄，將會導致錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:378
msgid ""
"The practical limit on the number of columns per sheet is therefore 18,278 "
"columns (i.e., up to column ZZZ)."
msgstr "因此，每個工作表的欄數實際上限為 18,278 欄（即最多至 ZZZ 欄）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:380
msgid ""
"**Rows**: There is no fixed limit on the number of rows a sheet can contain."
msgstr "**列**：工作表可包含的列數沒有固定上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:383
msgid ""
"To quickly add a maximum of 10,000 rows to the bottom of the sheet in one "
"go, scroll to the bottom of the sheet, enter the desired number of rows, "
"then click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/get_started.rst:386
msgid ""
"**Cells and characters per cell**: There is no fixed limit on the number of "
"cells a sheet can contain, nor on the number of characters within a cell."
msgstr ""
"**儲存格及每個儲存格的字元數**：工作表可包含的儲存格數量，以及單一儲存格內的"
"字元數量均沒有固定上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:5
msgid "Insert and link to Odoo data"
msgstr "插入並連結至 Odoo 資料"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:16
msgid ""
"Several elements from your Odoo database can be inserted into an Odoo "
"spreadsheet, namely:"
msgstr "您可將 Odoo 資料庫中的多個元素插入 Odoo 試算表，包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:18
msgid ""
":doc:`lists <insert/insert_list>`, i.e., data from a :ref:`list view "
"<studio/views/multiple-records/list>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:20
msgid ""
":doc:`pivot tables <insert/insert_pivot_table>`, i.e., data from a "
":ref:`pivot view <studio/views/reporting/pivot>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:22
msgid ""
":doc:`charts <insert/insert_chart>`, i.e., data from a :ref:`graph view "
"<studio/views/reporting/graph>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`圖表 <insert/insert_chart>`，即來自 :ref:`統計圖檢視 <studio/views/"
"reporting/graph>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:25
msgid ""
"Each time a list, pivot table, or chart is inserted, a :ref:`data source "
"<spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>` is created, directly connecting the "
"spreadsheet to the underlying data."
msgstr ""
"每次插入清單、樞紐分析表或圖表時，系統都會建立一個 :ref:`資料來源 "
"<spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>`，將試算表直接連接至底層資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:30
msgid ""
"Lists, pivot tables, and charts from different apps and models can be "
"inserted into the same spreadsheet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:32
msgid ""
"It is also possible to :ref:`insert a pivot table that retrieves Odoo data "
"directly from an Odoo spreadsheet "
"<spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_spreadsheet>`."
msgstr ""
"亦可以 :ref:`插入直接從 Odoo 試算表擷取 Odoo 資料的樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/"
"insert_pivot_table/from_spreadsheet>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:36
msgid ""
"If you intend to use :doc:`global filters <work_with_data/global_filters>` "
"to dynamically filter Odoo data in a spreadsheet or dashboard, do not use "
"the same conditions to establish the initial list, pivot table, or chart in "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"如果您打算使用 :doc:`全域篩選器 <work_with_data/global_filters>` 在試算表或儀"
"表板中動態篩選 Odoo 資料，請勿使用相同條件來建立資料庫中的初始清單、樞紐分析"
"表或圖表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:42
msgid ""
":doc:`add clickable links <insert/insert_clickable_links>` to Odoo menu "
"items, to other sheets of the same spreadsheet, or to external URLs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:44
msgid ""
":doc:`insert financial data <insert/insert_financial_data>` from your Odoo "
"database using Odoo-specific spreadsheet :doc:`functions "
"<work_with_data/functions>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:50
msgid "Data sources"
msgstr "資料來源"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:52
msgid ""
"When you :doc:`insert a list <insert/insert_list>` or :doc:`chart "
"<insert/insert_chart>` from an Odoo list or chart view into an Odoo "
"spreadsheet, or insert a pivot table referencing Odoo data :ref:`from an "
"Odoo pivot view <spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_view>` or "
":ref:`directly from a spreadsheet "
"<spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_spreadsheet>`, the spreadsheet is "
"automatically connected to the underlying data thanks to a unique 'data "
"source.'"
msgstr ""
"當您從 Odoo 清單或圖表視圖 :doc:`插入清單 <insert/insert_list>` 或 :doc:`圖"
"表 <insert/insert_chart>` 至 Odoo 試算表，又或 :ref:`從 Odoo 樞紐分析視圖 "
"<spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_view>` 或 :ref:`直接從試算表 "
"<spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_spreadsheet>` 插入參照 Odoo 資料的樞紐分"
"析表時，試算表會透過獨有的「資料來源」自動連接至底層資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:58
msgid ""
"This connection ensures that the data in the spreadsheet is updated when the"
" corresponding data in your database changes, and allows you to :ref:`access"
" the underlying data <spreadsheet/insert/accessing-data>`."
msgstr ""
"此連線可確保當資料庫中的相應資料有所變更時，試算表內的資料亦會隨之更新，並讓"
"你 :ref:`存取底層資料 <spreadsheet/insert/accessing-data>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:63
msgid ""
"Data in a list, pivot table, or chart linked to an Odoo model is refreshed "
"every time the spreadsheet is opened or the browser page is reloaded. It is "
"also possible to manually refresh data by clicking :menuselection:`Data -->`"
" :icon:`os-refresh-data` :menuselection:`Refresh all data` from the menu "
"bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:67
msgid ""
"Inserting a pivot table :ref:`from a range of data <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/create>` also creates a data source that connects the pivot table to "
"the underlying spreadsheet range."
msgstr ""
"從 :ref:`資料範圍 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/create>` 插入樞紐分析表時，系統亦"
"會建立資料來源，將樞紐分析表連接至底層試算表範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:70
msgid ""
"Each data source is identified by a unique ID, with each source type (i.e., "
"list, pivot table, or chart) numbered separately, and each new list, pivot "
"table, or chart numbered sequentially, e.g., *List #1*, *List #2*, *Pivot "
"#1*, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:74
msgid ""
"The properties of a data source can be accessed via the :guilabel:`Data` "
"menu, where they are grouped by source type, and then listed in ascending "
"order by source ID. The name of the data source is displayed, e.g., "
":icon:`oi-view-pivot` *(#1) Sales Analysis by Product*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:78
msgid ""
"Clicking on a data source opens the related properties in a panel on the "
"right of the spreadsheet."
msgstr "點擊資料來源，即可在試算表右側的面板中開啟相關屬性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:81
msgid ""
"Deleting an inserted list or pivot table, or deleting the sheet into which "
"it was inserted, does not delete the underlying data source; this can be "
"done via the data source's properties. Unused data sources from inserted "
"lists or pivot tables can also be deleted via the :ref:`Data cleanup "
"<spreadsheet/insert/delete-unused-sources>` feature. Deleting an inserted "
"chart deletes its underlying data source."
msgstr ""
"刪除已插入的清單或樞紐分析表，或刪除插入它們的工作表，並不會刪除其底層資料來"
"源；您可以透過資料來源的屬性進行刪除。已插入清單或樞紐分析表中未使用的資料來"
"源，亦可透過 :ref:`資料清理 <spreadsheet/insert/delete-unused-sources>` 功能"
"刪除。刪除已插入的圖表則會一併刪除其底層資料來源。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:88
msgid ""
"The properties panel can also be opened by right-clicking any cell of an "
"inserted list or pivot table, then clicking :icon:`oi-view-list` "
":guilabel:`See list properties` or :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`See "
"pivot properties`, or by clicking the :icon:`fa-bars` :guilabel:`(menu)` "
"icon at the top right of an inserted chart, then clicking :icon:`fa-pencil-"
"square-o` :guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr ""
"您亦可在已插入的清單或樞紐分析表中，於任何儲存格上按右鍵，然後點擊 :icon:`oi-"
"view-list` :guilabel:`查看清單屬性` 或 :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`查看"
"樞紐分析表屬性`，以開啟屬性面板；或者點擊已插入圖表右上角的 :icon:`fa-bars` "
":guilabel:`（選單）` 圖示，再點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`編"
"輯`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:93
msgid ""
"Once the properties of a specific data source are open, they remain open "
"even when navigating between spreadsheet tabs. To close the properties "
"panel, click the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(close)` icon at the top right "
"of the panel."
msgstr ""
"開啟特定資料來源的屬性後，即使在試算表分頁之間切換，屬性面板仍會保持開啟。要"
"關閉屬性面板，請點擊面板右上角的 :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`（關閉）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:96
msgid ""
"To collapse the properties panel, click the :icon:`fa-angle-double-right` "
":guilabel:`(double chevron)` icon at the top of the panel."
msgstr ""
