#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:138
msgid "Convert a static list to a dynamic list"
msgstr "將靜態清單轉換為動態清單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:140
msgid ""
"To allow an inserted list to expand and accommodate new records, convert the"
" list to a :ref:`dynamic list <spreadsheet/insert-list/static-vs-dynamic>`, "
"then :ref:`update the array function <spreadsheet/insert-list/dynamic-all-"
"records>`."
msgstr ""
"要讓已插入的清單可擴展以容納新記錄，請將清單轉換為 :ref:`動態清單 "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/static-vs-dynamic>`，然後 :ref:`更新陣列函數 "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/dynamic-all-records>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:144
msgid "There are two main ways to convert a static list to a dynamic list:"
msgstr "將靜態清單轉換為動態清單主要有兩種方法："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:146
msgid ""
":ref:`Duplicate the list from the list properties <spreadsheet/insert-"
"list/duplicate>`. The new dynamic list has the same styling as the original "
"list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:150
msgid ""
"With this method, the new dynamic list is assigned the next available list "
"ID. This means multiple lists can be associated with the same model, but "
"have distinct configurations or calculations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:154
msgid ""
"**Re-insert a dynamic list from the Data menu.** On the sheet that contains "
"the static list, position the cursor in an empty cell. Click "
":menuselection:`Data -->` :icon:`os-insert-list` :menuselection:`Re-insert "
"dynamic list` from the menu bar, then select the relevant list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:159
msgid ""
"A new dynamic list appears, with the same styling as the original list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:162
msgid ""
"It is also possible to re-insert a dynamic list by entering the "
":ref:`function of the dynamic list <spreadsheet/insert-list/dynamic-"
"function>` in an empty cell, e.g., `=ODOO.LIST(1)`, where `1` is the "
":ref:`list ID <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties-id>`. However, with this "
"method, the table styling needs to be re-applied manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:168
msgid ""
"When a dynamic list is re-inserted from the data menu or by manually "
"entering the dynamic list function, the static and dynamic lists share the "
"same data source and, consequently, the same list ID. To avoid confusion, "
"delete the original static list."
msgstr ""
"從數據選單重新插入動態清單，或手動輸入動態清單函式時，靜態清單與動態清單會共"
"用相同的數據來源，因此亦會共用相同的清單 ID。為免混淆，請刪除原本的靜態清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:172
msgid ""
"The top-left cell of the new dynamic list contains an :ref:`Odoo-specific "
"array function <spreadsheet/insert-list/dynamic-function>` that retrieves "
"data from the database."
msgstr ""
"新動態清單左上角的儲存格包含:ref:`Odoo 專用陣列函式 <spreadsheet/insert-list/"
"dynamic-function>`，用於從資料庫擷取資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:176
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:230
msgid ""
":ref:`Determine the number of records displayed in a dynamic list "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/dynamic-all-records>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:182
msgid "Insert an Odoo list from a spreadsheet"
msgstr "從試算表插入 Odoo 清單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:184
msgid "To insert an Odoo list directly from an Odoo spreadsheet:"
msgstr "如要直接從 Odoo 試算表插入 Odoo 清單："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:186
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:248
msgid ""
"Open the relevant Odoo spreadsheet from the **Documents** app or "
":ref:`create a new blank spreadsheet <spreadsheet/get-started/create-"
"spreadsheet>`."
msgstr ""
"從 **文件** 應用程式開啟相關的 Odoo 試算表，或 :ref:`建立新的空白試算表 "
"<spreadsheet/get-started/create-spreadsheet>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:188
msgid ""
"Click :menuselection:`Insert -->` :icon:`oi-view-list` :menuselection:`Odoo "
"list` from the menu bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:190
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`New Odoo list` panel at the right of the sheet, select the"
" :guilabel:`Model` from which data should be retrieved, then click "
":guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"在工作表右側的:guilabel:`新增 Odoo 清單`面板中，選取要擷取資料的:guilabel:`模"
"型`，然後按一下:guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:195
msgid ""
"The default list for the model is inserted into a new sheet in the "
"spreadsheet. The sheet name in the bottom bar shows the model name followed "
"by the :ref:`list ID <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties-id>`, e.g., *Sales "
"Order (List #1)*. A panel on the right side of the spreadsheet shows the "
":ref:`properties of the list <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties>`."
msgstr ""
"模型的預設列表會插入試算表的新工作表中。底部欄的工作表名稱會顯示模型名稱，後"
"方加上 :ref:`列表 ID <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties-id>`，例如 *銷售訂單"
"（列表 #1）*。試算表右側面板會顯示 :ref:`列表屬性 <spreadsheet/insert-list/"
"properties>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:200
msgid ""
"By default, the list is a :ref:`dynamic list <spreadsheet/insert-"
"list/static-vs-dynamic>`, where the top-left cell contains an :ref:`Odoo-"
"specific array function <spreadsheet/insert-list/dynamic-function>` that "
"retrieves data from the database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:205
msgid ""
"When a dynamic list is first inserted into a spreadsheet, a maximum of 80 "
"records are displayed. :ref:`Edit the array function <spreadsheet/insert-"
"list/dynamic-all-records>` to change the maximum number of records to "
"display or to display all records and allow the list to expand to "
"accommodate new records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:213
msgid "Dynamic list function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:215
msgid ""
"Unlike a :ref:`static list <spreadsheet/insert-list/static-functions>`, "
"where each cell contains a unique function that retrieves data via the "
":ref:`data source <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>`, a dynamic list has a "
"single :ref:`Odoo-specific array function <spreadsheet/functions/odoo>`:"
msgstr ""
"相較於 :ref:`靜態清單 <spreadsheet/insert-list/static-functions>`（其中每個儲"
"存格皆包含一個透過 :ref:`資料來源 <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>` 擷取資料"
"的獨立函數），動態清單只有單一個 :ref:`Odoo 專用陣列函數 <spreadsheet/"
"functions/odoo>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:225
msgid ""
"`list_id`: the ID assigned when the list is inserted. The first list "
"inserted in a spreadsheet is assigned list ID `1`, the second, list ID `2`, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"`list_id`：插入清單時指派的 ID。試算表中插入的第一個清單會獲指派清單 ID `1`，"
"第二個為清單 ID `2`，如此類推。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:227
msgid "`row_count`: set a value to limit the number of rows/records."
msgstr "`row_count`：設定數值以限制列數／記錄數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:236
msgid "Convert a dynamic list to a static list"
msgstr "將動態清單轉換為靜態清單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:238
msgid ""
"In some situations, for example, to be able to add a column containing a "
"manually entered formula, it may be necessary to convert a dynamic list to a"
" :ref:`static list <spreadsheet/insert-list/static-vs-dynamic>`, where each "
"cell has an individual function that retrieves data from the data source. To"
" do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:243
msgid ""
"On the sheet that contains the dynamic list, position the cursor in an empty"
" cell."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:244
msgid ""
"Click :menuselection:`Data -->` :icon:`os-insert-list` :menuselection:`Re-"
"insert static list` from the menu bar, then select the relevant list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:247
msgid ""
"A new static list appears, with the same styling as the original list. Click"
" on a cell to see the function in the formula bar."
msgstr ""
"隨即出現一個新的靜態清單，其樣式與原清單相同。點擊儲存格即可在公式欄中查看該"
"函數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:253
msgid "List properties"
msgstr "列表屬性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:255
msgid ""
"The list properties appear on the right side of the screen when a list is "
"inserted. They can be accessed at any time via the :guilabel:`Data` menu by "
"selecting the relevant list from the :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`List` "
"section, or by right-clicking anywhere on the list and clicking :icon:`oi-"
"view-list` :guilabel:`See list properties`."
msgstr ""
"插入列表時，列表屬性會顯示在畫面右側。您可隨時透過 :guilabel:`資料` 選單，在 "
":icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`列表` 部分中選擇相關列表來存取屬性，或右鍵點"
"擊列表上的任何位置，然後點擊 :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`查看列表屬性`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:260
msgid "The following list properties are shown, some of which can be edited:"
msgstr "系統會顯示以下清單屬性，其中部分可供編輯："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:264
msgid ""
":guilabel:`List #`: the list ID, which is used to identify the list for the "
"lifetime of the spreadsheet. List IDs are assigned sequentially as "
"additional lists are inserted into the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`清單 #`：清單 ID，用於在試算表的整個生命週期中識別該清單。隨着更多"
"清單插入至試算表，系統會按順序指派清單 ID。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:268
msgid ""
":guilabel:`List Name`: the name of the list. Edit this if needed. Note that "
"editing the list name in the list properties does not modify the list name "
"shown in the sheet name, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`清單名稱`：清單的名稱。如有需要可編輯此名稱。請注意，在清單屬性中"
"編輯清單名稱不會修改工作表名稱中顯示的清單名稱，反之亦然。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:271
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Model`: the model from which the data has been extracted and the "
"total number of records in the model. The number of records is re-calculated"
" each time the spreadsheet is opened or each time the browser or spreadsheet"
" is refreshed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`模型`：提取資料所用的模型，以及該模型中的記錄總數。每次開啟試算表"
"，或重新整理瀏覽器或試算表時，都會重新計算記錄數目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:275
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Columns`: the columns that were visible in the list view when the"
" list was inserted, or the list's default columns if the list was inserted "
"from the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`欄位`：插入列表時在列表檢視中可見的欄位；若列表是從試算表插入，則"
"為列表的預設欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:278
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sorting`: how the data is :ref:`sorted <spreadsheet/insert-"
"list/manipulate-sort>`, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`排序`：資料的 :ref:`排序方式 <spreadsheet/insert-list/manipulate-"
"sort>`（如適用）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Domain`: the rules used to determine which records are shown. "
"Click :guilabel:`Edit domain` to :ref:`add or edit rules <search/custom-"
"filters>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:284
msgid ""
"To :ref:`duplicate <spreadsheet/insert-list/duplicate>` or :ref:`delete "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/delete>` a list's data source, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon, then click :icon:`fa-clone` "
":guilabel:`Duplicate` or :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Delete` as relevant."
msgstr ""
"要 :ref:`複製 <spreadsheet/insert-list/duplicate>` 或 :ref:`刪除 "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/delete>` 清單的資料來源，請按一下 :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示，然後按一下 :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`複製` 或 "
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`刪除`（視乎需要）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:290
msgid ""
"For a :ref:`dynamic list <spreadsheet/insert-list/static-vs-dynamic>`, "
"columns can only be added, hidden, or deleted via the list properties; these"
" actions cannot be performed in the list itself. For a :ref:`static list "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/static-vs-dynamic>`, the opposite is true; columns "
"can only be added, hidden, or deleted in the list itself."
msgstr ""
"對於 :ref:`動態清單 <spreadsheet/insert-list/static-vs-dynamic>`，只能透過清"
"單屬性來新增、隱藏或刪除欄，而無法直接在清單中執行這些操作。對於 :ref:`靜態清"
"單 <spreadsheet/insert-list/static-vs-dynamic>`，情況則剛好相反，只能直接在清"
"單中新增、隱藏或刪除欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:294
msgid ""
"When :doc:`global filters <../work_with_data/global_filters>` are used, the "
":guilabel:`Domain` is combined with the selected values of the global filter"
" before the data is loaded into the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`全域篩選器 <../work_with_data/global_filters>` 時，系統會在將資料"
"載入試算表前，先將 :guilabel:`網域` 與全域篩選器的已選值結合。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:301
msgid "Manipulate an inserted list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:306
msgid "Sort columns"
msgstr "排序直欄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:309
