msgid ""
"To add rows/records to a static list, use one of the following methods:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:348
msgid ""
"Select the last row of the table, then hover over the blue square until the "
"plus icon appears. Click and drag down to add the desired number of rows. "
"The cells of the new rows are populated with the :ref:`appropriate formula "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/static-functions>` to retrieve the list values. If "
"there is corresponding data in the database, the cells are populated."
msgstr ""
"選擇表格的最後一列，然後將滑鼠游標移至藍色方塊上，直至出現加號圖示。按一下並"
"向下拖曳，即可新增所需的列數。新資料列的儲存格會填入:ref:`合適的公式 "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/static-functions>`，以擷取清單數值。如果資料庫中有對"
"應資料，儲存格便會填入相關資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:353
msgid "Add rows/records by dragging the cell down"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:356
msgid ""
"Position the cursor in the top left cell of the sheet, click "
":menuselection:`Data --> Re-insert static list` from the menu bar, then "
"select the appropriate list. In the pop-up window, indicate the number of "
"rows/records to insert and click :guilabel:`Confirm`. An updated list is "
"inserted, overwriting the previous list."
msgstr ""
"將游標置於工作表左上角的儲存格中，在選單列按一下 :menuselection:`數據 --> 重"
"新插入靜態清單`，然後選取相應的清單。在彈出視窗中，輸入要插入的列數/記錄數，"
"再按一下 :guilabel:`確認`。系統隨即插入更新後的清單，並覆寫先前的清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:362
msgid ""
"The above methods can also be used to add additional blank rows to a "
"spreadsheet table. This may be useful for lists where additional records are"
" likely to be generated in the database, e.g., new product categories or new"
" salespersons."
msgstr ""
"上述方法亦可用於在試算表表格中新增額外的空白列。這對於資料庫中可能會繼續產生"
"新記錄的清單特別有用，例如新產品類別或新銷售人員。"

