#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:478
msgid "To duplicate an inserted list:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:480
msgid ""
"With the :ref:`list properties <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties>` open, "
"click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon next to the :guilabel:`List"
" Name`, then :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`Duplicate`. The duplicated list is "
"automatically inserted into a new sheet in the spreadsheet, with the list "
