msgstr ""
"開啟 :ref:`清單屬性 <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties>` 後，按一下 "
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示（位於 :guilabel:`清單名稱` 旁邊），"
"然後按一下 :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`複製`。複製的清單會自動插入試算表的新"
"工作表中，並在右側面板開啟清單屬性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:485
msgid ""
"Edit the :guilabel:`List Name` in the properties panel and the sheet tab if "
"desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:487
msgid ""
"The new data source is assigned the next available list ID. For example, if "
"no other lists have been inserted in the meantime, duplicating *List #1* "
"results in the creation of *List #2*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:491
msgid ""
"Duplicating an inserted list by copying and pasting it or by duplicating the"
" sheet into which it has been inserted does not create a new data source. "
"Any changes made to such a list's properties would therefore impact all "
"copies of the list."
msgstr ""
"透過複製及貼上已插入的列表，或複製包含該列表的工作表來建立副本，並不會建立新"
"的資料來源。因此，對該列表屬性所作的任何變更，都會影響該列表的所有副本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:494
msgid "Duplicating a:"
msgstr "複製以下項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:496
msgid ""
"static list results in the insertion of the default :ref:`dynamic list "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/from-spreadsheet-default>` for that model, i.e., "
"with default columns and a maximum of 80 records;"
msgstr ""
"靜態清單會為該模型插入預設的 :ref:`動態清單 <spreadsheet/insert-list/from-"
"spreadsheet-default>`，亦即包含預設欄位及最多 80 筆記錄；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:499
msgid ""
"dynamic list results in the insertion of a list with the same columns as the"
" original list and a maximum of 80 records, even if the original list had "
"been :ref:`modified to have a different or no limit <spreadsheet/insert-"
"list/dynamic-all-records>`."
msgstr ""
"動態清單會插入與原清單相同資料欄、且最多包含 80 筆記錄的清單，即使原清單"
"已:ref:`修改為不同上限或不設上限 <spreadsheet/insert-list/dynamic-all-"
"records>`亦然。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:506
msgid "Delete an inserted list"
msgstr "刪除已插入的清單"

