"To fully delete an inserted list and the underlying data source from a "
"spreadsheet, perform the following steps in any order:"
msgstr "如要從試算表中完全刪除已插入的清單及底層資料來源，請按任何順序執行以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:511
msgid ""
