"This deletes the visual representation of the data."
msgstr ""
"使用慣用的方法刪除包含該清單的試算表表格，例如透過鍵盤指令、試算表選單，或刪"
"除工作表。這會刪除數據的視覺化呈現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:514
msgid ""
