"trash` :guilabel:`Delete`. This deletes the data source of the list from the"
" spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"在列表的:ref:`屬性面板 <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties>`中，點擊 "
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-trash` "
":guilabel:`刪除`。這會從試算表中刪除該列表的資料來源。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:519
msgid ""
"Alternatively, after deleting an inserted list from a spreadsheet, use the "
":ref:`Data cleanup <spreadsheet/insert/delete-unused-sources>` tool to "
"delete the corresponding data source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:3
msgid "Insert a pivot table"
msgstr "插入樞紐分析表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:5
msgid ""
"There are two main ways to integrate live Odoo data into a :doc:`pivot table"
" <../work_with_data/pivot_tables>` in Odoo Spreadsheet:"
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 試算表中，有兩種主要方法可將即時 Odoo 資料整合至:doc:`樞紐分析表 <../"
"work_with_data/pivot_tables>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:8
msgid ""
":ref:`Insert a pivot table from an Odoo pivot view "
"<spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_view>` into an Odoo spreadsheet, Odoo "
"dashboard, or quote calculator spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":ref:`從 Odoo 樞紐分析檢視插入樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/"
"from_view>` 至 Odoo 試算表、Odoo 儀表板或報價計算機試算表中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:11
msgid ""
":ref:`Insert a pivot table that retrieves Odoo data directly from an Odoo "
"spreadsheet <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/create>`. This option allows data to "
"be pulled from any model, including models for which no pivot view is "
"available, e.g., the *Sales Order Line* model."
msgstr ""
":ref:`插入直接從 Odoo 試算表擷取 Odoo 數據的樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/create>`。此選項容許從任何模型提取數據，包括未提供樞紐分析檢視的模型（"
"例如 *銷售訂單明細* 模型）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:15
msgid ""
"In both cases, the pivot table is connected to the underlying database data "
"thanks to its unique :ref:`data source <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>`, "
"which keeps the data up-to-date and provides :ref:`access to the underlying "
"data <spreadsheet/insert/accessing-data>` directly from the spreadsheet. "
"However, whether or not the pivot table expands to accommodate new "
"dimensions depends on whether it is a :ref:`static or dynamic pivot table "
"<spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:23
msgid ""
"It is also possible to :ref:`create a pivot table from a range of data "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/create>` already present in a spreadsheet. This "
"could be a range of static, manually entered data or a range of Odoo data "
"inserted into the spreadsheet, e.g., from an Odoo list view."
msgstr ""
"您亦可以選擇試算表中已有的資料，並 :ref:`從資料範圍建立樞紐分析表 "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/create>`。這些資料可以是手動輸入的靜態資料範圍，亦"
"可以是插入至試算表中的 Odoo 資料範圍（例如來自 Odoo 清單檢視）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:31
msgid "Static vs dynamic pivot tables"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:33
msgid ""
"When a pivot table from an Odoo pivot view is inserted into an Odoo "
"spreadsheet, it is, by default, a *static* pivot table, where each cell "
"retrieves data from your database via an :ref:`Odoo-specific function "
"<spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-functions>`. The pivot table's data "
"is kept up to date, but it does not expand to accommodate new data, e.g., "
"sales data for a new quarter or for a newly hired salesperson, and its "
"dimensions and measures cannot be :ref:`manipulated <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/build-manipulate>`."
msgstr ""
"將 Odoo 樞紐分析檢視的樞紐分析表插入 Odoo 試算表時，預設會成為 *靜態* 樞紐分"
"析表，每個儲存格都會透過 :ref:`Odoo 專用函數 <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/"
"static-functions>` 從資料庫擷取數據。樞紐分析表的數據會保持最新狀態，但不會自"
"動擴展以容納新數據（例如新一季或新入職銷售人員的銷售數據），而且其維度及量值"
"亦無法 :ref:`操作 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/build-manipulate>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:40
msgid ""
"A static pivot table can be :ref:`converted to a dynamic pivot table "
"<spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-convert>` to allow the pivot table to"
" evolve with your business and be manipulated to gain different and deeper "
"insights."
msgstr ""
"靜態樞紐分析表可:ref:`轉換為動態樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/"
"static-convert>`，讓樞紐分析表隨着您的業務發展而更新，並透過操作取得不同及更"
"深入的洞察。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:44
msgid ""
"Inserting a pivot table that retrieves Odoo data directly from an Odoo "
"spreadsheet results in a *dynamic* pivot table, where a single :ref:`Odoo-"
"specific array function <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/dynamic-function>` "
"retrieves data from your database. The pivot table's data is kept up to "
"date, it expands for new data, and its dimensions and measures can be "
"manipulated. A pivot table :ref:`inserted from a range of data "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/create>` is also a dynamic pivot table."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 試算表中插入直接從 Odoo 擷取資料的樞紐分析表，會建立 *動態* 樞紐分析"
"表，透過單一 :ref:`Odoo 專用陣列函數 <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/dynamic-"
"function>` 從資料庫擷取資料。該樞紐分析表的資料會保持最新狀態、隨新資料自動擴"
"展，並可操作其維度與量值。:ref:`從資料範圍插入 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/"
"create>` 的樞紐分析表亦屬於動態樞紐分析表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:51
msgid ""
"If needed, there are various ways to :ref:`see the individual functions of a"
" dynamic pivot table <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/dynamic-convert>`."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，有多種方法可:ref:`查看動態樞紐分析表的各項函數 <spreadsheet/insert-"
"pivot-table/dynamic-convert>`。"

