msgid "Convert a static pivot table to a dynamic pivot table"
msgstr "將靜態樞紐分析表轉換為動態樞紐分析表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:95
msgid ""
"To :ref:`manipulate the dimensions and measures <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/build-manipulate>` of a pivot table that has been inserted from an "
"Odoo pivot view, it first has to be converted to a :ref:`dynamic pivot table"
" <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>`."
msgstr ""
"如要對從 Odoo 樞紐分析檢視插入的樞紐分析表 :ref:`操作維度及量度 <spreadsheet/"
"pivot-tables/build-manipulate>`，必須先將其轉換為 :ref:`動態樞紐分析表 "
"<spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:99
msgid "There are two main ways to do so:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Duplicate the static pivot table from the pivot table properties**: "
":ref:`Open the pivot table's properties panel <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties>`, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon at the"
" top right of the pane, then click :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:106
msgid ""
"A new data source is created and a dynamic version of the pivot table is "
"inserted into a new sheet. The dynamic pivot table has the same styling as "
"the original pivot table."
msgstr ""
"系統會建立新的資料來源，並將樞紐分析表的動態版本插入至新工作表。動態樞紐分析"
"表與原始樞紐分析表具有相同的樣式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:110
msgid ""
"When you use this method, your new dynamic pivot table gets the next "
"available pivot ID. This means you can create multiple pivot views "
"associated with the same model, but with distinct settings, groupings, or "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"使用此方法時，新的動態數據透視表會取得下一個可用的透視 ID。這代表您可以建立多"
"個與同一模型關聯的數據透視檢視，並各自採用不同的設定、分組或計算方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Re-insert the dynamic pivot table from the Data menu**: On the sheet that "
"contains your static pivot table, position your cursor in an empty cell. "
"Click :menuselection:`Data -->` :icon:`os-insert-pivot` :menuselection:`Re-"
"insert dynamic pivot` from the menu bar, then select the relevant pivot "
"table."
msgstr ""
"**從「資料」選單重新插入動態樞紐分析表**：在包含靜態樞紐分析表的工作表上，將"
"游標放在空白儲存格中。在選單列點擊 :menuselection:`資料 -->` :icon:`os-"
"insert-pivot` :menuselection:`重新插入動態樞紐分析表`，然後選擇相關的樞紐分析"
"表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:119
msgid ""
"A new, dynamic pivot table appears, with the same styling as the original "
"pivot table."
msgstr "畫面上會出現一個新的動態樞紐分析表，樣式與原有樞紐分析表相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:122
msgid ""
"It is also possible to re-insert the dynamic pivot table by entering the "
":ref:`function of the dynamic pivot table <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-"
"table/dynamic-function>` in an empty cell, e.g., `=PIVOT(1)`, where `1` is "
"the :ref:`pivot table ID <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-id>`. However,"
" with this method, the table styling needs to be re-applied manually."
msgstr ""
"你亦可在空白儲存格中輸入 :ref:`動態數據透視表函數 <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-"
"table/dynamic-function>` 以重新插入動態數據透視表，例如 `=PIVOT(1)`，其中 "
"`1` 為 :ref:`數據透視表 ID <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-id>`。不過，"
"使用此方法時，需要手動重新套用表格樣式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:129
msgid ""
"When you re-insert the dynamic pivot table from the data menu or via the "
"dynamic pivot table function, your static and dynamic pivot share the same "
"data source, and, consequently, the same pivot ID. To avoid confusion, "
"delete the original static pivot table."
msgstr ""
"當您從資料選單或透過動態樞紐分析表函數重新插入動態樞紐分析表時，靜態與動態樞"
"紐分析表會共用相同的資料來源，因此亦會共用相同的樞紐分析表 ID。為免混淆，請刪"
"除原有的靜態樞紐分析表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:133
msgid ""
"The top-left cell of the new dynamic pivot table contains an :ref:`Odoo-"
"specific array function that retrieves data <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-"
"table/dynamic-function>` from your database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:139
msgid "Dynamic pivot table function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:141
msgid ""
"Instead of each cell containing a unique function that retrieves data via "
"the :ref:`data source <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>`, as in a "
":ref:`static pivot table <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-functions>`,"
" a dynamic pivot table has a single :ref:`Odoo-specific array function "
"<spreadsheet/functions/odoo>`:"
msgstr ""
"與每個儲存格各包含一個透過 :ref:`資料來源 <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>` "
"擷取資料的獨立函數（即 :ref:`靜態樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/"
"static-functions>` 的方式）不同，動態樞紐分析表僅包含單一 :ref:`Odoo 專用陣列"
"函數 <spreadsheet/functions/odoo>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:151
msgid ""
"This function allows the pivot table to expand automatically to accommodate "
"the results of the function. The arguments of the function are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:156
msgid ""
"`row_count` and `column_count`: set a value to limit the number of rows and "
"columns respectively."
msgstr "`row_count` 及 `column_count`：設定數值以分別限制列數及欄數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:157
msgid ""
"`include_total`: set a value of `0` to hide the totals; this can be useful "
"when creating a graph."
msgstr "`include_total`：將值設為 `0` 以隱藏總計；這在建立圖表時十分有用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:158
msgid ""
"`include_column_titles` and `include_measure_titles`: set a value of `0` to "
"remove the column and measure titles respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:162
msgid ""
"To set a value for an argument of the function, with the function open in "
"the formula bar or the top-left cell of the pivot table, position your "
"cursor after the pivot ID then type `,` to advance to the argument you want "
"to modify. In the example below, adding the value `0` for `[include_total]` "
"removes both the row total and column total from the pivot table."
msgstr ""
"如要為函式的引數設定值，請先在公式列或樞紐分析表的左上角儲存格開啟該函式，將"
"游標置於樞紐分析表 ID 之後，然後輸入 `,` 以移至你想修改的引數。在以下範例中，"
"為 `[include_total]` 加入值 `0`，即可從樞紐分析表中移除列總計和欄總計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:167
msgid "Array function of a dynamic pivot table"
msgstr "動態數據透視表的陣列函數"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:170
msgid ""
"The pivot table structure can also be controlled via the :ref:`pivot table "
"properties <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties>`, in the :ref:`Design "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-design>` tab."
msgstr ""
"您亦可透過:ref:`樞紐分析表屬性 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties>`控制樞紐"
"分析表結構（位於:ref:`設計 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-design>`分頁"
"）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:177
msgid "Convert a dynamic pivot table to a static pivot table"
msgstr "將動態樞紐分析表轉換為靜態樞紐分析表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:179
msgid ""
"There are two main ways to convert a dynamic pivot table to a :ref:`static "
"pivot table <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>`, where each "
"cell has an individual function that retrieves data from the data source:"
msgstr ""
"將動態樞紐分析表轉換為:ref:`靜態樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/"
"static-vs-dynamic>`主要有兩種方式，其中每個儲存格都會有個別函式從資料來源擷取"
"資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:183
msgid ""
"**Re-insert the static pivot table from the Data menu**: On the sheet that "
"contains your dynamic pivot table, position your cursor in an empty cell. "
"Click :menuselection:`Data -->` :icon:`os-insert-pivot` :menuselection:`Re-"
"insert static pivot` from the menu bar, then select the relevant pivot "
"table."
msgstr ""
"**從「資料」選單重新插入靜態樞紐分析表**：在包含動態樞紐分析表的工作表上，將"
"游標置於空白儲存格中。從選單列按一下 :menuselection:`資料 -->` :icon:`os-"
"insert-pivot` :menuselection:`重新插入靜態樞紐分析表` ，然後選擇相關的樞紐分"
"析表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:188
msgid ""
"A new static pivot table appears, with the same styling as the original "
"pivot table. Click on a cell to see the function in the formula bar."
msgstr ""
"系統會顯示一個新的靜態樞紐分析表，其樣式與原本的樞紐分析表相同。點擊儲存格即"
"可在公式欄中查看函數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:191
msgid ""
"**Use the 'Convert to individual formulas' option**: Right-click on any cell"
" in the pivot table, then click :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`Convert to "
"individual formulas`. Every populated cells is replaced by an individual "
"function; click on a cell to see the function in the formula bar."
msgstr ""
"**使用「轉換為獨立公式」選項**：在樞紐分析表的任何儲存格上按右鍵，然後按一下 "
":icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`轉換為獨立公式`。每個已填入資料的儲存格都會"
"替換為獨立函數；按一下儲存格，即可在公式列中查看該函數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:196
msgid ""
"To see the individual functions behind specific cells of a dynamic pivot "
"table, copy the relevant cells and paste them elsewhere in the spreadsheet; "
"click on a pasted cell to see the function in the formula bar."
msgstr ""
"要查看動態樞紐分析表特定儲存格背後的個別函數，請複製相關儲存格並貼上至試算表"
"的其他位置，然後點擊貼上的儲存格，即可在公式列查看該函數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:203
msgid "Insert a pivot table from a pivot view"
msgstr "從樞紐分析檢視插入樞紐分析表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:205
msgid ""
"To insert a pivot table from an :ref:`Odoo pivot view "
"<studio/views/reporting/pivot>` into an Odoo spreadsheet:"
msgstr ""
"如要將 :ref:`Odoo 樞紐分析檢視 <studio/views/reporting/pivot>` 中的樞紐分析表"
"插入至 Odoo 試算表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:208
msgid ""
"With the relevant pivot view open in your database, click :guilabel:`Insert "
"in Spreadsheet`."
msgstr "在資料庫中開啟相關的樞紐分析表檢視後，按一下:guilabel:`插入至試算表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:209
msgid ""
"In the window that opens, edit the :guilabel:`Name of the pivot` if needed. "
"This name is used as the sheet name and in the :ref:`pivot table properties "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties>`, and can be edited later, if needed."
msgstr ""
"在開啟的視窗中，如有需要可編輯 :guilabel:`樞紐分析表名稱`。此名稱會用作工作表"
"名稱，並顯示於 :ref:`樞紐分析表屬性 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties>` 中"
"，日後如有需要亦可隨時修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:213
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Blank spreadsheet` to create a new spreadsheet, or select "
"in which existing spreadsheet the pivot table should be inserted."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`空白試算表` 以建立新試算表，或選擇要將數據透視表插入至哪個"
"現有試算表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:217
msgid ""
"When inserting a pivot table into a new spreadsheet, the spreadsheet is "
"saved in the **Odoo Documents** app in the :icon:`fa-hdd-o` :guilabel:`My "
"Drive` personal folder."
msgstr ""
"將樞紐分析表插入新試算表時，該試算表會儲存在 **Odoo 文件** 應用程式的 "
":icon:`fa-hdd-o` :guilabel:`我的雲端硬碟` 個人資料夾中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:222
msgid ""
"The pivot table is inserted into a new sheet in the spreadsheet; the sheet "
"name is the pivot table name followed by the :ref:`pivot table ID "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-id>`, e.g., *Sales Analysis by Sales "
"Team (Pivot #1)*. By default, the pivot table is a :ref:`static pivot table "
"<spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>`, where each cell "
