"Only the spreadsheet's owner or users with :guilabel:`Editor` rights can use"
" comments in a spreadsheet; both roles can perform the same actions. "
"Comments are not visible to users with :guilabel:`Viewer` rights."
msgstr ""
"只有試算表的擁有者或擁有:guilabel:`編輯者`權限的使用者才可在試算表中使用註解"
"；兩個角色均可執行相同操作。擁有:guilabel:`檢視者`權限的使用者無法查看註解。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/share_collaborate.rst:186
