msgid "Stacked column chart icon"
msgstr "堆疊直條圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stacked Column`: displays part-to-whole relationships within "
"categories, such as regional contributions to total sales."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`堆疊直條圖`：顯示類別中部分與整體的關係，例如各地區對總銷售額的貢"
"獻。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:125
msgid "Bar"
msgstr "條形圖"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:127
msgid "Bar chart icon"
msgstr "柱狀圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bar`: similar to a column chart but horizontal, making it better "
"for comparing long category names or datasets."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`橫條圖`：與直條圖類似，但改為水平顯示，更適合比較較長的類別名稱或"
"數據集。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:133
msgid "Stacked bar chart icon"
msgstr "堆疊橫條圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stacked Bar`: highlights cumulative contributions across "
"categories, often used in demographic or resource allocation analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:139
msgid "Area"
msgstr "區域"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:141
msgid "Area chart icon"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Area`: similar to a line chart but fills the area beneath the "
"lines to emphasize magnitude, perfect for cumulative metrics over time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:147
msgid "Stacked area chart icon"
msgstr "堆疊面積圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:150
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stacked Area`: visualizes the composition of changes over time, "
"such as market share by product category."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`堆疊面積圖`：視覺化呈現隨時間變化的組成結構，例如按產品類別劃分的"
"市場佔有率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:153
msgid "Pie"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:155
msgid "Pie chart icon"
msgstr "圓形圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pie`: best for showing proportions or percentages of a whole, "
"such as market share or budget allocation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:161
msgid "Doughnut chart icon"
msgstr "環形圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:164
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Doughnut`: A variation of the pie chart with a hollow center, "
"offering similar use cases but with a modern aesthetic."
msgstr ":guilabel:`圓環圖`：圓形圖的變體，中心為空心設計，用途相近但外觀更具現代感。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:167
msgid "Hierarchical"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:169
msgid "Sunburst chart icon"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:172
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sunburst`: a variation of the doughnut chart with hierarchical "
"rings, showcasing part-to-whole relationships across multiple levels."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`旭日圖`：環圈圖的變體，採用階層式圓環設計，可跨多個層級展示部分與"
"整體的關係。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:175
msgid "Treemap chart icon"
msgstr "樹狀圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Treemap`: a multi-level rectangular chart that displays "
"hierarchical data through nested rectangles, ideal for illustrating "
"proportions and categories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:181
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "雜項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:183
msgid "Scatter chart icon"
msgstr "散佈圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:186
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Scatter`: ideal for analyzing relationships or correlations "
"between two numerical variables, such as price vs. quantity sold."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`散佈圖`：非常適合用於分析兩個數值變數之間的關係或相關性，例如價格"
"與銷售數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:189
msgid "Waterfall chart icon"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:192
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Waterfall`: ideal for visualizing cumulative effects of "
"sequential positive and negative values, such as profit/loss analysis."
msgstr ":guilabel:`瀑布圖`：適合將連續正負數值的累積效應視覺化，例如損益分析。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:195
msgid "Population pyramid chart icon"
msgstr "人口金字塔圖表圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:198
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Population Pyramid`: a specialized chart for comparing "
"distributions, often used in demographics, such as age and gender group "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`人口金字塔`：一種專門用於比較分佈情況的圖表，常用於人口統計分析，"
"例如年齡及性別組別分析。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:201
msgid "Radar chart icon"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Radar`: displays multivariate data as a polygon on axes radiating"
" from a center, allowing for profile comparisons across multiple variables."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`雷達圖`：將多變量資料顯示為從中心向外輻射軸線上的多邊形，方便跨多"
"個變量比較概況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:207
msgid "Filled radar chart icon"
msgstr "填滿式雷達圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filled radar`: fills the area within the radar chart's polygon, "
"emphasizing the overall magnitude of values across different attributes for "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`填滿雷達圖`：填滿雷達圖多邊形內的區域，藉此突顯不同屬性之間數值的"
"整體大小，方便比較。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:213
msgid "Funnel chart icon"
msgstr "漏斗圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:216
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Funnel`: visualizes data that progressively decreases over stages"
" of a process, with the option to display cumulative data for each stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:219
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:995
msgid "Other"
msgstr "其他"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:221
msgid ""
"When creating a chart from spreadsheet data, rather than inserting one from "
"a graph view, the following chart types are also available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:224
msgid "Bubble chart icon"
msgstr "氣泡圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:227
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bubble`: Visualizes multi-dimensional data across categories "
"using circle size and position."
msgstr ":guilabel:`氣泡圖`：使用圓圈大小及位置，將跨類別的多維度數據視覺化。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:230
msgid "Gauge chart icon"
msgstr "儀表圖圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:233
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gauge`: displays progress toward a goal or a single key metric, "
"such as performance against a target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:236
msgid "Scorecard icon"
msgstr "記分卡圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:239
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Scorecard`: used to summarize key performance indicators (KPIs) "
"in a compact format, such as total sales or conversion rates, and compare to"
" a baseline or a previous value."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`計分卡`：用於以精簡格式總結關鍵績效指標（KPI），例如總銷售額或轉換"
"率，並與基準值或先前數值進行比較。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:243
msgid "Geo chart icon"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:246
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Geo`: visualizes data on a map using color variations to "
"represent values or categories across different geographical regions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:249
msgid "Calendar chart icon"
msgstr "日曆圖表圖示"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:252
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Calendar`: shows activity over a long, continuous span of time, "
"such as months or years. This chart type can be used to illustrate "
"fluctuations based on e.g., specific days of the week or for tracking long-"
"term trends."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`日曆`：顯示在一段較長且連續的時間（例如數月或數年）內的活動情況。"
"此圖表類型可用於說明特定星期幾等的波動情況，或用於追蹤長期趨勢。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:259
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:151
msgid "Design tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:261
msgid ""
"The :icon:`design_services` :guilabel:`Design` tab contains several "
"sections, depending on the :ref:`type of chart "
"<spreadsheet/charts/customize-configuration-type>`. The fields and options "
"available within sections may also vary depending on the chart type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:268
msgid "General"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:270
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`General` section allows the following elements to be "
"modified:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`一般` 部分可修改以下項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:272
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Background color`: Add or change the background color by clicking"
" the color dot, then :ref:`choosing the desired color "
"<spreadsheet/charts/design-color>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:274
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Chart title`: Edit the chart title, if needed. The font "
"formatting, horizontal alignment, font size, and color of the title can be "
"modified using the editor."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`圖表標題`：如有需要，請編輯圖表標題。你可使用編輯器修改標題的字體"
"格式、水平對齊方式、字體大小及顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:276
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Legend position`: Change the position of the legend or opt to "
"have no legend."
msgstr ":guilabel:`圖例位置`：變更圖例的位置，或選擇不顯示圖例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:277
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show values`: Add numeric values to the data points on the chart."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:278
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Zoom`: Enable :guilabel:`Show slicer` to be able to zoom in on a "
"portion of the horizontal axis and scroll forwards and backwards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:280
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Number formatting`: Enable :guilabel:`Use compact format` to "
"display, e.g., $200k instead of $200,000.00."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:286
msgid ""
"To choose a color from the color selector, use one of the following methods:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:288
msgid "select one of the standard colors"
msgstr "選擇其中一種標準顏色"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:289
msgid ""
"click the :icon:`add_circle` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to manually select a "
"custom color"
msgstr "點擊 :icon:`add_circle` :guilabel:`（加號）` 圖示以手動選擇自訂顏色"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:290
msgid ""
"click the :icon:`colorize` :guilabel:`(dropper)` icon to copy any color from"
" the device's screen"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:296
msgid "Annotation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:298
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Annotation` section allows the addition of :guilabel:`Text` "
"to provide context or additional information about the chart and/or a "
":guilabel:`See more link`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`註解` 部分中，你可以加入 :guilabel:`文字`，以提供圖表的相關背景"
"或額外資訊，及/或加入 :guilabel:`查看更多連結`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:302
msgid ""
"Annotations added to a chart can be viewed by hovering over the chart, then "
"clicking the :icon:`info` :guilabel:`(Chart Info)` icon in the top right "
"corner."
msgstr ""
"將游標懸停在圖表上，然後按一下右上角的 :icon:`info` :guilabel:`（圖表資訊）` "
"圖示，即可檢視新增至圖表的註解。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:308
msgid "Data Series"
msgstr "數據系列"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:310
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Data Series` section allows the following elements to be "
"modified:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`資料數列` 部分，可修改以下項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:312
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Series color`: With the relevant data series selected, change the"
" color of the related data points on the chart by clicking on the color dot "
"and :ref:`choosing the desired color <spreadsheet/charts/design-color>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`數列顏色`：選取相關資料數列後，點按顏色圓點並 :ref:`選擇所需顏色 "
"<spreadsheet/charts/design-color>`，即可更改圖表上相關資料點的顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:315
msgid ":guilabel:`Series name`: Edit the name of a data series, if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:316
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Series type`: For each data series of a :guilabel:`Combo` chart, "
"determine whether the series is shown as a :guilabel:`Bar` or "
":guilabel:`Line`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`數列類型`：對於 :guilabel:`組合` 圖表的每個數據數列，決定該數列顯"
"示為 :guilabel:`長條圖` 還是 :guilabel:`折線圖`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:318
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vertical axis`: For the selected data series of a "
":guilabel:`Line`, :guilabel:`Area`, or :guilabel:`Column` chart, select "
"whether it should be displayed on the :guilabel:`Left` (primary) or "
":guilabel:`Right` (secondary) vertical axis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:321
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Trend line`: With the relevant data series selected, enable "
":guilabel:`Show trend line` then select the :guilabel:`Type` of trend line: "
":guilabel:`Linear`, :guilabel:`Exponential`, :guilabel:`Polynomial`, "
":guilabel:`Logarithmic`, or :guilabel:`Trailing moving average`. To change "
"the color of the trend line, click the color dot, then :ref:`choose the "
"desired color <spreadsheet/charts/design-color>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`趨勢線`：選取相關資料數列後，啟用 :guilabel:`顯示趨勢線`，然後選擇"
"趨勢線的 :guilabel:`類型`：:guilabel:`線性`、:guilabel:`指數`、:guilabel:`多"
"項式`、:guilabel:`對數` 或 :guilabel:`尾隨移動平均`。要更改趨勢線顏色，請點擊"
"顏色圓點，然後 :ref:`選擇所需顏色 <spreadsheet/charts/design-color>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:330
msgid "Axes"
msgstr "坐標軸"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:332
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Axes` section allows the following elements to be modified:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`坐標軸` 部分中，可修改以下元素："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:334
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Axis title`: Add a title to the :guilabel:`Horizontal axis` or "
":guilabel:`Vertical axis`. The font formatting, horizontal alignment, font "
"size, and color of the title can be modified using the editor."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`軸標題`：為:guilabel:`水平軸`或:guilabel:`垂直軸`新增標題。標題的"
"字體格式、水平對齊方式、字體大小及顏色均可透過編輯器修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:338
msgid ""
"For horizontal or vertical axes that display numerical scales, it is also "
"possible to modify the following elements:"
msgstr "對於顯示數值刻度的水平軸或垂直軸，亦可修改以下元素："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:341
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Axis range`: To restrict the range shown by an axis, enter a "
"minimum and/or maximum value. This can be used, for example, to avoid having"
" empty space at the bottom of a chart if all the values are well above zero,"
" or to focus on a specific range of data."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`座標軸範圍`：如要限制座標軸顯示的範圍，請輸入最小值及／或最大值。"
"例如，若所有數值均遠高於零，此設定可避免圖表底部出現空白位置，亦可用於聚焦特"
"定數據範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:344
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gridlines`: By default, only major horizonal/vertical gridlines "
"are shown. Enable minor horizonal/vertical gridlines if desired."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`格線`：預設只會顯示主要水平／垂直格線。如有需要，可啟用次要水平／"
"垂直格線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:350
msgid "Pie Slice"
msgstr "圓餅切片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:352
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pie Slice` section allows the color of pie chart slices, or "
"categories of data, to be modified. With the relevant data series selected, "
"change the color of the related pie chart slice by clicking the color dot "
"and :ref:`choosing the desired color <spreadsheet/charts/design-color>`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`圓餅圖扇區` 區段中，你可修改圓餅圖扇區（即資料類別）的顏色。選"
"取相關的資料數列後，點擊顏色圓點並 :ref:`選擇所需顏色 <spreadsheet/charts/"
"design-color>`，即可變更相應圓餅圖扇區的顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:359
msgid "Other chart type-specific sections"
msgstr "其他圖表類型專用部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:361
msgid ""
"Sunburst, treemap, bubble, gauge, scorecard, waterfall, geo, funnel, and "
"calendar charts have dedicated design sections."
msgstr ""
"旭日圖、樹狀圖、氣泡圖、儀錶圖、計分卡、瀑布圖、地理圖、漏斗圖及日曆圖均設有"
"專屬的設計部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:367
msgid "Manage charts"
msgstr "管理圖表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:372
msgid "Basic actions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:374
msgid ""
"Hover over a chart, then click the :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(menu)` icon"
" to reveal the following options:"
msgstr ""
"將游標懸停在圖表上，然後點擊 :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(選單)` 圖示，即可"
"顯示以下選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:377
msgid ""
":icon:`edit_square` :guilabel:`Edit` to open the chart's properties, where "
"various aspects of the chart's configuration and design can be "
":ref:`customized <spreadsheet/charts/customize>`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`edit_square` :guilabel:`編輯` 以開啟圖表屬性，並在此 :ref:`自訂 "
"<spreadsheet/charts/customize>` 圖表配置與設計的各項設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:380
msgid ""
":icon:`assignment` :guilabel:`Copy` or :icon:`os-cut` :guilabel:`Cut` to "
"copy or cut a chart with the intention of pasting it *within the same "
"spreadsheet*. Alternatively, with the chart selected, use the relevant "
"keyboard shortcut to copy or cut the chart."
msgstr ""
":icon:`assignment` :guilabel:`複製` 或 :icon:`os-cut` :guilabel:`剪下`，即可"
"複製或剪下圖表，以便將其貼上至 *同一份試算表內*。或者，在選取圖表後，使用相關"
"的鍵盤快捷鍵來複製或剪下圖表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:384
msgid ""
