#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:388
msgid ""
"For a chart inserted from an Odoo graph view, copying/cutting and pasting a "
"chart in this way maintains the :ref:`link between the chart and the "
"database <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>`. The data in the pasted chart "
"remains up-to-date, and :ref:`clicking on a data point "
"<spreadsheet/insert/accessing-data>` opens the related list view in the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"對於從 Odoo 圖表檢視插入的圖表，以此方式複製／剪下並貼上圖表，可保留 :ref:`圖"
