"持最新狀態，而 :ref:`點擊資料點 <spreadsheet/insert/accessing-data>` 則會在資"
"料庫中開啟相關的列表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/charts.rst:394
msgid ""
