#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:3
msgid "Conditional formatting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:5
msgid ""
"Conditional formatting applies specific formatting, such as a background "
"color or font color, to a range of cells that meet one or more defined "
"criteria, or rules. This allows you to visually highlight important data, "
"patterns, trends, or anomalies."
msgstr ""
"條件格式設定會將特定格式（例如背景顏色或字型顏色）套用至符合一個或多個已定義"
"條件或規則的儲存格範圍，讓您以視覺方式突顯重要資料、模式、趨勢或異常情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:10
msgid ""
"When a spreadsheet containing dynamic Odoo data is reopened or refreshed, "
"any conditional formatting that has been defined is updated to reflect any "
"changes to the data."
msgstr ""
"重新開啟或重新整理包含動態 Odoo 數據的試算表時，任何已定義的條件式格式設定都"
"會隨之更新，以反映數據的任何變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:13
msgid "Different types of conditional formatting are possible:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:15
msgid ""
":ref:`Single color <spreadsheet/conditional-formatting/single-color>`: "
"changes the color of the cell’s background or font, or changes the font "
"formatting if cell values meet the defined conditions, e.g., changes a cell "
"to red if an invoice is overdue."
msgstr ""
":ref:`單一顏色 <spreadsheet/conditional-formatting/single-color>`：如果儲存格"
"數值符合所定義的條件，便會變更儲存格的背景顏色、字體顏色或字體格式，例如：當"
"發票逾期時將儲存格變為紅色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:18
msgid ""
":ref:`Color scale <spreadsheet/conditional-formatting/color-scale>`: uses "
"color intensity to represent smaller and larger values on a two- or three-"
"color scale, e.g., shows sales performance using increasingly dark tones of "
"the same color."
msgstr ""
":ref:`色階 <spreadsheet/conditional-formatting/color-scale>`：使用顏色深淺在"
"雙色或三色色階中表示較小與較大的數值，例如以同一顏色由淺至深的色調顯示銷售表"
"現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`Icon set <spreadsheet/conditional-formatting/icon-set>`: uses sets of "
"arrows, smileys, or dots in green, orange, and red to visually show how cell"
" values in a range compare to certain defined values, e.g., a green smiley "
"to represent sales performance above a certain amount."
msgstr ""
":ref:`圖示集 <spreadsheet/conditional-formatting/icon-set>` ：使用綠色、橙色"
"和紅色的箭頭、笑臉或圓點組合，以視覺化方式顯示範圍內的儲存格數值與特定定義數"
"值的比較結果，例如以綠色笑臉代表高於特定金額的銷售表現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:24
msgid ""
":ref:`Data bar <spreadsheet/conditional-formatting/data-bar>`: inserts "
"colored bars inside a cell to show how a value compares to the value of "
"other cells in the defined range, e.g., the customer generating the highest "
"sales has the longest bar, with bars of decreasing length for customers "
"generating lower sales."
msgstr ""
":ref:`資料橫條 <spreadsheet/conditional-formatting/data-bar>`：在儲存格內插入"
"彩色橫條，以顯示數值與指定範圍內其他儲存格數值的比較，例如產生最高銷售額的客"
"戶會有最長的橫條，而銷售額較低的客戶橫條長度會遞減。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:29
msgid "To add conditional formatting to a range of cells:"
msgstr "如要為儲存格範圍新增條件式格式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:31
msgid "Select the cells the formatting rule should apply to."
msgstr "選取要套用格式設定規則的儲存格。"

