#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:3
msgid "Global filters"
msgstr "全域篩選器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:5
msgid ""
"Global filters, accessed via :icon:`os-global-filters` :guilabel:`Filters` "
"at the top right of an Odoo spreadsheet or via the search bar of an "
":ref:`Odoo dashboard <dashboards/use-dashboards/global-filters>`, allow the "
"simultaneous filtering of all the Odoo data connected to the spreadsheet or "
"dashboard. This feature enables individual users to dynamically personalize "
"their view to draw specific insights, without altering the base report or "
"dashboard for others."
msgstr ""
"全域篩選器可透過 Odoo 試算表右上角的 :icon:`os-global-filters` :guilabel:`篩"
"選器`，或透過 :ref:`Odoo 儀表板 <dashboards/use-dashboards/global-filters>` "
"的搜尋列存取，讓您同時篩選連接至該試算表或儀表板的所有 Odoo 資料。此功能讓個"
"別用戶能動態自訂檢視畫面以取得特定分析洞察，同時不會影響其他人的基礎報表或儀"
"表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:12
msgid ""
"Unlike standard spreadsheet filters, which only act on visible data, global "
"filters act on a spreadsheet's underlying :ref:`data source(s) "
"<spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>`. They control which data is retrieved "
"from the data source, essentially filtering the data *before* it is loaded. "
"By using filter operators such as :guilabel:`contains`, :guilabel:`is equal "
"to`, :guilabel:`starts with`, etc., users can refine the filtering for more "
"precise results; the available operators depend on the :ref:`type of filter "
"<spreadsheet/global-filters/create-types>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:19
msgid ""
"During the configuration of a global filter, a :ref:`field matching "
"<spreadsheet/global-filters/field-matching>` process ensures that the filter"
" acts on, or matches against, the appropriate database :doc:`fields "
"</applications/studio/fields>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:24
msgid ""
"The example shows a list of the top ten sales orders across all salespeople,"
" with a Date global filter limiting the data to the `Last 30 Days`. Applying"
" a global filter on the :guilabel:`Salesperson` field allows the user to see"
" only records where the salesperson :guilabel:`is in` the defined set of "
"values, i.e., is `Mitchell Admin` or `Marc Demo`."
msgstr ""
"此範例顯示所有銷售員的前十張銷售訂單列表，並以日期全域篩選器將資料限制於 `過"
"去 30 天`。對 :guilabel:`銷售員` 欄位套用全域篩選器後，用戶只會看到銷售員 "
":guilabel:`屬於` 所定義值集合中的記錄，即 `Mitchell Admin` 或 `Marc Demo`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:29
msgid "Global filters in action"
msgstr "全域篩選器實際應用"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:33
msgid ""
"Global filters work by temporarily adding extra conditions to the domains of"
" the connected data sources. Therefore, if you intend to use global filters,"
" do not use the same conditions when preparing the initial list, pivot "
"table, or chart for insertion into a :doc:`spreadsheet <../insert>` or "
":ref:`dashboard <dashboards/customize-dashboard/edit-spreadsheet-new-odoo-"
"data>`."
msgstr ""
"全域篩選器的運作原理，是暫時在已連接資料來源的網域中加入額外條件。因此，若你"
"打算使用全域篩選器，在準備要插入 :doc:`試算表 <../insert>` 或 :ref:`儀表板 "
"<dashboards/customize-dashboard/edit-spreadsheet-new-odoo-data>` 的初始列表、"
"樞紐分析表或圖表時，請勿使用相同條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:38
msgid ""
"Setting default filter va^plues, where relevant, ensures that the "
"spreadsheet or dashboard loads quickly and provides a useful initial view "
"that can be further customized if needed. For example, a :guilabel:`Date` "
"filter could be set to show data from the last 30 days by default, rather "
"than  showing all historical data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:44
msgid ""
"Only users with :doc:`Editor rights to an Odoo spreadsheet "
"<../share_collaborate>` can configure, manage, and apply global filters in "
"that spreadsheet. Any user with :ref:`access to an Odoo dashboard "
"<dashboards/access-and-sharing>` can apply global filters configured for "
"that dashboard."
msgstr ""
"只有擁有 :doc:`Odoo 試算表編輯權限 <../share_collaborate>` 的用戶，才能在該試"
"算表中設定、管理及套用全域篩選器。任何擁有 :ref:`Odoo 儀表板存取權限 "
"<dashboards/access-and-sharing>` 的用戶，均可套用為該儀表板設定的全域篩選器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:52
msgid "Configure global filters"
msgstr "設定全域篩選條件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:54
msgid "To configure global filters in a spreadsheet:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:56
msgid ""
"Open the relevant spreadsheet from the **Odoo Documents** app or :ref:`via "
"the Odoo Dashboards app <build_and_customize_dashboards/customize/open-"
"spreadsheet>` if you are configuring global filters for a dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:59
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:329
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`os-global-filters` :guilabel:`Filters` at the top right of the "
"spreadsheet to open the :guilabel:`Filters` panel."
msgstr ""
"按一下試算表右上角的 :icon:`os-global-filters` :guilabel:`篩選條件`，開"
"啟:guilabel:`篩選條件`面板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:61
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create filter` section, select the relevant :ref:`type of "
"global filter <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-types>`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`建立篩選器` 區段中，選取相關的 :ref:`全局篩選器類型 "
"<spreadsheet/global-filters/create-types>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:63
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Filter properties` panel that opens, complete the relevant"
" fields based on the :ref:`type of global filter <spreadsheet/global-"
"filters/create-types>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:65
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`Field matching <spreadsheet/global-filters/field-matching>` "
"section, for each data source, select or search for the field the filter "
"should match against. If needed, click the :icon:`oi-chevron-right` "
":guilabel:`(right arrow)` next to the field name to access the list of "
"related fields."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`欄位配對 <spreadsheet/global-filters/field-matching>` 部分中，為每個"
"資料來源選擇或搜尋篩選條件應配對的欄位。如有需要，請點擊欄位名稱旁邊的 "
":icon:`oi-chevron-right` :guilabel:`（右箭頭）`，以開啟相關欄位列表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:71
msgid ""
"Depending on the data source(s) connected to the spreadsheet, suggested "
"global filters may be automatically proposed in the :guilabel:`Suggestions` "
"section of the :guilabel:`Filters` panel. While these filters are pre-"
"configured for immediate use, it is still possible to add a default value or"
" restrict values using a domain."
msgstr ""
"視乎連接至試算表的資料來源，系統可能會自動在 :guilabel:`建議` 部分（位於 "
":guilabel:`篩選條件` 面板內）提供建議的全域篩選條件。雖然這些篩選條件已預先設"
"定好，可即時使用，但你仍可加入預設值或使用網域條件（domain）限制數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:75
msgid ""
"If a default value is defined during configuration, the spreadsheet data "
"updates immediately when the filter is saved."
msgstr "如果在設定期間定義了預設值，儲存篩選器後，試算表資料會立即更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:79
msgid ""
"To pin the :guilabel:`Filters` panel so another panel, such as the "
":guilabel:`Filter properties` panel, can be opened beside it, click "
":menuselection:`View -->` :icon:`fa-thumb-tack` :menuselection:`Pin the side"
" panel` from the menu bar. To unpin a panel, click the :icon:`fa-thumb-tack`"
" :guilabel:`(pin)` icon at the top right of the panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:87
msgid "Types of global filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:89
msgid "Six types of global filter are available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:91
msgid ""
":ref:`Date <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-date>`: filters based on a "
"specific or relative time range, e.g., `January 2026` or `Last 7 Days`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`日期 <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-date>`：根據特定或相對時間範圍"
"進行篩選，例如 `2026 年 1 月` 或 `過去 7 天`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:93
msgid ""
":ref:`Relation <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-relation>`: filters using "
"a relational field in a related model, e.g., by :guilabel:`Salesperson` with"
" the *User* model set as the related model."
msgstr ""
":ref:`關聯 <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-relation>`：使用相關模型中的關"
"聯欄位進行篩選，例如將 *用戶* 模型設為相關模型，並按 :guilabel:`銷售員` 篩選"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:95
msgid ""
":ref:`Text <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-text>`: filters on a string of"
" characters or a range of predefined values, e.g., a product reference or "
"barcode."
msgstr ""
":ref:`文字 <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-text>`：根據字元字串或一系列預"
"先定義的值進行篩選，例如產品參考編號或條碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:97
msgid ""
":ref:`Yes/No <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-checkbox>`: filters based on"
" whether or not a checkbox (boolean) field is checked, e.g., leads where the"
" :guilabel:`Active` field is checked."
msgstr ""
":ref:`是/否 <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-checkbox>`：根據核取方塊（布林"
"值）欄位是否已勾選進行篩選，例如已勾選 :guilabel:`有效` 欄位的潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:99
msgid ""
":ref:`Selection <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-selection>`: filters "
"using the predefined options of a selection field, e.g., tasks where the "
"priority level is set to `Urgent`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`選擇 <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-selection>`：使用選擇欄位的預設"
"選項進行篩選，例如將優先級設為 `緊急` 的任務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:101
msgid ""
":ref:`Numeric <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-numeric>`: filters based on"
" numerical values and ranges, e.g., purchase orders where the "
":guilabel:`Untaxed Amount` is above `$1,000`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:110
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Date` filter can only match against a :ref:`Date or Date & Time"
" <studio/fields/simple-fields-date-time>` field."
msgstr ""

