msgid ""
"In the :ref:`Field matching <spreadsheet/global-filters/field-matching>` "
"section, for each relevant data source, click beside :guilabel:`Field`, then"
" select or search for the field the filter should match against."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:121
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Period offset` option, which appears when a date field is "
"chosen, enables comparisons to be made by shifting the time range by one or "
"more periods in the past or future. By default, no period offset is defined."
" To define a period offset, select :guilabel:`Previous` or :guilabel:`Next`,"
" then select the desired number of periods in the past or future."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:128
msgid ""
"To compare data effectively using the :guilabel:`Period offset` feature, "
":ref:`duplicate the relevant inserted list <spreadsheet/insert-"
"list/duplicate>` or :ref:`pivot table <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/duplicate>`,"
" then, when setting up field matching, set a period offset for the second "
"data source but not the first."
msgstr ""
"如要使用 :guilabel:`期間偏移` 功能有效比較資料，請 :ref:`複製相關的已插入清"
"單 <spreadsheet/insert-list/duplicate>` 或 :ref:`樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/"
"pivot-tables/duplicate>`，然後在設定欄位配對時，為第二個資料來源設定期間偏移"
"，而第一個資料來源則不作設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:133
msgid ""
"When applying the filter, the original list or pivot table shows data for "
"the time range selected, while the second shows data for a period before or "
"after that time range, as defined."
msgstr ""
"套用篩選器後，原本的清單或樞紐分析表會顯示所選時間範圍的資料，而第二個則會按"
"設定顯示該時間範圍之前或之後的期間資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:142
msgid "Relation"
msgstr "關聯"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:145
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Relation` filter can only match against a :ref:`Many2One "
"<studio/fields/relational-fields-many2one>`, :ref:`One2Many "
"<studio/fields/relational-fields-one2many>`, or :ref:`Many2Many "
"<studio/fields/relational-fields-many2many>` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:154
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Related model` field, start typing the model name to "
"reveal a list of all models, then select the appropriate one. Once a model "
"is selected, the :guilabel:`Default value` and :guilabel:`Possible values` "
"fields appear, as well as the :guilabel:`Field matching` section."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`相關模型`欄位中，開始輸入模型名稱以顯示所有模型清單，然後選取合"
"適的模型。選取模型後，便會顯示:guilabel:`預設值`及:guilabel:`可能的值`欄位，"
"以及:guilabel:`欄位配對`部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:159
msgid ""
"To set a :guilabel:`Default value`, select one of the available values; "
"these are records from the model. If the related model is the *User* model, "
"the option :guilabel:`Automatically filter on the current user` can be "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:163
msgid ""
"To limit the :guilabel:`Possible values` that can be shown, enable "
":guilabel:`Restrict values with a domain`, then click :ref:`Edit domain "
"<search/custom-filters>` to add or edit rules."
msgstr ""
"要限制可顯示的 :guilabel:`可能的值`，請啟用 :guilabel:`使用網域限制值`，然後"
"按一下 :ref:`編輯網域 <search/custom-filters>` 以新增或編輯規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:166
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`Field matching <spreadsheet/global-filters/field-matching>`  "
"section, check if the correct matching field has been assigned for each "
"relevant data source. If this is not the case, click beside "
":guilabel:`Field` then select or search the appropriate field."
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`欄位配對 <spreadsheet/global-filters/field-matching>`分區中，檢查是否"
"已為每個相關資料來源指派正確的配對欄位。如果沒有，請在:guilabel:`欄位`旁邊點"
"擊，然後選擇或搜尋適當的欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:178
msgid ""
