"Click the :icon:`os-global-filters` :guilabel:`Filters` icon at the top "
"right of the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:301
msgid ""
"Global filters that have been configured are presented as cards. The icon "
"before the filter name indicates the :ref:`type of filter "
"<spreadsheet/global-filters/create-types>`: :icon:`fa-calendar` (Date), "
":icon:`fa-chain` (Relation), :icon:`fa-font` (Text), :icon:`fa-toggle-off` "
"(Yes/No), :icon:`fa-caret-down` (Selection), :icon:`fa-hashtag` (Numeric)."
msgstr ""
"已設定的全域篩選器會以卡片形式顯示。篩選器名稱前的圖示代表:ref:`篩選器類型 "
"<spreadsheet/global-filters/create-types>`：:icon:`fa-calendar`（日期）"
"、:icon:`fa-chain`（關聯）、:icon:`fa-font`（文字）、:icon:`fa-toggle-off`（"
"是／否）、:icon:`fa-caret-down`（選項）、:icon:`fa-hashtag`（數值）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:308
msgid ""
"**Change the order** in which the global filters are displayed by clicking "
"on a card and dragging it to the desired position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:312
msgid ""
"This order also determines how the filters appear in the search bar of a "
"dashboard when filters are being applied."
msgstr "此順序亦決定套用篩選條件時，篩選器在儀表板搜尋列中的顯示方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:315
msgid ""
"**Edit a global filter** by clicking the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` "
"icon, then :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Edit`, then :ref:`editing "
"the filter properties <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-types>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"若要 **編輯全域篩選器**，請點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示，然"
"後點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`編輯`，再按需要 :ref:`編輯篩選器"
"屬性 <spreadsheet/global-filters/create-types>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:318
msgid ""
"**Delete a global filter** by clicking the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)`"
" icon, then :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Delete`. Alternatively, with a "
"filter's :guilabel:`Filter properties` panel open, click :guilabel:`Remove` "
"to delete the global filter."
msgstr ""
"**刪除全域篩選器**：點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(齒輪)` 圖示，然後點擊 "
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`刪除`。或者，在開啟篩選器的 :guilabel:`篩選器屬"
"性` 面板時，點擊 :guilabel:`移除` 以刪除全域篩選器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:327
