#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:3
msgid "Pivot tables"
msgstr "樞紐分析表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:5
msgid ""
"Pivot tables allow you to organize, summarize, and analyze large amounts of "
"data without the need for complex formulas. By grouping and segmenting data "
"into :ref:`dimensions <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions>` (i.e., the "
"fields added as columns and rows) and defining what is being :ref:`measured "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>` (e.g., the total amount or quantity "
"ordered), the corresponding values of each intersecting data point are "
"calculated automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:12
msgid ""
"Various manipulations can be performed to see the same dataset from "
"different perspectives, such as :ref:`rearranging or sorting dimensions "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions>`, or :ref:`changing how measures are "
"aggregated or calculated <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>`."
msgstr ""
"您可以執行各種操作，從不同角度檢視同一組資料集，例如 :ref:`重新排列或排序維"
"度 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions>`，或 :ref:`更改指標的彙總或計算方式 "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:17
msgid ""
"In the example, the pivot table shows the :guilabel:`Total` amount of sales "
"orders per salesperson per quarter. The :guilabel:`Salesperson` field is "
"represented in rows, the :guilabel:`Order Date` (grouped by quarter and "
"year) in columns, while the values represent the total amount for the given "
"salesperson and quarter."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，樞紐分析表顯示每位銷售員每季的銷售訂單 :guilabel:`總計` 金額"
"。:guilabel:`銷售員` 欄位以列顯示，:guilabel:`訂單日期`（按季度及年份分組）則"
"以欄顯示，而數值代表指定銷售員及季度的總金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:22
msgid "Pivot table showing sales per salesperson per quarter"
msgstr "顯示每位銷售員每季銷售額的樞紐分析表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:25
msgid "With Odoo Spreadsheet, it is possible to:"
msgstr "使用 Odoo 試算表，你可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:27
msgid ""
":ref:`insert a pivot table from an Odoo pivot view "
"<spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_view>` into an Odoo spreadsheet, Odoo "
"dashboard, or quote calculator spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":ref:`從 Odoo 透視表檢視插入透視表 <spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_view>"
"` 到 Odoo 試算表、Odoo 儀表板或報價計算器試算表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:30
msgid ""
":ref:`insert a pivot table referencing Odoo data directly from an Odoo "
"spreadsheet <spreadsheet/insert_pivot_table/from_spreadsheet>`. This option "
"allows you to retrieve and work with data from any model, including models "
"for which no Odoo pivot view is available e.g., the *Sales Order Line* "
"model."
msgstr ""
":ref:`直接從 Odoo 試算表插入引用 Odoo 資料的透視表 <spreadsheet/"
"insert_pivot_table/from_spreadsheet>`。此選項讓你擷取及處理任何模型的資料，包"
"括沒有 Odoo 透視表檢視的模型，例如 *銷售訂單明細* 模型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:35
msgid ""
":ref:`insert a pivot table from a range of data <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/create>`. The data can be static data or dynamic Odoo data that had "
"been inserted into the spreadsheet, e.g., from a list view."
msgstr ""
":ref:`從資料範圍插入樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/create>`。該資料可以"
"是靜態資料，或是已插入試算表的動態 Odoo 資料（例如來自列表檢視）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:39
msgid ""
"When a pivot table is inserted in an Odoo spreadsheet, a :ref:`data source "
"<spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>` is created, which connects the pivot "
"table to the underlying database data or spreadsheet range."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 試算表中插入樞紐分析表時，系統會建立一個 :ref:`數據來源 <spreadsheet/"
"insert/data-sources>`，將樞紐分析表連接至底層資料庫的數據或試算表範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:44
msgid ""
":ref:`Static vs dynamic pivot tables <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-"
"vs-dynamic>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`靜態與動態樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>"
"`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:49
msgid "Insert a pivot table from a range of data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:52
msgid "Before inserting a pivot table from a range of data:"
msgstr "從資料範圍插入樞紐分析表前："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:54
msgid ""
"Organize your data in columns, not rows, i.e., each column should contain "
"one category of information, while each row should contain one record."
msgstr ""
"請以直欄而非橫列整理資料，即每個直欄應包含一個類別的資訊，而每個橫列則應包含"
"一項紀錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:56
msgid ""
"Ensure all columns have a unique header; avoid double rows of headers or "
"merged cells."
msgstr "確保所有欄均有唯一標題；避免使用雙列標題或合併儲存格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:57
msgid ""
"Format your data as a table by selecting any cell in the range, clicking "
":icon:`os-edit-table` :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`Insert table` from "
"the toolbar, then selecting a style. This ensures any updates to the table "
"are reflected in the pivot table."
msgstr ""
"要將資料格式化為表格，請選取範圍內的任何儲存格，在工具列按一下 :icon:`os-"
"edit-table` :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`插入表格`，然後選取樣式。這樣可"
"確保表格的任何更新都會反映在樞紐分析表中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:61
msgid "To create a pivot table from a range of data:"
msgstr "要從資料範圍建立樞紐分析表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:63
msgid "Open the relevant Odoo spreadsheet."
msgstr "開啟相關的 Odoo 試算表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:64
msgid ""
"Select any cell within the range of data to be analyzed, then click "
":menuselection:`Insert -->` :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :menuselection:`Pivot "
"table` :icon:`fa-caret-right` :menuselection:`From range` from the menu bar."
msgstr ""
"選擇要分析的資料範圍內的任何儲存格，然後在選單列點擊:menuselection:`插入 -->"
"` :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :menuselection:`樞紐分析表` :icon:`fa-caret-right` "
":menuselection:`從範圍`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:68
msgid ""
"A new sheet opens with an empty pivot table in the top-left corner of the "
"sheet; the sheet name is the :ref:`pivot table ID <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties-id>`, e.g., *Pivot #2*. By default, the pivot table is a "
":ref:`dynamic pivot table <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-"
"dynamic>`, where the top-left cell contains an :ref:`Odoo-specific array "
"function <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/dynamic-function>` that retrieves "
"data from the range of data once :ref:`columns, rows, and measures have been"
" added <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/build-manipulate>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:84
