"Here, it is possible to modify various aspects of the pivot table's "
"configuration and presentation via the :icon:`fa-sliders` "
":ref:`Configuration <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-configuration>` and"
" :icon:`fa-paint-brush` :ref:`Design <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-"
