"click :guilabel:`Update (Apply all changes)` or :icon:`fa-undo` "
":guilabel:`(Discard all changes)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:195
msgid ""
"Disabling :guilabel:`Defer updates` applies all the changes made since the "
"option was enabled and restores real-time updating."
msgstr ""
"停用:guilabel:`延遲更新`後，系統會套用自啟用該選項以來所作的所有變更，並恢復"
"即時更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:201
msgid "Dimensions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:203
msgid ""
"The dimensions of a pivot table, i.e., fields added as columns and rows, "
"represent the categories used to group or segment the data. Columns are "
"typically used for fields that can provide a comparative view, e.g, "
":guilabel:`Order Date` grouped by quarter, while rows are typically used for"
" fields that will return many values, e.g., :guilabel:`Customer` or "
":guilabel:`Product`."
msgstr ""
"樞紐分析表的維度（即加入為欄與列的欄位）代表用於分組或細分資料的類別。欄通常"
"用於可提供比較檢視的欄位，例如按季度分組的:guilabel:`訂單日期`；而列則通常用"
"於會傳回多個值的欄位，例如:guilabel:`客戶`或:guilabel:`產品`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:208
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:394
