msgid ":ref:`sort dimensions <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions-sorting>`"
msgstr ":ref:`排序維度 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions-sorting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:217
msgid "Add or remove dimensions"
msgstr "新增或移除維度"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:219
msgid ""
"Adding or removing dimensions allows you to tailor the pivot table to your "
"needs and control the level of granularity of the data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:222
msgid "To add a dimension to a pivot table:"
msgstr "若要為樞紐分析表新增維度："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:224
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:285
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:291
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:337
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:356
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:407
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:444
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:471
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:485
msgid ""
"Open the :ref:`pivot table's properties panel <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties>`."
msgstr "開啟 :ref:`數據透視表的屬性面板 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:225
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Columns` or :guilabel:`Rows` section, as relevant, click "
":guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "視乎需要，在 :guilabel:`欄` 或 :guilabel:`列` 區域中點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:227
msgid ""
"Change the :ref:`sorting <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions-sorting>`, if "
"desired."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可更改 :ref:`排序方式 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions-sorting>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:230
msgid ""
"For date- or time-based dimensions, select the desired "
":guilabel:`Granularity` from the options in the dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"對於以日期或時間為基礎的維度，請從下拉式選單的選項中選擇所需的 :guilabel:`粒"
"度`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:232
msgid ""
"In a pivot table referencing Odoo data that was inserted from an Odoo pivot "
"view or inserted directly from the spreadsheet, click the :icon:`oi-chevron-"
"right` :guilabel:`(right arrow)` next to the field name to access the list "
"of related fields when adding columns or rows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:236
msgid ""
"To remove a dimension from a pivot table, click the :icon:`fa-trash` "
":guilabel:`(delete)` icon on the dimension's card."
msgstr ""
"要從樞紐分析表移除維度，請點擊維度卡片上的 :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`（刪除"
"）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:242
msgid "Nested dimensions"
msgstr "巢狀維度"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:244
msgid ""
"Adding multiple row or column dimensions creates a nested hierarchy. To "
"change the hierarchy of the dimensions, drag the dimension's card to the "
"desired position within its section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:248
msgid ""
"In the example, the field :guilabel:`Product` was added as a row dimension "
"in addition to :guilabel:`Saleperson` to show products per salesperson. "
"Switching the order of the dimensions then shows salesperson per product."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，系統加入了:guilabel:`產品`欄位作為列維度（連同原有的:guilabel:`銷"
"售員`），以顯示每位銷售員的產品。切換維度順序即可顯示每項產品的銷售員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:252
msgid "Creating a nested hierarchy of dimensions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:255
msgid ""
"To collapse or expand a nested hierarchy in the pivot table, click the "
":icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(expand)` or :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` "
":guilabel:`(collapse)` icon as relevant."
msgstr ""
"如要摺疊或展開樞紐分析表中的巢狀層級，請按需要點擊 :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` "
":guilabel:`（展開）` 或 :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`（摺疊）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:261
msgid ""
"To flatten a pivot table, i.e., convert hierarchical data into a simple "
"table where each row dimension field has its own column and every line has "
"complete information with repeated labels, enable :guilabel:`Use tabular "
"form` in the :guilabel:`Design` tab of the :ref:`pivot table's properties "
"panel <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-design>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:267
msgid ""
"In the example, with tabular form enabled, the row dimensions "
":guilabel:`Salesperson` and :guilabel:`Product` are no longer nested in a "
"single column, but are presented in separate columns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:271
msgid "Pivot table in tabular vs compact form"
msgstr "表格式與壓縮式樞紐分析表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:277
msgid "Rearrange dimensions"
msgstr "重新排列維度"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:279
msgid ""
"Rearranging the dimensions of a pivot table, i.e., moving a field from a "
"column to a row, or vice versa, allows you to view the same dataset from "
"different perspectives and potentially gain new insights."
msgstr ""
"重新排列樞紐分析表的維度（即將欄位從欄移至列，或從列移至欄），可讓你從不同角"
"度檢視同一組資料集，並可能獲得新的見解。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:283
msgid "To change the axis on which an individual dimension is shown:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:286
msgid ""
"Drag the dimension's card from the :guilabel:`Columns` section to the "
":guilabel:`Rows` section or vice versa."
msgstr "將維度卡片從 :guilabel:`欄` 部分拖曳至 :guilabel:`列` 部分，或反向操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:289
msgid ""
"To move *all* the dimensions represented in columns to rows and vice versa, "
"at the same time:"
msgstr "若要同時將以欄顯示的 *所有* 維度移至列（反之亦然）："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:292
msgid "Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon."
msgstr "點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:293
msgid "Click :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Flip axes`."
msgstr "點擊 :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`翻轉坐標軸`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:296
msgid ""
"Depending on the volume of data, flipping the axes of a pivot table can "
"result in a :guilabel:`#SPILL` error. This happens when a formula tries to "
"output a range of values, but something is preventing cells from being "
"populated, such as other data, merged cells, or the boundaries of the "
"current sheet."
msgstr ""
"視乎資料量而定，翻轉樞紐分析表的座標軸可能會導致 :guilabel:`#SPILL` 錯誤。當"
"公式嘗試輸出一組數值範圍，但有其他內容阻礙儲存格填入資料時（例如其他資料、合"
"併的儲存格或目前工作表的邊界），便會發生此情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:301
msgid ""
"Hovering over the cell containing :guilabel:`#SPILL` provides details of the"
" error."
msgstr "將滑鼠游標停留在包含 :guilabel:`#SPILL` 的儲存格上，即可查看錯誤詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:306
msgid "Sort dimensions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:308
msgid ""
"Sorting dimensions allows you to organize pivot table data and more easily "
"uncover the insights you need. Any dimension can be sorted :ref:`by "
"dimension value <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions-sorting-value>`, while "
"row dimensions can also be sorted :ref:`by measure <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/dimensions-sorting-measure>`."
msgstr ""
"排序維度可讓你整理樞紐分析表資料，更輕鬆找出所需見解。任何維度均可 :ref:`按維"
"度值 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions-sorting-value>` 排序，而列維度亦可 "
":ref:`按量度 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions-sorting-measure>` 排序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:316
msgid "By dimension value"
msgstr "按維度值"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:318
msgid ""
"Dimension values are typically sorted in ascending alphabetical, "
"chronological, or numerical order by default."
msgstr "維度值預設通常按字母、時間或數值的遞增順序排列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:321
msgid "To change how a dimension is sorted by dimension value:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:323
msgid ""
"Open the :ref:`pivot table properties <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:324
msgid ""
"On the card of the relevant dimension, in the :guilabel:`Order by` field, "
"select :guilabel:`Ascending`, :guilabel:`Descending`, or "
":guilabel:`Unsorted`."
msgstr ""
"在相關維度的卡片上，於 :guilabel:`排序方式` 欄位中，選擇 :guilabel:`遞"
"增`、:guilabel:`遞減` 或 :guilabel:`未排序`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:330
msgid "By measure"
msgstr "按度量"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:332
msgid ""
"Row dimensions can be sorted by measure, e.g., to see the total amount of "
"sales orders per salesperson per quarter in ascending order based on the "
"total amount."
msgstr ""
"橫列維度可按指標排序，例如按總金額由小到大查看每位銷售人員每季的銷售訂單總金"
"額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:335
msgid "To sort row dimensions by measure:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:338
msgid ""
"Right-click any value in the relevant column, then click :icon:`os-sort-"
"range` :guilabel:`Sort pivot` and select :guilabel:`Ascending` or "
":guilabel:`Descending`."
msgstr ""
"在相關欄位的任意數值上按一下右鍵，然後按一下 :icon:`os-sort-range` "
":guilabel:`排序數據透視表`，並選擇 :guilabel:`升序` 或 :guilabel:`降序`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:341
msgid ""
"To return to the default order, follow the same steps, then select "
":guilabel:`No sorting` from the dropdown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:347
msgid "Group dimension values"
msgstr "將維度值分組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:349
msgid ""
"Grouping dimension values allows you to declutter your pivot table by "
"combining multiple dimension values into a single, collapsible group. This "
"can be useful, for example, for creating an :guilabel:`Others` category to "
"group less significant values and allow focus to be placed on more "
"significant data."
msgstr ""
"將維度值分組可讓您將多個維度值合併為單一的可摺疊群組，從而簡化樞紐分析表。例"
"如，這可用於建立:guilabel:`其他`類別，將較不重要的數值歸納在一起，以便專注於"
"更重要的數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:354
msgid "To group dimension values and create an :guilabel:`Others` category:"
msgstr "如要將維度數值分組並建立 :guilabel:`其他` 類別："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:357
msgid ""
"Hold `Ctrl` then select the cells of the row or column dimension values that"
" should be grouped."
msgstr "按住 `Ctrl` 鍵，然後選取要分組的列或欄維度值儲存格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:358
msgid ""
"Right-click one of the selected cells, then click :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` "
":guilabel:`Group pivot dimensions`. A new dimension is added to the "
":guilabel:`Columns` or :guilabel:`Rows` section, as relevant. Change the "
"sorting to :guilabel:`Ascending` or :guilabel:`Descending`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:361
msgid "On the card of the new dimension:"
msgstr "在新維度的卡片上："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:363
msgid ""
"Change the :guilabel:`Order by` field from :guilabel:`Unsorted` to "
":guilabel:`Ascending` or :guilabel:`Descending`, as desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:365
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-angle-right` :guilabel:`Groups` to expand the sub-section."
msgstr "點擊 :icon:`fa-angle-right` :guilabel:`群組` 以展開該子區段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:366
msgid ""
"Optionally, rename :guilabel:`Group` by clicking it and entering a new name."
msgstr "如有需要，可按一下 :guilabel:`群組` 並輸入新名稱來重新命名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:367
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`+ \"Others\"` group to have the unselected dimension values"
" added to a single group that is then placed after the selected values."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`+「其他」` 群組，系統便會將未選取的維度值加入單一群組，並將該"
"群組置於已選取的數值之後。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:370
msgid ""
"To collapse or expand a dimension group in the pivot table, click the "
":icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(expand)` or :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` "
":guilabel:`(collapse)` icon as relevant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:374
msgid ""
"In the example, data per salesperson for the secondary markets of Ireland, "
"Italy, and the United States has been grouped into an :guilabel:`Others` "
"category, which can then be collapsed and its data seen beside that of the "
"main markets of Belgium and Spain."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，愛爾蘭、意大利和美國等次要市場按銷售員劃分的資料，已歸類至 "
":guilabel:`其他` 類別，然後可將其摺疊，並在比利時和西班牙等主要市場的資料旁邊"
"查看其資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:378
msgid "Grouping dimension values to create an 'Others' category"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:384
msgid "Measures"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:386
msgid ""
"The measures of a pivot table represent what is being measured, or analyzed,"
