msgid ""
"If the desired measure did not exist in the original data source, create a "
":ref:`calculated measure <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-calculated>`, "
"e.g., to show the average revenue per order."
msgstr ""
"如果原始資料來源中沒有所需的指標，請建立:ref:`計算指標 <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/measures-calculated>`，例如顯示每張訂單的平均收益。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:396
msgid ":ref:`add or remove measures <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-add>`"
msgstr ":ref:`新增或移除度量 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-add>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:397
msgid ""
":ref:`rearrange measures <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-rearrange>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:398
msgid ""
":ref:`change how measures are calculated and shown <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/measures-calculated>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`更改測量值的計算及顯示方式 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-"
"calculated>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:403
msgid "Add or remove measures"
msgstr "新增或移除計量"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:405
msgid "To add a measure to a pivot table:"
msgstr "如要在樞紐分析表新增量度："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:408
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:445
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Measures` section, click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`量度` 區段中，按一下 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:409
msgid ""
"Select the appropriate measure or click :icon:`os-formula` :guilabel:`Add "
"calculated measure` to create and add a custom :ref:`calculated measure "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-calculated>`."
msgstr ""
