"加入自訂 :ref:`計算度量 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-calculated>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:412
msgid ""
"Optionally, edit the name of the measure by clicking and then editing the "
"measure's name."
msgstr "如有需要，可點擊並編輯量度的名稱，以修改該量度名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:413
msgid ""
"Optionally, change how the measure is aggregated by selecting a value from "
"the dropdown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:415
msgid ""
"To remove a measure from a pivot table, click the :icon:`fa-trash` "
":guilabel:`(delete)` icon on the dimension's card. To temporarily hide a "
"measure instead of removing it, click the :icon:`fa-eye` :guilabel:`(Hide)` "
"icon; to make a previously hidden measure visible, click the :icon:`fa-eye-"
"slash` :guilabel:`(Show)` icon."
msgstr ""
"如要從樞紐分析表中移除度量，請點擊維度卡片上的 :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`（"
"刪除）` 圖示。如要暫時隱藏度量而非移除，請點擊 :icon:`fa-eye` :guilabel:`（隱"
"藏）` 圖示；如要再次顯示先前隱藏的度量，請點擊 :icon:`fa-eye-slash` "
":guilabel:`（顯示）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:421
msgid ""
"To simply display a count of the dimensions, rather than a quantifiable "
"measure, select :guilabel:`Count` as the measure."
msgstr "如只想顯示維度的計數而非可量化的指標，請選取 :guilabel:`計數` 作為指標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:423
msgid ""
"In the pivot table, a measure's label is shown in a second header row by "
"default; :ref:`hide this row <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-hide-"
"titles>` if desired."
msgstr ""
"在樞紐分析表中，預設會在第二個標題列顯示量度標籤；如有需要，可 :ref:`隱藏此"
"列 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-hide-titles>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:425
msgid ""
"The same measure can be added multiple times with different aggregations."
msgstr "同一個量度可以不同的彙總方式重複加入多次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:426
msgid ""
"If multiple measures are added, they are shown in columns in the order in "
"which they are added; :ref:`change the order <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/measures-rearrange>` if desired."
msgstr ""
"如果新增了多個指標，它們會按新增順序顯示在各欄中；如有需要，可 :ref:`更改順"
"序 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures-rearrange>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:432
