msgid ""
"In the pivot table, measures are shown in columns in the order in which they"
" were added."
msgstr "在樞紐分析表中，指標會按新增順序顯示於各欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:469
