msgstr "若要更改顯示度量指標的順序："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:472
msgid "Drag the measure’s card to the desired position."
msgstr "將量度卡片拖曳至所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:477
