"or ranked from smallest to largest."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:483
msgid "To change how a measure is shown:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:486
msgid ""
"On the measure's card, click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Show values as)` "
