#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:487
msgid "Select the desired option from the dropdown menu."
msgstr "從下拉式選單中選擇所需選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:491
msgid ""
"When changing how the measures are shown, the pivot table data updates in "
