"defer-updates>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"變更量度的顯示方式時，即使已啟用 :ref:`延遲更新 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/"
"properties-defer-updates>` 功能，樞紐分析表數據亦會實時更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:497
msgid "Remove measure titles"
msgstr "移除度量標題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:499
msgid ""
"By default, measure titles are shown in a second header row in a pivot "
"table."
msgstr "預設情況下，量值標題會顯示在樞紐分析表的第二個標題列中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:501
msgid ""
"To remove this header row in a :ref:`dynamic pivot table "
"<spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:504
msgid ""
"Double-click the top left cell of the pivot table to be able to edit the "
"formula."
msgstr "按兩下樞紐分析表左上角的儲存格，即可編輯公式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:505
msgid ""
"Position your cursor after the pivot ID then type `,` to advance to "
":guilabel:`[include_measure_titles]`, then type `0`."
msgstr ""
"將游標置於樞紐分析表 ID 後方，輸入 `,` 以移至 :guilabel:`[包含指標標題]`，然"
"後輸入 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:508
msgid "The row showing measure titles is removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:510
msgid "Removing measure titles from pivot table"
msgstr "從樞紐分析表移除量度標題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:514
msgid ""
"The visibility of measure titles, as well as other display options, can also"
" be controlled via the :ref:`pivot table properties <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties>`, in the :ref:`Design <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties-design>` tab."
msgstr ""
"量值標題的可見性及其他顯示選項，亦可透過:ref:`樞紐分析表屬性 <spreadsheet/"
"pivot-tables/properties>`內的:ref:`設計 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-"
"design>`分頁控制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:517
msgid ""
"In a :ref:`static pivot table <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-"
"dynamic>`, delete the second header row manually, if desired."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`靜態樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>` "
"中，如有需要，可手動刪除第二個標題列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:523
msgid "Duplicate or delete a pivot table"
msgstr "複製或刪除樞紐分析表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:526
msgid ""
"When :ref:`duplicating <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/duplicate>` or "
":ref:`deleting <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/delete>` a pivot table, it is "
"important to remember that each inserted pivot table also has a :ref:`data "
"source <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>`."
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`複製 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/duplicate>`或:ref:`刪除 <spreadsheet/"
"pivot-tables/delete>`樞紐分析表時，請謹記每個已插入的樞紐分析表亦都有一"
"個:ref:`資料來源 <spreadsheet/insert/data-sources>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:533
msgid "Duplicate a pivot table"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:535
msgid ""
"Duplicating a pivot table via the pivot table's properties creates an "
"additional data source. This allows for different manipulations to be "
"performed on the same data within one spreadsheet. For example, you can see "
"the same data aggregated by different dimensions or use :doc:`global filters"
" <global_filters>` to offset the date and create pivot tables that compare "
"the current period's data with a previous period."
msgstr ""
"透過數據透視表屬性複製數據透視表，會建立額外的資料來源。這樣便可在同一試算表"
"內對相同資料執行不同的處理操作。例如，您可以查看按不同維度彙總的相同資料，或"
"使用:doc:`全域篩選器 <global_filters>`來偏移日期，從而建立比較本期與上期資料"
"的數據透視表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:541
msgid "To duplicate a pivot table:"
msgstr "要複製樞紐分析表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:543
msgid ""
"With the :ref:`pivot table properties <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties>`"
" open, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon then :icon:`fa-"
"clone` :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"開啟 :ref:`樞紐分析表屬性 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties>` 後，點擊 "
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-clone` "
":guilabel:`複製`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:546
msgid ""
"The duplicated pivot table is automatically inserted into a new sheet in the"
" spreadsheet, with the pivot table properties open in the right panel."
msgstr ""
"複製的樞紐分析表會自動插入至試算表中的新工作表，並於右側面板開啟樞紐分析表屬"
"性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:549
msgid ""
"Edit the :guilabel:`Name` in the properties panel and the sheet tab if "
"needed."
msgstr "如有需要，可在屬性面板及工作表分頁中編輯 :guilabel:`名稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:551
msgid ""
"The new data source is assigned the next available :ref:`pivot table ID "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-id>`. For example, if no other pivot "
"tables have been inserted in the meantime, duplicating *Pivot #1* results in"
" the creation of *Pivot #2*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:556
msgid ""
"Duplicating a pivot table by copying and pasting it or by duplicating the "
"sheet does not create a new data source. Any changes made to the pivot "
"table's properties would therefore impact any copies of the pivot table."
msgstr ""
"透過複製貼上或複製工作表來複製樞紐分析表，並不會建立新的數據來源。因此，對樞"
"紐分析表屬性所作的任何變更，都會影響所有樞紐分析表的副本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:559
msgid ""
"When a pivot table is duplicated, the new pivot table is, by default, a "
":ref:`dynamic pivot table <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-"
"dynamic>` whose dimensions and measures :ref:`can be manipulated "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/build-manipulate>`."
msgstr ""
"複製樞紐分析表時，預設會建立一個:ref:`動態樞紐分析表 <spreadsheet/insert-"
