"to be sent by the terminal. This is critical to ensure the WhatsApp "
":abbr:`API (Application Programming Interface)` is working."
msgstr ""
"在此步驟中新增接收測試的電話號碼，可讓終端機成功傳送測試。這對於確保 "
"WhatsApp :abbr:`API（應用程式介面）` 正常運作至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:254
msgid ""
"On the next page, enter the verification code sent to the phone numbers, and"
" click :guilabel:`Next` to verify the numbers."
msgstr ""
