msgstr "回呼網址必須可公開存取，以便 Meta 伺服器能成功傳送 Webhook 事件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:529
msgid "Go live with the Meta app"
msgstr "正式啟用 Meta 應用程式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:531
msgid ""
"Finally, to launch the app, the Meta app must be set to :guilabel:`Live` in "
"the `Meta Developer Dashboard <https://developers.facebook.com/apps>`__. "
"Click the app that is being configured, then toggle the :guilabel:`App Mode`"
" field from :guilabel:`Development` to :guilabel:`Live`."
msgstr ""
"最後，若要推出應用程式，必須將 Meta 應用程式設為:guilabel:`上線`，此操作須於 "
"`Meta 開發人員儀表板 <https://developers.facebook.com/apps>`__ 進行。點擊正在"
"設定的應用程式，然後將:guilabel:`應用程式模式`欄位由:guilabel:`開發中`切換"
"至:guilabel:`上線`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:536
msgid ""
"If the app status is **not** set to *live*, then the database is only able "
"to contact the test numbers specified in the developer console."
msgstr ""
"如果應用程式狀態 **並非** 設為 *上線*，則資料庫只能聯絡在開發者控制台中指定的"
"測試號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:540
msgid ""
"A privacy policy URL must be set in order for the app to be set to live. Go "
"to the `Meta Developer Dashboard <https://developers.facebook.com/apps>`__ "
"and select the `Odoo` app. Then, in the left-hand side menu, go to "
":menuselection:`App Settings --> Basic`. Enter the privacy policy hyperlink "
"address under the :guilabel:`Privacy Policy URL` field of the form. Click "
":guilabel:`Save changes` to apply the privacy policy to the app."
msgstr ""
"必須設定私隱政策網址，才能將應用程式設為正式上線。前往 `Meta 開發人員主控台 "
"<https://developers.facebook.com/apps>`__，然後選擇 `Odoo` 應用程式。接著，在"
"左側選單中前往 :menuselection:`應用程式設定 --> 基本資料`。在表單的 "
":guilabel:`私隱政策網址` 欄位中輸入私隱政策超連結地址。點擊 :guilabel:`儲存變"
"更`，即可將私隱政策套用至應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:546
msgid ""
"Once the app has gone live in the Meta developer console, a confirmation "
"email is sent to the administrator."
msgstr "應用程式在 Meta 開發人員主控台上線後，系統會向管理員發送確認電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:552
msgid "WhatsApp templates"
msgstr "WhatsApp 範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:554
msgid ""
"WhatsApp templates allow users to store messages that are frequently sent. "
"By creating templates tailored to specific situations, users can send pre-"
"approved messages, without having to compromise on quality or compose the "
"same text repeatedly. This ensures fast turnaround and consistent customer "
"service messaging, and increases the overall engagement rate with the "
"customer."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp 範本讓用戶可儲存經常傳送的訊息。透過建立針對特定情況的範本，用戶無需"
"犧牲品質或重複編寫相同文字，即可傳送預先核准的訊息。這不但能確保快速回應及維"
"持一致的客戶服務訊息，亦可提升與客戶的整體互動率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:559
msgid ""
"WhatsApp templates can be created on both the :ref:`Odoo <whatsapp/odoo-"
"templates>` and :ref:`Meta <whatsapp/meta-templates>` consoles."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp 範本可同時在 :ref:`Odoo <whatsapp/odoo-templates>` 及 :ref:`Meta "
"<whatsapp/meta-templates>` 主控台上建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:563
msgid ""
"WhatsApp has an approval process that **must** be completed *before* the "
"template can be used. See :ref:`productivity/whatsapp/template-approval`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:566
msgid ""
"To access WhatsApp templates, navigate to the :menuselection:`WhatsApp app "
"--> Templates` dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:568
msgid "Each template has three tabs:"
msgstr "每個範本均有三個分頁："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:570
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Body`\\: stores the message body. The message body may contain "
"placeholders for dynamic content which is populated when the message is "
"sent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:572
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Buttons`\\: adds clickable buttons/hyperlinks at the bottom of "
"the WhatsApp template. Currently, there are three button types\\: *Quick "
"Reply*, *Visit Website*, and *Call Number*. *Visit Website* supports static,"
" dynamic, and tracked URLs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:575
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Variables`\\: lists all of the placeholders in the template, as "
"well as the variables that should be populated. For example, messages can "
"contain placeholders for a recipient's name, purchased products, or sales "
"order number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`變數`：列出範本中的所有預留位置，以及應填入的變數。例如，訊息可包"
"含收件人姓名、已購買產品或銷售訂單編號的預留位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:582
msgid "Create WhatsApp templates in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 建立 WhatsApp 範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:584
msgid ""
"To create a WhatsApp template, go to the :menuselection:`WhatsApp app --> "
"Templates` dashboard and click :guilabel:`New`. Enter a :guilabel:`Name` for"
" the template, and select a :guilabel:`Language`."
msgstr ""
"要建立 WhatsApp 範本，請前往:menuselection:`WhatsApp 應用程式 --> 範本`儀表板"
"，然後點擊:guilabel:`新增`。為範本輸入:guilabel:`名稱`，並選擇:guilabel:`語"
"言`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:588
msgid ""
