"api/message-templates/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Meta 的 WhatsApp 範本說明文件 <https://developers.facebook.com/docs/"
"whatsapp/business-management-api/message-templates/>`__"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:868
msgid ""
"Notifications in WhatsApp are handled similar to a message conversation in "
"Odoo. A pop-up window appears with the received conversation from the "
"customer. By default, notifications are set in the WhatsApp business account"
" configuration in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp 通知的處理方式與 Odoo 中的訊息對話類似。收到客戶對話時，系統會彈出一"
"個視窗顯示對話內容。預設情況下，通知會於 Odoo 的 WhatsApp 商業帳戶設定中配置"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:872
msgid ""
"Notification settings can be adjusted by navigating to "
":menuselection:`WhatsApp app --> Configuration --> WhatsApp Business "
"Accounts`. From there, select the account and scroll down to the "
":menuselection:`Control` section where notifications are handled. Under the "
":guilabel:`Notify users` heading, type in the field which users should be "
"notified for this particular WhatsApp channel."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`WhatsApp 應用程式 --> 配置 --> WhatsApp Business 帳戶` "
"即可調整通知設定。在該頁面選取帳戶，然後向下捲動至處理通知的 "
":menuselection:`控制` 部分。在 :guilabel:`通知用戶` 標題下的欄位中，輸入應接"
"收此特定 WhatsApp 頻道通知的用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:878
msgid ""
"Once a conversation is initiated between a user and a customer, "
"notifications to all the users specified in the WhatsApp business account "
"configuration will not occur. Only notifications to the users in the "
"conversation occur. Should the user not respond within 15 days, the "
"customer's reply after the 15 days populates once again to all the users "
"specified in the WhatsApp configuration."
msgstr ""
"當使用者與客戶開始對話後，系統不會再向 WhatsApp 商業帳戶設定中指定的所有使用"
"者發送通知，而只會通知參與該對話的使用者。若使用者在 15 天內未有回覆，客戶在 "
"15 天後的回覆將會再次發送給 WhatsApp 設定中指定的所有使用者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:887
msgid "Add users to a chat"
msgstr "將用戶加入聊天"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:889
msgid ""
"Users can be added to a WhatsApp chat by expanding the WhatsApp pop-up "
"window. WhatsApp conversations are located in the **Discuss** app. Select a "
"conversation, then click the :icon:`fa-user-plus` :guilabel:`(Add User)` "
"icon in the top-right, and a window appears to invite users to the "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"展開 WhatsApp 彈出視窗即可將用戶新增至 WhatsApp 對話。WhatsApp 對話位於 **討"
"論** 應用程式中。選擇一個對話，然後點擊右上角的:icon:`fa-user-plus` "
":guilabel:`（新增用戶）`圖示，隨即會出現一個視窗，供您邀請用戶加入對話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:894
msgid ""
"Adding users to a WhatsApp conversation, with the add user icon highlighted."
msgstr "將用戶加入 WhatsApp 對話，當中已突顯新增用戶圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:900
msgid "WhatsApp API FAQ"
msgstr "WhatsApp API 常見問題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:905
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "驗證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:907
msgid ""
"As of February 1, 2023, if the Meta app requires advanced level access to "
"permissions, a complete business verification may need to be completed. This"
" includes submitting office business documents to Meta. `See this "
"documentation "
"<https://developers.facebook.com/docs/development/release/business-"
"verification>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:913
msgid ""
"`Meta's WhatsApp access verification documentation "
"<https://developers.facebook.com/docs/development/release/access-"
"verification/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Meta 的 WhatsApp 存取權限驗證說明文件 <https://developers.facebook.com/docs/"
"development/release/access-verification/>`__"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:919
msgid "Cannot receive messages"
msgstr "無法接收訊息"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:921
msgid ""
"If the business account cannot receive messages, check all of the webhook "
"configurations. Navigate to :menuselection:`WhatsApp Business Platform "
"documentation --> Resources --> API Reference --> WhatsApp Business Account "
"--> Subscribed Apps API --> POST /{Version}/{WABA-ID}/subscribed_apps`, or "
"click `here <https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/business-"
"messaging/whatsapp/reference/whatsapp-business-account/subscribed-apps-"
"api/#post-version-waba-id-subscribed-apps>`__. Log in to the business "
"account if necessary. Under the *Request Syntax* section, click "
":guilabel:`Try it` and fill out the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"如果商業帳戶無法接收訊息，請檢查所有 Webhook 配置。前往 "
":menuselection:`WhatsApp Business 平台文件 --> 資源 --> API 參考 --> "
"WhatsApp Business 帳戶 --> 已訂閱應用程式 API --> POST /{Version}/{WABA-ID}/"
"subscribed_apps`，或點擊 `此處 <https://developers.facebook.com/"
"documentation/business-messaging/whatsapp/reference/whatsapp-business-"
"account/subscribed-apps-api/#post-version-waba-id-subscribed-apps>`__。如有需"
"要，請登入商業帳戶。在 *請求語法* 部分下，點擊 :guilabel:`試用` 並填寫以下欄"
"位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:929
msgid ""
":guilabel:`authorization`: enter the :ref:`permanent access token "
"<productivity/whatsapp/token>`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`授權`：輸入 :ref:`永久存取權杖 <productivity/whatsapp/token>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:930
msgid ""
":guilabel:`WABA-ID`: enter the *WhatsApp Business Account ID (WABA ID)*."
msgstr ":guilabel:`WABA-ID`：輸入 *WhatsApp 商業帳戶識別碼（WABA ID）*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:931
msgid ""
":guilabel:`override_callback_uri`: enter the :ref:`callback URL "
"<productivity/whatsapp/webhooks>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`override_callback_uri`：輸入:ref:`回呼網址 <productivity/whatsapp/"
"webhooks>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:932
msgid ""
":guilabel:`verify_token`: enter the :ref:`verification code "
"<productivity/whatsapp/webhooks>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:934
msgid ""
"To retrieve the *WABA ID*, navigate to :menuselection:`WhatsApp --> API "
"setup` in the left-hand side menu of the `Meta Developer Dashboard "
"<https://developers.facebook.com/apps>`__. The WABA ID is located in the "
"*Send and receive messages* section, under :guilabel:`Step 1: Select phone "
"numbers`. Once all the fields are filled out, click :guilabel:`Send "
"request`."
msgstr ""
"如要取得 *WABA ID*，請前往 :menuselection:`WhatsApp --> API 設定`（位於 "
"`Meta 開發者儀表板 <https://developers.facebook.com/apps>`__ 左側選單中）。"
"WABA ID 位於 *傳送及接收訊息* 部分下的 :guilabel:`步驟 1：選擇電話號碼`。填妥"
"所有欄位後，請點擊 :guilabel:`傳送要求`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:942
msgid "Template errors"
msgstr "範本錯誤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:944
msgid ""
"Editing templates can cause tracebacks and errors unless :ref:`the exact "
"process is followed <productivity/whatsapp/templates>`."
msgstr ""
"編輯範本可能會導致回溯錯誤及故障，除非:ref:`嚴格遵循確切流程 <productivity/"
"whatsapp/templates>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:950
msgid "Duplicate validation error"
msgstr "重複驗證錯誤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:952
msgid ""
"When syncing the templates there may be an instance when there are multiple "
"templates with the same name on Meta's business manager and in Odoo. This "
"causes a duplicate validation error. Odoo displays `Validation Error: The "
"operation cannot be completed: Duplicate template is not allowed for one "
"Meta account`. To correct this issue, rename the duplicate template name on "
"Odoo and :ref:`sync the templates once again <productivity/whatsapp/sync-"
"templates>`."
msgstr ""
"同步範本時，Meta 企業管理平台與 Odoo 上可能會出現多個同名的範本。這會導致重複"
"驗證錯誤。Odoo 會顯示 `Validation Error: The operation cannot be completed: "
"Duplicate template is not allowed for one Meta account`。要解決此問題，請在 "
"Odoo 上重新命名重複的範本名稱，並:ref:`再次同步範本 <productivity/whatsapp/"
"sync-templates>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:958
msgid "Error message displayed in Odoo when a duplicate template exists."
msgstr "當存在重複範本時，Odoo 顯示的錯誤訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:964
msgid "Token errors"
msgstr "權杖錯誤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:969
msgid "User error 190"
msgstr "用戶錯誤 190"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:971
msgid ""
"If the temporary token is not replaced with a permanent token, Odoo displays"
" `User Error 190: Error validating access token: Session has expired`. To "
"correct this issue, :ref:`add a permanent token "
"<productivity/whatsapp/token>`."
msgstr ""
"如果未以永久權杖取代臨時權杖，Odoo 會顯示 `User Error 190: Error validating "
"access token: Session has expired`。要解決此問題，請 :ref:`新增永久權杖 "
"<productivity/whatsapp/token>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:975
msgid "Error message displayed in Odoo when the temporary token expires."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:981
msgid "User error 100"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:983
msgid ""
"If an :guilabel:`Employee` attempts to set up the permanent token, Odoo "
"displays `User Error 100: Unsupported get request`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:986
msgid ""
"To correct this error, :ref:`create an Admin system user "
"<productivity/whatsapp/token>`."
msgstr "要修正此錯誤，請 :ref:`建立管理員系統用戶 <productivity/whatsapp/token>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:988
msgid ""
"Error message displayed in Odoo when an employee token is generated instead of an Admin\n"
"user."
msgstr ""
"當產生的權杖屬於員工而非管理員\n"
"用戶時，Odoo 顯示的錯誤訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:1000
msgid "Template cannot be sent to multiple contacts"
msgstr "無法將範本傳送給多個聯絡人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:1002
msgid "Make sure the *Multi-Template* feature is enabled on the template."
msgstr "請確保已在範本上啟用*多範本*功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:1007
msgid "Message failed to send"
msgstr "訊息傳送失敗"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:1009
msgid ""
"Enable the *Failure Type* and *Failure Reason* columns under "
":guilabel:`WhatsApp ---> Messages`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`WhatsApp ---> 訊息` 下方，啟用 *失敗類型* 及 *失敗原因* 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:1014
msgid "Other error codes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/whatsapp.rst:1016
msgid ""
"For other errors, see Meta's Developer Suite for `WhatsApp Error Codes "
"<https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/business-"
"messaging/whatsapp/support/error-codes>`__."
msgstr ""
"如遇其他錯誤，請參閱 Meta 開發者套件中的 `WhatsApp 錯誤代碼 <https://"
